  ('zcrm_1579374000140030060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990092', 'Andrea Perrault', NULL, '5/30/24: Andrea called asking if her plan is HSA compatible. I informed her that yes, her MEC with Planstin makes her eligible to contribute to an HSA since it is a high deductible plan and that she can use her planstin card for proof when opening an account. She got out her card and said nowhere on there does it list the deductible amount. 
I advised that she could get an updated card from Planstin by calling them and transferred her over. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-30 09:58:02', '2024-05-30 09:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140030055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '5/30/24: 
After asking for guidance from Catherine regarding Lori''s case, she stated there is nothing MPB can do for Lori without her being an active member. IF she was an active member, then she could try the additional giving fund or try for Debt relief through our essentials plan. 

Called Zion to clarify some dates regarding Lori''s sharing request. 
Initial need was submitted 9.29.23
Appeal 1 - 10.16.23
Appeal 2 - 10.19.23
Appeal 3 - 5.16.23
According to Mandy at Zion: Zion sent another determination email in March (after they had attempted to collect additional records) letting Lori know their findings, that the need is still unshareable. 

I asked Mandy, that since this email was sent after Lori''s age out date, would Lori be eligible to access the additional giving fund? 
Mandy couldn''t give me a definite answer and suggested I speak to Jayden - Lori''s determination officer. Mandy assured me that she would have Jayden (determination officer) give me a call today when she is available. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-30 09:54:56', '2024-05-30 09:54:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140030036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135183021', 'Larissa Brice', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update.  CC already updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-30 09:26:41', '2024-05-30 09:28:18'),
