  ('zcrm_1579374000140049046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, 'RE ATAP: Cheryl chose to re-enroll with Planstin. Remind her in the fall to do it.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-05-30 09:23:36', '2024-05-30 09:24:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140030023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129887006', 'Zachary Fink', NULL, 'Member called in and expressed an interest in cancelling.  I asked if he had spoke to Leslie  and he had not.  I directed him to reach out to Leslie and advised him of the deadline.  I will send out link to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-30 09:18:55', '2024-05-30 09:18:55'),
