  ('zcrm_1579374000140049021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109658034', 'Dawn Dines', NULL, '5-30-2024 LVM re ATAP.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-05-30 08:52:37', '2024-05-30 08:52:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140030013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137619002', 'Laura Shymkus', NULL, '5/30/24: Laura called with 2 questions. Her daughter is having issues getting into CirrusMD - says they are asking for her member ID. I gave her the ID number, but said it sounds like she may be trying to access the wrong portal, and if she has issues registering, have her daughter call me.
2. Laura is getting a Spine X-ray. We looked up fair price which was between 80-380 for her area. I suggested she call around and check pricing knowing what a good range is and if it becomes an issue that exceeds her IUA, then she can submit for sharing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-30 08:41:33', '2024-05-30 08:41:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140030008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110450002', 'Marianne Bashista', NULL, '5/30/24: Marianne called. She needs help with a sharing request - she''s having neck surgery in July and the hospital is being difficult with her presenting as self-pay with a health share. 
First, we made sure member was registered with Zion and could access her member portal. 
I advised to go ahead and begin the request with the info she has now which is physical therapy bills and an MRI bill. I made sure they knew that Zion will check to make sure it''s not a pre-ex condition, and afterwards make a full determination. 
Secondly, I advised to call the hospital and collect as much info as possible and an estimated quote and submit that into the request. After the determination is made, Zion can potentially issue the funds pre-surgery especially if you let them know the circumstances.
Marianne is going to submit the request and contact the hospital. I''ll follow up and check on her progress in a week. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-30 08:17:46', '2024-05-30 08:17:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140030003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '5/30/24: April called to get reimbursement for blood work she received at an annual exam. I explained that her MEC pays for services listed under the ACA guidelines, and if the bloodwork is a service listed, usually she would present her RCI card for billing. I advised to speak to RCI directly to see if you she send the bill to them, but they do work with a specific network of providers. Transferred to RCI. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-30 07:44:39', '2024-05-30 07:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139993048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413287', 'Blaire Speaker', NULL, '5-29-24 Per Blaire, "I am moving out of state and will be switching to my employer provided insurance."  I''ll let her know how to cancel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-29 19:49:06', '2024-05-29 19:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139994074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130351002', 'Catherine Cowles', NULL, '05.29.2024 My Results to Cathy''s RX Request:
Climara Pro: 45-15/ 24h - 20 days - 4 Patches

The information is derived from a couple of resources. Unfortunately, the international shopper shared that this medication is not available through their supply chain.
However, I found some of these resources informative. The coupon does not seem to limit access to only commercial holding patients, with the first link, so I added it.
Family Wize Site: https://www.familywize.org/drug/climara-pro?utm_medium=paid-search&utm_source=google-hrxfw-generic&utm_campaign=16609353016&utm_adgroup=&utm_term=&utm_content=&gclid=Cj0KCQjwpNuyBhCuARIsANJqL9N4_gporWrcd9n8UUJb6tBIslG7RX6-H7vVZnsi05ocoDaNdcPo6qgaAop1EALw_wcB

Manufacturing Site: https://www.climarapro.com/save-climara-pro
The mfr. DOES dictate that the patient needs to have commercial insurance.

RxSaver shared this generic coupon: https://www.rxsaver.com/drugs/climara-pro/coupons

City Market: $243.82
I attached a coupon, just as an option, but it is not the most attractive. It would be more feasible if they made a generic version.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-29 17:42:39', '2024-05-29 17:42:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139994069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135183021', 'Larissa Brice', NULL, '05.29.2024 Larissa called requesting to change her payment information and access her member portal. I sent her the MPB change form, and assisted her access her MPB portal. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-29 16:59:16', '2024-05-29 16:59:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139993038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140470082', 'Sam Wyman', NULL, '5-28-24 Sam is 30 and his wife is 28. His mom Jean Wyman was referred to me by Lynn Ryan. Sam''s employer was bought out and the new company plan is going to cost $300 a week! That brings the cost to about $1971.20 per month for a young couple! They are healthy, no meds, no tobacco. They do typical wellness, dental, vision, nutrition (previously), mental health, skin checks and gym! They are also asking about maternity for the future, not quite yet. I told him it must be after membership start date and he''s not concerned about it bc they are not ready. Quoted CARE+ $450/$1000 and HAB $165 = $615 total, plus $125/$25. He just wants to review it with his wife and then he''s ready to enroll. He also wants to make sure he can cancel/opt out of his employer plan. Once he''s certain then he''s ready to enroll for July 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-29 16:47:12', '2024-05-29 16:47:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139993018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '5-29-24 Patty is 55 and live in Boulder. She''s a typical healthy Boulderite. She''s going through a divorce and she''s going to find out when she will lose coverage. Looking for a July 1st start date likely.  She doesn''t smoke or use tobacco. She''s on HRT, so I explained how meds work through MPB Concierge Team. She watched the 9-minute video. She does most of the wellness items. She does mammo and never heard of thermography but is interested in learning. She does the other typical wellness visits, dental, vision and gym. She doesn''t do mental health visits but will use the rest. I quoted Premium Care since she''s 55 at the $1000 IUA / $285 plus HAB at $107 and $392 plus $125/$25.  We will meet again on June 10th to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-29 16:04:18', '2024-05-29 16:04:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139994056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118740002', 'Deven Hazelbaker', NULL, '05.29.2024 Deven called to add her newborn baby''s SSN. I sent her via CRM the MPB change form. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-29 15:15:59', '2024-05-29 15:15:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139958043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '5/29/24: Emailed Marni registration link for Cirrus MD and advised that her spouse and dependents use the link to create a unique account. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-29 14:47:17', '2024-05-29 14:47:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139958033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '5/29/24: Denise & Concepcion called. She submitted a sharing request regarding Iliac vein stint. The procedure was done Feb. 14th and so far she has accumulated $16K in expenses. She wants to know when to expect a reimbursement. 

Determination been made (today) eligible with a cap of $50K until team is finished reviewing records and decision is made to make sure it''s not a pre-ex condition. 

Dr''s are wanting to do a kidney location transplant. 
Denise: "Is this different issue or all the same?" T from Zion stated it may be all the same as long as it''s related to the first issue. Denise said provider stated she''s always had this condition but it was never diagnosed. 

What do I do for UC health for upcoming transplant consult on June 14th? They are afraid we will not be able to pay. T suggested calling UC health and gather as much info about the procedure as you can - estimated cost, etc and submit that under your sharing request. Then, Zion can go ahead make some pre-payments for surgery. 
Is ambulance shareable? Yes. 
I had T clarify with Denise about how the payment works because she was under the impression from Karen that Zion pays the hospital directly. T said, "it is like we are paying the provider, but we issue you a digital credit card so you can still get that self-pay discount".

T stated reimbursements will be going out in June. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-29 14:36:03', '2024-05-29 14:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139994043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '05.29.2024 Sent Marni an email with information on MAP program. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-29 13:52:33', '2024-05-29 13:52:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139994038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139615002', 'Bryan Lobmeyer', 'Sent MPB Permission Form to Discuss Plan with Wife on 05.29.2024', '05.29.2024 Wife called wondering where all his cards for the membership are.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-29 13:52:01', '2024-05-29 13:52:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139958028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133359001', 'Jianny Adamo', NULL, '5/29/24: Jianny called. She is having major dental issues. Needs fillings for 8 teeth and possibly dentist is recommneding invisaline. I advised that unfortunately, this condition is not shareable according to Zion''s guidelines, and that she could purchase additional dental insurance through her advisor if that is something she needs. I ended up trans. to Zion bc Jianny wanted confirmation on whether or not periodontal disease is shareable. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-29 13:46:17', '2024-05-29 13:46:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139993013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124369011', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '5-29-24 Dan and Rachel chose to go directly with Zion when they enrolled bc they have a private therapist they already work with, they can access discounted labs at wholesale pricing and they can access Full Scripts already through his own work. So, that''s why they aren''t showing up in Admin123 or Zoho as usual.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-29 13:17:50', '2024-05-29 13:17:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139994018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '05.29.2024 April called b/c she is trying to open a medical need with Sedera, but cannot access her portal. I tried to get clarification on how they are proceeding with members opening medical needs presently, but did not get a clear response.
I went ahead and sent April the email template for opening medical needs with Sedera that includes a video with instructions. She received the email while we were on the phone, and proceeded to view the video for instructions. She will call us if she ends up against a brick wall. **********************************************************************************
April ended up needing to call us back. The above information was not effective and did not guide her through the process.
Angee had forwarded me what she found in the guidelines - and I shared that with April, to call the number 855-973-3372, to allow Sedera to guide her through the entire process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-29 13:12:48', '2024-05-29 15:08:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139958023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129710002', 'Becky Ricketts', NULL, '5/29/24: Becky called needing help finding a dermatologist. I walked her through using HCBB to find a list of providers. I also suggested she try using CIrrusMD before scheduling an appointment. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-29 13:10:40', '2024-05-29 13:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139949063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129064002', 'Kellie Galligan', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-29 12:46:36', '2024-05-29 12:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139994008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130351002', 'Catherine Cowles', NULL, '05.29.2024 Cathy  called requesting help in savings on her prescription. I sent her the form that she opened while we are on the phone. The form does not offer "patch" as an option, so I told her to put that in the notes section. 
********************************************************************************
The prices showing up for this medication were expensive in the $200''s-$400''s range.
I reached out to our international shopper, who told me that he needs to investigate this medicine and will get back to me. I emailed Cathy via outlook to let her know. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-29 12:15:07', '2024-05-29 15:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139993008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '5/29/24: Reached out to mbr to talk about the atap email, presented some options to him and decided he can either re enroll with rci at a $2500 IUA or re enroll with planstin.', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-05-29 12:09:54', '2024-05-29 12:09:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139958018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135628001', 'John Carmola', NULL, '5/29/24: Kathryn called, she''s having a 7K cardiac stress test being done and wants to know if it''s covered. I informed her that I didn''t see anything in ZIon''s guidelines that would make me think it isn''t shareable, but she would need to open a sharing request to get an official determination for the procedure. She seemed confused and was wanting to log into her member portal. I explained that to submit a need, she would need to that through her Zion portal, not MPB. She said - "No, I want to view my plan information and there is no where on the mpb site to log in." I then explained how she can log into her MPB member portal (even though I just did this with her on the 17th - see note above). AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-29 11:16:03', '2024-05-29 11:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139949058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951263', 'Christina LeBoeuf', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will update across all platforms &amp; notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-29 11:06:24', '2024-05-29 11:06:24'),
