  ('zcrm_1579374000139949040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083119002', 'Jooeun Kim', NULL, 'Employer Ann Kim that was paying for this member submitted Cancellation Request with their name on it 5/1/24.  I was unable to find them in any of our systems so I put it in "reviewed" status.  Received a call from Karen asking about it.  I will cancel member eff 6/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-29 09:29:42', '2024-05-29 09:30:13'),
