  ('zcrm_1579374000139958003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106773002', 'David Garrett', NULL, '5/29/24: David called trying to access member portal. I gave him his credentials, but then helped him access his Zion member portal. He is going for an xray for a basketball injury and may end up starting a need. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-29 08:07:24', '2024-05-29 08:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139905054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124369011', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '5-28-24 Dan called for help with submitting a new Need. I gave him Concierge Team''s # and let him know he can call me for specifics if it''s more than following the process of submitting a Need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-28 18:15:30', '2024-05-28 18:15:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139905049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005566009', 'Helen Gemmill', NULL, '5-28-24 Rest of the notes for Helen and the kids are under Daniel Yechout''s account.  They are getting divorced and Helen is taking care of the kids. As the secondary member, Helen had to re-enroll in CARE+ and chose HAB for wellness. The HSA was less important than all of the added benefits and ability to see alternative doctors for their wellness visits. They are all healthy, no pre-x other than ADHD for Margaux. It doesn''t matter since they are keeping Zion active. Their original start date is Aug. 2020 under Dan''s account.  They do skin checks, dental, colonoscopy, gym for Margaux, etc. Re-enrolled in CARE+ $450 / $1000 and HAB $200 for $650 a month July 1st effective date. However, the website was showing a $420 price instead of $450 that it should be! I''m notifying Vinnie and Team.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-28 16:19:09', '2024-05-28 16:19:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139894119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755217', 'John Mills', NULL, '05.28.2024 Rcv''d an email from CJ Wilson, regarding John Mills being discovered by his sister and is being transported by EMS to the hospital. He is not able to communicate. 
Assumption at the moment is a stroke. According to CJ Wilson, he is otherwise healthy with no meds or required past records that she knows of. She has questions about navigating intake.
Her number is 602-369-8401, so I called her to help her, and learned that John has been cancelled. 
Given the heightened situation and the state that John is in, I went ahead and spoke to the plan, briefly with Anne, his sister. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 14:32:47', '2024-05-28 14:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139930003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005566009', 'Helen Gemmill', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-28 13:55:07', '2024-05-28 13:55:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139912058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111949002', 'Jay Andre', NULL, '5/28/24: Nichole called. Her daughter had an appt (not preventive) and even though she presented as self-pay, the provider billed planstin anyway. Now she has 2 bills - one from planstin and one from the provider. The bills are different but both have urinalysis on them. I said this sounds like a huge provider error and advised her to call the provider and have them re-submit the bill to her directly and have them let planstin know that it was sent in error and to disregard. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-28 13:20:59', '2024-05-28 13:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139905039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079570002', 'Joel Schoenborn', NULL, '5/28/24: Reached out to mbr to encourage them to check their email, resent the atap email. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-05-28 13:02:31', '2024-05-28 13:02:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139873090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079921002', 'Karol Tutton', NULL, 'Member called in wondering if spouse was removed from the membership since he now has Medicare.  I advised he was removed eff 2/24 after 2 notifications were sent prompting submission of Change Form.  She wanted to know what her price was.  I let her know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-28 12:50:57', '2024-05-28 12:50:57'),
