  ('zcrm_1579374000139912043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, '5/28/24: Cameron called. He has an appt next week with provider to read some labs. We discussed when and how he should use his Planstin MEC for preventive appointments. I advised that it has to be an ACA service, coded as preventive and billed to Planstin directly from the provider - Dr is not in network according to multiplan, but explained RBP pricing. 
