  ('zcrm_1579374000139912038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109018020', 'Elisabeth Mullen', NULL, '5/28/24: Elisabeth called. She said she has two annual provider appointments coming up. I advised her that under her plan, Zion will issue up to $175 per year for an annual wellness visit, and to submit a preventive sharing request through her member portal. She was having issues logging in bc of password, but will try forgot password and go through the steps. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-28 12:09:53', '2024-05-28 12:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139905018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '5-28-24 Cynthia came to me via her friend Anne Marie Marron (I think this is the correct Anne Marie). Cynthia is 51 and husband is 60. He just got laid off last week and they ended his benefits immediately. They can get  onto Cobra for next 60 days but they don''t want it and know it''s very expensive. Her husband may choose to remain working independently if they can find a good healthcare option. They live in Evergreen, CO. Cynthia has a great doctor that she loves and it took a long time to find her.  She''s a traditional MD. Only 2 plans with C4 include this Dr. For pre-x, her husband had a surgery on a compressed nerve in his neck about 1 1/2 yrs ago. She said it''s fully healed 100%. Cynthia had a concussion in Sept. 2022 and it took a few months to heal 100%.  Otherwise, anything else was minor that she paid cash for. For meds her husband takes sumatriptan for mirgaines 1-2x per year and she takes trazadone and HRT.  For wellness they do all of the typical wellness visits such as mammo, colonoscopy, no pap bc she had a hysterectomy about 10 years ago, yes, to vax and needs shingles shot, yes, to dental cleanings, yes, vision screenings, yes to mental health therapist, yes to skin checks 1x per year. Neither of them smoke. They were facing a cost double what I am offering. Premium Care $575/$1000 and HAB $165 = $740 and $125/$25. July 1st start date will work. Wants to share it with her husband and reconnect later this week to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-28 12:01:13', '2024-05-28 12:52:23'),
