  ('zcrm_1579374000139894106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985046', 'Maria Mitzi Moye', NULL, '05.28.2024 Mitzi called and left us a VM that she wants to cancel eff 6/1. She missed the deadline for all membership changes, including cancellations. I called her and left her a message. I sent her the form via CRM email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 11:12:29', '2024-05-28 11:13:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139912023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850008', 'Melissa Mangum', NULL, '5/28/24: Called Melissa and LVM about prescription quote request. She accidentally put her name instead of the name of medication and her preferred pharmacy is not an option for our resource sites. Sent an email letting her know we called and posing the same questions that need to be resolved before we can move forward with her quote. Will wait to hear back before proceeding. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-28 11:07:25', '2024-05-28 16:27:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139894101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106720002', 'Jessica Chariton', NULL, '05.28.2024 Jessica called and left us a VM - her son broke his arm and she wanted to learn how to proceed from here. I guided her through the receipt organization, opening a sharing request if needed, the 6 month deadline. She also asked about a preventive appointment for her husband, outside of the DPC realm in their plan. I explained the minimal preventive services that are offered with Zion, specifically the Physical Annual Wellness Visit that offers up to $175 towards that visit, and how to attain that amount. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 11:07:14', '2024-05-28 11:07:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139912018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116120018', 'David Cole', NULL, '5/28/24: David called asking for his member number. I let him know that while he does have an ID number associated with his account, it''s not something that will be much use for a provider, and advised him to present as a self-pay patient. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-28 11:05:10', '2024-05-28 11:05:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139894086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135466002', 'Brent Tunnell', NULL, '05.28.2024 Miko called to attain the Planstin fax#. She was all set and at her appointment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 10:55:24', '2024-05-28 10:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139884028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of June 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-28 10:46:27', '2024-05-28 10:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139894078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850008', 'Melissa Mangum', NULL, '05.28.2024 Melissa called to get help with saving on her medication. I guided her to the MPB portal page with all the resources and sent her the form as well. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 10:44:20', '2024-05-28 10:48:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139912013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '5/28/24: Clint called to ask how to present at a specialist visit. He''s going to see a neurosurgeon about issues related to his spine. I advised to present as self pay and collect itemized bills. Reminded him he has up to 6 months to submit a bill for sharing and that he is initially responsible for his 2500 IUA. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-28 10:42:13', '2024-05-28 10:42:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139912008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130493002', 'Leigh Robbins', NULL, '5/28/24: Leigh called in. Her daughter is pregnant. I emailed Zion''s maternity guidelines and advised her to go ahead and open a maternity request through their Zion member portal and at provider''s office, collect a global package to submit. Leigh has already registered for member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-28 10:25:18', '2024-05-28 10:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139894058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294002', 'John Mone', NULL, '05.28.2024 Adriana called to learn how to proceed with the following specific situations:
1-Urgent care visit.
2-Torn miniscus: have a doctor, have paid for many visits, needs surgery now.
We walked through the sharing request details, saving receipts, paying the IUA (with facility OR Zion), getting bills reduced through the cash-pay discounts, the 6 month deadline and how alternative therapy work (physical therapy) if needed. 
I transferred her to Zion and guided her on what to press and ask for. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 10:16:49', '2024-05-28 10:40:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139894050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '05.28.2024 Kathryn called to learn what her IUA is and how to proceed with the specific situation she is on a journey with NOW. I guided her to keep all her receipts and organize them in a folder for one specific situation. Specialist - paying cash pay - opening a sharing request and being responsible for ONLY the IUA portion, SHOULD the sharing request be approved by Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 10:06:25', '2024-05-28 10:42:20'),
