  ('zcrm_1579374000139876005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116120018', 'David Cole', NULL, 'David reached out to me and needed his "member number" for a dr. appt. he has today. I first asked his name to pull him up and then what kind of appt. this was. This is for an ENT Dr. So I explained him paying out of pocket up to his IUA and anything there after he will submit into Zion health. Which I gave Zion''s phone number, along with him asking what was covered under the preventative. I let David know that everything preventative would be through his DPC provider and sent him the list of the mandated by the ACA items covered from healthcare.gov. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-05-28 09:54:01', '2024-05-28 09:54:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139905008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001538301', 'Brenda Smith', NULL, '5-22-24 Per Andrea and sent to Gmail.   "Sounds like she may need some testing and her plan doesn’t pay?  So no qualifying event.  She is 62. Not sure a candidate for cost share, but maybe the company to told me about yesterday.  Thanks"  I just left Brenda a vm now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-28 09:53:15', '2024-05-28 09:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139894042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116120018', 'David Cole', 'Sent MPB Perm. to Speak to Plan with Dorothy 05.28.2024', '05.28.2024 Dorothy called today on behalf of David. I did not see the form filled out, even though she said she completed it. I did not see a note here that it was sent. So I sent it again to them, they said they RCV''D it.
David has a sinus infection, he''s already been to their DPC and wants to know how to proceed to the ENT appointment that is coming up. I guided them to present as a cash pay patient from here on for this specific situation, and coached them on how to organize their papers, should they need to open a sharing request and need to upload their receipts. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-28 09:52:51', '2024-05-28 10:43:30'),
