  ('zcrm_1579374000139789058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692197', 'Scott Ritterbuck', NULL, '05.24.2024 Scott called to change his payment information. He was aware that his bank was changing ownership, but was informed that the routing # and account # should still work.
He''s filling out the form as this note is being generated. He will follow up on Tuesday morning to confirm the change is being processed and speak to billing regarding the $25 late fee. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-24 17:24:17', '2024-05-24 17:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139760038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135184001', 'Julie Moinicken', NULL, '5-24-24 Julie was wanting to extend her membership for one more month bc they don''t have Medicare set to go. Zion won''t honor anyone past age 64. So, Julie would be exposed for half of the month and they aren''t allowing her to remain a member. I learned that they have until May 31st to get her going. So, hopefully they will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-24 17:08:17', '2024-05-24 17:08:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139789045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, '5.24.2024 Jason called to get help in scheduling his welcome call. I sent him the scheduling link. He also asked to get help in downloading the MPB Health app, and I recommended he also download the CirrusMD app.
