  ('zcrm_1579374000139789029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120998002', 'William Chilton', NULL, '05.24.2024 William called sharing that he still needs help saving on his RX Request for 5 syringes of 300mcg/.5ml Zarxio.
After doing a brief search to see the cost, I realized it was outrageously expensive. I asked William what exactly he''s using this medication for, and he said for the white blood cell count (possibly for his wife). I remembered Angee and I discussing this briefly, and I asked him if he''d apply for a sharing request. He said yes, but they denied it. I checked his effective date, and it has not been one year. I asked him if they are considering it a pre-X, and he said yes they are. They are connecting it with another incident a while back, when she was experiencing blood in her stool.
I offered him an option to appeal Zion''s determination on the sharing request. He was not aware he could do that. So we did a 3-way call and spoke with Mindy, who guided William with the steps on how to appeal and the deadline that he should do it by. 
I encouraged William to connect with the previous physician, explain to him what is going on, and request that he share his terminology on the previous incident in hopes that it DOES NOT corroborate with the present incident. That way William can have this hardship relieved from the financial aspects.
In the meantime Angee and I worked on trying to find a coupon for the medication, since it is needed ASAP, and the medical professional that needed to send it into the pharmacy was going to leave in an hour of the time we talked.
Angee was able to find a few coupons in pharmacies around William. (Below is that information).
I found a couple of links that could possible help them save money on this medication should the sharing request not pan out. Over the phone, William was sharing that he was not approved, so we will need to talk again to see if these programs might help out.
Savings options through the grant:
https://www.panfoundation.org/apply-and-manage-grants/applying-for-grants/.

I can''t figure this site out. Will need to learn it first: https://www.novartis.com/us-en/patients-and-caregivers/patient-assistance/patient-assistance-foundation-enrollment.                 NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-24 12:08:27', '2024-05-24 17:49:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139760033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124672026', 'Jessica Bartmann', NULL, '5-24-24  Hi Wendy, 

