  ('zcrm_1579374000139760023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139748167', 'Maryjean Starr', NULL, '5-24-24 Next she just enrolled in CARE+ $265/$1000 July 1st start and HAB $107 June 1st start with separate billing. All set!  Next I had her upload her Cobra notice for the above Anthem plan for the month of June. She will call to make sure that becomes active and she will then call later in the month of June to cancel Anthem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-24 11:44:15', '2024-05-24 11:44:15'),
