  ('zcrm_1579374000139759078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, '5/24/24: Kelly called back with one final question. She was wondering if she could get updated cards since hers say 2020. Patti is sending a digital one and put in a request for physical ones. I let member know. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-24 11:33:31', '2024-05-24 11:33:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139759073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, '5/24/24: Kelly called back and said she found a provider but the provider''s office said they were in PHCS but didn''t accept the "limited benefit plan". I explained that her network is not "limited benefit", but instead "specific services". We did a 3 way call with providers office. It seemed ok, but I gave them RCI''s info just in case. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-24 11:10:55', '2024-05-24 11:10:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139789003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089965012', 'Michele Palumbo', NULL, '05.24.2024 Michele called to see if she missed a step with her process of going to her physical annual on 1/12/2024, GIVEN she''s just received a bill for $2098.86. I gave her a few steps to follow to get the Std. Lipid Panel covered, at least and in hopes to save money on the rest:
1- Ask the lab if they can separate the Std. Lipid Panel from the rest of the blood work.
2- Ask the lab if they will accept her seeking the savings after the fact, and present them with a receipt (usually considered a pre-purchase, but in this case it''s the after the fact/post purchase). Prefacing that she misunderstood her plan and how the coverage and savings work.

In order to do the above, she first needs to contact the doctor where she had her physical to learn where EXACTLY was her blood work sent to, since it was drawn at the doctor''s office. 
Michele will call us back for additional guidance, should she need it  to find the savings on the sites or if she hits a speed bump.    NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-24 11:08:37', '2024-05-24 11:15:52'),
