  ('zcrm_1579374000139760013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139748167', 'Maryjean Starr', NULL, '5-24-24 We got her enrolled in the above Anthem Gold plan for $322.57. Now in 2024 she has no pre-x. Clear for 5-6 years, no tobacco, no meds except vaginal estrogen cream, yes for supplements. She has a Full Scripts membership already but MPB will give her great discounts. She does a skin check every year, annual well check, gym/triathlons/ski pass/parks pass, dental cleanings, vision screening every other year, no nutritional health, sometimes mental health.  She wants to be protected for when she''s traveling also. CARE+ is the most affordable and best option for her. She does Not do mammograms but she does thermograms.  CARE+ $265/$1000 and HAB $107 = $372. July 1st for CARE+ and ? for HAB start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-24 08:44:47', '2024-05-24 08:44:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139760008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139748167', 'Maryjean Starr', NULL, '5-21-24 Maryjean was referred by Summer Deaton. She is 43 and Cobra ended on May 7th and she didn''t realize. So, we needed to get her on C4 since we missed all deadlines for MCS and America''s Choice. She was declined private ins unexpectedly bc of a car accident and issues that stemmed from that in 2017. That was all cleared up by 2018 with no further complications.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-24 08:38:52', '2024-05-24 08:38:52'),
