  ('zcrm_1579374000139731056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102741010', 'James Schrock', NULL, '05.23.2024 James had called and left us a message, while we were on the phone. He also reached out to CJ Wilson (QR Life Code), who sent us an email about the same situation.
James just needed guidance on how to proceed with his ER visit with his son. I guided him with the sharing request with Zion, and to just present as a cash pay patient right now.
He did say the other party was at fault, and their insurance will kick in first. I asked him to open that sharing request regardless, and when that part is all settled, he can upload whatever other bills are left and the receipt for the $1000 IUA. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-23 17:01:31', '2024-05-23 17:01:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139731051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097027002', 'Elaine Colter', NULL, '05.23.2024 Jonathan called to learn what he needs to do when aging out. I shared that our member services department send two emails. One two months prior to the birthday, and another 1 month prior.
His birthday is wrong in our system, so I sent him the form to correct it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-23 16:52:02', '2024-05-23 16:52:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139731041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '05.23.2024 Maya called to see if we could find her a lesser price than $45 for her dermatology medication.
