  ('zcrm_1579374000139728036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143664002', 'Mary Ellen Francescani', NULL, '5-23-24 She has more questions and asked me to call her this afternoon. I just left her a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-23 15:08:38', '2024-05-23 15:08:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139710023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '5/23/24: John called VERY ANGRY about his current therapy situation. He was mad from the beginning bc I asked him to please tell me what''s going on so I can assist him. He continued to yell and speak over me. I repeatedly told him he cannot speak to me in this manner and to let me speak (which he never did). He said he is entitled to counseling services and we should pay for his current therapist. I explained that''s not how this system works. He said he wants this escalated. After (audibly sighing) and saying "Ok, I''ll let my manager know" he called me a f''n b.....so I hung up the phone. 
Spoke to Joan about the conversation and what has been done so far. MAP has been trying to find a solution for John, but he refuses to work with a virtual therapist or the in-person option in his area. His therapist refuses to join the map network, because according to John "Why would a therapist join a network and not be able to get any referrals?"
Called Karen Torsoe, explained what just happened and that the concierge will NOT speak to John if he continues to be verbally abusive. I asked her to call him, which she agreed to do, and to let us know what becomes of the situation. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-23 14:21:50', '2024-05-23 14:27:01'),
