  ('zcrm_1579374000139728031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139729018', 'Raeanna Clarke', NULL, '5-23-24 She needs better mental health benefits and wants to keep her therapist. She I mentioned HAB and went through it all. She''s thrilled for this benefit. She pays about $260 per month or $100 per session and she''s dealing with PTSD. She will gladly join this. It''s what she was looking for. I didn''t mention it initially bc I didn''t think she could afford it. But, she join for June 1st at $107 per month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-23 13:44:56', '2024-05-23 13:44:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139710018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137206018', 'Laura Johnson', NULL, '5/23/24: Laura called interested in nominating her current counselor to work with MAP. I advised she would need to talk to them about how that might work. Transferred to MAP. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-23 13:21:52', '2024-05-23 13:21:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139728023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139729018', 'Raeanna Clarke', NULL, '5-23-24 Raeanna is enrolling in CARE+. It''s the most affordable option for her needs. She can''t join anything else for June 1st. I sent her to GetSpot.com for accident benefits. She will choose $2500/$185 for July 1st start date. She watched the 9-minute video and the video with Cory Nickerson and I. She has allergies that she''s treating with diet, PTSD and scoliosis from car accident in 2017 or 2019? She is being treated for back pain and understands pre-x clause. She takes no meds, no tobacco, no smoking.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-23 13:19:39', '2024-05-23 13:22:44'),
