  ('zcrm_1579374000139728018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, '5-23-24 Monique changed her payment method with HMA long ago around the new year. She sees her payments come out of her account every month. She has a new digital card and is good with that. She was able to update her mailing address in her account as well. So, she should be all set with her HMA account! YAY!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-23 12:11:55', '2024-05-23 12:11:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139713048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109799016', 'Robert Louchheim', NULL, 'Member called in asking what this was, he gave me Philadelphia American.  I told him we were not affiliated with them that this was Medical Cost Sharing.  He wanted to know why his cost did not decrease in price when he took his 26 yr old off the membership.  I advised that he had 3 other children on the membership.  He asked spouse why they were on there.  He asked the price without them.  I advised him of the dealdine if he wanted to remove them in the future.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-23 12:02:18', '2024-05-23 12:02:18'),
