  ('zcrm_1579374000139710008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', NULL, '5/23/24: Jennifer called wondering how to get to her Zion member portal. I gave her Zion''s website and navigated her on how to find her portal log in. She was able to get in and begin uploading documents. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-23 09:09:41', '2024-05-23 09:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139710003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, '5/2324: Karen called, she was in the hospital yesterday for a hypoglycemic incident and wondering what to do now. The hospital had her planstin info on file and she did not get a bill at time of service. 
