  ('zcrm_1579374000139598008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', NULL, '5/21/24: Diane called saying she is on the way to pick up some antibiotics and needs a coupon right away. I let her know that she would need to fill out a prescription quote request form, and we can search best price for her and email her back. She said she doesn''t have time to fill out a form, she needs these meds right now. I replied that it''s important she fill out the form so there are no mix ups on medication type, dosage, etc and emailed the form to her. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-21 12:41:31', '2024-05-21 12:41:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139598003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '5/21/24: Carey called. She had a telehealth appt with her pcp yesterday bc she tested positive for covid and was seeking medication. I advised that this wouldn''t be something included in your plan unless the issue became a large medical expense, but for the future - don''t forget to utilize your telehealth services with CIrrusMD as they are free to access and perfect for something like this. I helped her to navigate to the browser log in for Cirrus. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-21 12:40:01', '2024-05-21 12:40:01'),
