  ('zcrm_1579374000139533031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128581003', 'Ian Leventhal', NULL, '05.21.2024 Ian''s sharing request is not being fully shared, under the determination terms of "Pre-X conditions" that Zion is using. However, according to Ian, this is a completely isolated situation and has ZERO connection to what took place in the past. I took the time to read out loud the terminology in their guidelines re: pre-x, and let him know that we need to have a 3-way call with Zion to better learn of the reasoning, options, appeals as well as other parties we can connect with to help educate about the situation NOT being pre-X. 
After speaking with Amber, she transferred us to Bethany where Ian left her VM to call him back. We hung up to release Zion''s connection, and I called him back and re-iterated to connect with his PRESENT physician, let him know the situation and to help him clarify the terminology on his report to reflect a COMPLETELY isolated incident in December 2023 than of a year ago. 
            His visit in Dec was for Intussusception - Symptoms & causes: Intussusception (in-tuh-suh-SEP-shun) is a serious condition in which part of the intestine slides into an adjacent part of the intestine.
             His visit a year ago, was for food poisoning.
Ian will wait to hear back from Bethany. Then connect with the present physician with all his information. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-21 11:16:28', '2024-05-21 11:57:56'),
