  ('zcrm_1579374000139451054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135600001', 'William Spiccia', NULL, '05.20.2024 Joseph called to learn how to proceed to a dermatologist appt. I explained that it would be a cash pay visit, to collect the receipt, and sent him the HCBB and Healthgrades link and directions to be sure he''s finding fair pricing and quality care. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-20 16:18:22', '2024-05-20 16:18:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139452096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139602002', 'Maeve Williams', NULL, '5-20-24 Maeve doesn''t qualify for C4 bc she doesn''t have a legit SEP. Her employer Michael Caspen is changing her from PT to FT for June 1st. But, he''s not offering her a new group plan, he''s offering to pay 50% up to $250 for her new plan. So, I shared America''s Choice with her again and MCS. She''s not interested in America''s Choice. It''s too expensive and limited. She is interested in CARE+/SECURE HSA w/ RCI or Premium Care or HSA at $1000 or $1500 IUA. If she chooses CARE+/SECURE HSA at $1000 it''s the cheapest. If wants the $1500 IUA PREMIUM CARE/HSA is cheapest.  She was asking about HAB as well and maybe wants to add that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-20 15:57:33', '2024-05-20 15:57:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139452091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139464012', 'Matthew Neumann', NULL, '5-20-24 Matt is enrolling in Premium Care $1500/$212 for June 1st start date.  All set to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-20 15:09:13', '2024-05-20 16:06:13'),
