  ('zcrm_1579374000139452086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '5-20-24 David''s provider is still claiming they didn''t receive payment for his colonoscopy from 2022!  I sent him proof of the email from Shanae stating she reprocessed the claim on Jan. 10th, 2024. I sent Shanae another email just now to confirm check # or proof.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-20 14:06:16', '2024-05-20 14:06:16'),
