  ('zcrm_1579374000139451041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129213002', 'Monica Campbell', NULL, '05.20.2024 Monica called to get assistance in viewing her receipts/charges from MPB. For some reason the emails are not reaching her, regarding the monthly premiums. She also wanted to  learn how to explain the healthsharing process to better relay it to the facility, City of Hope, who performed a pap smear that revealed abnormal cells in her cervix. Monica opened a sharing request, and is connecting the facility with Zion for pricing and negotiations. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-20 13:11:52', '2024-05-20 13:13:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139416063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, '5/20/24: Caterina called, she''s having some pains and was recommended to go to the ER immediately. She feels bad for accumulating any large medical expenses, but I assured her it was fine and to please go. Just present as self-pay and ask for a self pay discount. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-20 13:11:29', '2024-05-20 13:11:29'),
