  ('zcrm_1579374000139451036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131323002', 'Jonathan Cockrill', NULL, '05.20.2024 Stephanie called to learn how to proceed with a preventive apt that might turn diagnostic. I guided her on the process and if it were to evolve into a diagnostic then we will open a sharing request. To call us if that were to happen and we will guide her again. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-20 12:49:57', '2024-06-10 15:35:46'),
