  ('zcrm_1579374000139452078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465016', 'Todd Smith', NULL, '5-20-24 Nahla found a fair priced colonoscopy at The Surgery Center at Lutheran in Wheat Ridge with a fair price of $3020. Cash price shows possible $2883. She will call Aimee and discuss.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-20 12:18:10', '2024-05-20 12:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139452073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, '5-20-24 Greg switched to Premium Care for June 1st to lower his monthly contribution amount by almost half, ie. about $300!  His new membership is $285/$1000, I waived the $100 and he''s set to go. He initially submitted his payment with a cc and didn''t realize the fees of 3%. So, he completed a Change Form to Update Payment to ACH. He also chose to add HAB $107 for June 1st. He said it''s a no brainer and gladly added that to his membership.  Total cost to him is $392. Greg''s original start date with MPB/Sedera was Aug. 1st, 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-20 12:09:44', '2024-05-20 12:20:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139394148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, 'Member cancelled previous Sedera membership and will be re-enrolling in the New Premium Care eff 6/1/24.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-20 12:09:04', '2024-05-20 12:09:04'),
