  ('zcrm_1579374000139451031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465016', 'Todd Smith', NULL, '05.20.2024 Aimee called to better learn how a colonoscopy screening pricing works. I explained the prev screening part and the biopsy diagnostic part. The facility was sharing the same information we do here on how we guide the members through both processes, so I told her they are telling her the truth. I sent her and Todd an email via CRM about HCBB. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-20 11:50:56', '2024-05-20 11:50:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139416053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120892002', 'Carly Swift', NULL, '5/20/24: Carly called asking how to access her preventive services like a mammography and colonoscopy, if she needs a referral or not. I advised that it would depend on the facility. For something involved like a colonoscopy, then probably yes, but for a preventive mammogram - she could call and check if the facility requires a referral. She asked how to present - I advised to show P card and have provider bill them directly. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-20 11:40:50', '2024-05-20 11:40:50'),
