  ('zcrm_1579374000139416023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, '5/20/24: Elizabeth called with a few questions:
1. Husband on Humira but there''s a ban on overnight shipping. They were able to get some help through Zion, but the med is $84K a year, and they were denied assistance through other measures due to their plan being determined alternate funding. I explained that essentially yes, what they have is an alternate to health insurance. 
