3. Daughter has care plus plan, what qualifies someone for the secure plan? I informed her that she would need to own her own business or collect 1099s for services, and to speak to their advisor Diane Border about if she could get that plan. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-20 08:51:36', '2024-05-20 08:51:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139416018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105831009', 'Dariusz Szteborowski', NULL, '5/20/24: Member called. His wife was having stomach issues and the doctor performed an endoscopy and prescribed medication. He received an $8,000 bill for the procedures and wants to know what to do. I advised him to open a new sharing request under his Zion member portal. He said that Zion didn''t pay much for his last request. I gave him the website address to access his portal and instructions on opening a new request. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-20 08:32:51', '2024-05-20 08:32:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139416013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638010', 'Douglas Merrifield', NULL, '5/20/24: Provider called to check Douglas''s eligibility. I explained the basics of his plan. Since it was a sick visit, I informed the provider that he would be a self-pay patient, and to have him call us if he has any questions. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-20 08:24:12', '2024-05-20 08:24:12'),
