  ('zcrm_1579374000139348013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124848011', 'Eileen Sun', NULL, '5-17-24 Calling Direct Benefits 651-259-6255 and spoke to Brent and he transferred me to 800-620-5010 option 4 and I spoke with Michelle. Michelle said the easiest path is to cancel the plan since she can''t just remove the payment method. She is cancelling it for June 1st, so nobody will be billed again. She will include me and Eileen on the cancellation request email. Eileen and Jennifer should be all set for this vision benefit. Eileen''s account # is 0300093397 for vision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-17 13:32:44', '2024-05-17 13:43:05'),
