  ('zcrm_1579374000139348008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124848011', 'Eileen Sun', NULL, '5-17-24 Eileen is going to cancel Cigna, cancel vision with VSP and for the HMA she might try to reimburse herself for some of the things she did. Her account is showing $132 since she''s not at the break even point yet. She wants to try to use up that money and then cancel the account before June 1st. She completed the update payment method already since she wasn''t ready to cancel it quite yet. She can''t see the current payment method information to make sure it changed. It''s just an online form she completed. Sounds like the payment is updated manually somehow. I have already contacted Elliott Gorog to find out the best way to make sure it''s successful and he''s said he will check with Geoff Kirk as well. I will contact VSP to remove the payment method for that next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-17 13:18:27', '2024-05-17 13:18:27'),
