  ('zcrm_1579374000139250023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139221238', 'Suzanna Steckley', NULL, '5-16-24 Matt enrolled today in Premium HSA $860/$1500 EF and had already enroll in HAB $250 the other day. He wants to make use of funding the HSA and also likes all of the other wellness benefits. He''s all set for June 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-16 16:06:31', '2024-05-16 16:06:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139250018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '5-16-24 Martha is planning for when her son turns 26 in July. He''s looking for jobs but doesn''t have anything yet and it may take many months. He can stay on until the end of July. We discussed moving him to CARE+ $1000/$240. He doesn''t do wellness visits other than dental cleanings. So, no need to pay for anything more. She will ponder it and let me know when they''re ready to make the change. I gave her July 1st or Aug. 1st effective date options. Their price remains the same since they have another child still on the membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-16 15:55:17', '2024-05-16 15:55:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139219079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133527002', 'Carl Cochran Jr', NULL, '5/16/24: Alana (member''s spouse) called to open their Zion member portal in order to submit a need. I gave her instructions on how to do so and transferred to Zion to begin the process. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-16 14:53:16', '2024-05-16 14:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139219069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093328002', 'Craig Anderson', NULL, '5/16/24: Lisa called stating that she got a bill from her provider for her preventive mammogram that was supposed to be paid for by Planstin. After asking her a few questions, it seems like she did everything right and it could possibly be a coding error. I advised her to speak to planstin to see what the issue might be. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-16 14:43:43', '2024-05-16 14:43:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139219064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128942001', 'Nicol Giandomenico', NULL, '5/16/24: Nicol called back to open a sharing request. I advised her on how to set up her member portal and trans to Zion to get the registration link. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-16 14:05:19', '2024-05-16 14:05:19'),
