  ('zcrm_1579374000139250013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, '5-16-24 Ryan will stay with his current membership since it''s the best and cheapest option. He doesn''t have a MEC. He''s interested in HAB but will have to get it approved first. He''ll let me know if/when he wants to begin. He will use the gym membership, dental, wellness, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-16 13:26:25', '2024-05-16 13:26:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139219059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128942001', 'Nicol Giandomenico', NULL, '5/16/24: Nicol called asking if Chiropractor, eye exams and glasses are services she can get with her MPB plan. I explained no - she said there used to be a way to get alternative services. I said that unless the chiropractor visits are part of an open sharing request then no. That MPB had a partnership with whole health living for coupons for alternative services, but that has been replaced. Nicol said that bs and she would call need to talk to someone else and hung up. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-16 13:03:14', '2024-05-16 13:03:14'),
