  ('zcrm_1579374000139255013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '05.16.2024 Lydia glass, has history with - MAP not paying her as a therapist - Spoke with Sherrie, but was not effective. Closest one they found for him is n Santa Monica who she said is a fit for him - Therapist did not sign. Wants a contract of EAP to learn of the terminology and why they wont'' pay her, and force her to sign up with them. They are not paying the therapist PHD, he''s been trying to get someone for a year, finally found one on his own, they are not processing the payments for him with her. Sherry sent the link for her to sign up, and the therapist has not responded back to her.  Needs to set up an appointment with therapist ASAP. Sent him someone from San Diego, but he lives in LA (Jessica Scheneck?) 12/2022 offered a provider Kurkian, in his city? - free consultation? - set it up in Zoom - then started wanting to charge John, when it is supposed to be part of his package. He then discontinued wanting to see this therapist. Others that were sent to him were not in his region. NO WHERE CLOSE. Sherry Myers found a fit for him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-16 12:25:16', '2024-05-16 12:30:05'),
