  ('zcrm_1579374000139111153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '5-15-24 Rick''s daughter, Rhyan is paying $275 plus cc fee $283.25 for SECURE HSA. We can change MEC which would be $309.20 but not good network for Aspen! So, instead we should drop the MEC for $50 making it $225 and add HAB for $107 to equal $332 at age 28 (turning 29 in June).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-15 16:28:06', '2024-05-15 16:28:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139111148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069411014', 'Rhyan Rosin', NULL, '5-15-24 Rhyan is paying $275 plus cc fee $283.25 for SECURE HSA. We can change MEC which would be $309.20 but not good network for Aspen! So, instead we should drop the MEC for $50 making it $225 and add HAB for $107 to equal $332 at age 28 (turning 29 in June).  I''ll call Rick tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-15 16:27:05', '2024-05-15 16:27:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139169033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '5/15/24: Willa asked how to access her mental health services? walked her though how to schedule with MAP.
New direct pcp? Willa is really interested in a direct care physician and exploring changing up her plan. I discussed the differences with her about each, but recommended she speak to Wendy if it''s something she really wants to do and reminded her that their plan right now qualifies them for their HSA whereas the Direct would not. Emailed Willa Zion''s guidelines for Preventive Services so she could do more research. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-15 16:21:59', '2024-05-15 16:21:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139169023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131706010', 'Sarah Larsen', NULL, '5/15/24: Carmen from Planstin called and relayed the message that Sarah and Andrew would like a refund since planstin did not backdate their start date to 2-1-24 as it should be. I let Carmen know that we will call the member tomorrow after I discuss this situation with billing and my supervisor. Reaching out to Julia via teams - will follow up 5/16. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-15 15:48:06', '2024-05-15 15:48:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139111137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139602002', 'Maeve Williams', NULL, '5-15-24  Maeve is 31, DOB 2/11/93. Lives in CO in Jefferson County, 80020. Referred to me by Michael Caspen via Andrea Hinman. She is an employee of Michael Caspen with CO Health Clinic. He will pay 50% up to $250 as an employee. Her husbands plan costs them $277 a month for UCH, CO Doctors Plan. It makes sense for her to choose a plan through her own work. She''s considering options that include good maternity as well but may not need that for over a year.  She''s healthy and rarely uses medical care other than for the birth of her child and wellness, ie. pap screening. She does her dental cleanings, gym membership and possible mental health. Doesn''t need nutritional health, vision or not necessarily 3rd IUA. I''m quoting her CARE+ $265 and HAB $107 = $372 for best maternity and best price at age 31. Quoting her America''s Choice $479 and great maternity but $500K cap. Finally quoting her RMHP, Cigna and Select plans. Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 is $353 a month. But, Cigna doesn''t include her Dr. Oberle. The other plans include her Dr.  I''m not sure if Dr. Oberle is in the PHCS network for America''s Choice.  We will talk again on Monday, May 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-15 15:01:38', '2024-05-15 16:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139111132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, '5-15-24 Jess removed Planstin MEC from MPB CareZ Worksite Bridge Membership for June 1st. She added HAB $250 EF. She added the two boys to their membership since they lost Medicaid. Pay should be $596.50 $1000 EF, No MEC and $250 HAB = $846.50 EF, June 1st effective.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-15 14:32:26', '2024-05-15 14:32:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139129086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123197010', 'Thais Alves', NULL, '05.15.2024 Thais called requesting the 1095 form. then Nicholas wanted the log in credentials for MPB Portal. There was a lot of educating on how a sharing request would work, and non-preventive visit process, and IUA interactions. Nicholas was able to accept the CirrusMD invitation and register successfully. I also requested via Teams chat to have the 1095 sent over to them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-15 14:13:41', '2024-05-15 14:44:07'),
