  ('zcrm_1579374000139111114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '5-15-24 Mat is part owner of Finesse Marketing and he wanted to move to the company membership which is Secure HSA. But, if he moves it will increase his price from $199 (no MEC) to $336.20 (w/ RCI MEC). He wanted the tax savings of the HSA and running it through the company. I suggested that he just has the company pay for his membership for now and the price increase will likely negate the tax savings of an HSA. But, he should defer to his tax professional.  I let him know that we will have to make a change with Finesse Marketing group soon to the new MEC but I don''t have to force that upon them today. Once we do that, he may switch his membership at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-15 11:50:29', '2024-05-15 11:50:29'),
