  ('zcrm_1579374000139129070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692197', 'Scott Ritterbuck', NULL, '05.15.2024 Scott needed clarifications on his plan. Knee injury. Initial visit Monday 5/13. Zion sharing request. Transferred him to Zion to open his mbr portal. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-15 11:21:38', '2024-05-15 11:30:58'),
