  ('zcrm_1579374000139111104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, '5-15-24 Jess needs to add the kids to their membership. They were kicked off Medicaid unbeknownst to them a month ago. We will add them to their membership MPB CareZ and just drop the MEC to be - $596.50 EF. We will add HAB $250 = $846.50 and add kids for June 1st. She can see if her dentist will delay the billing for their $350 annual membership. She just signed up for hers and Daniel is going in today or tomorrow. She will inquire. They will also use the $4500 wellness benefits. She''s going to do her colonoscopy this year and will do research to make sure where she goes bills fairly. She usually recommends her patients go to Gastroenterology of the Rockies. I told her they are notorious for crazy rates when they turn it into a diagnostic visit. She totally understands to do her homework on this front. She''s happy to hear HAB allows for thermography. She sees the labs included. They pay for ski passes. Might need vision for one kid. She''s happy to have freedom to see alternative doctors for wellness. I will call her this afternoon to help her complete the forms.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-15 11:04:11', '2024-05-15 11:04:11'),
