  ('zcrm_1579374000139111086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139221238', 'Suzanna Steckley', NULL, '5-14-24 Matthew is 56 and his wife is 55. Came to me via Terry and Melissa McDowell in Hood River, OR. Matt and family are in Jupiter, FL. One son is 19 and healthy. The other is in college and plays baseball with benefits already. Matt wants HSA compliance. He owns a small biz. They were looking at Zion already but open to my thoughts. Premium Care or HSA are more affordable and will give him everything he wants. He also will utilize most of HAB benefits. They both did their colonoscopies recently, Suzanna did her mammo recently. He''s not sure she even knows about a thermogram. They prefer alternative care and their son is fully on board with alternative and now teaches them about it. They do their skin checks, dental cleanings, vision screenings, gym for yoga (Matt surfs and swims), and his wife might be interested in a bone density scan. They are a Maybe for mental health.  They are interested in joining Premium HSA $1500/$860 EF and including HAB for ES $165. Total per month is $1025.  He enrolled in HAB. We tried to enroll in Premium Care but the price was totally wrong, so we aborted mission until May 16th at 10:30 am.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-14 21:03:57', '2024-05-14 21:04:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139111078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124848011', 'Eileen Sun', NULL, '5-14-24 I called Cigna and cancelled auto pay for Abbott Psyche. Cigna will send communications via mail to Eileen moving forward since her email is a work email and won''t work on 5/23/24 onward. I''ve sent the Cobra notice to Eileen and Jennifer. I''ve emailed Eileen about what she wants to do for medical, HMA and vision moving forward.  I spoke with Candace at Cigna Broker Services and she also gave me the client # for Eileen to call to cancel or update her payment method 877-484-5966.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-14 17:31:57', '2024-05-14 17:34:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139111073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124848011', 'Eileen Sun', NULL, '5-14-24 Eileen will be leaving Abbott Psyche on 5/23/24. With the help of Sean Burke, I created and sent the Cobra notice to Eileen and cc''ed Jennifer Abbott. I also called Cigna at 877-244-6215 and  cancelled auto pay.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-14 16:25:40', '2024-05-14 16:25:40'),
