  ('zcrm_1579374000139111041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, '05.14.2024 Jessica needed two lists: mammography and colonoscopy. I searched the lists for her AND sent her the results with directions to peruse at her own leisure.
