  ('zcrm_1579374000139111036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130236002', 'Tilio Lagatta', NULL, '05.14.2024 Teya called requesting to have the welcome emails and cards from Planstin. She did not receive those yet. I called Planstin and Karen sent them again. They were sent back in February. We then 3-way called Zion and did the same. Tee went ahead and sent her both the welcome email AND the portal link to reciprocate with Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-14 10:07:27', '2024-05-14 10:07:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139111028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118826002', 'Cathy Baker', NULL, '5-14-24 Cathy is 63 and wants wellness, colonoscopy, mammo, skin check, dental cleaning, vision screening, labs, gym- is open to it, nutritional health, integrative doctors, bone density scan!  She doesn''t care about mental health. She enrolled with ACH bank draft and June 1st start date. She knows it resets for Jan. 1st for benefits. She''s thrilled to include this. Her cost is $265 +$107 = $372 per month and knows the billing dates.
