  ('zcrm_1579374000139111003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '05.14.2024 Maria  called wanting to learn how to get covered for urgent care visits. I asked her to tell me more so I can best guide her. She shared that she has a UTI. I confidently guided her to use telehealth first, in hopes they will prescribe her some antibiotics. IF for whatever reason they would not, then the physician or urgent care visit will be a cash pay visit.
Maria downloaded the CirrusMD app on the phone, changed her passcode, and was able to start a chat WHILE on the phone with me. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-14 09:04:22', '2024-05-14 09:04:22'),
