  ('zcrm_1579374000139027108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128809002', 'Ann LeFiles', NULL, '5/13/24: Ann called with a couple of questions. She paid for a wellness visit for her son and wondering if she can get a reimbursement. I advised that planstin usually doesn''t do reimbursements but gave her the claims address just in case. She has an ER bill she needs to submit. I instructed her on how to open her member portal and submit a sharing request and trans to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-13 14:49:18', '2024-05-13 14:49:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139027103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171053', 'Brian Starling', NULL, '5/13/24: Brian called saying he has a colonoscopy scheduled in 2 days and is there anything he needs to do? I advised to 1.open his member portal and submit a sharing request and gave him the instructions to do so, and 2. he could either pay for the procedure and submit the bill afterwards, or call the facility and get an estimation to submit to Zion and try to get the funds ahead of time. He stated he''ll probably just end up submitting the bill afterwards bc it''s gotten a bit late. I transferred to Zion for him to register for his member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-13 14:38:36', '2024-05-13 14:38:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139027098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135466002', 'Brent Tunnell', NULL, '5/13/24: Miko called with questions about preventive appointments for her and her daughter. Her advisor told her she could go to the prev appt and get a reimbursement later. I advised that Planstin does not like to do reimbursements and require the providers to bill them directly. Her daughter is seeing a naturopathic doctor for her checkup and she is seeing an MD. I informed her that for planstin to pay for services, they have to be billed by a provider and medically coded as preventive and meet the aca guidelines. I emailed Miko some preventive care resources with links to PHCS network search and the list of services on healthcare.gov. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-13 14:24:13', '2024-05-13 14:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139027093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094002', 'Theresa Stratton', NULL, '5/13/24: Julia provided reset portal credentials for Theresa that worked. I have been going back and forth with Vinnie on this since 5/2. Emailed member new info and apologized for how long it took to resolve this issue for her. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-13 14:17:20', '2024-05-13 14:17:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139027078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '5/13/24: Called Lori back to try and walk her through sending her documents to Zion. She was having tech issues with the app I recommended she use to make her documents into pdfs. She was super frustrated and finally said she''d get her husband to help her, and that she would send us the documents. 
I advised to NOT send any more documents to MPB, and instead send them straight to Zion and gave her the appeals address, stating again that too much time has passed, and we''ve already gave her a substantial amount of guidance on her situation. At this point, the only thing left to do is file the paperwork. She said she just got busy and it "left her mind". 
She said she would send the paperwork today.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-13 13:26:24', '2024-05-13 13:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139064016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130371008', 'Rachel Yellin', NULL, '05.13.2024 A lot of health problems, unsure why. Consulted a couple of month ago, had tests done, PreX of Hashimoto''s disease.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-13 12:51:57', '2024-05-13 12:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000139064011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '05.13.2024 Lori Altman called seeking tech assistance on how to upload/share the document she scanned onto Scannable.
 
