  ('zcrm_1579374000139027073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131650010', 'Neil Goldsmith', NULL, '5/13/24: Neil called. They got a bill from gyno of a few dollars and he is confused because he thought it was completely covered. After he began to explain the charges, it wasn''t an obvious issue that I could help explain for him, so I advised he speak to Planstin and transferred him over. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-13 11:59:30', '2024-05-13 11:59:30'),
