  ('zcrm_1579374000138990003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138597002', 'Bladimir Aviles', NULL, '5-7-24 Bladimir is 28 and works for Ironwood Marketing/Tyler Fritz. He enrolled in Essentials all on his own and thankfully I saw his enrollment by accident in Admin123. I called him and he had no idea what he had chosen. He will get $200 reimbursement from Ironwood Marketing. I explained CARE to him and that''s exactly what he wants. He''s healthy, no tobacco, no meds, no real need for wellness visit. Lives in MA. He will pay for the membership on his own and get reimbursed from Tyler Fritz. I think the group is just the two of them now.  He will pay $40 for the $240/$1000 CARE+ and start June 1st. He''s rescheduling his welcome call for June. He was very appreciative of my call since he didn''t know what he was choosing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-10 21:32:37', '2024-05-10 21:32:37'),
