  ('zcrm_1579374000138887013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123690002', 'Sheala Smith', NULL, '5/10/24: Sheala called. The CirrusMD doctor recommended she go to and ER for symptoms she''s been having and Shela wanted to know if there was somewhere specific she needed to go. I advised that she can go anywhere and to choose a hospital she feels comfortable with. Present as self pay, and once she receives the bill - to submit to Zion for sharing after IUA is met. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-10 09:20:20', '2024-05-10 09:20:20'),
