  ('zcrm_1579374000138829092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134448007', 'Robert Ridpath', NULL, '5/10/24: Robert called. His wife has an appt today to remove an IUD and seek pain management from GOP. I called P to see if IUD removal is covered and Carmen said it is - but Member is not showing up in system. I manually emailed member''s info to member@planstin.com alerting them of the time sensitive appointment and that they need cards before this afternoon. 
