  ('zcrm_1579374000138887003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, 'Welcome call with wife Risa. Changed email on file. Also showed her member change form to fill out for email as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-10 08:46:04', '2024-05-10 08:46:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138886008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131740020', 'Duncan Burke', NULL, '5-10-2024
Kirk,

I just received news that Zion is not covering expenses for my knee as my doctors visit contained notes that I first reported symptoms two months prior to membership. 

I felt twinges of pain a couple months prior to seeing someone and that’s pre-existing? Ok. Well, you got me! I have zero confidence that this service will ever support my healthcare needs and will be canceling my membership immediately. 

As we discussed, this was my first foray into a healthcare option outside of the mainstream array of bad options, and so I was hopeful it would be a much needed service to support my ongoing health. However, given that I’ve been encouraged all along to seek treatment and pay out of pocket only to then learn months later it won’t be covering any expenses based on a reason that is by law covered by traditional healthcare is preposterous. 

This is exactly the kind of technocratic treatment that does us all a disservice by pitting healthcare providers against patients- in other words - you are no better than all the rest, in fact, worse. 

Duncan', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-05-10 08:15:37', '2024-05-10 08:15:37'),
