Sedera.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-09 14:21:57', '2024-05-09 14:21:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138829013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132140010', 'Christopher Melton', NULL, '5/9/24: Pre-ex thyroid condition and needs bloodwork done. How to get discount labs. accessing member portal and HCBB. Emailing portal credentials and links for lab sites. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 14:17:14', '2024-05-09 14:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138829008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118740002', 'Deven Hazelbaker', NULL, '5/9/24: HMA account card not working. I advised him to reach out to the bank he has his account under. Member was very confused about this, so I then advised him to speak to his advisor. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 14:00:58', '2024-05-09 14:00:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138843032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109381009', 'Bryan Felberg', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he had submitted a Cancellation yesterday 5/8 and could he cancel that request.  It had not been processed yet so I deleted it and told him that he is still active.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 13:38:03', '2024-05-09 13:38:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138843027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119797010', 'Ron Porter', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 6/1/24 citing employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 13:33:38', '2024-05-09 13:33:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138861003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118826002', 'Cathy Baker', NULL, '5-9-24 Left vm for her from call to me when I was gone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-09 13:03:36', '2024-05-09 13:03:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138843016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951309', 'Kaitlyn Laney', NULL, 'Member called in letting me know that she just a baby and wanted to add him to the membership.  I will send her out the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 12:42:41', '2024-05-09 12:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138830036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135466002', 'Brent Tunnell', NULL, '05.09.2024 Member Portal log in. Successful log in in the end. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-09 12:35:20', '2024-05-09 12:35:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138843011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578731', 'Ryan Tuinstra', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add dependent to membership eff 6/1/24.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 12:16:04', '2024-05-09 12:16:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138830026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126850001', 'Nicole Kutchai', NULL, '05.09.2024 Confused about her plan. Thought she could get telehealth. I confirmed she can. Tried to help her register, but needed to send CirrusMD a support ticket. 
**********************************************************************
CirrusMD Rep responded a few minutes later that they helped her register and sent her the information.
**********************************************************************
Spoke to Nicole again, she needed to learn how to proceed with a physical annual for the first time. I guided her then generated two PHCS lists: Family Practice & OBGYN. Information and attachments were sent via crm.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-09 12:13:24', '2024-05-09 17:25:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138843006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095959020', 'Mickey Chupek', NULL, 'I received the Change Form to add newborn to the membership.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 12:01:36', '2024-05-09 12:01:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138830018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098135002', 'Tommy McCoy', NULL, '05.08.2024 Tommy called to open a sharing request for 3 surgeries on a hip replacement: 3/4, 3/6, 4/15. Illona from Zion sent him the invitation link to open a portal, to start a sharing request.
Tommy started the process while we were on the line. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-09 11:54:02', '2024-05-09 11:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138830013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137202002', 'Kristianne Goff', NULL, '05.08.2024 Kristianne called to follow up on the integration file process. She''s been calling Planstin each day to check, but Planstin has not received the file from MPB. I checked in with Julia via teams and she confirmed that the file has not been sent to Planstin yet, and to make it a point to call Kristianne back tomorrow on friday afternoon and do a 3-way call will Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-09 11:40:28', '2024-05-09 12:05:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138830008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179002', 'Corey Vincent', NULL, '05.09.2024 Corey called to see if we have any benefits for vision care. I told him that WE at MPB, the plans do not carry those features, however, a lot of the advisors offer product companions to help with those items. He will connect with Analisa Cleland to learn more options. Call is an hour time stamp from the one now. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-09 11:30:49', '2024-05-09 12:48:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138830003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, '05.08.2024 Planstin card - prev
Elizabeth wanted to know where her preventive card is found. I guided her to her email and talked briefly about the prev process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-09 11:26:51', '2024-05-09 12:46:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138829003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '5/9/24: Craig called asking why the pharmacy only gave him 30 pills instead of 90 for his statins. He said the pharmacy claimed that''s all your insurance covers. 
I explained that he had 2 options - he could either use Planstin to pay for 30 day increments, or use the coupon and pay that price for a 90 day supply. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 11:18:52', '2024-05-09 11:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138128002', 'Justin Caid', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of June 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 11:06:45', '2024-05-09 11:06:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138772065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128331001', 'Jennifer King', 'New Membership eff 6/24', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 10:45:07', '2024-05-09 10:45:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138817003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130357019', 'Brett Smagala', NULL, '05.09.2024 Kim called trying to learn more about her plan, and how to proceed to attain a more entailed blood work done, in order to start testosterone shots. 
Kim wanted to know if she needs a prescription in order to do the bloodwork. Based on my experience with other members and what the discounted websites request, I told her you do need a prescription in order to attain or have any blood work done.
I sent her the detailed instructions, via Outlook, on HCBB and Healthgrades.
I helped her register with CirrusMD, she received the email successfully and she will try to get a prescription through them.
Call actually two hours from the time stamp here.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-09 10:29:17', '2024-05-09 12:44:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138795036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137631002', 'Remso Martinez', NULL, '5/9/24: Called to verify Julianna''s DOB since we have 2 on file. Leaving a voicemail was not an option. Sent an email asking for accurate info. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 10:29:17', '2024-05-09 10:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618002', 'McKinley Frazier', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 10:24:21', '2024-05-09 10:24:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138795031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, '5/9/24: Lady called. She has a pending need with Zion. It''s been pending for the past 2 months and she''s about to go in for a pre-op appointment. I advised her to speak to the sharing department at Zion as they can pull up her account and see what the hold up might be. Transferred her to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 10:13:11', '2024-05-09 10:13:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138795026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130447001', 'Dewayne Nelson III', NULL, '5/9/24: Andrea called with additional questions about her plan. Her son is going in for a psych eval and wants to know what to do. I advised on how to check and see if this provider is in MAP''s network if they were to go that route. Also, some mental health screenings are listed on the ACA so she check with Planstin to see how those services need to be coded. 
I encouraged her to use MAP for future appointments. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 09:58:51', '2024-05-09 09:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138754002', 'Melissa Osika', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of June 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 09:58:43', '2024-05-09 09:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138772042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095959020', 'Mickey Chupek', NULL, 'Spoke to member who was sent to me by Zion because he has to add his newborn to membership.  I will send him out the Change Form Link.  I advised of the time factor prior to 30 days', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 09:55:08', '2024-05-09 12:00:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138501002', 'Stephen Hill', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of June 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 09:53:58', '2024-05-09 09:53:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138305002', 'Wesley Bertch', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 09:45:37', '2024-05-09 09:45:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137735002', 'Jeffrey Danos', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of June 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 09:39:51', '2024-05-09 09:39:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137731002', 'Davina Warrener', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 09:36:34', '2024-05-09 09:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138812003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706105', 'Joseph Freije', NULL, '5-9-24 Joe needs to open a new Need for some knee and back issues he''s been dealing with for about 1 year. I let him know of the 6 month time limit and he''s ok with that. He will call our Concierge Team to start the need and show proof of paying $1000 already each for knee and back. He''s looking at getting possible PRP injection for his knee and asked about possibility of sharing for that. I explained the alternative care process of pre-approval. 
I explained HAB which he''s not a good candidate for. He doesn''t do dental cleanings, vision screening, wellness visits, mental health or any of that. He does go to the gym and owns a gym!  He could share it with his gym members who may benefit from HAB! He''s happy to do that. He was thankful for my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-09 09:25:00', '2024-05-09 09:25:00');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000138795021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133860009', 'Claire Kern', NULL, '5/9/24: Kelly forwarded the Concierge the following email from Claire:

I never received my welcome email from Zion health. I called Zion to create my login, and they said they have no record of me nor my family in their system at all. Perhaps the communication got dropped between your team and theirs. I have an R between claire and kern in my email address, and that often gets lost and messes up logins, so perhaps one of your team members typed my email address wrong when they went over my info to Zion. 

I will need my coverage to be back dated to when I first signed up for MPB health, which was sometime in mid february. 

I have my first need to share, which is why I figure out this mistake happened. Please let me know if I can do anything else to assist, and if not, then please reach out when I have been set up in Zion''s system and can create a login. 

***I added Claire to the member support form and reached out to let her know what to expect. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 09:14:47', '2024-05-09 09:14:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138795013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918010', 'Lauren Klucewich', NULL, '5/9/24: Lauren called and LVM about opening a need with Zion, said she didn''t get William''s email with link - I explained that he sent it on 4/17 with instructions and link. Explained how to submit her bills after portal is opened and transferred to ZIon. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 08:47:23', '2024-05-09 08:59:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138795008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137620002', 'Jennifer Wojtas', NULL, '5/8/24: member called very confused about what she has just purchased. I explained the major parts of her plan and suggested she hop on a welcome call for further clarification. Sent email to schedule call. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-09 08:44:40', '2024-05-09 08:44:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138772016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128663002', 'Sara Klotz', 'Member Aging into Medicare eff 6/24', 'Member submitted Cancellation on 4/4 I will process cancellation - 5/9', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 08:22:24', '2024-05-09 08:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138781003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130447001', 'Dewayne Nelson III', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Changed email on file as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-09 08:03:21', '2024-05-09 09:05:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138772008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138754002', 'Melissa Osika', NULL, 'Member  &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 08:01:23', '2024-05-09 08:01:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138772003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138574002', 'Tammy Basile', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-09 07:53:09', '2024-05-09 07:53:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138756064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790107', 'Stephen Hill', NULL, '5-8-24 Hello Stephen,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522190506
Benefits Start Date: 06/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-08 21:12:34', '2024-05-08 21:12:34'),
