  ('zcrm_1579374000138735048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120892002', 'Carly Swift', NULL, '05.08.2024 wanted to know more about her plan:
MAP: Gave her their number, confirmed each member has 12 sessions
Zion: Explained it''s her health sharing company
