  ('zcrm_1579374000138735018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116673002', 'Kevin Stanek', NULL, '05.08.2024 Kevin called to follow up on receiving links from CirrusMD. He was first expecting them from Angee directly, so then he searched for CirrusMD.
