  ('zcrm_1579374000138756003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138754002', 'Melissa Osika', NULL, '5-8-24 Neill had a meeting so Lisa enrolled them under her name as the primary. They are only months apart in age and Lisa is a little younger. She enrolled in CARE+ $1000/$635 and HAB $250 for June 1st start date. She knows of billing dates and chose ACH. She will follow up with Welcome Call and knows of Full Scripts new membership as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-08 14:35:53', '2024-05-08 14:35:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138729021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061594028', 'Aftan Murphy', NULL, '5/8/24: Member has degenertive arthritis in knees, might need a knee replacement for both knees. She needs to open a sharing request for the issue. Gave instructions on opening member portal, submitting her first need and trans. to Zion . AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-08 13:28:54', '2024-05-08 13:28:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138735008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103642010', 'Mary Huber', NULL, '05.08.2024 After further in depth attention to Mary''s situation among; Joan, Catherine, Rod and Angee and I - we decided a detailed and structured email to Mary was in order, to better clarify and empower her:
"Dear Mary,

We hope this email finds you well. 
Please accept our apology for the confusion in communication, and getting stuck in our answering system, while we are on the other line. We understand how frustrating this situation is, and not being able to connect with us emphasizes the discomfort.

I understand our last conversation was not successful, and I wanted to offer an additional option that could provide you with a solid base to start from for these types of prescriptions. 

Regarding your RX request for the specific manufacturers:
Progesterone: (Manufacturer = Aurobindo), 100mg, 90 Days
Estradiol: (Manufacturer = Mylan), patches - .075mg - twice a week - 90 Days

      We don’t have the tools to delve that deeply in our search for these requests. The resources we utilize to find great prescription prices do not show specific manufacturers. Also, calling and checking with pharmacies about your medications is not part of what we do as Concierge here at MPB. Our role is to do part of the leg work in opening several discounted websites, compare then clip the least expensive. If the least expensive happens to be different from the preferred pharmacy of the member, we clip both for convenience.
      Should we encounter a challenge in finding a coupon that is at least a 75% discount, we reach out to our international shopper, who most of the time is able to source the medicine at a much more affordable price. However, for your specific manufacturer necessity, he was unable to accommodate. 
      Should the medicine not be sourced by our international shopper and is extremely costly (like most diabetes and weight loss meds), we spend time doing research on the manufacturer to see if they offer any options for patients to save money.
        In the future, the questions you have regarding these medications should be directed to your health care provider, as they are educated in the field and familiar with what is available in your area, and the requests are very specific and unique. After these details are squared away, we are more than happy to perform searches to help you get the best price available.
Here is the protocol we use:
Complete the MPB RX Request form: https://www.cognitoforms.com/mpoweringbenefits1/prescriptionquoterequest 
Submit it, where it populates in our database to get picked up by one of the Concierge (Angee or Nahla).
Each medicine is allocated 1 business day to: do the search, clip and label appropriately, generate a detailed email and send, and document all the details.
Please note that we do have your best interest at heart here at MPB, and want you to be fulfilled with your membership in all aspects.
Wishing you will accept this as a mere attempt to guide you, one more time, regarding this specific request. We wish you well, and hope this pushes you further closer to attaining the medication that you need for optimum wellness. 

Please feel free to reach out to us after you speak with your provider, if he feels these medications may offer discount pricing.

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969"                                                                   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-08 11:48:06', '2024-05-08 11:48:06'),
