  ('zcrm_1579374000138622003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139074004', 'Pietro Simonetti', NULL, '5-7-24 Pietro watched the video and he''s not interested in MCS. It''s too much of a stretch for him. He''s coming from life long group coverage with Key Bank. His severance and Cobra ended March 3rd. So, he missed his SEP. He''s looking for another job and Key Bank just asked him to come back to work. He may only need coverage for a short time. His daughter has been accepted into Medicaid/Peak due to losing their home in the Marshall Fire. There''s a program to help those folks with medical expenses. She actually developed blood clots from the covid vax sadly at the age of 14 and now she''s 16. She''s all set with Medicaid for now. He can join America''s Choice 500 Plan for $679. Both Pietro and wife are healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no mental health issues. DOB Pietro 5/12/73 and wife 2/3/73. Also wants to review life ins for 15 or 20 YR Term. He was paying about $1500-$2000 annually total for both Pietro and his wife.  He has $750K DB for him and $300K DB for wife. That''s what he wants quoted. Finally he wants dental. They don''t have any dental issues but want cleanings and protection for small stuff or the potential for larger issues if needed. He will sign up for dental and medical today once he reads through it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-07 13:01:24', '2024-05-07 13:06:37'),
