  ('zcrm_1579374000138532008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '05.07.2024 Jared called to learn how to proceed with a dentist appointment. I did not see a product companion regarding dental no vision in his profile that I could speak to. I told him that is usually sold separately, and guided him to speak to his advisor Michael Dawson. He had never heard of Michael Dawson, but I gave him his email to connect with him.
