  ('zcrm_1579374000138497086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, '5-6-24 I sent an email to client about payment but it looks like she''s all set according to Patti''s notes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-06 16:34:35', '2024-05-06 16:34:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138497081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790107', 'Stephen Hill', NULL, '5-6-24 Stephen''s wife landed in the ER for some post-partum recovery complications. They dropped Cobra bc it''s so insanely expensive and he missed the deadlines to join MCS for May 1st. So, he''s still enrolled in HAB EF $250 for June 1st. He''s enrolling in CARE+ now for $1000 / $635 for June 1st. He realized he just learned his lesson on gambling since they have no ins for May and are already in the ER. He knows whatever is happening with his wife will be considered pre-x. He''s all set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-06 16:33:40', '2024-05-06 16:33:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138497076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115068001', 'Rachel Rowland', NULL, '05.06.2024 Rachel called to learn how to connect with the mental wellness program. I gave her Mazzitti &amp; Sullivan''s number, and let her know their hours. Rachel was not in front of a computer to view my guidance. She will call us if she has anymore question. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-06 16:13:06', '2024-05-06 16:13:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138497071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, '05.06.2024 Susan called to learn if a specific therapist is in the program. I told her that would be a great question for the Mazzitti  &amp; Sullivan group where we offer the mental wellness program from. I guided her to the website, suggested she save our member portal page, and helped her access the EAP page. I also gave her their times that they are open. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-06 15:59:18', '2024-05-06 15:59:18'),
