  ('zcrm_1579374000138466181', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819002', 'Kristin Dotlich', NULL, '5/6/24: Kristin called saying she hasn''t received anything from Planstin. I let her know that I would call planstin and check on this and give her a call right back. Kaitlyn issued new digital cards to Kristin. Called member back to confirmed she received the email. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-06 14:53:55', '2024-05-06 15:00:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138466171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113498002', 'Devin Miller', NULL, '5-6-24 Ashley called me... explained all. She will incure a price increase of $20 by staying with Secure HSA as she''s aged 55. She wants to re-enroll with Planstin. Sent her the link; told her to do it no later than September.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-05-06 14:45:44', '2024-05-06 14:45:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138466166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366082', 'Irene Mendyuk', NULL, '5/6/24: Irene called. Her husband is in ER and they are wondering how to pay. I advised for them to present as a self pay patient, and once the bill is sent to them, then submit to Zion for reimbursement. Irene said they could use their HSA for the visit. I said yes, you can absolutely do that, and then submit an itemized receipt afterwards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-06 14:42:24', '2024-05-06 14:42:24'),
