  ('zcrm_1579374000138497021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, '5-6-24 Patti called me bc Jill called Patti. Sedera is telling her she has a $5K IUA. However, she never completed a change form. We have absolutely not proof of a change and Jill also believes she''s had the $1000 IUA all along. That''s what she''s paying for. Sedera shows they changed it to $5K around 5/22/22. But, Jill was simply opening a Need at that time and setting up her banking information to get reimbursed. This was around the time of the transition but she didn''t have to go through the process in the way most did since she already had an open need. Patti sent a note to Mady to get this resolved. Jill was much calmer now that she seemed to be with Patti since she just looked through her emails as well. We are both in agreement that nothing was changed at that time. We will wait to hear back from Mady next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-06 12:39:30', '2024-05-06 12:39:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138467029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, 'Member called in and left a VM that she went to open a need with Sedera and was told that she had a $5000 IUA.  She has always had a $1000 IUA since she made the transition at Sedera back in 8/20.  There has not been any changes to her membership other than a price adjustment back in 12/23 when she aged into the 50 age band.  Sedera told me that this was done on 5/23/22.  However they cannot tell me by who.  I have escalated this to Mady to look into and maybe get some clarity.  Member extremely upset and  is having a major health issue.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-06 12:29:04', '2024-05-06 12:29:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138497013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130236002', 'Tilio Lagatta', NULL, '05.06.2024 Tilio called to learn if physiotherapy is something that would be considered for sharing. He''s getting physiotherapy for neck and shoulder issues - cash paying. Chiro also.
We did a 3-way call with Zion to confirm the process, and spoke with Amber. She sent him the invitation link that he opened while still on the phone, and opened a portal with them as well.
Tilio also wanted to know how to proceed with wanting to be seen for the nose bleeds he''s been receiving. I explained that he''ll need to start with his initial visit, and see what the doctor tells him. He might just give him a prescription or he might prescribe a treatment journey that''ll require him to have services that will reach his IUA, $1000. Tilio seemed understanding and grasping the process. We let Amber go, and he hung up with her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-06 12:18:08', '2024-05-06 12:36:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138497008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131623002', 'William Pullano', NULL, '05.06.2024 Karen checking on if her file was finally integrated. I reached out to the IT department, Adan &amp; Vinnie. Julia shortly responded saying that Karen is now in the transition file, and will be sent out today before the day is over. 
I called Karen back and got to speak with her to let her know the above. I will call Planstin upon my arrival to my shift tomorrow to confirm she''s solid, and call her back if that''s the case. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-06 12:14:49', '2024-05-06 12:44:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138502003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122383002', 'David Edwards', NULL, '05.06.24:  Bryan Amaya of Script Sourcing emailed us to inform us the Debt Dismissal program completely wiped out David''s medical debt of $621,000. He has been totally freed from debt and is also entitled to a refund! Catherine asked me to contact David to request he share his story with us.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-05-06 12:12:22', '2024-05-06 12:12:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138478056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137206018', 'Laura Johnson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-05-06 11:23:03', '2024-05-06 11:23:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138466095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109512002', 'Gabrian McPhail', NULL, '5-6-24 ATAP. Spoke with Gabe at length.  She will save $27/mo by converting to Sedera''s Premium HSA membership. Sent her the link to the Cognito form to make the change.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-05-06 11:20:55', '2024-05-06 11:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138466090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745001', 'Louis Marchetti', NULL, '5/6/24: Jessica called. Her OB found a fibroid and they think it may be contributing to some fertility issues. She wondered how to sumbit a need and what to do if she needed surgery. I advised her that according to ZIon''s guidelines: testing and treatment for fertility issues is not an eligible expense, however the removal of a fibroid would be a separate issue and could be shareable. Gave her advice on how to submit this as a need with Zion and transferred her to Zion to get a link to register for member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-06 11:20:07', '2024-05-06 11:20:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138466085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130290009', 'Kelly Stecklein', NULL, '5/6/24: Kelly called saying she hasn''t gotten anything from Planstin. I said I''d call and look into it and give her a call back. Spoke to Caden from P- Caden said it was sent in December, and they resent the cards as well as the onboarding emails. Verified with Kelly that she received them.
Kelly also said that her advisor told her she could go to her regular OBGYN appt and get a reimbursement. I said no, that''s not how planstin operates. They require the bills to be sent to them directly from the provider. I called Leslie and LVM to clarify that this is not something members can do. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-06 11:18:25', '2024-05-06 11:18:25'),
