  ('zcrm_1579374000138466036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116003002', 'Robert Hanley', NULL, '5/6/24: Andrea called to submit bills related to her daughter''s genetic testing. I asked if she had registered for her member portal yet with Zion. She said she had no idea she needed to register for a portal - that wasn''t something anyone told her - but Nahla previously went through this process with her. She was very frustrated at the fact that she can''t get a definite answer on whether or not this issue will be shared. I explained that while we can''t give her a definite answer, we are here to help her through the situation, and her next step at this time is to submit the need with the information she has now. I advised her to set up her Zion member portal, open a need and submit all the information zion is asking for. Transferred her to Zion to get the link again. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-06 09:31:35', '2024-05-06 09:42:17'),
