  ('zcrm_1579374000138466008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130571025', 'Charlotte Cadieux', NULL, '5/6/24: Charlotte called. She received 3 bills from planstin and quest and is confused bc she was under the impression that Planstin pays for all the preventive visits. I explained that planstin will pay for preventive services listed on the aca guidelines. From her explanation of the bills, it seems like she got a duplicate bill - one from quest and one that was kicked back from planstin. I advised her to speak to planstin directly as they can see what claim was sent it and will be able to tell her exactly what was paid for and why. Gave her P number and transferred over. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-06 07:34:06', '2024-05-06 07:34:06'),
