I spoke with Joan and asked if I could call him back with more options. In the meantime, I recommended he google search " Surprise Billing in AZ".
After speaking with Joan, it was apparent and corroborated that there is not much or anything MPB nor Sedera can do given the time that has gone by, 5 years, especially with Sedera being rigid with their deadlines.
Ross understood, but was not happy, he was disappointed. and willing to go ahead with the Surprise Billing approach:
