  ('zcrm_1579374000138366026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103642010', 'Mary Huber', NULL, '5/3/24: Mary called. She was able to get the right manufacturer estradiol patches sent to her local kroger pharmacy, and have a compounding pharmacy make the other medications, and is now wanting coupons for both. I explained that I could go ahead and start working on clipping the coupon for her Estradiol, but our resources aren''t applicable for specialty formulated prescriptions. She mentioned only having to pay 80% of the compounded price. I''m unfamiliar with what she is talking about with that, and suggested that she speak with Nahla again regarding the compounded drugs since she is more familiar with her situation. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-03 10:01:30', '2024-05-03 10:01:30'),
