  ('zcrm_1579374000138366021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137202002', 'Kristianne Goff', NULL, '5/3/24: Kristyanne called asking how to get Planstin cards sooner. I advised to call and ask for digital ones to be sent. She asked how to get discount labs. I gave her 3 site options and checked to see if Quest or Labcorp was close to her which it is. I explained how the sites worked and advised that if she needed assistance, we are here to walk her through it. Transf. to P for cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-03 09:34:16', '2024-05-03 09:34:16'),
