  ('zcrm_1579374000138352008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099565002', 'Dennis Flannigan', NULL, 'Member called in approx 4/17, told me he spoke to Planstin and they do not have his son Jack on the membership.  After trying to get member off the phone so I could speak to Planstin they told me that they had the dependents information there , however he was never added to the membership.  I asked if we could back date his membership and they said no.  I do not have any explanation as to why dependent was not added it was in the file.  I handed this over to Karina and she is refunding member.  Now mwmbwe3 wants Monthly statements and a reason why his son was not added to membership.  Payment was put on hold until this was sorted.  Now I will change membership and charge member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-03 07:40:35', '2024-05-03 07:40:35'),
