  ('zcrm_1579374000138286105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125105002', 'Dean Powell', NULL, '5-2-24 Called Dean, he is on the form now and fixing today.  Apparrently he had a banking issue and needed to change banks.  But he likes his Secure HSA and  and intends to continue on.  Had a mental health Q, referred him to Concierge team.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-05-02 15:27:04', '2024-05-02 15:27:04'),
