  ('zcrm_1579374000138326018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '5/2/24: Member called to check if a doctor is in the PHCS network. I did several searches for her requests and came up with nothing. I advised her to first ask the provider if they are a part of the PHCS network, and if not are they willing to bill planstin. She then asked if a pap smear is included for a 14 year old. I informed her that the ACA guidelines state paps for ages 21-65, but she is welcome to double check with planstin directly. It is a mute point if it''s not even a service covered by Planstin. Transferred over to Planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-02 09:08:29', '2024-05-02 09:08:29'),
