  ('zcrm_1579374000138326013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094002', 'Theresa Stratton', NULL, '5/2/24: Theresa called to see if an annual derm appt is included in her Planstin MEC. I informed her that is is not, and for future reference, she can find all of the services included on Healthcare.gov - that there''s a quick link on our website under the Member Portal page. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-02 08:27:30', '2024-05-02 08:27:30'),
