  ('zcrm_1579374000138315063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '5/1/24: Paul called, he needs to go to ER and wanted to know how to present. I advised to present as self pay, and then give us a call later if he needs help submitting the bill. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-01 17:37:34', '2024-05-01 17:37:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138315058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107136010', 'Aryel Gladden-Banning', NULL, '5/1/24: Aryel called with questions regarding included wellness visits for her daughter. I read her the list of visits listed on the ACA guidelines and then transferred to Planstin for her to request additional cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-01 17:18:58', '2024-05-01 17:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138315053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '5/1/24: Peter called saying that the hospital is requesting that Planstin send them a "denial of coverage" letter in order to re-bill him as self pay. I brought planstin into our call so we could both speak to them together and make sure Peter got the letter. Nadi explained that an explanation has already been sent, but she can email it to Peter and fax to hospital with his permission and an accurate fax number. Peter said he''ll go ahead and call hospital now to get number and then call planstin back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-01 15:45:49', '2024-05-01 15:45:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138315048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '5/1/24: Peter called and said he got a 30K bill from the hospital. They ran it through Planstin. I advised to call the billing office and let them know that they billed it incorrectly - that planstin is only for preventive services. I suggested he let the hospital know that he is a self-pay patient and would like a self pay discount. Then submit the bill to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-01 15:11:49', '2024-05-01 15:11:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138312041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136403002', 'Duane Ellsworth', NULL, '05.01.2024  RX Request.

"Glad I was able to find you savings for:
Unithroid: 112mcg, 90Tablets

I see you chose OptumRX as your preferred pharmacy, however that is for the CoPay plan we also offer at MPB.
I took the liberty to clip two coupons for Safeway and Frys. Brand or Generic were not indicated, so I went with brand, since the price difference was super miniscule. 

The prices below are as of today 05.01.2024:
Unithroid: 112mcg, 90Tablets
Safeway = $12.53
Frys = $12.90

Please let us know if you need anything changed or adjusted. We are here M-F, 9am-8pm ET. I am currently signing off for the day, but Angee will be on till 8pm if you need this changed RIGHT AWAY." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-01 15:09:13', '2024-05-01 15:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138312036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, '05.01.2024 Dorian wanted to confirm who her healthsharing company is, should her colonoscopy become diagnostic - SEDERA confirmed. And how to get a discounted rate for her colon med prep. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-01 15:00:32', '2024-05-01 15:00:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138315043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109794002', 'Sharri Maynard', NULL, '5/1/24: Sharri called about the exact same issue I noted on the 22nd. I advised for a second time for her to call Zion as they are the ones managing the need. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-01 14:47:25', '2024-05-01 14:47:25'),
