  ('zcrm_1579374000138312018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121824002', 'Meghan Nyswaner', 'SENT Perm to Speak on the MPB Plan with Adam Nyswaner 05.01.2024', '05.01.2024 Meghan''s husband, Adam, called regarding her daughter Oakley. Been to the hospital in the last few days. Wanted to know how to proceed with the financial portion. I coached Meghan and Adam to present as cash pay, and expect the price to decrease. Collect any paperwork, including the payment they make towards their IUA, $2500. Once they are home and are settled, give us a call back to go through the minute steps of opening a sharing request with Zion.
NB: Meghan is giving Adam permission to speak on her behalf on this plan, when she needs help. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-01 13:34:53', '2024-05-01 14:10:31'),
