  ('zcrm_1579374000138315033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256002', 'Christopher McNiven', NULL, '5/1/24: Chris called bc he got a bill for his colonoscopy for $297, and wanted to know what to do about it, and if he should pay for it with his HSA. I suggested calling Planstin and finding out if is a billing error or if it''s related to being in or out of network. If it''s billing, he could have the bill resent, and if it''s network - then yes, go ahead and pay for it with his HSA account. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-01 12:15:08', '2024-05-01 12:15:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138315028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '5/1/24: Lisa called to set up her member portal. I provided her with her Member ID number to access the new MPB app, and gave her instructions for opening her portal. Transferred to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-01 11:47:42', '2024-05-01 11:47:42'),
