  ('zcrm_1579374000138316006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '05.01.24:  Messged Nahla this morning to notify her Lisa may be calling her for help accessing Zion to open a sharing request.  Lisa called me at 1 p.m. Said her cat bit her on her knuckle and it became infected. She went to several doctors and they said they didn''t think she needs the hospital. She''s going to see an orthopedic surgeon today to see what further treatment she may need in addition to the antibiotics she''s been given.  She said she will now call the concierge to get help accessing Zion.  She doesn''t remember ever registering for their portal.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-05-01 11:16:56', '2024-05-01 11:16:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000138315008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128937002', 'Tracy Hulse', NULL, '5/1/24: James and Tracy called with a list of questions:
1. Tracy needs to change her name - Fill out Member Change Form
2. How to present bc hospital charged Planstin for surgery and it took 2 months to get the cash pay discount of 7K. I advised to just be proactive about directing the providers prior to your appt. whether or not you''ll be using Planstin or self-pay.
3. Is there any discount labs we can get. I advised that the labs related to your need can be submitted as part of that, but for preventive to call the labs in your area and see if there are any other options - since our discount lab sites weren''t helpful for where they live.
4. During Tracy''s emergency gallbladder removal, they found something on her kidney''s - how does that work. I explained it would be a separate issue with a new IUA.
