  ('zcrm_1579374000138253039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130296001', 'Sheri Nordstrom-Wehner', NULL, '04.30.2024 I heard back from Patti. The following was sent to Skip:
"Greetings Skip,

Thank you for reaching out to follow up on this. I''m glad I can help clarify the process and help move it along in the right direction.
We are sad to see you go but understand how the opportunities align.
I reached out to the billing department, to attain more information on this, since I''m being added in the middle of it. Due to this being entangled with financial calendar obligations, it is not possible to process a refund. MPB billing received the change form on 4/17 and it was processed on 4/18. for a 5/1 effective.  They cannot backdate refunds.

If you would like further details on the process, please do not hesitate to contact us again. We''d be glad to speak with you.

Once a member, always a member. "                   

