  ('zcrm_1579374000137991102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139074004', 'Pietro Simonetti', NULL, '4-25-24 Daniel Barsky (?) from UHC gave Pietro my name. Pietro wasn''t sure how he knows me. He thinks Dan may have found me on the C4 site which makes sense since Pietro lives in Louisville.  Pietro has a UHC plan now through his company that he''s worked for for 25 years! His cost is $2000 per month for his current plan with a little help from his employer. His daughter is 16 and has some blood clotting from covid or the vax they think. She''s on blood thinners. He can put her onto Peak he thinks. Not sure if he means Medicaid? But, he seems to have an option for her if we need to separate the family since she now has pre-x. He and his wife are fine. I sent him the video to watch and we will meet on Tuesday, May 7th at noon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 17:19:59', '2024-04-25 17:19:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893179', 'Brian Cosner', NULL, '04.25.2024 Brian needs to reinstate his membership plan, due to the job falling through. I offered him Wendy''s contact information and transferred him to Patti''s number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-25 16:29:08', '2024-04-25 16:29:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138754002', 'Melissa Osika', NULL, '4-25-24 Neill is a character and super nice, as is his wife. He says Rob Woodward is his best boss ever. They have fun. He is paid as a W2 employee. So, I shared CARE+ $635/$1000 and HAB $250 = $885. They will make use of the wellness visits, dental cleanings, vision screenings, sports/fitness/gym/YMCA, etc. They will read it over. They watched the video and understand it very well. We will meet again on May 8th for enrollment once they''ve done their homework on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 14:46:03', '2024-04-25 14:46:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136872002', 'Hank Smith', NULL, '4/25/24: Member called asking for Member number to schedule PCP visit. I explained his start date isn''t until 5/1, and that he should get cards in the mail and email from Planstin that contains his member number for preventive appointments. Also recommended he schedule a welcome call so we can educate him on the parts of his plan. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 14:43:35', '2024-04-25 14:43:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137970028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, '4/25/24: Member called in to inquire how to go about submitting a sharing request for an upcoming dermatology appointment he had coming. -  WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-25 14:40:18', '2024-04-25 14:40:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, '4/25/24: Originally, we were going to  3 way call Zion with Sheila, but it looks as though that slipped through the cracks. Added Sheila to Member Support Form to have access to Zion Preventive Sharing added to her account on their end, as Zion has no record she is on the Direct Plan. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 14:31:32', '2024-04-25 14:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129039020', 'Mathew Aho', NULL, '4/25/24: Returned Mathew''s call about adding wife to plan and making other changes - Left a detailed voicemail and followed up with an email including membership change link. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 14:14:14', '2024-04-25 14:14:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123505002', 'Catherine Fisher', NULL, '4/25/24: Catherine called. She''s having an ultrasound on her thyroid and asking how to present. I suggested using her planstin card since she has the copay plan and that she should be able to pay a $200 copay for the test with a max payout of $1000. And if there are more expenses related to her issue, to submit them as a sharing request. Advised on how to open a sharing request and trans to Zion to get the process started. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 14:03:10', '2024-04-25 14:03:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138754002', 'Melissa Osika', NULL, '4-24-24 Neill is 44, Lisa 44, Ella 11 and Olivia 6. Neill works for Rob Woodward. They don''t have pre-x, no tobacco, Lisa is a fitness instructor but has family hereditary high blood pressure that she takes a medication for. Otherwise they are all healthy. They do their annual wellness visits. Neill just had his colonoscopy this year. They are paying Ambetter about $1400+ with a high ded and mop. They live in NW Indiana, about 30 min. from Chicago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 14:02:44', '2024-04-25 14:42:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137959069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address.  I will process.  Address was not updated in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 13:39:09', '2024-04-25 13:43:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137959064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004339007', 'Phil Guinouard', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 13:23:45', '2024-04-25 13:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137959059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117970009', 'Marissa O''Neal', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 13:12:42', '2024-04-25 13:12:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098329001', 'Darius Kohanim', NULL, '4-25-24 Darius let me know he''s still fighting with the hospital re his preventative colonoscopy. They are saying the Dr. is in network but the hospital is not. He''s doing everything he can to get the bill removed. But, he will submit it to Zion if he has to. They can help pay above his $1000 IUA, therefore $1700 of the remaining $2700 bill. The colonoscopy was clean and clear, no issues! Not sure how the bill can be over $10K for this!!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 13:10:08', '2024-04-25 13:10:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137959054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113788002', 'David Joyce', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in wanting to cancel.  I told her to get in touch with her advisor and that I would send her out the Cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 13:08:48', '2024-04-25 13:08:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137959046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117970009', 'Marissa O''Neal', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled eff 6/1/24 after cancelling eff 4/24.  I will re process.  Previous enrollment 5/1/2023-4/1/2024', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 13:04:35', '2024-04-25 13:05:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, '4-25-24 After much back and forth with Pam she just decided to cancel MPB and go with her husband''s group health plan. The plans don''t look great but she couldn''t wrap her head around the differences. She also couldn''t supply me with the cost through the employer for each plan option. She seems to think they make come back to MPB if this job doesn''t last. We will see.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 12:46:52', '2024-04-25 12:46:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153961021', 'Patricia Lenz', NULL, '4-11-24 Patti came to me via Kara Wells. Patti owns her own company. She was working with LHS but isn''t super Christian. She really likes the idea of HAB. No pre-x, no tobacco, just meds for estrogen. She had hernia surgery 3 years ago and that''s it. This would be for her only.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 12:22:02', '2024-04-25 12:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137959041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137826002', 'Michael Gelfeld', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 12:13:18', '2024-04-25 12:13:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109183002', 'Joseph Szymanski', NULL, '04.25.2024 Liz chatted us via SalesIQ, to learn what options they have to get some bills covered. A few weeks before they cancelled their membership, for medical reasons, their son had a scary episode where he lost his vision. They have reached out to seek alternative financial assistance, but it does not look promising, so they resulted back to us to see if there''s any hope for Zion to honor their plan, while still active. Liz will call us tomorrow to do a 3-way with Zion to learn of all the options. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-25 12:08:11', '2024-04-25 12:08:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137991051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '4-23-24 

Getting Started with
Your Health Access Benefits
Hello Laura,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522190296
Benefits Start Date: 05/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 12:07:28', '2024-04-25 12:07:28'),
