  ('zcrm_1579374000137991036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131784002', 'Pia Wasterval', NULL, '04.25.2024 Pia called with 11 lab work that she wants to save money on. At first I sent her the 4 websites we usually use. Then I realized she lives in one of the restricted states, NY. So I told her I''d like to find something else for her and if I can put her on hold. She accepted.
