  ('zcrm_1579374000137991026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080943010', 'Gaia Marrs', NULL, '4-25-24 Gaia chose to change to CARE+ $450 /$1000 EC and add HAB $200 = $650. She will definitely use the gym membership for aikido and/or ski pass, dental cleaning, wellness visits, etc. They are not funding an HSA right now. She had troubles with Planstin recognizing their kids are on the membership. They finally fixed it and she''s still working with them to pay some outstanding bills. She''s keeping Planstin until June 1st and will sort that stuff out in the interim. She chose to add HAB for May 1st since she has a dental cleaning coming up and aikido always. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 11:34:35', '2024-04-25 11:34:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, '4/25/24: Linda called to see if some recent appointments were shareable. They were related to diabetes and high blood pressure. I explained that diabetes medication and testing were not shareable according to the guidelines, but there is limited info on high blood pressure, and advised her to ask Zion directly before submitting her need. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 11:29:03', '2024-04-25 11:29:03'),
