  ('zcrm_1579374000137991003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, '4-25-24 Kia lives in ID where the PHCS network is very limited. She chose to remove Planstin MEC and add HAB. She doesn''t fund the HSA. She does fund the HMA. She does yoga classes and rock climbing gym, wellness visits, pap screenings, etc. She''s excited to add this. The total cost will be $265 / $1000 CARE+ and $107 HAB to equal $372. She knows billing dates are 20th and 1st and is set to go with ACH bank draft. May 1st start start for HAB and for change to CARE+.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-25 10:25:17', '2024-04-25 10:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768159', 'Robert Pyle', NULL, '4/25/24: Robert called. He was wondering if he needed a referral?? And said the last person he talked to referred him to Optum RX for his immunization questiouns. He got the first round of Hep A and B and needs the third. I explained that as long as he goes to a participating pharmacy, like the one he went to before and presents his planstin card for billing, he should be good, but he may want to call the pharmacy first to make sure they have the immunization. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 10:21:21', '2024-04-25 10:21:21'),
