Member submitted OU form I will rerun - 4/26', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 10:05:38', '2024-04-26 09:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, '4/25/24: Pam called. Her husband got insurance through an employer and needs to cancel. I explained the process for cancellation is to contact her advisor. She asked if she could get reimbursed for May. I explained the deadline for cancellation and changes is the 19th of the month but would be happy to transfer her to billing to see if there is anything they can do for her. Informed her how to access the cancellation form and transferred to Patti. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 10:04:57', '2024-04-25 10:04:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137960083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133844002', 'Alex Woelfel-Smith', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-25 10:03:40', '2024-04-25 10:03:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137959013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that her spouse just got employer benefits and that they would have to cancel.  She was very appreciative when I told her that I could refund her the 5/24 Share Amount.  I will send her out the link.  She has already been in contact with Wendy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-25 10:01:19', '2024-04-25 10:01:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137960078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131785018', 'Trevor Halpern', NULL, 'Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-25 09:59:47', '2024-04-25 09:59:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137960068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131799002', 'Natasha Farrell', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-25 09:47:52', '2024-04-25 09:47:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137960058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131801011', 'Christopher Stutes', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-25 09:44:28', '2024-04-25 09:44:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137964003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120892002', 'Carly Swift', NULL, '4/25/24: Carly called with questions about plan:
1. Physical Therapy shareable? I read her the info from the guidelines and reminded her that if it is determined shareable, it would only be after her 5K IUA is met.
2. Son had stitches, is that a separate IUA? Yes
3. Does the IUA start over each year? Explained that she will never be responsible for more than 3 IUAs in a 12 month rolling period. 
4. What is covered without paying IUA? I explained the difference between her Planstin MEC and Medical Cost Sharing,  and where to find services paid for by the MEC, plus examples.
5. Can I go ahead and submit bills for a need before IUA is met. Yes, and there is a 6 month deadline to submit bills from date of service.
6. Do I just show doctor planstin card for preventive services? Yes, for preventive services, present your Planstin card and have provider bill Planstin directly. For larger expenses that will be submitted to Zion for medical cost sharing, present as cash pay.
7. Where do I access my Zion Member Portal? Gave her website address for portal. 
***Informed Carly about Zion''s new search tool on their website, where she can search for shareable expenses and other parts of their guideline easily. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-25 09:41:41', '2024-04-25 09:41:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137960048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131956012', 'Ty Perdue', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-25 09:38:59', '2024-04-25 09:38:59'),
