  ('zcrm_1579374000137954003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130263002', 'Philip Kohnen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member overwhelmed with information. Went through website with him. Don''t think he is right fit for this plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-25 07:59:04', '2024-04-25 08:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137906041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135434019', 'Abbey Erquiaga', NULL, '04.24.2024 RX Request:
"Hello Abbey,
I''m glad I was able find savings for:
Trazodone Hcl: 50mg, 60 tablets
Propranolol: 20mg, 30 tablets
The prices below are as of today 04.24.2024:
CVS
Trazodone Hcl: 50mg, 60 tablets = $6.63
Propranolol: 20mg, 30 tablets = $5.93
Please let us know at the concierge line if you need anything changed or adjusted. We are here M-F, from 9am - 8pm ET."                               NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-24 16:54:55', '2024-04-24 16:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137906036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507139', 'Penny Dias', NULL, '04.24.2024 Frank and Penny called back today so we can confirm the sharing request process, given it being such a new plan. After speaking with Zion, we learned that most likely the biopsy would not reach the IUA, $2500, and Frank confirmed it is presently priced at $1800. Frank has medicare background and shared how overly priced this facility is for a simple procedure, such as a breast biopsy. 
I sent both Frank and Penny an email with the HCBB and Healthgrades links, to proceed with searching for a cheaper price for that same procedure in their area. They will call back if they have any questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-24 15:51:28', '2024-04-24 15:51:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137906028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116003002', 'Robert Hanley', NULL, '04.24.2024Andrea called to learn how to proceed with a genetic lab testing. After searching Zion''s guidelines, it shared that "Genetic Testing can be considered to be shared, under an already approved Sharing Request", in this case she mentioned "Short Stature". We called Zion, spoke to Mandy, and she explained that is it a unique situation, and opening a sharing request is in order, but she cannot give a definitive decision, as the medical advocacy team will need to do their own research including the request of the medical records. 
Mandy sent Andrea the invitation link to register for their portal with Zion and open the sharing request from there. Mandy was confident to take it from here on her own. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-24 15:43:05', '2024-04-24 15:44:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137906023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098329001', 'Darius Kohanim', NULL, '4-24-24 Darius called bc his provider is balance billing him on his preventative colonoscopy. His bill was over $10K!  Planstin has already paid $8K showing the provider is in-network. The facility is trying to charge him $2700 more. I suggested he has to work with his provider to remove the balance bill since they aren''t allowed to do so for the ACA wellness visit in network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-24 15:17:00', '2024-04-24 15:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137881108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105322002', 'Christopher Ambrosio', NULL, '4/24/24: Did cancellation call, lvm and sent referral. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-24 14:49:48', '2024-04-24 14:49:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137881093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134879002', 'Darlene Tobias', NULL, '4/24/24: Did cancellation call, lvm and sent referral email. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-24 14:36:24', '2024-04-24 14:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137906013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137607002', 'Amanda Caras', NULL, '4-24-24 Amanda and I discussed NLG Term Life 30. Hope Institute will pay $25 per month. So, she can get $150K-$200K face amount depending on how she''s rated. $150K is at Standard Non-Tobacco and $200K is Preferred Non-Tobacco which both fall right around $25. She will keep her plan going, if she leaves Hope Ins. so we are keeping the monthly cost low and sustainable for 30 year.  She completed her app. She only takes Sertaline HCL for Anxiety/OCD and has no other health issues and both parents are alive and well at 58 and 59.  Her policy # is LS775231200. She chose 15th of the month for payment. She will pay the first month on her own and then The Hope Institute will start reimbursing her in June. She knows I''ll be gone the 26-5th as well. We chose to have the payment/policy finalized upon the agents agreement. So, once she gets the policy we can make a final decision. It was immediately accepted as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-24 14:08:43', '2024-04-24 14:08:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137881088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656140', 'Elizabeth McGavin', NULL, '4/24/24: A woman called from a facility inquiring if she would need a prior authorization with this plan, told her this individual hasn''t been a member for several years due to aging out but that our plans do not typically require prior authorizations. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-24 13:55:48', '2024-04-24 13:55:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137931003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109507002', 'Leslie Zimmerman', NULL, 'Member called letting me know that she wants to cancel.  I directed her to contact Zac and I will send her link and copy Zac as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-24 13:55:18', '2024-04-24 13:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137881083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132103008', 'Elmer Suazo', NULL, '4/23/24: Reached out to mbr to wish happy birthday, offered referral and lvm. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-24 13:23:34', '2024-04-24 13:23:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137882008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128980002', 'Wendy Migdal', NULL, '3/24/24: Wendy called to ask about the best way to use her services to manage her anti-anxiety meds. I suggested starting with telehealth especially since she already has a running prescription from another provider, and if that doesn''t work then to reach out to the MAP providers. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-24 13:22:50', '2024-04-24 13:22:50'),
