  ('zcrm_1579374000137881018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135244002', 'Elaine Stedman', NULL, '4/24/24: Elaine had called in to check on the status of her card as she hadn''t got one yet, told her how I noticed she called Friday and that we were still in the process of getting one out to her but that she does still have coverage and a plan with us effective 4/1/24. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-24 11:52:35', '2024-04-24 11:52:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137906008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, '4-24-24 Shawna enrolled in HAB for May 1st. She''s excited and plans to use it for her skin check at her derm soon. She may refer her nephew to me as well. He might have ins through his parents but he just turned 26.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-24 11:49:09', '2024-04-24 11:49:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137906003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '04.24.2024 Kathryn called to learn how to get started on an HSA, I shared the minimal information that I have, and then suggested she speak to Wendy about any suggestions or details. As Wendy most likely has institutions she might be familiar with that she can recommend, or at least guide in a more detailed fashion.
Kathryn then asked how to maneuver an appointment with a gastro that is not in the preventive scope. I shared that she can go to any doctor she prefers, and if she does not have one in mind or needs to do further research, she can follow the instructions in the email I sent her for HCBB and Healthgrades. I emailed her those details via Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-24 11:00:23', '2024-04-24 11:00:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137883028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137242007', 'David Olheiser', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of May 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-24 10:58:34', '2024-04-24 10:58:34'),
