  ('zcrm_1579374000137882003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125283001', 'Christina Laffranchi', NULL, '4/24/24: Christina called. She needs to access her member portal in order to cancel her account. She got a new job and is taking their insurance plan. I led her to the cancellation form on the website and emailed her portal credential. Will notify advisor that she is cancelling. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-24 10:32:14', '2024-04-24 10:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137881013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117095002', 'Susan Brannon', NULL, '4/24/24: Reached out to mbr to wish happy birthday, offered referral and lvm. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-24 10:20:32', '2024-04-24 10:20:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137881003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '4/24/24: Elizabeth called in to inquire about coverage for a knee injectable, connected her directly to planstin after answering some basic membership questions. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-24 10:13:12', '2024-04-24 10:13:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137875018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '4-24-24 I spoke with Elliott again and he said he and his team have talked to Alicia on numerous occasions. He mentioned that she''s not cooperating with the solutions they are providing. They can''t just give her the money back since it doesn''t have cash value. It must be used for medical expenses. I asked him how she can get reimbursed for old payments when she couldn''t access the money in the account during the transition. He suggested to watch this video - https://vimeo.com/928106583/813c14a0a7?share=copy#t=0 and upload the provider information to use her membership moving forward. He also said he will personally make sure old bills are reimbursed if they fall within the proper guidelines. I sent her all of the information via email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-24 09:52:15', '2024-04-24 09:52:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137851028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137621018', 'Maria Daniela Ysursa', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-24 09:49:30', '2024-04-24 09:49:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137875013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '4-23-24 To Elliott, 

Hi Elliott,

It seems your staff is not following through of any of their promises. Here''s yet another request for assistance after 3 months of trying. Please, please, please help resolve this problem for Alicia Hutchens.

"Hi Wendy – Thanks for checking in. I finally got a hold of Elliot last Tuesday. I am very unimpressed with him, and he very much brushed me off and told me someone would call to settle it. I am requesting my account be closed and that I am reimbursed $675, all of which is my own contribution in the past 24 months minus what has been paid to me. None of that is HMA''s contribution. No one has called. I left a message with Elliot today to follow up. I just want my money back from purchasing a faulty product.

Thanks,

Alicia Hutchens"

See the below email as well.

Thanks,


Wendy Scipione

I also called him and he said he''d personally stand over his team to make sure it was handled.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-24 09:48:57', '2024-04-24 09:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137875008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '4-17-24 I checked in again with Elliott to see what progress was made. He continues to reassure me he and his team will take care of it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-24 09:47:56', '2024-04-24 09:47:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137875003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '4-16-24 I sent another email to Elliott letting him know Alicia hasn''t been taken care of and to please help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-24 09:47:06', '2024-04-24 09:47:06'),
