  ('zcrm_1579374000137855003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132697002', 'Timothy Mills', NULL, '4/24/24: Sean called and needs the correct info to present to dr office. He doesn''t remember getting Planstin cards in the mail. I transferred him directly to Planstin to request a new set of cards for his check up today. 
Carmen from P called back unable locate Sean. I asked if I emailed his info can it be added quickly and she said yes, most likely - Emailed Sean''s info to member@planstin.com stating the urgency of the situation. 
Sean was successfully added to the system and sent cards. I called to follow up and made sure he received the email. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-24 09:01:48', '2024-04-24 13:46:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137851008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137631002', 'Remso Martinez', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of June 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-24 08:56:48', '2024-04-24 08:56:48'),
