  ('zcrm_1579374000137798039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135244018', 'Ross Muscolino', NULL, '04.23.2024 Ross called to learn more on how to use the MAP program. He was not available to be in front of a computer. So I gave him the phone number, and told him they close at 4pm ET. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-23 16:04:08', '2024-04-23 16:04:37'),
