  ('zcrm_1579374000137706062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, '04.22.2024 Karen called from home with the OBGYN on the other line, needing help to get them to just bill Planstin. After a few words and persistence in conversation, when they were refusing to even input her information in the system, the receptionist finally placed the Planstin information in Karen''s NOTES, and coaching Karen to let them know of the NOTES upon her arrival. She is scheduling her as a self pay for now, due to lack of recognition of Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-22 18:22:05', '2024-04-22 18:22:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137706057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423001', 'Nicholas Palmer', NULL, '04.22.2024 Nick called to learn how to proceed with getting shared for wrist surgery. I walked him through the process to open a sharing request with Zion. I also sent him directions on how to use HCBB and Healthgrades. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-22 17:02:29', '2024-04-22 17:02:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137706049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134448007', 'Robert Ridpath', NULL, '4.22.2024 Robert is trying to get all squared away with signing all the form with MPB via Member Portal, and needed help accessing it. I gave him his credentials, he accessed it smoothly and voiced he will be able to sign all the forms there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-22 16:34:08', '2024-04-22 16:34:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137706029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120998002', 'William Chilton', NULL, '04.22.2024 William called on behalf of his wife who is going through cancer treatment. Angee had left him a VM regarding the medication he requested a coupon, Zarxio. I asked him if he was comfortable to tell me what the medication for, and he shared it was for increasing white blood cells during the cancer treatment his wife is going under. I asked if he has a sharing request open, and he said yes but it is in waiting phase for determination for the sharing request decision. The medical records have not been released to Zion.
So William is trying to help his wife through her treatments, so I told him that once that sharing request is open I''m pretty sure all of the medications are shareable. Let''s ask Zion and confirm. . I did 3-way called Zion to confirm that as long as there''s a sharing request open, all medications for cancer treatments are shareable. Ilona answered and confirmed the above, as long as there''s a prescription form accompanying the medication. She proceeded to share how to collect itemized bills and receipts.
Provider released the information form that they have, but then Zion asked for description information to be shared but some do not apply, i.e. EKG, ambulance, emergency notes........etc.
Ilona transferred us to another Zion member, Rachel ( I did not catch her position - receptions was sketchy) - we were on hold for a while. She was going to help to get the HIPAA form signed - William is saying that THE PROVIDERs are needing a wet signature to release the medical records. William attained that wet signature TODAY, and is trying to get it to the medical office. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-22 16:04:43', '2024-04-22 16:25:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137664214', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120981009', 'Anne Steegman', NULL, '4/22/24: Anne called in with questions about sharing requests for potential hip imaging etc and the fair prices for them, pulled those up on hcbb and shared them with her over the phone. Sent her a list of providers nearby to do some preventive services she was interested in. Told her I would need to follow up on the timeframe for pre membership conditions and how they worked but would follow up with her soon. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-22 15:27:01', '2024-04-22 15:27:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137706021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117867002', 'Peter Harris', NULL, '04.22.2024 Loni called to better learn about her plan and check to see if they have vision as part of the plan. I told her the plans usually come without and advisors sometimes have companion products they can add onto their plans, such as vision and dental. 
She asked how to proceed with an OBGYN visit, I explained the process. She found the virtual card via email. She asked to resend the Post Welcome Call email to her, I did.
I also sent her instructions on how to use the multiplan link and the MPB change form to add her email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-22 15:00:43', '2024-04-22 15:00:43'),
