  ('zcrm_1579374000137706003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103642010', 'Mary Huber', NULL, '04.22.2024 Mary called following up about any results form mentioning the above concerns (needing that EXACT brand or else her body reacts harshly), at a better deal. Reid is able to source, but not much less expensive and not the exact brand either. I told her I will connect with Joan RIGHT after our phone call. 
********************************************************************
SENT HER THE BELOW EMAIL:
Greetings Mary,
Thank you for calling in today and following up, I felt an email with all the details was in order, instead of a phone call back. I was able to speak to my supervisor, and Planstin -  who then referred me to call OptumRX, and reconnected with our international shopper again. Below are some details I have found and have questions about.
Do you know if the HRT you are taking is bio-identical? I learned that this is made specifically for one''s body.
Do you have access to a compound pharmacy? I learned that although a little more pricey, they are able to formulate a specific prescription for you.  which is generally a better quality.
I contacted OptumRX, to inquire if they offer your mfr, given they do cover Estradiol and Progesteron. However it proved the member needs to call in personally. They would not move past trying to verify your account to answer my question. Here''s their number: 877-633-4461, extension #4 for "coverage".
This may be a shot in the dark, but any chance the Dr. can guide you to where you can find these mfr''s, since they are running scarce.
Lastly to display additional resources, with the chance that the manufacturers he lists might be new to you, I reconnected with our international shopper again to attain the list of all that he offers, to share with you, below is his response:
"Hello Nahla,
The medications that we have are below along with their manufacturer.
Prometrium (Brand) Progesterone- Pharmasco and Besins Healthcare
Endometrin (Brand) Progesterone micronized- Ferring
Climera (Brand) Estradiol Patches- Bayer
Vivelle Dot (brand) Estradiol Patches- Novartis"

Please don''t hesitate to call us, if we need to discuss this further. We are here M-F, 9am-8pm ET.

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
