  ('zcrm_1579374000137603013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137619002', 'Laura Shymkus', NULL, '4-19-24 Laura is 57, husband Tim 57 and daughter Amelia 22. Laura has offered to help care for Marni Shymkus'' mother, Laura''s mother in law for the next many months into the fall. Laura and family are healthy, no pre-x, no meds. Laura is interested in doing a thermogram, has gym or yoga membership, dental cleaning, labs, etc. Marni or her mom will pay for the membership at the $5000 IUA level for CARE+ $600 EF and HAB $107 EO for Laura. Total will be $707 and I waived the $100 fee since Marni is already paying for it, so the money would just go back to her.  for future info, Tim is self-employed. Laura is the only one who will make use of the wellness benefits, not Tim or Amelia. Laura used to work in children''s mental health, she was a case manager and also a teacher. Now she''s helping care for Marni''s aging mom. She''s all set with a May 1st start date for both.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-19 16:19:20', '2024-04-19 16:19:20'),
