  ('zcrm_1579374000137605026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125995002', 'Mel Fonseca', NULL, '04.19.2024 Mel called b/c his provider''s doctor''s office billed him two bills for ONE visit. I needed more clarification on how exactly he was billed, so we did a 3-way with Planstin. We spoke with William, who shared with us how the billing shows up in their system. He confirmed:
