  ('zcrm_1579374000137605003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081342010', 'Francisca Onuoha', NULL, '04.19.2024 Francisca called b/c after speaking with Zion, she learned they have her email in their system wrong and told her that it needs to be fixed on our end. This is usually the case, but her email was correct in both of our platforms, so we called Zion back who transferred us to Planstin, and they both made the corrections on their end. Planstin''s reciprocation reached Francisca, but she is still waiting on Zion to make it to her email. 
Requested from Dayra via outlook and Cc''d Angee to correct Francisca''s sex ID from male to female in the CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-19 10:53:41', '2024-04-19 10:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137603003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '4-19-24 Laura joined HAB EF $250 for May 1st. She has a dental cleaning in May to give it a test. She completed the Member Change Form as well and got to the confirmation page. She is choosing to remove the Planstin MEC and keeping her plan as is, otherwise. She''s excited and all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-19 09:48:46', '2024-04-19 09:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137551038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130580009', 'Thomas Tigges', NULL, '4/19/24: Thomas called to set up welcome call. I emailed the link to scheduler. He also asked if he could update his email address so sent him member change form. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-19 09:27:21', '2024-04-19 09:27:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137551033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755369', 'Rachel Allen', NULL, '4/19/24: Rachel called to see about submitting some bills that she just got in. I gave her the web address to log into her zion member portal and instructions on what to submit. She said her bills were from last May but she just received them from the hospital. I let her know that there is a 6 month deadline, and that she will most likely get declined for sharing, but to then submit an appeal proving the billing date. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-19 09:26:32', '2024-04-19 09:26:32'),
