  ('zcrm_1579374000137551013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '4/19/24: Peter LVM last night about getting a CT Angiography of his head and neck, and wanted to know if this is something covered by Planstin. 
I called him back and educated him about the differences between his Planstin MEC and Healthshare. I searched the procedure on HCBB and emailed screenshots of what they are showing as fair price for the the facility he''s scheduled to have the procedure done, along with search instructions so he can use the tool in the future. 
He''s aware that this is a cash pay procedure, and that he can submit this along with previous appointments related to the issue to Zion for sharing if/once they exceed his 2500 IUA. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-19 07:33:01', '2024-04-19 07:33:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137549008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107386002', 'mitchell cody', NULL, 'I heard from Karen about this member - his employer was paying for his membership.  However he has left their employment and Karen wants us to hold the billing because she has not been able to reach the member.  However Karina wants to handle this as she advises that we cannot hold the billing.  I will email Karen and let her know to contact Karina.
