  ('zcrm_1579374000137530039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117456002', 'Kelly Pieropan', NULL, '04.18.2024 Jennifer called to see if any of the vaccines she and Kelly will need to go to Africa are covered. Caitlyn at Planstin asked and verified that Yes they are, MINUS the yellow fever, they do not need to go to an annual physical to have it done. IT can be separate. They will accept Costco pharmacy codes. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-18 17:58:52', '2024-04-18 17:58:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137482008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137105002', 'Christopher Ferritto', NULL, '4-18-2024 Chris called me, wants to move start date to July 1st. Says he spoke with someone at MPB and they referred him to me directly. I sent him the Cognito change form.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-04-18 17:33:26', '2024-04-19 08:47:39'),
