  ('zcrm_1579374000137496068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116266002', 'Edee Yuen', NULL, '4/18/24: Edee called wanting info about Hospital Debt Relief. I told her how the program worked but informed her that it is only for members under our Essentials plan. Then Edee went on and on asking  what would happen if everyone left MPB (or rather the Healthshare) bc the economy is so bad right now, and if everyone left, would she have to pay her own medical bills. She was very worried that this isn''t safe like traditional insurance. I tried to ease her worry as much as possible, but in the end she wanted to talk to Zion about her worries too! AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-18 14:23:47', '2024-04-18 14:23:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137496063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133359001', 'Jianny Adamo', NULL, '4/18/24: Jianny called. She''s traveling and wants to make sure if something happens while she''s out of the country that it would still be eligible for sharing. I advised yes, as long as it meets the guidelines.
She also said she has a rash and needs to use the telehealth services. I reminded her of the name of the app and she found it on her phone. She''s trying to get some medication for her rash asap before she leaves town. She asked if I could search the medication (but didn''t know the name of it - she googled cream for Herpes and asked if I could do a quick price search for VALACYCLOVIR). I informed her that the lowest prices ranged from $22-$30 for 1000mg, 30 tablets. She''s going to try using CirrusMD and call us back for RX coupons. I let her know we are here till 8pm eastern. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-18 14:20:54', '2024-04-18 14:20:54'),
