  ('zcrm_1579374000137496008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023291015', 'Robert "Kevin" Sanders', NULL, '4/18/24: Robert reached out trying to get into the app, but needing his member ID. Called him back and LVM. His ID # is 600289864. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-18 07:34:57', '2024-04-18 07:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137482003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137483002', 'Denis Bashtovoi', NULL, 'ENROLLED in Secure HSA today. FINALLY...this guy (love him) took forever.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-04-18 06:46:52', '2024-04-18 06:46:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137475061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, '04.17.2024 Karen is having a hard time making that Gyno appt. The list I sent her IS NOT ACCURATE. I called the first one and it ended up being a whole different facility. I called the MultiPlan link number, 866-981-7427, and I got a recording speaking Spanish to me.
Finally, I came back to Karen, b/c she did not have a lot of time for me to make more phone calls, and I guided her to present through the RBP approach. Karen will call us back if there are any more obstacles. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-17 17:38:44', '2024-04-17 18:00:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137475056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124142012', 'Trudi Sorensen', NULL, '02/20th Annual Check Up. Colorado Mountain. Bill is $500~. I''m unsure if the medical advocacy team would be able to negotiate this bill down, since it''s after the fact, and that the provider did iterate that they do not offer cash pay discounts.
