  ('zcrm_1579374000137460045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '4-17-24 Called to understand which HMA card to use the debit card or the newer card. I sent instructions via email and left her a vm to let her know to use the new card, not the debit card moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-17 15:44:43', '2024-04-17 15:44:43'),
