  ('zcrm_1579374000137415058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124142012', 'Trudi Sorensen', NULL, '4/17/24: Mbr called in to check to see if her current plan was hsa compatible, explained to her that it didn''t look like it was without the additional mec coverage. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-17 13:00:38', '2024-04-17 13:00:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137460030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, 'Member updated payment method.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-17 12:58:32', '2024-04-17 12:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137475023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, '04.17.2024 Wife Tami, cannot have mammograms, wondering if Planstin has leniency on what the doctor is prescribing. Higher risk group, needs an annual MRI, 
Did a 3-way with Planstin, Caitlyn, put in a message to the claims department, offered to look at a different plan with us (CoPay Plan perhaps?), and listened entirely to all of Nicholas'' details.
Here are some he share:
-Tami cannot get mammograms due to size of breasts and have an ATM gene mutation not the BRCA (which is what is listed in the ACA guidelines),
-She got an ultrasound, and is recommended to one annually.
-He was checking his EOB from the Planstin portal, looking for claims for the most recent MRI/ultrasound. Caitlyn needs to know the date of it, (MAYBE a couple of months ago) - He decided it was the NOVEMBER one, has an ultrasound code. 
Caitlyn asked if they can code the ultrasound as a mammogram, but it would depend on the provider/facility to be willing to do that. 
Presently and until June, we are in open enrollment, so there''s an option to changing plans.
Caitlyn will reach back out to Nicholas directly.
While Caitlyn was about to let us go, she received word from the claims department saying that they/the provider, needs to code it preventive. In the meantime, Nicholas had been in touch with the billing department, but did not get to speak to anyone. He just received a message saying "no change".  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-17 12:40:21', '2024-04-17 13:13:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137415048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918010', 'Lauren Klucewich', NULL, '4/17/24: Reached out to mbr to wish her happy birthday and see if she had any questions and she had referenced her previous conversation and not being sure of how to submit a sharing request. Explained how she could do so in her Birthday email. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-17 12:36:14', '2024-04-17 12:36:14'),
