  ('zcrm_1579374000137475008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131623002', 'William Pullano', NULL, '04.17.2024 Karen is not showing up in Zion''s platform, after attempting to open a member portal to open a sharing request, for her son''s right ankle that had an initial visit back on 2/9. 
I insured her that I will add this plans information onto the IT''s list to upload their integration file.
