  ('zcrm_1579374000137460016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '4-17-24 Planstin has been working for them. They are very close to choosing to add HAB. Martha wants to talk it over with her husband one more time. They will likely keep Planstin so they can fund their HSA. They will still run their ACA compliant wellness visits through Planstin and use HAB for anything not included with Planstin. It will be $3K more for the family per year. But, they can now get their health fair labs reimbursed as well as all of the other benefits such as gym membership, skin checks, etc.  She knows the deadline. She''s not sure if they''ll be ready for May 1st or June 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-17 11:28:38', '2024-04-17 11:34:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137414041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131623002', 'William Pullano', NULL, '4/17/24: Karen called. She''s having a breast MRI and the facility priced it around 6500. She wanted to know how to search for a fairer price. I guided her through using healthcare bluebook and finding alternate facilities, and reminded her that anything over her IUA amount can be submitted as a sharing request to Zion. Ended the conversation with transferring her over in order to set up member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-17 11:28:36', '2024-04-17 11:28:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137414031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137483002', 'Denis Bashtovoi', NULL, '4-17-2024 Denis tent set up for Thursday at 8am eastern enrollment.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-04-17 11:15:44', '2024-04-17 11:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137460006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137607002', 'Amanda Caras', NULL, '4-17-24 Amanda just got hired with The Hope Institute for June 1st start date. We can get her going for June 1st, per Andrew Evans. Amanda is turning 30 on May 10th. She takes sertraline for OCD, no tobacco, no pre-x. She doesn''t need vision screening but wants dental benefits for cleanings. She doesn''t have any life ins and is interested in getting it. We are meeting again tomorrow and will work on medical and dental. We''ll set another time for life ins. plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-17 10:37:59', '2024-04-17 12:27:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137461008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130297012', 'Lea Long', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Lea and Jay. Put in request to Kelly resend out QR Life code cards. Changed address in crm also member filled out update address form on our website. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-17 10:37:31', '2024-04-17 10:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137414023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128409012', 'Shawn Ford', NULL, '4/17/24: Called Shawn in regards to a conversation I had with Carmen at Planstin. Shawn called Planstin bc she noticed she was listed as a M instead of F, and was trying to register for Telehealth. Shawn is listed correctly on our end. I made sure she got into her Cirrus account and gave her a bit of education during the process about how to access her services and when to call which number. She asked if her husband is registered for Cirrus, and he was showing no records found. Sending his info to Cirrus manually. AM

