  ('zcrm_1579374000137360013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129714015', 'Charlene Dickey', NULL, '04.16.2024 Charlene called with MAJOR concerns regarding a CHRONIC COUGH, leading to spasms, thought it was bronchitis, doctor on telehealth would not prescribe medicine until she saw someone in person,
coughing so bad, she gagged, 
Spent Sunday night in hospital, Tuesday at 3am-administered saline an hour drip (didn''t feel right), started burning her arm, was going right into her skin, developed a rash - needed to be discharged another day. It hiked up the bill quite a bit.  Thursday morning she had been balanced.
paid the $1000, needs to open a sharing request, needs a nebulizer (abrea? - got one from amazon it is HSA approved, required prescriptions)
Leslie recommended she save all her receipts.
Pulmonary Dr. - wasn''t sure how to present - guided her to present as a cash pay patient......
I guided her to bring up all the details with Zion including the mistake they did, the amazon purchase, all the services done and coming up. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-16 17:51:29', '2024-04-16 17:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137360008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, '04.16.2024 Kerry called to attain further clarification regarding preventive services: Mammogram per year vs. what the ACA guidelines recommend and what Planstin would pay for, same for colonoscopy every 2 years vs 10, and trying to find her doctor: Karen Locke in the PHCS network. The practice shows up, but not Karen''s name. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-16 16:17:59', '2024-04-16 16:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137352021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '4-16-24 He has a new email address so I wanted to keep this one in addition -  devonandrewevans@msn.com.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-16 15:49:26', '2024-04-16 15:49:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137352013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '4-16-24 Robin is interested in HAB after talking with Nelson Oldham. We are now playing phone tag.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-16 15:37:24', '2024-04-16 15:37:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137352008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870116', 'Paul Borchers', NULL, '4-16-24 Paul is turning 65 in June and they wanted to make sure he''s protected in case of an motorcycle accidents. He''s taking a trip on his bike and they just wanted to check to see if there are any specific limitations for this type of sharing. I let them know that any other auto insurance will come first and MCS is secondary. She understands that and understands they have a $1000 IUA to pay first as well. They are just being overly cautious before he sets out on the road. Sally referred their friend Damon West who is Kevin West''s brother. She gave him my phone number and email. She''s fine if Damon puts Kevin down as the person who referred Damon to me. We will wait and see.
I called back and just let them know that driver while under the influence of drugs or alcohol will disallow sharing of medical expenses. That will NOT be a problem at all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-16 15:32:39', '2024-04-16 15:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137397013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104974001', 'Emily Bristol', NULL, '4/16/24: Emily called back and we discussed her upcoming surgery and how to get a sharing request started. I educated her on the difference between the Planstin and Zion portions of her plan, and advised her on how to navigate the fact that she hasn''t received any bills yet and that her surgery is tomorrow. That she''ll have up to 6 months from date of service to submit those bills, and when she speaks to Zion - let them know whats going on. If there is no way to rush the determination, then she might want to consider rescheduling the procedure bc Zion will base everything on whether this is a pre-ex condition, and without getting the determination first, she may be paying a lot out of pocket. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-16 14:50:58', '2024-04-16 14:50:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137357144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114987002', 'Melissa Dixon', NULL, '4/16/24: Melissa reached out to have us find a family doctor nearby, emailed her a list from phcs and got disconnected, reached out to her and left vm that i sent her an email and to call back for further help. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-16 14:47:37', '2024-04-16 14:47:37'),
