  ('zcrm_1579374000137352003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137350002', 'Alexander VanWeelden', NULL, '4-16-24 Alexander is turning 26 on May 1st. Diane VanWeelden (his mom) removed him from the family membership for June 1st. She re-enrolled him into CARE+ for June 1st. He doesn''t have any pre-x. They know that it doesn''t include wellness and they are fine with that. They paid with ACH bank draft and she knows to encourage Alexander to complete the new Welcome Call and print the Reference Guide. They are all set for June 1st and I sent Patti a heads up that it''s June 1st, not May 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-16 11:54:48', '2024-04-16 11:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137320013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127834010', 'Desmond Agostini', NULL, '4/16/24: Reached out to mbr to wish them happy birthday, call didn''t go through, sent email with referral. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-16 11:54:11', '2024-04-16 11:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137346008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330064', 'Diane VanWeelden', NULL, '4-16-24 Diane''s son is turning 26 in May. She completed the Remove Dependent for June 1st and is re-enrolling him in CARE+ for June 1st. They know wellness is not included.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-16 11:43:22', '2024-04-16 11:43:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137346003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137242007', 'David Olheiser', NULL, '4-16-24 Hello David,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522190238
Benefits Start Date: 05/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-16 11:15:53', '2024-04-16 11:15:53'),
