  ('zcrm_1579374000137320003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985028', 'Phil Welch', NULL, '4/15/24: Brittany called back in with questions about the coupon and mentioned accidentally filling out a couple of additional forms online. Told her to call the pharmacy and use the one nahla sent and reach out to us if theres issues. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-16 10:24:47', '2024-04-16 10:24:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137318013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135538001', 'Alison Johnston', NULL, '4/16/24: Allison called asking if she will get a physical ID card from Planstin - that she had her welcome call a couple weeks ago and hasn''t received anything. I let her know that I would call and check on the card for her. Crystal from Planstin didn''t see her in the system, so I filled out the support form to have her added to the list, and sent Vinnie and Adan a message reminding them of the actual DOB since 1961 is not an available option. Called member to alert her of IT issue and estimated resolution time. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-16 10:03:24', '2024-04-16 10:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137318008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575309', 'Corrie Black', NULL, '4/16/24: Corrie called. Her daughter has Pink Eye and they wanted the number for telehealth. I informed her that CirrusMD is a text first application that could then turn into a phone call if necessary. I began her registration through CirrusMD and she was sent a link to complete the registration. Let her know that it is straightforward but to call if she needs additional assistance in navigating the app. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-16 10:01:46', '2024-04-16 10:01:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137318003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129389012', 'Tracey Marchitto', NULL, '4/16/24: Tracey called. She had a telehealth appointment, but was told to go to urgent care. Since she has the co-pay plan, I helped her search the phcs network, and also emailed her a list of clinics within a 20 mile radius from her. I advised if the provider has any questions about billing or where to send the claim, to have them call the number on the Planstin card. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-16 09:49:32', '2024-04-16 09:49:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137317003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091166', 'Courtney Cowan Gray', NULL, 'After many issues with this payment not going through, I got corrected Routing number and went with the new acct # and it initially went through.  I will monitor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-16 09:48:11', '2024-04-16 09:48:11'),
