  ('zcrm_1579374000137283003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128139002', 'Dixie Johnson', NULL, 'I received an email from Leslie and this member asking why member was charged $7.99.  Member said that she had called into the Concierge who told her that it is a "plan that has nothing attached to it".   I was unable to find any charge for $7.99 and responded back to member &amp; Leslie.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-16 07:53:34', '2024-04-16 07:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137276008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104974001', 'Emily Bristol', NULL, '4/16/24: Emily called and LVM last night saying she tore her meniscus and needs knee surgery. I called her back this morning and advised her on how to open her member portal and that she''ll need itemized bills from the previous appointments to submit. 
Since she was about to board a plane, I sent an email with ZIon''s number and instructions on how to start her sharing request. She alerted me that the surgery is tomorrow, and she hasn''t received a bill because the provider had been sending them to Planstin. I let her know she would need to get itemized bills for these appointments to submit, and suggested that when she speaks to Zion, ask if there is anyway they can rush the determination since the surgery date is so close. 
She said she''d call back later this afternoon to try and get everything resolved. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-16 07:45:42', '2024-04-16 07:46:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097264002', 'Marilyn Negley', NULL, '04.15.2024 Sonia from Pediatrics called to verify coverage for a primary care visit. I explained vaguely that coverage is only for preventive. Primary care visits are cash pay. She will relay the information and request that they all us, per my request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 17:53:14', '2024-04-15 17:53:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130569031', 'Hugo Merin', NULL, '04.15.2024 Hugo called,  and a woman in the background was listening in with him present. I do not know who that was. Hugo wanted to make an appointment with a hand specialist and wanted the policy number. I looked him up in the Admin123, and gave him his Member ID#, then asked him what exactly is he trying to do. He said trying to make an appointment. .....', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 17:47:56', '2024-04-15 17:47:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120538002', 'Fabian Garcia', NULL, '04.15.2024 Fabian called b/c the doctor''s office called wanting him to update his insurance information. He first requested that we do a 3-way call, but I assured him that all he needs to do, when he calls them back, is to offer them the information on the front of his card, especially their phone number that ends with 7526. He seemed more confident than when he called, and will call us back if they give him a hard time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 16:42:49', '2024-04-15 16:42:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '04.15.2024 Nancy called to better understand what she needs to do in preparation of her aging out in Oct. I told her that members are to start their paperwork 3 months prior, and that our Patti will reach out to her around the same time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 16:27:22', '2024-04-15 16:27:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137190036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137203027', 'Mary Campbell', NULL, '4-15-23 Mary is 51, solo. She has the same grandfathered ins for a very long time but it ended and she never received the letter. She missed her SEP. Casey Hebb referred her to me. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. She watched the video. She has ADHD and takes meds for it. Lives in Boulder, CO. She''s not working now. She''s been an event planner, taught 2nd grade, line cook, etc. She''s done organic farming, etc. She chose CARE+ $350/$1000 and HAB $107 = $457. She''s enrolled for May 1st, 2024 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-15 15:47:14', '2024-04-15 15:47:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '04.15.2024 Mary Ann called wanting to log into her ZION member portal BUT asked to get help to log into her MPB portal, assuming so since she called OUR concierge. She was wanting to upload some bills.
I was trying to explain to her that Zion was the party to talk to, but she kept cutting me off until I told her all we have is their phone number, and only THEY can help her access her log in information. She finally agreed, I asked her to press on #6 for sharing request. I transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 15:30:42', '2024-04-15 15:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '04.15.2024 Maria called to learn what to do to get shared for her melanoma surgery THIS FRIDAY. I guided her to open a sharing request with Zion, and to organize her paperwork to upload them to the sharing request, should it be approved. I guided her through the steps of the process to open one, gave her Zion''s number and transferred. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 14:51:24', '2024-04-15 16:30:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137217053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125635002', 'Duane Burton', NULL, '4/15/24: Duane called asking for a 1095 form. I asked Kelly if she could send it out, but with it being so close to the deadline, I informed Duane that he could access the numbers and data from his portal and walked him through how to find that info. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-15 14:28:59', '2024-04-15 14:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137217043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '4/15/24: Paul called to ask if a yearly physical is covered under his plan. I informed him that it is, it''s a service covered by the preventive Planstin portion of his plan. He paid over $500 and is wondering how he can get reimbursed. I advised to give Planstin a call to discuss bc they don''t typically do reimbursements. He found his card and is going to have the doctor bill Planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-15 13:42:49', '2024-04-15 13:42:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985028', 'Phil Welch', NULL, '04.15.2024 Brittany put in an RX request, but with confusing choices. I sent her an email via Outlook to help clarify. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 13:27:53', '2024-04-15 13:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117873002', 'Marc Marlowe', NULL, '04.15.2024 Patricia messaged via SalesIQ asking what her IUA was and how to proceed with opening a sharing request. In simple steps, I typed up what she needs to follow, and if she has more sharing request questions, to contact Zion back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 13:17:28', '2024-04-15 13:17:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118690002', 'Michael Patland', NULL, '04.15.2024 Hospital called confirming Natalie is delivering her baby, but the hospital is unsure how to bill. I told her that most likely it will be a cash pay visit, and that they need to call us RIGHT AWAY to make sure they are taking the right next steps. 
****************************************************************************************
Michael called back, their baby was born, he wanted to learn a few things about his plan. I noticed he has not had his welcome call. I urged him to do so, and resent him the link, since it''s been a while. 
I read the Zion guidelines, to add the baby within 30 days, but no less than 7 to the plan. 
I explained the ACA guidelines with Healthcare.GOV
I explained cash pay visits vs. preventive visits. 
He asked if more baby visits would be considered extra, I told most likely yes, but a conversation with Planstin would be MORE IDEAL. 
I transferred him to Planstin. He will schedule his welcome call, and call us if he has anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 13:16:02', '2024-04-15 17:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137190031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137242007', 'David Olheiser', NULL, '4-15-24 We had scheduled for Wed! Oops. But, he called me back and was ready to roll for CARE+ $350 and HAB $107 for May 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-15 13:13:13', '2024-04-15 13:13:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137217038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106312002', 'Steven Welch', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel his membership.  I will email him the link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-15 12:06:49', '2024-04-15 12:06:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137217033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137215161', 'Christine Nelsen', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-15 12:03:31', '2024-04-15 12:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137190026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137242007', 'David Olheiser', NULL, '4-15-24 Left vm since we had a tentative appt now, but not confirmed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-15 12:03:28', '2024-04-15 12:03:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109649016', 'Mark Sanders', NULL, '04.15.2024 Mark called to see how to submit the change form, to add his newborn, without having a ssn. I told him it should let him submit it without it, and when her attains the ssn# he can call us back to provide it. Due to the integration file issue we are still experiencing, I asked him to definitely call us back within a week and a half or so to make sure the file transfer on the newborn is complete. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 11:57:20', '2024-04-15 11:57:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137190021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, '4-15-24 Pam''s husband just got a new job with benefits. It looks to be about $838.50 for all of the benefits combined. $129.39 medical, $24 dental, $10 supplemental medical, $63 supplemental medical, $41 something, $54 LTD. She said it''s $387 bi-weekly which turns into $838.50. She''s paying $650 now and has an open need. She''s just overwhelmed with submitting a new Need and isn''t eager to quit. She will find out the mop and co-ins.  $3200 Ded HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-15 11:35:21', '2024-04-15 11:35:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137237003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '04.15.2024 Asiye called to get guidance on how to get her bills shared, and she was very worried about owing people money. She went to the doctor, problem with her right eye, the Optamologist 2/5 first in February Dr. Schobel (sp?), it turns out it was torn retina. So then she sees a retina specialist on 2/6,  told her she needed laser surgery Dr. Schobel and did the procedure the SAME DAY. on 3/5 Saw Dr. Schobel again cz she thought she had more problems, her blood pressure was high, went to urgent care, PCP gave her anti depressants, anti anxiety and and blood pressure medication. He did blood work right there.
I did not quite understand whether SHE believes the two incidents are related or was that a conversation she had with her doctor. I do KNOW that she needed to begin a sharing request, so I guided her to first, speak with zion to move forward with that, and ask them:
1-Should she confirm with the doctor and attain verbiage that the two incidents are related OR WOULD they use their medical advocacy team to confirm with the doctor.
She was feeling much more at ease, now that there''s a plan, I transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-15 11:05:00', '2024-04-15 16:39:02'),
