  ('zcrm_1579374000137160066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735002', 'Sean Reilly', NULL, '04.12.2024 Sean needed a list of PCP''s in his area under the PHCS network. I generated on via MultiPlan Link, then via outlook, I sent him both the directions for searching the PHCS network on MultiPlan and the HCBB and Healthgrades for further research, especially on cash-pay visits. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-12 11:40:07', '2024-04-12 11:40:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137160058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128856002', 'Roy Van Zweden', NULL, '04.12.2024 Roy called on behalf of his wife, Karen, regarding her diagnosis of stage 4 breast cancer. They are wanting to start some medication and he noticed it is so expensive, so he wanted to reach out in hopes there would be some sort of financial relief. 
I quickly guide him to the option of opening a Sharing Request, and that as long as it is approved, I do believe it is covered. 
I wanted to double check, so we did a 3-way call with Zion, and spoke with Rebecca, who confirmed the following, as long as the sharing request is approved and the IUA is met:
1-Karen''s sharing request is now being reviewed by Zion for approval, which means they all the paperwork then presently need to move forward with the determination.
2-Standard (not experimental) medication is usually covered along with the doctor visits.
3-Zion issues members a digital debit card dedicated to ONE place with a CERTAIN amount to use towards doctors visits and more.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-12 11:06:38', '2024-04-12 11:32:07'),
