  ('zcrm_1579374000137154003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133430012', 'Vanessa Audisio', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that her son had been in a skiing accident and she was told that she needed to open a Needs Request.  I gave her the contact number for Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-12 08:24:18', '2024-04-12 08:24:18'),
