  ('zcrm_1579374000137149003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075571098', 'Garrick Dorn', NULL, 'Member left me vm requesting cancellation.  Per note below he has been transferred to Jane.  I will send him the Cancellation Request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-12 07:41:58', '2024-04-12 07:41:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137098063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137191001', 'Carol Cheh', NULL, '4-11-24 Carol is 57 and found me via C4. She just went through a divorce and discovered her ins had ended. But, we since discovered it was her 18 months of Cobra that ran out already on Feb. 29th, 2024. So, she still has time for SEP and can get a May 1st start date. She has blood pressure meds from hereditary higher levels. She takes enlodigine. She had Cigna with her job at Premier Members Credit Union which she left there in Sept. 2022. She''s a non-smoker, very healthy. She does take Lexipro for anxiety bc of her two kids and divorce (she said jokingly). The pressure of her job as a loan officer attributed. However, she''s looking to get off of it at her next dr. appt. She''s a candidate for MCS but seems to want C4 if she can get it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-11 20:04:42', '2024-04-11 20:04:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '04.11.2024 Spoke to Heather today and discussed the process in opening a sharing request with Zion, especially if it is a preplanned surgery, like tonsillectomy for her daughter. I then transferred her to Zion, after going through the steps and options throughout opening a sharing request, and what to expect from Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 18:08:57', '2024-04-11 18:08:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130554030', 'Candis Davis', NULL, '04.11.2024 Candis called 7 to 7pm wanting to speak to a doctor. I suspected she wanted telehealth, so I proceeded to help her register by sending her an invitation link for CirrusMD. She could not download the app, and was not next to a computer to get on a browser. I explained to her that it text base service, and that she can connect with  a doctor in less than 2 minutes. But she was adamant it was too much texting and that she needs to speak to a doctor now. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 18:03:36', '2024-04-11 18:03:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131706010', 'Sarah Larsen', NULL, '04.11.2024 Andrew called after JUST YESTERDAY receiving his welcome call and email with Zion and Planstin. He had been trying to open a sharing request for the last 2 months, and was not successful, to learn just recently that his information was not in their system, it seems, until a few days ago.
Andrew is seeking a form of reparations like a reduction in monthly costs, due to him not being able to use their services, as promised, while still paying.
I told him I would have to bring this up to management level''s attention to see how they would proceed from here, especially that the mishap seems it was with another party/Zion. I will email Joan and Vinnie with this to learn when did we manually send his information to Zion and Plantin? Why did it take so long, if done a while back, for Zion to reach out and do the welcome call?
I offered him a call back tomorrow around 1:30 ET to update him.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 17:17:05', '2024-04-11 17:17:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131650010', 'Neil Goldsmith', NULL, '04.11.2024 Neil called wanting to know if there are any financial institution compatible with his plan with us. I assured him he can go to any financial institution of his choosing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 15:36:01', '2024-04-11 15:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137098053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137242007', 'David Olheiser', NULL, '4-11-24 David is 51 and semi-retired. He was the owner of consulting firm for 15 years. As of Jan. 1st, 2024 he''s no longer the owner. He had 2 health ins. plans with UHC and 1 was high ded short-term medical and the other in place for the small stuff like Dr. visits. However, the STM was cancelled 6-8 months ago without his knowledge!  He was paying $600+$110=$710. He also pays $1200-$1500 for an annual membership to a dr. for unlimited access to her. He wasn''t familiar with the term DPC but it sounds like that''s what he''s paying for. He can access her virtually or in-person unlimited and she does much for the additional wellness visits and gets good contracted rates for specialists, etc. So, I quoted him CARE+ $350 and HAB w/ DPC $140 = $490 - $70 reimbursed for DPC. In essence it''s $420. Wife is retiring from school system in June and will lose benefits Aug. 31st. I quoted ES for them as well which is $615+$230=$845 and reimbursed $140 for DPC = $705. Wife''s only issue is migraine meds. They are both active cyclists and cycle all around the world. He is also super healthy but has had injuries from his activities such as skiing and issues from traveling like salmonella poisoning, etc. However, there''s nothing to report from the past 24 months. He'' also enrolled in an Executive Health Program at the Mayo Clinic for extensive wellness checks.  He pays $1200-$1500 yr for DPC type program. They don''t smoke or drink. He''s looking for May 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-11 15:30:33', '2024-04-11 15:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114147002', 'James Doyle', NULL, '04.11.2024James called with a minor emergency. He was in his car, maybe pulled over or in parking lot. He wanted to know how to proceed if his situation would extend on to an Urgent care or specialist. I coached him to present as a cash pay patient and request the cash pay discount. He said ok, but he wants to try TeleHealth first to see if he could avoid talking to too many entities. I guided him to find the app, and change his passcode to access it again. He said he will go ahead and do that, and will call us back if he still cannot access CirrusMD. 
James assured me it is not life threatening, so I don''t need to worry about heading straight to the ER/Urgent care. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 15:10:56', '2024-04-11 15:10:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137125004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105466010', 'Anna Marie Somera', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with William Upton', 'Visit ID : 3606 Question : Hello, I need to speak with someone about pausing or cancelling my membership due to financial constraints.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-04-11 14:50:28', '2024-04-11 14:50:28'),
