  ('zcrm_1579374000137091071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133668002', 'Alastair Cross', NULL, '04.11.2023 John called to confirm the blood work ordered is covered. Std Lipid panel was going to be, but the rest was not. I sent him the discounted lab sites via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 14:48:23', '2024-04-11 14:48:23'),
