  ('zcrm_1579374000137098043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, '4-11-24 Jennifer needs a MEC since in CA. She will ask employer if she can get on Cobra for 1 month or backdate if need be. We will await the roll-out of new product with Sedera with MEC for compliance. If not, other new ins might work but not ideal with the $500K cap.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-11 14:37:35', '2024-04-11 14:37:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137098038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '4-11-24 Nelson chose to remove Apex/RCI for May 1st and added HAB instead. He knows he can no longer fund HSA May 1st onward but can use the funds in the account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-11 14:14:51', '2024-04-11 14:14:51'),
