2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em - 5/9  spouse removed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-11 13:31:03', '2024-05-09 10:48:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131700002', 'Erin Needham', NULL, '04.11.2024 Erin called to confirm the mammography place she found is ok to go to, even though it does not state ARA acronyms per her Dr.s request. Both the doctor and the facility corroborated her appointment, but she was concerned it would be covered, b/c in the PHCS list results, it did not show ARA next to their name. I assured her that it sounds like with their corroboration and it showing up in the PHCS list that she does not need to worry about being covered. I also shared that the titling is up to the facilities and providers to input when signing up with PHCS. 
She also had extra lab work, and was looking for a lab under the ARA to connect with MyChart, but the discounted websites pull up only labcorb and quest diagnostics. She will call her doctor and ask if she can have the labs sent to labcorb instead.  I sent her the discounted website for labwork. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 13:28:12', '2024-04-11 13:28:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137098033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '4-11-24 HAB will begin on May 1st. 
Hello Julie,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522190223
Benefits Start Date: 05/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-11 13:25:57', '2024-04-11 13:25:57'),
