  ('zcrm_1579374000137091051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '04.11.2024 Jani couldn''t register for CirrusMD, so I sent a support ticket to them. She also JUST learned she can share her HRT hormone replacement therapy with Zion, so I coached her through the steps, and transferred her over. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 12:28:34', '2024-04-11 12:28:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134879002', 'Darlene Tobias', NULL, '04.11.2024 Sent Darlene the welcome call scheduling link. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-11 12:26:13', '2024-04-11 12:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137098008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '4-11-24 Nathalie called to find out how to address going in for further screening for cancer such as for breast and other. I think she''s doing the follow up mammo and another cancer screening. I told her to contact Redirect Health for pre-approval and to get it in writing if they will cover the costs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-11 12:15:09', '2024-04-11 12:15:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000137091028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097826002', 'Sharon McCormick', NULL, '04.11.2024 Sharon called for a few reasons:
1-PCP is no longer in network: I explained the RBP model as an option. She''s going to call them back and repeat the explanation to get covered for her appointment TOMORROW.
2-She''s been paying out of pocket. I asked for what appointments, prev or non. She said non, and for a specific issue being a left knee issue that might need a replacement. She was worried it will work against her, so she was hesitant to mention any details, should I not have asked. I explained and strongly encouraged her to open a sharing request RIGHT NOW, b/c her initial visit with her Ortho was on 11/14/2023. 
3-I briefly explained her plan to her being 3 parts: essentials, preventive under the ACA guidelines, healthsharing.

