  ('zcrm_1579374000136998028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129714015', 'Charlene Dickey', NULL, '4/10/24: Charlene called in and mentioned how she had went to the ER for a breathing issue, answered some basic membership questions about how to submit a sharing request and differences with zion and planstin, asked if prescriptions were covered. Emailed her section of guidelines that talks rx. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-10 14:20:52', '2024-04-10 14:20:52'),
