  ('zcrm_1579374000136984034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126614002', 'Sarah Swisher-Leatherman', NULL, '04.10.2024 Jeffrey called a few times, one time after hours, but we kept missing his call. He is requesting a proof of insurance coverage of some sort for his son''s university. We do NOT know, which son, and Planstin said b/c they are over 18, they might need to call in themselves and request this. Caitlyn came back saying she is able to generate BOTH letters, since we do not know which son, just so they could have it, since we have been playing phone tag a bit. Caitlyn sent it to both emails. 
Prior to calling Planstin, I called Jeffrey and LVM. I then called him back after speaking to Planstin and let him know it should be in his emails. I caught him and spoke to him directly. I asked him to call us if the letters are not there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-10 14:16:20', '2024-04-10 14:18:10'),
