  ('zcrm_1579374000136984024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135103002', 'Donna Williams', NULL, '04.10.2025 Donna called asking how our prescription program works. I explained the process and options to her. She then asked about My Free Pharmacy and how that works and how long it takes. I shared that it all depends on what medication the member takes, and calculating if the monthly website fee is worth it. Donna is considering going that route, so I emailed her via CRM the website for MyFreePharmacy and the MPB RXRequest form.
Donna is also having integration issues with Planstin and Zion. I 3-way called Planstin, left Donna on hold, as Nedi if she can pull her up in their system, and she could''nt. I generated a ticket for our IT dept. I included that she also, gets an error when trying to registeron the app. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-10 12:27:07', '2024-04-10 12:27:07'),
