  ('zcrm_1579374000136880080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127972002', 'Catherine Culnane', NULL, '04.09.2024 Catherine, Cathy, and I learned from a 3-way call with Celeste at Planstin that there are no restrictions on whether the member gets the 1 dose or the 2 dose vaccine of the Hep B. However, the pharmacy may or may not add an administration fee, and that Planstin will not cover. So going to the physician to get it done, can go under preventive care with Planstin.
