  ('zcrm_1579374000136756029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109649016', 'Mark Sanders', NULL, 'I received email from Planstin that member reached out to add newborn to membership.  I will add to CRM &amp; A123 &amp; submit to Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-05 13:16:34', '2024-04-05 13:16:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136774018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '4-5-24 Nelon is super frustrated with Valley View Hospital and their billing practices. No matter how many times he tells them he''s self pay they continue to bill Apex/RCI for non wellness visits and it''s a huge problem with the billing. He''s ready to cancel RCI but might want to do his colonoscopy first. He will save $50 by removing Apex/RCI. He might want to add HAB for $107 instead. Julie has joined Thrive for $100 a month to have unlimited access to that dr. But, HAB I suspect gives him more for his money.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-05 12:31:54', '2024-04-05 12:31:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136783003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130958002', 'Erwin Clamor', NULL, '4/5/24: Lili reached out explaining how she was having issues with cirrusmd, told her we can manually register her and will need to follow up. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-05 12:27:14', '2024-04-05 12:27:14'),
