  ('zcrm_1579374000136775001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165365', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Angee Montgomery', 'Visit ID : 3588 Question : Does we all have to register for the Advisor Playbook again even though we''ve had an account for years?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-04-05 11:36:20', '2024-04-05 11:36:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136774013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '4-5-24 Hello Jana,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

