  ('zcrm_1579374000136766013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '4/5/24: Kim called asking how to present for upcoming mammogram appt. I explained just make sure the imaging facility is in the network, that it stays preventive, and they bill to planstin. She''s still very uncertain about using her services and said she would call and double check with facility and planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-05 11:13:40', '2024-04-05 11:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136753013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135244018', 'Ross Muscolino', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-05 11:05:18', '2024-04-05 11:05:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136766008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, '4/5/24: Member called to get cards (MPB and RCI) with her husband''s name on them. Trans to Patti to see if that''s a possibility, and reaching out to Kelly about MPB card. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-05 11:03:24', '2024-04-05 11:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136766003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656124', 'Lesa Russell', NULL, '4/5/24: Lesa called to ask which card she should use for annual visit, I advised to use the Planstin card. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-05 11:01:22', '2024-04-05 11:01:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136753003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-05 10:34:09', '2024-04-05 10:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136700031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135674019', 'Amanda Lewis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-05 10:05:39', '2024-04-05 10:05:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136700021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135434002', 'Michael Castaldo', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-05 09:48:07', '2024-04-05 09:48:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136701028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108862002', 'Mark Witt', NULL, '4/5/24: Mark called. Him and his wife are going on a cruise and will be traveling outside of the country. They are thinking about purchasing travel insurance, but wanted to know what their plan covers. I informed him that any medical expenses incurred outside of the US or Puerto Rico are considered shareable as long as they meet the guidelines, so if something happens, collect an itemized bill like usual and they can still submit. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-05 09:43:48', '2024-04-05 09:43:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '4-5-24 Laura is super interested in HAB. Their membership is $731.50. If they remove Planstin and add HAB it will be $846.50. They will use the gym membership for running races, nutritional health, dental, vision, mental and well checks as well as child immunizations. They may also check drug prices for albuterol and asthma medicine. She will run the numbers with her husband Charles and let me know if they want to move forward. Most likely yes. They don''t fund an HSA since they are strapped for money with a new baby on the way!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-05 09:41:54', '2024-04-05 09:41:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136701023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079594002', 'Swati Patel', NULL, '4/5/24: Swati called requesting 1095. I added to list and informed her that she should receive it if not by today, then by Monday. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-05 09:01:29', '2024-04-05 09:01:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136701018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108507002', 'Daria Volkova', NULL, '4/5/24: Daria called. She opened a maternity request June 2023, and it was just marked as approved March 7, 2024. She had a miscarriage and didn''t end up following through with the need, but she wanted to know if that was normal. I informed her that no, it''s not - usually requests are sent a determination letter within 1-2 weeks. She is now pregnant again and opening another maternity need and wants to talk to Zion about her previous and upcoming requests. I transferred her to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-05 08:51:44', '2024-04-05 08:51:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136700011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135183021', 'Larissa Brice', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Larissa. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-05 08:32:32', '2024-04-05 08:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136701013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088963002', 'Noreen Knight', NULL, '4/5/24: April B. called from a providers office to check the status of a claim for Noreen. I asked if it were a preventive or diagnostic/illness related claim bc that would make a difference in who you speak to. She said it was sent to Planstin. Provided April with the Planstin number and transferred her over. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-05 08:15:10', '2024-04-05 08:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136382001', 'Eliza Volk', NULL, '4-4-24 Hello Eliza,

