  ('zcrm_1579374000136686071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135320002', 'Wilfred Thibodeau', NULL, '4/4/24: Called Charlene back regarding voicemail about medication. She says she was able to talk to someone and is being taken care of. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 17:16:22', '2024-04-04 17:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136713017', 'Jeff Tomlinson', NULL, '4-4-24 Jeff came to me via ASHI. However, they live in WA state unfortunately and his wife is currently pregnant. So, this won''t work for them on both fronts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-04 16:00:20', '2024-04-04 16:00:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098380002', 'Elaine Reynolds', NULL, '4/4/24: Elaine called and left message with BOB, Called back and tried to LVM but call was picked up and then hung up. She was reaching out about 1095. Put a reminder in 1095 teams chat for tomorrow. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 15:58:03', '2024-04-04 15:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109495026', 'Karen Luthart', NULL, '4/4/24: Called Karen back. She left a message with BOB today saying she needed her 1095 and to update her address. Adding her to form and emailing link to change address. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 15:47:59', '2024-04-04 15:47:59'),
