  ('zcrm_1579374000136686038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122624002', 'Keith Damiano Jr.', NULL, '4/4/24: Keith LVM about needing prescriptions filled and bloodwork. I called him back and over a voice message informed him on how to access the RX quote request form. Asked him to give us a call back when he can. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 15:27:55', '2024-04-04 15:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '4-4-24 Jana is enrolling now for EF CARE+ $1000/$875 May 1st start date and HAB $250 for July 1st start date. She''s easing into her new paycheck and job. She doesn''t get paid until 1st of the month. She just did all of her wellness visits. But, she is interested in using the vision screening, nutritional counseling for her athlete daughter, mental health counseling for daughter as athlete and teenager. She just dealt with 2 crowns, filling and cleaning before losing her dental insurance from work. 1Dental is not in network for her dentist. I explained HMA and she''s sort of interested for dental and other medical expenses. She also already referred two people to me and she was referred by Martin Bonzi a year or so ago while teaching skiing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-04 15:20:12', '2024-04-04 15:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136690051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002647007', 'Benjamin Pieper', NULL, '4/4/24: Reached out to mbr to wish them happy birthday and offer referral, lvm. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-04 14:34:31', '2024-04-04 14:34:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '4-4-24 Cancelled Apex/RCI MEC. I think her price becomes $781.65+$30=$811.65 for SDHC down from $922. She''s adding HAB for $250. She had troubles with Apex on a number of items such as mammo. Happy to have self-pay and no network moving forward. Starts May 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-04 14:33:25', '2024-04-04 14:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136690041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', NULL, '4/4/24: Reached out to mbr to wish her happy birthday and offer referral, lvm and sent email. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-04 14:31:49', '2024-04-04 14:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136690026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, '4/4/24: Reached out to wish mbr happy birthday and do referral, lvm. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-04 14:28:51', '2024-04-04 14:28:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136690016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082152002', 'Denise DeLeo', NULL, '4/4/24: Reached out to do mbr to do birthday call and cancellation call at once, talked about daughters sharing requests and sent her to zion to create mbr portal. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-04 14:24:23', '2024-04-04 14:24:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136690011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439212', 'James Backes', NULL, '4/4/24: Reached out to mbr to wish him happy birthday, wife answered and said they were on their way to one of their children''s wedding rehearsals, congratulated them and sent referral email. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-04 14:01:48', '2024-04-04 14:01:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136701008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130447001', 'Dewayne Nelson III', NULL, 'Spouse Andrea called in wanting to know who was the primary on the account so she could set up the HSA Account.  Also she wanted to update the Payment Method.  I will send her the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-04 12:45:30', '2024-04-04 12:45:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136701003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256010', 'Marc DiNunzio', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know why his payment was still being charged to his bank account.  I couldn''t figure it out until I saw that he changed that to the credit card on 3/27 after we billed.  Per the members request I deleted all the other payment methods that we had on file.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-04 12:28:25', '2024-04-04 12:28:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, '4/4/24: Called Planstin to check on Kerry Kleisner''s account status, and she still wasn''t showing active in their system. Caden manually added her, and assured me that she should get digital cards today. I asked if Zion would be able to send a welcome email, and he said he would could get something to her letting her know she has services. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 12:27:27', '2024-04-04 12:27:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '4-4-24 I just left vm for HMA''s CEO to call Alicia as well. We''ll see if that happens.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-04 12:22:43', '2024-04-04 12:22:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, '4/4/24: James called to get his 1095 showing he had coverage in January of 2023. Adding him to 1095 list , and let him know he should get the form in the next couple of days. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 12:12:24', '2024-04-04 12:12:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120539002', 'Michael Morby', NULL, '4/4/24: Kari called. After telling her about children''s labs, she decided to try and get discounts on the labs using our reference sites. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 12:05:18', '2024-04-04 12:05:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '4/4/24: Robert called. He''s wanting references for an endocrinologist. We searched multiplan, and I emailed him a list of 6 options close to him. He asked what the price is for meds. I gave him the copay price breakdown for different tiers and we searched his medication, Jatenzo 237 mg, in the formulary. It was listed as exempt. I advised him to put in an RX request next time he needs the meds and we can try to get him a better price. Reid said he cannot source this drug bc it''s a controlled substance. 
Robert requested a quote through our traditional sources. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 11:58:28', '2024-04-04 16:17:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136688023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135538001', 'Alison Johnston', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-04 11:39:51', '2024-04-04 11:39:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129524001', 'Kathryn Jarrett', NULL, '4/4/24: Kathryn called. She has an OBGYN and Mamm visit coming up and wants to see how to go about it. We searched multiplan for her provider. Mine wasn''t pulling up, and she didn''t see the provider listed. I informed her about Planstin''s RBP and advised her to call her provider to 1. check if they are in the PHCS network, or 2. see if they are willing to bill planstin. Also said if the provider is concerned, they can always call planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 11:32:33', '2024-04-04 11:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137479002', 'Kimberly Zimmerman', NULL, '4-4-24 Kimberly and Michelle are almost ready to join. They want to just discuss it a little more. Kimberly had covid last year and thinks it might be considered long haul covid but not really sure. She just gets cold and sinus infections now that can be managed via virtual healthcare. I let her know it will be considered pre-x and she may request her dr. records to see what they''ve written. She also wants to know if she can get some of the blood work such as vitamin D more than once a year. Her dr. had her redo that one to compare after base level test. Although I looked it up on Labratory Assist and it''s only $37.80. They asked about HSA and I let them know we may be offering new options on that front. But, they''re not that concerned about that. They also asked about the discounts on organic foods which is no longer included. I was transparent about that and they are ok with that as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-04 11:31:47', '2024-04-04 11:31:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120539002', 'Michael Morby', NULL, '4/4/24: Called Planstin to check on blood work for children in order to get back to Kari. Crystal informed me that the labs are very very limited under the HSA plan, and she suggested that the member get the codes for what labs the doctor is wanting, call Planstin - and they can cross reference the codes with their list to let her know what is covered. According to the ACA guidelines, only Hematocrit, hemoglobin, and dyslipidemia are listed for older children. 
Called to relay this info to Kari and LVM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 11:04:59', '2024-04-04 11:04:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '4-4-24 Figge''s new business is helping homeowners with all needs for contractors - https://thehomeowneradvocate.com/.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-04 11:02:40', '2024-04-04 11:02:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136690003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '04.04.24:  Brooke texted me to ask for her 1095 form. I replied she doesn''t have a MEC (stated as part of her profile so she doesn''t need a 1095.  She replied she''s been getting them in years past.  I check with Patti who agreed she has no MEC but my notes state she did get a MEC wth her converseion plan of 2020.  When she recently changed her membership to MO with a $1000 IUA, we charged her $234 w/o a MEC.  Patti notified her she has no MEC and she is ok with that. She confirmed this with me by text. I also told her she doesn''t need a 1095 to submit with her taxes but she said her accountant asked for it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-04-04 10:53:16', '2024-04-04 10:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136688003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130065001', 'Ehab Ismail', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-04 10:52:46', '2024-04-04 10:52:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136686003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '4/4/24: Emailed Peter information about Debt Dismissal and he forwarded to his son to check qualification and apply. I said for Blake to reach out if he has any questions or needs assistance with the application. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-04 10:45:22', '2024-04-04 10:45:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136683003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '4-4-24 Martha is interested in HAB for the family. They would use the gym membership for ski passes or gym, annual skin check, dental and vision screenings, bone density test, ultra sound post mammo for dense breast and annual mammo, Cologuard every three years, etc. If they drop Planstin they will lose HSA compliance that they want to keep. So, it''s only $30 more if they keep it since they''d have to re-enroll in CARE+ $875+$250 = $1125 vs current older pricing at $905 +$250= $1155. They will likely keep MEC and add wellness in addition. Also, her son will be aging out this summer onto his own membership. They 24 year old might get a job with benefits. That would lower their price to $650 SECURE HSA + $165 = $815 for ES. She may decide for May 1st start date. Very appreciative of this option. She had success getting her mammo paid by Planstin but had to pay $500 for the additional ultrasound. She''s had to pay $600 for bone density scan every other year. She also had to pay for additional labs that ACA didn''t include. Likely it makes sense to add.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-04 10:38:48', '2024-04-04 10:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136635016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135312001', 'Jennifer Lloyd', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-04 10:07:49', '2024-04-04 10:07:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136642018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, 'I returned a VM from this member asking about add a baby that''s about to be born.  He asked about preventative, however since he has the DPC plan he would have to change plans and I advised that both him and the baby would have preventative.  I gave him pricing for both Secure &amp; Copay.  Also told him how needs/Preventative worked.  I will let Wendy know of my conversation with member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-04 09:51:31', '2024-04-04 09:51:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136642013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136530002', 'Linnea Andersson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-04 08:58:37', '2024-04-04 08:58:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136642008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507245', 'Aimee Fisher', NULL, 'I received an email from Planstin letting me know that member has updated her address with them.  I will update and send over in spreadsheet.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-04 08:27:53', '2024-04-04 08:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136641006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '04.04.24:  Emailed Mary Ann her plan name and information to give to Zion. Included the phone number for Zion''s "Sharing Request" department and described what information to give them and ask them to assist her in opening up a preventive care need.  I asked her to keep me posted on this but I will follow up with her.
I spoke w/Patti to try to verify which conversion plans have which services. Per Patti, she doesn''t think Mary Ann has Zion''s preventive care with her plan. I mentioned, however, she does have a DPC plan which Zion was supposed to honor w/ther preventive care program. Mary Ann is a Liverty conversion.  She and her husband are now paying $343, so Patti doesn''t feel we should press the issue of preventive care w/Zion right now.  I told Patti I''ve already directed Mary Ann to talk to Zion and see if they''ll share her preventive sharing request, since, to me, it looks like it was included in her plan initially, we''ll see how she fares.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-04-04 08:22:36', '2024-04-04 11:01:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136620028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137105002', 'Christopher Ferritto', NULL, 'Spoke w Chris. We now have an enrollment seet up for 4/11 at 10:30am pacific time.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-04-04 08:20:01', '2024-04-04 08:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120635002', 'Timothy Bush', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-04 08:19:54', '2024-04-04 08:19:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136635003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Kerry. Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet to Kerry that was added to plan for 3/1/24. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-04 08:13:35', '2024-04-04 08:18:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136582039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134793011', 'Juan Carlos Garcia Benitez', NULL, '04.03.2024 Seeking a therapist. Guided him to the MAP web page and offered a brief coaching on how to connect and parts of the page. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-03 17:30:42', '2024-04-03 17:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136582034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893179', 'Brian Cosner', NULL, '04.03.2024 Brian has a new job with benefits, and needs to cancel. I sent him the form via CRM. RESENT the cancellation link, as the first time around it did not pull up for him properly. 
I had to send it to him a 3rd time via outlook, where it pulled up instantly. 
Brian was very irate b/c of the phone system, saying that it kept putting him on hold, then he would leave a message (he says he left several messages).
Eventually the form made it to him and his cancellation request made it thru. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-03 17:05:12', '2024-04-03 18:09:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136582024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135674019', 'Amanda Lewis', NULL, '04.03.2024 Amanda called saying she tried attaining a list of therapists through Mazzitti and Sullivan, but they would not recognize her "insurance" when she said MPB Healthcare, which they should''ve at least recognized the company, being that they are partnered with us (MPB).
I told her to call them tomorrow morning and let them know that she is part of the EAP program with MPB and is looking for a therapist. I offered her to call in at the concierge first, if she would like a 3-way call with them for support.
If tomorrow (4/4) does not go as planned, then we will escalate it to Sherry (talk to Joan) NT.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-03 15:41:33', '2024-04-03 15:41:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136582016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671026', 'George Jarratt', NULL, '04.03.2024 George called to learn how to proceed in having the services for his slipped disc shared.I went over the sharing process....', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-03 15:32:45', '2024-04-03 15:33:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136600003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '04.03.24:  Called Mary Ann. She needs a colonoscopy and wanted to know how to move ahead to get this through her plan.  I told her to open a preventive need with Zion. She wants to call them directly to discuss it with them.  I approved that and told her to call the concierge if she has any problem with Zion approving her need.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-04-03 15:21:06', '2024-04-04 08:19:43'),
