  ('zcrm_1579374000136564008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135184001', 'Julie Moinicken', NULL, '4/3/24: Julie called in and mentioned how her husband had aged out recently and put her on her own plan. Told her how I had spoken with her husband Randall regarding his cancellation recently and explained that he had a different plan that she has right now as she was going from a secure to a care plus. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-03 14:09:27', '2024-04-03 14:09:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136588008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110880002', 'Alexander Crowe', NULL, '4/3/24: Alex called to open a new sharing request. He had specific questions regarding the integrative therapies. While I gave him general info regarding Zion''s policies for these types of treatment, I advised him to ask Zion directly for answers to the specifics. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-03 14:05:22', '2024-04-03 14:05:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136588003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '4/3/24: Kim called. She has an appointment set up for her kid to have a preventive check up. She called to verify that the provider is in the PHCS network, and they are - but since they hadn''t heard of Planstin, they wanted her to check the NPI number. Planstin told her they couldn''t see that info, and she would have to call the number on the card (multiplan). But when she called multiplan, she couldn''t get anyone on the phone. Then she mistakenly told her provider that she has a health share plan, instead of presenting the preventive planstin card like insurance. At this point she''s very worried about getting a bill. I assured her that since the office has verified they are in PHCS network, all she needs to do is make sure the bill is coded as preventive and billed to Planstin. She still wasn''t completely convinced and said she''d keep trying to call the number on the card. I advised her to have the provider call Planstin if there are any issues. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-03 13:57:01', '2024-04-03 13:57:01'),
