  ('zcrm_1579374000136551013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '4/2/24: Emily called. She "just doesn''t understand how to use her plan" and said it''s way too difficult. She''s going to an orthopedic dr today and doesn''t know what to do. I explained to present as cash pay and collect an itemized bill for her visit, and if she expects this issue to exceed her $1500 IUA, then those bills can be submitted to Sedera. I also suggested another welcome call to go over her service providers and how to use them. She had to jump off the call, but I sent her the sedera guidelines and a link to schedule another welcome call to gain insight into using her plan. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-03 10:20:45', '2024-04-03 10:20:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136529023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, '4-3-24 Felecia and Debby want to join for Aug. 1st into HAB. So, we put them on the calendar for July 15th to enroll. This will allow their finances to be in order.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-03 10:07:16', '2024-04-03 10:07:16'),
