  ('zcrm_1579374000136529003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '4-3-24 Linnea is enrolling in CARE+ and we reiterated there are no wellness benefits since at her age the cost difference doesn''t make sense to include it in the membership. She''s choosing the $1000 IUA / $240 and I waived the $100 since she''s already a member. She had the procedures for her vericose veins done already and has one more final appt next week. Some of the costs have already been shared. It should be all set before the start of moving onto her own membership for 5/1/24. Any new Needs can be at the $1000 IUA and old ones at $2500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-03 09:16:24', '2024-04-03 09:16:24'),
