  ('zcrm_1579374000136434048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129966020', 'Abigaiel Dalke', NULL, '4/2/24: Abigaiel called to inquire about opening a sharing request. I walked her through how it works, and transferred to Zion to set up her member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-02 10:07:10', '2024-04-02 10:07:10'),
