  ('zcrm_1579374000136434032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131712002', 'Grant Zabielski', NULL, '4/2/24: Crystal from Planstin called. She said Milynn reached out last night about opening a sharing request, but they do not show her as having Zion, only the Planstin MEC. Entered member''s info into Member form. Crystal said she would call member back once the files have been corrected on their end. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-02 09:16:27', '2024-04-02 09:16:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136431023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135103002', 'Donna Williams', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-02 09:02:49', '2024-04-02 09:02:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136431018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135249002', 'Peter Deichmann', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-02 08:59:03', '2024-04-02 08:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136426044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982002', 'Gabriella Carenza', 'New Membership eff 5/1/24', 'Member Only $1000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-02 08:50:48', '2024-04-02 08:50:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136434013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '4/2/24: Emailed Lori appeal suggestions based on the documentation she provided us:
"As you move forward with your new appeal, we suggest including all of this documentation and supporting evidence as well as pointing out in writing exactly which lab results led to your diagnosis and the treatment plan to resolve said diagnosis.
Be specific as possible by referencing the documents provided in your writing.  What you want to do is make it easy for them to connect the dots and see this issue clearly.
Ultimately, Zion has the final say, but if there is new information here that wasn''t provided before, then there''s a possibility of approval. 
I''ve taken the liberty of organizing what you provided us with in order to better understand your issue. See attached."
Called to speak with her about issue, LVM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-02 08:44:11', '2024-04-02 09:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136426036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136403002', 'Duane Ellsworth', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-02 08:43:35', '2024-04-02 08:43:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136426031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136381002', 'Jacob Cox', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-02 08:39:39', '2024-04-02 08:39:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136426026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660008', 'Larry Essex', NULL, 'Member called in with a number of questions.  But mostly to try to update his payment Method w/HMA.  Member is very confused about the different companies involved and asked what we do.  I explained that we supply the Telehealth, Mental Health &amp; Concierge Services.  He told me he was having issues getting a Ambulance bill paid.  Told him to speak w/Zion about that .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-02 08:38:25', '2024-04-02 08:38:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136426021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136247002', 'Patrick Hanrahan', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-02 08:22:38', '2024-04-02 08:22:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136434008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755162', 'Scott Yarbrough', NULL, '4/2/24: Scott called to submit a new sharing request. He couldn''t remember how to start one. I sent him the link to Zion''s member portal sign on page. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-02 07:55:02', '2024-04-02 07:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136434003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109378002', 'Jean-Guy Ricard', NULL, '4/2/24: Chatted with Jean about how to open a sharing request. I ended up sending him a link to Zion''s member portal sign in page, bc the new website doesn''t contain a link. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-02 07:53:58', '2024-04-02 07:53:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136431008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135605018', 'Jessica Robinson', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-02 07:39:16', '2024-04-02 07:39:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136402003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136403002', 'Duane Ellsworth', NULL, '4-1-24 Called at 4pm for the enrollment... no answer. LVM. He called me back; Enrolled family.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-04-01 17:00:49', '2024-04-02 09:26:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136393011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119927002', 'Shane Farina', NULL, '04.01.2024 Shane called to learn if any of the vaccines he needs to get with his wife are covered. He emailed me the list. When Planstin is available, as I called and they were not able to pick up, I will relay the list to see if it is covered. 
Shane emailed back stating he had not luch with telehealth to attain a prescription for vaccines needed for travel. I sent him the following to take the next steps:
It was very nice to speak with you today. Sorry the telehealth approach did not work. It sounds like, they consider all vaccines to be controlled, perhaps.

