  ('zcrm_1579374000136347028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, '4/1/24: Sheila called asking if there is anyway she can get a reimbursement for her obgyn appt today. I advised that in the future, to present her planstin card at the appointment and have the provider bill them directly. They don''t do reimbursements, but she could see about having the provider re-send the claim to them. At the end of our conversation, I offered to transfer to planstin so she could see if it''s possible tofor her to send the claim to them. AM

*** Now realizing I gave member incorrect info since she''s on the Direct Plan. Will call and fix. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 14:56:41', '2024-04-25 14:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136347023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, '4/1/24: Called Abigail and LVM regarding her question about whether or not a third non-standard, additional ultrasound is shareable in a maternity request. I informed her that according to the guidelines, it''s usually 3 standard UNLESS an unexpected complication requires additional scans. So it sounds like her situation would fall into this, but to be 100% certain I would advise she ask Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 14:32:42', '2024-04-01 14:32:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136352018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '4-1-24 Rachel''s husband went to a naturopath in May 2023 and did a blood test. He had elevated PSA. They weren''t worried about it. But, now he''s been suddenly and newly diagnosed with low grade prostate cancer and Zion is rejecting the new Need for pre-x bc of the blood test in May before they re-enrolled in Nov. 1st, 2023. They can take their time bc it''s low grade, so she''s not panicked. The doctor is telling them to take their time in making any next steps. So, she''s thinking maybe they can wait until Nov. 2024 to do any high cost stuff related and up to $25K. She''s super bummed they left the membership for 9 months bc they got it for free from her husbands job at the time. Now she''s regretting ever leaving the membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-01 14:32:09', '2024-04-01 14:32:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136347018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110365002', 'Richard Webster', NULL, '4/1/24: Rich called. His son got insurance with an employer and Rich wanted to know if it would save him any money if his son wasn''t on the plan. I explained that the price is for member and family regardless of family size and since he has 2 children dependents on his plan that removing his son wouldn''t affect the price. He asked if there was an issue how would that be handled, and I explained that according to Zion''s guidelines, his son would have to use primary insurance first. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 14:11:20', '2024-04-01 14:11:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136347013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114145002', 'Mary Soborowicz', NULL, '4/1/24: Craig called, he''s going to see a doctor about pain in his ankle and wondering how to best approach his appointments and upcoming ones. I advised to simply collect itemized receipts for any services he has relating to the issue, and keep in mind that there is a 6 month deadline to submit those. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 14:08:33', '2024-04-01 14:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136372003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105619002', 'James Paulus', NULL, '04.01.23:  On Thursday, 3.28.24, B.O.B. emailed my personal email account a message re: Laura''s call as the co. email was not working properly.  I copied and sent it to Nahla but it, apparently, was not received.  When Angie asked today where the B.O.B messages could be found, I tried to find the one I sent but was unsuccessful. I asked Angie, who had called Laura back, to let Laura know this was my fault and please apologize for the glitch. I sent Angee the B.O.B. message today.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-04-01 13:38:56', '2024-04-01 13:38:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136356013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982002', 'Gabriella Carenza', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove spouse eff 5/1.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 13:37:59', '2024-04-01 13:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136352008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005534005', 'Christie L. Cadwell', NULL, '4-1-24 Christie has still not heard back from Anthem about reinstating their plan. I''m awaiting some new options to share with her as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-01 13:26:30', '2024-04-01 13:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107499002', 'Isser Zeilingold', NULL, '4/1/24: Reached out to mbr to wish him happy birthday, vm was full, sent email referral. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 13:19:23', '2024-04-01 13:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136347008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '4/1/24: Julie called asking about how her plan worked if she goes out of the country. I informed her that according to the guidelines, expenses incurred outside of the US are shareable as long as they meet the member guidelines. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 13:13:56', '2024-04-01 13:13:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129548001', 'Jill Finn', NULL, '4/21/24: Reached out to mbr to wish her happy birthday and offer referral, lvm and sent email. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 13:11:56', '2024-04-01 13:11:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, '4/1/24: Reached out to mbr to wish him happy birthday and offer referral, lvm sent email. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 13:09:07', '2024-04-01 13:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109799016', 'Robert Louchheim', NULL, '4/1/24: Reached out to Robbie to wish him happy birthday and offer our referral, he has a question about a potential sharing request, explained how his iua works and how he can begin an ongoing share request. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 13:06:48', '2024-04-01 13:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136349013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130717010', 'Dalton Fisher', NULL, '04.01.2024 Sara called to get help in accessing her MPB Portal and learning how to connect with a therapist. I offered her the appropriate credentials to sign into her MPB Portal, and guided her to the Mazzitti and Sullivan &amp; MPB collaborative page to sign in and access their resources and more. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-01 12:57:17', '2024-04-01 12:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127150001', 'Cynthia Barrett', NULL, '4/1/24: Mbr was calling in asking for a reminder of what our teleheath program was, told her cirrus md and explained that she can download the app or visit the website as well. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 12:55:53', '2024-04-01 12:55:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109171001', 'Amy Hindman', NULL, '4/1/24: Amy reached out to us to inquire about having a colonoscopy and wanted to know in the event it wound up being more than just a colonoscopy if she could get sharing, explained to her the iua and how it works. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 12:44:50', '2024-04-01 12:44:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136356008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112836002', 'Andre Savoie', NULL, 'I will compose an email to member with Payment plan since they have not been billed since 10/23.  Pmt plan as follows:', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 12:38:38', '2024-04-01 12:38:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107281002', 'Devorrah Moss', NULL, '4/1/24: Reached out to Devorrah to wish her happy birthday and spoke with her directly, offered her the referral as she proactively mentioned she has a friend who might be interested in joining. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 12:37:31', '2024-04-01 12:37:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '4/1/24: Christopher called in and mentioned how he was needing to have a surgery on his thumb but it was a pre membership condition and wanted to know how to proceed and if he was limited to the PHCS network. Told him he was not limited to any network or provider and asked if he had one in mind already which he did, told him he would follow the same sharing request process but is limited to 50k. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 12:32:33', '2024-04-01 12:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072553056', 'Jason Naumann', NULL, '4/1/24: Reached out to Jason to wish him happy birthday, Angela answered, wished him well still and offered referral. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 12:30:26', '2024-04-01 12:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136351008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130065001', 'Ehab Ismail', NULL, '4/1/24: Reached out to mbr to wish him happy birthday and offer referral, mbr had a question about welcome call and then if we offer psychiatric services, explained to him how our mental health program is mainly just talk therapy, asked to speak to someone else about it, told him he could speak with Vanessa more about it during his welcome call potentially. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 12:20:08', '2024-04-01 12:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136356003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120534002', 'Gregory Nelsen', NULL, 'I contacted this member re:making spouse primary after he ages out eff 5/1.  I explained to him that his spouse would have to re-enroll.  I reminded him about the link that was sent to him that he will need to submit.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 12:15:30', '2024-04-01 12:15:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136352003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763225', 'David Lung', NULL, '4-1-24 Called to help them enroll in HAB. They are not answering so I left a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-04-01 12:05:59', '2024-04-01 12:05:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136349008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120534002', 'Gregory Nelsen', NULL, '04.01.2024 Gregory called to switch his dependent/spouse Christine to the primary holder position, since he is aging out.
I tried connecting with Patti, but she was pre-engaged with another valued member. I offered him  the option, if he would like me to transfer him to his advisor, Michael Montes or leave Member Services a VM. He chose the latter. I direct transferred him to Patti''s VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-01 11:51:43', '2024-04-01 11:51:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136349003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, '04.01.2024 Rachel called in to attain her 1095C. I explained it would not normally come from Zion (where she thought she downloaded the empty form from ), and that I will add her to the list to send out an email too, if that''s good with her. She was thankful and in agreement. She also mentioned her premium almost doubling in amount, from high $600''s to mid $900''s. I told her that sounds like a billing question, how about we transfer her over to make sure there''s not glitch in the system. I direct transferred her to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-01 11:30:48', '2024-04-01 11:30:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136347003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130421011', 'Shane Mellin', NULL, '4/1/24: Shane LVM with some questions regarding what''s included in his plan. Called him back and he wanted to know if vision and dental is included bc planstin directed him to a virtual helpdesk which included a pdf with MPB logo on in outlining vision coverage. He also asked about accessing WHLD bc the link was broken from his email. I informed him that as far as I know, vision is not included in MPB plans, but I would check into this pdf, and WHLD is being replaced at the moment. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 11:27:58', '2024-04-01 11:27:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136289060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568331', 'Carol Boire', NULL, '4/1/24: Carol called to make sure she is still an active member. She said that she hasn''t seen a statement recently on funds being deducted. I checked her payment history and confirmed that all is fine. I showed approved bank drafts with the most recent being March 2024. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 10:56:49', '2024-04-01 10:56:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136309029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', 'Removing Dependent eff 5/1/30', 'I processed Change form to remove Linnea eff 4/30.  Per Wendy''s notes she will be re-enrolling.  Membership still Mem &amp; Ch so no change in price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 10:44:09', '2024-04-01 10:47:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136338003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, '04.01.2024 Lady called to learn what her next steps were regarding opening the sharing request AO last night, Sunday.
We did a 3-way call with Zion, Meghan answered and gracefully guided us through what to expect next.
Presently, Zion does not have a leading prompt, after members submit a sharing request, to know what to do next. For new members, this could be confusing, and may cause LOSING TIME, b/c they don''t know they can JUST upload the documents right then and there, once the sharing request is open, whether it has been approved or not. The supporting documents are key for their sharing request to move forward.
Meghan assure Lady that she will receive an email now from the determination team informing her of the status of her request, any needed documents or have any questions that need clarification about her surgery. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-04-01 10:31:53', '2024-04-01 10:31:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136308028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133663012', 'Steven Hitchcock', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-01 10:30:45', '2024-04-01 10:30:45'),
