  ('zcrm_1579374000136309019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130192002', 'Retha Parsley', NULL, 'Back in early February when this member submitted the change form to split spouse from membership she wanted to cancel her membership.  Andrea sent that form but she did not fill it out.  She called in on 3/22 and wanted March &amp; April refunded.  I advised her that I could not do that only April.  I will refund that now.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 09:57:59', '2024-04-01 09:57:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136289037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103167002', 'Teresa Broaddus', NULL, '4/1/24: Teresa called asking if there was a way she can access a year end statement. I informed her that while we do not provide a year end statement, she can view her statement history through her member portal. I helped her navigate to and access her portal. She requested a 1095 be emailed to her. Adding to 1095 list. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 09:56:15', '2024-04-01 09:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136289024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115632002', 'Tatiana Hamawi', NULL, '4/1/24: Tatiana called frustrated bc she needs her 1095 form, and this is the third time she''s called asking for it. I reached out to group chat and Kelly sent it on the spot. Called member back to make sure she received it. She said that the form is completely blank, and that its a fillable form. Kelly is showing everything correctly on her end and in the email. I transferred member to Karina to hopefully correct the issue and answer the tax related/ form questions she had. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 09:04:16', '2024-04-01 09:19:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136319008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113416002', 'Conrad Buteau', NULL, '4/1/24: Conrad reached out to let us know that his was pregnant, congratulated them both and explained how a maternity sharing request works. Transferred him to zion to create a mbr portal as he had never done so before. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 08:56:33', '2024-04-01 08:56:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136319003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125284001', 'Marianne Ricciardi', NULL, '4/1/24: Marianne called in because she was mentioning that she had an upcoming procedure and she was unsure of how to proceed, explained how her iua works and submitting a sharing request. transferred her to zion to create mbr potal. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 08:55:35', '2024-04-01 08:55:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136289019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081769002', 'Robert Henchel', NULL, '4/1/24: Robert called and asked if sleep apnea is covered. He needs to have a procedure to remove a flap of skin. I advised that while equipment and testing are not shareable, this could be and transferred him to ZIon to get a for sure answer. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 08:37:04', '2024-04-01 08:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136289014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105619002', 'James Paulus', NULL, '4/1/24: Laura called last Thurs, and left a message with BOB while we were in meeting. Stated she was disappointed that she never got a call back. Left another VM over the weekend. I called her back. She had questions about a colonoscopy, but they decided they are going to cancel for now. They enrolled with Covered California over the weekend. She said they like MPB and will most likely come back in December, but after doing a cost analysis, it made more sense to go that route. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 08:27:31', '2024-04-01 08:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136308013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465016', 'Todd Smith', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Todd and Aimee. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-01 08:18:28', '2024-04-01 08:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136309011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098470001', 'Jen Coggin', NULL, 'Spouse Maria called into update address.  I will email the Change Form to her.  She also need new Planstin cards I directed her to Planstin for that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 07:51:48', '2024-04-01 07:51:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136312008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125144014', 'Edward Hartman', NULL, '4/1/24: Edward reached out because he had injured his elbow, mentioned how he started with cirrusmd and they recommended him go to urgent care for imaging. Provided him with some imaging centers nearby from hcbb in an attempt to lower mbr out of pocket cost. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-04-01 07:49:04', '2024-04-01 07:49:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136309003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', NULL, 'Member called in re; 1095 for membership in 2023.  I advised her that she did not need this to file her taxes.   That it would show only this time period that she was on the membership.  She also asked the amount she could submit for her taxes and I told her the $90 per month for Member &amp; Sp.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 07:38:48', '2024-04-01 07:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136308008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134789023', 'Jessica Guillet', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-04-01 07:36:22', '2024-04-01 07:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136289009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863002', 'Dennis Nield', NULL, '4/1/24: Dennis called requesting amounts paid for MEC for tax purposes. I showed him how to collect the information through his member portal, and advised that these forms are sent to ACA mandate states, but if he would like a 1095, we can email one with his permission. He requested to have it emailed. Added to 1095 request sheet through teams. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-04-01 07:18:28', '2024-04-01 07:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136288003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105428002', 'Steven Vertz', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he now had "Insurance" thru his wifes employer and needed to cancel.  I will send out cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-04-01 07:11:09', '2024-04-01 07:11:09'),
