  ('zcrm_1579374000136261003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136256011', 'Brian Coffey', NULL, '3-19-24 Brian''s DOB is 7/29/74. His two girls are on their mom''s ins. So, they are all set. Brian is solo. Met him from BSU. His income is $2K-$3K per month. Putting it at $2500 is $30K per year and he gets about a $502 APTC. He thinks his income will be about $50K-$60K later this year if he partners with someone. He currently is managing an ankle problem with a boot up to his knee. If he needs surgery or more significant care, he will try to manage it while he get a big APTC and CSR. He''ll create his account with C4 or update it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-29 13:08:50', '2024-03-29 13:08:50'),
