  ('zcrm_1579374000136184165', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662022', 'Jaime Klingelhofer', NULL, '03.29.2024 Jamie called asking how to proceed with the ultrasound she needs done on her thyroid, for an ongoing condition, PreX. I walked her through the process and of being a cash pay patient, how to present, organize her papers, IUA, and the best time to open the sharing request with Zion. I did not mention the 6 month deadline, as it is just a one service per year she gets done. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-29 08:04:38', '2024-03-29 08:04:38'),
