  ('zcrm_1579374000136184160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918010', 'Lauren Klucewich', NULL, '03.28.2024 PHCS search. Was told on December 2023, if doctor is not in the PHCS network then she has to pay out of pocket. This is incorrect information, given the kick-off of the RBP price model in June of 2023, where members have the option to request for their NON PHCS providers/facilities to call Planstin to bill them, as THE PROCESS. THIS was not introduced to Lauren. 
She describes the person she spoke with to have an authentic accent. She will see if she wrote her name down anywhere.
MONDAY: she will call back so we can 3-way call Planstin, explain the situation, and hope they will accept to reimburse/cover, given the 3 months that just passed.
We will contact the doctor''s office and see if they are willing to REVERSE the process, reimburse Lauren and bill Planstin instead.
Lauren was kind, patient and understanding and looking forward to fixing these issues.
Lauren is also seeking a non-preventive CT scan situation. I guided her to make sure all services for this matter to be presented as a cash-pay patient, collect receipts, watch for fulfilling the IUA, and be prepared to open a sharing request if needed, and that she has 6 months to do so. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-28 18:04:41', '2024-03-28 18:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136184152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985046', 'Maria Mitzi Moye', NULL, '03.28.2024 CirrusMD assistance. Maria Mitzi (Full First Name) needed help accessing CirrusMD. I sent her  a registration and thankfully she was already registered. So I walked to the app via website, and got access quickly, and was able to start a chat with a doctor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-28 17:30:53', '2024-03-28 17:39:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136184147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467623', 'Christopher Bonelli', NULL, '03.28.2024 Missed a call from Christopher last night. He left a VM asking for his 1095. I will put it in the loop table in the Teams chat with Patti, Kelly and Karina to request an email for a 1095. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-28 17:30:02', '2024-03-28 17:30:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136184142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098690002', 'Samantha Hernandez', NULL, '03.28.2024 Heard Samantha''s VM and called her back today. The VM was from the same day Angee spoke with her, so I''m not sure if they connected. I left her another VM to call us back on the same subject of using the EAP program with us. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-28 17:26:44', '2024-03-28 17:26:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136205044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '3-28-24 Matt completed the Change form today to add his baby Kaia who was born 4/8/23. He added her to Sedera and not with MPB. I''ve sent a note to Sedera to make sure this is true. The rest of Kaia''s benefits will begin April 1st, 2024. He noticed only bc of his tax form didn''t show her. We can''t backdate the MEC or CirrusMD. But, assuming he did her add her via Sedera then Sedera will show her membership from birth for MCS aspect of membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-28 16:47:06', '2024-03-28 16:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136205039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136014163', 'Joslyn Sarshad', NULL, '3-28-24 Hello Joslyn,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

