  ('zcrm_1579374000136205021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137479002', 'Kimberly Zimmerman', NULL, '3-28-24 Brandi Stanley referred Kim to me. They are friends and Kimberly was complaining about the complexity of her ins and lack of benefits. Brandi sent her to me. Email is not working, so I called Kimberly. She is 44 and her wife is 47. She is self-employed, no health issues, no tobacco, no meds. They are using US Health now at $600+ with $5K ded and they have sickness plan w/$5K ded, accident plan w/ $500 ded and health and wellness plan. I explained CARE+ $450/$1000 and HAB $165 for total of $615. She prefers the $1000 IUA level. She wants to share it all with her wife. I will send her the video and written emails and brochures for all aspects.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-28 16:10:53', '2024-03-28 16:19:30'),
