  ('zcrm_1579374000136205003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136189019', 'Kristen Balcom', NULL, '3-28-24 Referred by Montanah Matthies. Kristen is 36, lives in Carbondale, CO. She''s self-employed as a contractor 1099 for a law firm and doesn''t qualify for any APTC. She got divorced last year and had a marketplace plan but now with her income, it''s expensive for nothing. She''s paying $460 with a $9K ded, she thinks. She did have ACL knee surgery 1 1/2 years ago and it''s fully healed. She had a fractured spine from work and got worker''s comp and it''s fully healed. She works at an airport part time which is where this happened.  She watched the MPB video. She''s interested in CARE+ with $2500 IUA for $205 a month and HAB for $107 = $312. She''s young and healthy other than what''s listed above. She gets a ski pass, gym membership and golf membership, dental cleanings, labs, possible mental health since it''s included, nutritional health and possible wellness visits for use of HAB. She enrolled in both and is all set for a May 1st start date. She''ll cancel her current ins once it''s April for April 30th. All set and super happy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-28 13:47:39', '2024-03-28 13:48:14'),
