  ('zcrm_1579374000136183008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135312001', 'Jennifer Lloyd', NULL, '3/28/24: Jennifer called. She has a mammogram scheduled for April 9th, and begins her services on April 1st. She wanted to go ahead and get cards and make sure that her provider is in network. I suggested to wait till Monday, and if she doesn''t receive cards by that day, to call back and we can get some emailed to her. We searched her provider on multiplan and didn''t see them, but she did find an extensive list of options. I advised she call her provider and see if they are willing to bill planstin, and if not explore these other options. I emailed her some preventive care resources. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-28 10:27:59', '2024-03-28 10:27:59'),
