  ('zcrm_1579374000136117041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106731013', 'Lori Miller', NULL, '3-27-24 Lori called bc income will be more than expected. I can''t login to C4. But, from notes above it looks like they put in $84K and increased it by $5K to $89K. She thinks they''ll make $99K. Since that''s borderline 10% change and it''s only until she moved to Medicare in Aug., I suggested she leaves it alone and pays the % tax penalty instead. She agreed. She let me know that Centura is now Common Spirit. Common Spirit and Anthem may not be able to reach a deal regarding in-network benefits. If not, this will be devastating to all clients who use Centura and Anthem''s network. They will decide by May, 2024!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-27 15:41:20', '2024-03-27 15:41:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136100028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128178008', 'Linda Robison', NULL, '3/27/24: Scott called. He had a sleep apnea test recently, and they are wanting to put him on a machine next which will go over his IUA. He stated that he has called before and we told him that this is covered, although there aren''t any notes stating that. 
