  ('zcrm_1579374000136117036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, '3-27-24 Heidi called bc she just received a $100 check for a lawsuit related to FTC and Benefytt Technologies and My Benefits Keeper. She wanted to know if/how it''s related to MPB. I let her know I''ve never heard of those companies and I have no idea what that''s all about. She started with MPB at a similar time she was receiving emails from those companies. She thinks she had some other benefits that overlapped for a few months perhaps. So, she was relieved to know it''s not related.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-27 14:14:18', '2024-03-27 14:14:18'),
