  ('zcrm_1579374000136117016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005534005', 'Christie L. Cadwell', NULL, '3-27-24 Christie lives abroad for part of the year. Upon her return she found a letter from Anthem that they cancelled her ins for non-pmt even though she was using the same cc as before. But, she did change her plan with Anthem and never followed up with Anthem to reset her payment for the new plan. So, she''s appealing the cancellation since she was not notified in any other way such as text, email or anything. They had a notice in her account but didn''t notify her beyond the one snail mail letter that she never received.  It''s in the appeals process right now. If that fails, I mentioned I have one possible other true ins option with underwriting. She did not need a stint in her heart. She had a heart catheter (?) and had some calcium build up. She had cataract surgery on one eye last year and doesn''t need it on the other eye. That''s it for now. Also, worst case scenario she''s willing to get married to her boyfriend if she has to for a SEP. But, that''s last resort.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-27 11:40:38', '2024-03-27 11:40:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136077091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135595019', 'Chandler Hyer', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of April 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-27 11:29:28', '2024-03-27 11:29:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136117011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '3-27-24 Traci is trying to email me and can''t bc email isn''t working. We are playing phone tag. I gave her my gmail account to try.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-27 11:28:13', '2024-03-27 11:28:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136117003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763225', 'David Lung', NULL, '3-27-24 Dave and Holly are very interested in HAB. They are just deciding whether or not to keep the HSA compliance with Planstin. The price difference is negligible. CARE+ $615 and HAB $165 = $780 or SECURE HSA $650+$165 = $815. They may keep Planstin and fully fund their HSA at $9300. They know they can still use the HSA money they''ve accumulated. They have a golf club membership and within that they have a sports/fitness membership for $3600 in which they''d apply the $250 towards. They do dental cleanings, Holly may want a thermogram instead of a mammo, they are interested in nutritional health but they have no interest in the mental health benefit. They use UC Health. Dave had a medical event this past year where his heart stopped while he was driving his new Tesla. It was totaled. His car insurance covered $50K of his $150K medical expenses. Zion was excellent and shared the rest of the cost which was about $100K. The only challenge in the process was UCHealth delaying things. Dave was thrilled with how Zion treated him and shared the cost! He will now need to do a quarterly test of his pace maker which is about $200 each visit. He will use his HSA money to pay for it. He may try to submit it to HAB to see if they will reimburse as well. He chose the Abbott Labs pacemaker which doesn''t auto communicate the results of the pace maker wirelessly yet. The MedTronics type will auto report the results. But his will not, which is why he needs ongoing check ups to be safe.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-27 11:16:30', '2024-03-27 11:24:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136077081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135598019', 'Becca Reynolds', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of April 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-27 11:10:43', '2024-03-27 11:10:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136077071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135601037', 'Scott Witham', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of April 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-27 10:27:56', '2024-03-27 10:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136084021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112836002', 'Andre Savoie', NULL, 'After looking into this members account, he has not been billed since 11/23 when his payment declined.  He never came up on any decline lists so was not contacted.  I reached out to him and he will be talking over with his wife re:continuing on the plan.  I will email him with options.  He was back in contact with me letting me know that his wife had a need and wanted to know of the status of monies that were owed to them.  I advised that I did not have access to that information, that he would have to speak with Zion about that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-27 10:17:21', '2024-03-27 10:17:21'),
