  ('zcrm_1579374000136046061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256010', 'Marc DiNunzio', NULL, 'Marc called saying he couldn''t log into the website. He was trying an old website that doesn''t exist anymore. Turns out, he wanted into his member portal to update payment info, so I provided him with his portal credentials and explained how to add a payment method. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-27 07:31:10', '2024-03-27 07:31:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136051023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136014163', 'Joslyn Sarshad', NULL, '3-26-24 Robin Brenneise''s daughter Joslyn is joining HAB for the mental health benefits. She was diagnosed with ADHD and needs Cognitive Behavioral Health Therapy. She just enrolled now and I''m requesting an April 1st start date, if possible. We will see. She''s all set with the application submitted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-26 16:54:41', '2024-03-26 16:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136046051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, '3/26/24: Elizabeth''s husband called trying to get us to make an appointment for colonoscopy, I explained that I couldn''t make an appt for him, but could lead him in the right direction. After searching for provider and facility, the problem was the initial appointment last time, and dr refusing to budge on billing. I advised he speak directly with Planstin for advice on how to proceed to avoid another billing error. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-26 16:18:18', '2024-03-26 16:18:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136046046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112836002', 'Andre Savoie', NULL, '3/26/24: Andre called to make sure payment info is correct. His payment history is showing the last date a payment was made was November 2023. WIll check in the morning and get back to Andre about this. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-26 15:41:31', '2024-03-26 15:41:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136046036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105130002', 'John Haley', NULL, '3/26/24: John called requesting a 1095. Adding him to loop table for Kelly to send out. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-26 15:24:09', '2024-03-26 15:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136046031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130717010', 'Dalton Fisher', NULL, '3/26/24: Sara called for help with registering for some of her services. Her DOB is wrong in our system. Reaching out to Patti to update. She is unable to register for Cirrus MD - bc bday is wrong. I sent a support ticket to Cirrus. Also interested in signing up for therapy, so I gave her the MAP number and instructions on how to access the MAP micro site. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-26 14:55:01', '2024-03-26 14:55:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136046026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130371001', 'Dawn Weitzel', NULL, '3/26/24: Dawn called needing help with healthcare bluebook. I walked her through how to log into the site and search for a dermatologist. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-26 14:52:57', '2024-03-26 14:52:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136051018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '3-26-24 Hello Rachel,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522190035
Benefits Start Date: 04/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-26 14:02:56', '2024-03-26 14:02:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136046013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133869001', 'Laura Flores', NULL, '3/26/24: Laura called and hasn''t received any Planstin cards yet, called Plasnstin and they confirmed she wasn''t in the system. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-26 13:19:56', '2024-03-26 14:11:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136042068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128526002', 'Barbara Lucille', NULL, '3-26-24: Hi Barbara,

