  ('zcrm_1579374000136051013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, '3-26-24 Liz is still considering HAB. On a different note, she had a cortisone shot in her hand a while back and then another one in Sept. They are recommending surgery to remove a cyst. The shot took care of the problem so far. She''s not eager to do any surgery. However, when she worked with Zion''s Advocacy Team, they instructed her to pay them the rest of her IUA and they''d send her a debit card to pay the provider. She has already paid the Dr. about $250 and then paid Zion about $750 to cover the surgery. But, she never did the surgery and they need to reimburse her the $750. I''ve never heard of them asking the member to pay them first. This is super bizarre. I recommended Liz works with her Advocacy Team Member to get reimbursed since she may never do the surgery and they are holding her money.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-26 12:43:31', '2024-03-26 12:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136012069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282132', 'Amanda Hoskins', 'Decline of 4/24 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 3/26  I contacted member and she told me she cancelled her membership via email.  I said we do not take cancellations via email.  I will send her out the Cancellation Link.  3/29- Member has cancelled her membership with Sedera and we have not received payment so I will cancel her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-26 12:15:37', '2024-03-29 09:50:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136012059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601439', 'Chelsie Dawydiuk', NULL, 'Member ''s 4/24 Share Amount declined, however she had submitted  Payment Update on 3/22.  I reran with new information.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-26 12:03:37', '2024-03-26 12:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136046008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919617', 'Heather Davies', NULL, '3/26/24: Heather called to ask what telehealth service she is supposed to be using "these days" I advised her to use CirrusMD, and made sure she knew how to access it. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-26 11:55:28', '2024-03-26 11:55:28'),
