  ('zcrm_1579374000136024034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098327002', 'Cindy Gordon', NULL, '03.26.2024 Cindy called on behalf of her daughter, Ally Schrier, requesting the 1095 for her, due to he mandating residential state in MA. I took her daughter''s email, and physical address, and shared it via team group chat with Karina and Kelly for the 1095''s processing this year. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-26 11:07:04', '2024-03-26 11:07:04'),
