  ('zcrm_1579374000136042013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136920019', 'Francesca Thornley', NULL, 'Hi Francesca, 

I made a call to Zion and escalated to their "determinations" department. They stated that the same terms as outlined in Sec 37 on page 30 would apply; an MD would need to make a referral to the chiropractic neurologist to be considered for sharing. At least we know now what you''d need to do in year 2; starting with an MD.

I know this is not the answer you are seeking but at least we know.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-03-26 09:52:19', '2024-03-26 09:52:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136042003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '3-26-2024 Called, Jude answered. (Male btw.). He is going to look it all over w his wife tonight and says he will call me tomorow morning.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-03-26 09:47:10', '2024-03-27 09:01:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136030038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135320002', 'Wilfred Thibodeau', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of April 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-26 09:47:09', '2024-03-26 09:47:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000136012028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127162011', 'Michael Yawn', NULL, 'Member claims that he was in contact with Zion to cancel his membership.  Unless he can produce proof that he was in contact prior to 3/1 I cannot refund him the March Share Amount.  I will refund him the April  Share Amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-26 09:42:44', '2024-03-26 09:42:44'),
