I messaged the team, via the already generated thread in Outlook and placed Cheryl''s name in the loop table created for Patrick. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-26 09:33:02', '2024-03-26 09:33:02'),
