  ('zcrm_1579374000135999008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135723002', 'Peggy Lee', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of April 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-26 07:34:56', '2024-03-26 07:34:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135977056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '03.25.2024 Carey put in a request for Adderall for 25mg. Adderall only goes from 20mg to 30mg. So I called her to confirm the strength. It turns out she needs the Adderall XR. So I sent her the following:
"Hello again Carey,
Thank you for helping clarify over the phone. 
Here''s a coupon for:
Generic Adderall Xr 25mg 30cap ER
The price below and coupon are AO 03.25.2024:
Safeway: Generic Adderall Xr 30 30 mg cap ER = $17.54.
If you need anything changed or adjusted, please call us at the concierge line. We are here from M-F, 9am-8pm ET."                                      NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-25 17:39:39', '2024-03-25 17:39:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135977048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, '03.25.2024 Althea called to learn about what blood work is considered preventive and covered by Planstin. I explained which ones we have seen covered, she shared what she is looking  to get, then I share with her the 4 lab discounted sites. guided her through the process.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-25 16:54:19', '2024-03-25 17:02:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135977043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115515002', 'Osha Waters', NULL, '03.25.2024 Osha called to better learn how to proceed with getting her daughter''s doctor''s appt shared for what possible be a form of autoimmune issue. Osha expects her daughter''s first appt to be around $800. She also foresees labwork &amp; follow-up appts.
After explaining the process, options, possibilities due to guidelines and deadlines, Osha paraphrased her understanding, I gave her Zion''s number, and transferred her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-25 16:21:05', '2024-03-25 16:21:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135977038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136382001', 'Eliza Volk', NULL, '3-25-24 I can''t login to C4 with the code. So, I talked Eliza through the entire process on C4. She still had to enter her self employment information which she did. She estimated her income at $22K for now. She will let me know if that changes throughout the year. If so, we will adjust. I helped her upload her end of ins doc from her UHC plan that was in NY. Her family company can also write a letter of ins termination if necessary. Her APTC is $400.50 which is more than the Cigna Connect CO Option Silver for $396.92. So, she doesn''t owe Cigna anything to get her plan started. Once I can access her account, I''ll check on it. But, I had her make sure it shows an April 1st start date which it does.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-25 15:06:59', '2024-03-25 15:06:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135983086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135467002', 'Michael Pommerening', NULL, '3/25/24: Reached out retention, lvm. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-25 15:00:41', '2024-03-25 15:00:41'),
