  ('zcrm_1579374000135983076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127162011', 'Michael Yawn', NULL, '3/25/24: Reached out to mbr and he answered, not joining new insurance, wants to try and get refund as he claims he reached out to zion before deadline to cancel his membership and that they confirmed they would do so, told him i would need to look further into it. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-25 15:00:15', '2024-03-25 15:00:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135974048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119412010', 'Carie Mueller', NULL, '3/25/24: Carie called. She''s doing her taxes and wanted to check and see if her plan is a high deductible HSA qualifying plan. She has an older HSA from her two previous jobs and is now unemployed. I explained that her plan is not HSA qualifying, it''s just health share, but we do have plans that are if she wants to explore that with her advisor. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-25 14:22:34', '2024-03-25 14:23:02'),
