  ('zcrm_1579374000135977033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119491002', 'Avraham Zeev Allina-Turnauer', NULL, '03.25.2024 Avraham called requesting assistance in finding a PCP. While I was confirming his Care+ plan, I reassured him that his plan does not required him to abide by a network, and it will be considered a cash-pay visit. He did not know that, but was glad to hear it, so I offered to send him brief directions on how to access and use HCBB and Healthgrades. I sent the email via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-25 12:57:55', '2024-03-25 12:57:55'),
