  ('zcrm_1579374000135977018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '3-25-24 Kristen is very interested in adding HAB for either the entire family or just exclude Kristen. But, with only a $50 difference, they''ll likely choose it for the entire family. They adopted 3 sisters from India when they were 6, 8 and 12. One is 21 now and working for Starbucks. She can get ins through Starbucks. But, they will keep SECURE for the entire family still. If they change from SECURE to CARE+ it''s $635+$250 = $885 for now until Kristen turns 50 this summer when it increases to $875+$250= $1125. It''s a big jump no matter what. She will discuss it with Stephen today. She knows today is the deadline if they want to add it for April 1st. They had a terrible experience with Planstin recently with the above notes. They do their annual wellness visits. They don''t fund an HSA. They do their dental cleanings and they use mental health counseling since the adoption stuff is challenging for all involved and amazing. Kristen also learned how ridiculously little the annual wellness visits include, learning that you can''t talk about anything or it will change to diagnostic, she only got one lab included, etc. She wants her thyroid testing 2x per year. HAB will solve all of their struggles and give them much more.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-25 11:39:51', '2024-03-25 11:39:51'),
