  ('zcrm_1579374000135977003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065203137', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, '03.25.2024 Bob called again regarding the 1095 tax form, b/c he says they have not received it. I sent the following in Teams group chat with Kelly and Karina:
