  ('zcrm_1579374000135907050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666920', 'Rachel Brandon', NULL, '03.22.2024 Rachel needs an allergist. HCBB directions were sent via CRM. She will search. She might need a sharing request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-22 17:54:16', '2024-03-22 17:54:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135907040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126312002', 'Russ Carpenter', NULL, '03.22.2024 Russ needs to open a sharing request for her daughter. Went to the ER, she had a kidney infection. They gave her antibiotics and now she is doing much better.
I explained to Russ the process of opening a sharing request, and he exclaimed that he went on their website and opened one directly, and that it says pending IUA. I further explained that the IUA, $1000, needs to fulfilled or at least close to it, for Zion to consider sharing expenses. He had not made any payments as of yet on this specific situation, so I offered him two options:
1-Call the ER and make a payment to attain a receipt demonstration fulfillment.
2-Connect with Zion and ask if he can pay the $1000 directly to Zion to continue sharing the remaining of the expenses.
Rus was pleased and chose the latter, I transferred him to Zion to speak to them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-22 16:16:54', '2024-03-22 16:16:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135907032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131098002', 'Dana Petty', NULL, '03.22.2024 Dana called asking for Angee to complete an on the spot long list of RX requests for her daughter, who she described as "not being cooperative".
I sent her the form for the RX requests on hand and requested that she fill it out with all the meds to be sure I don''t make a mistake with the coupons details.
Dana very shortly sent me back an email, thanking me and proceeded to list medications w/o anything other than their names. 
**********************************************************************
Was able to fulfill her coupon requests:
Dear Lacy and Dana,

I''m glad the lines were in favor of me spending my undivided attention on all the meds. Otherwise, I would not have been able to find all of them in the same day. 

The savings are found for the following:
Ibuprofen: 800mg, 30
Amoxicilin: 500mg, 30
Cyclobenzaprine: 5mg, 24
Chlorhexidine: Liquid Mouth Rinse, 473ml, 1 bottle

You shared your preferred pharmacy is Market Street, unfortunately it did not come up for me. However, I did include a few options that you might like, due to the savings.

The prices below are as of 03.22.2024.
Kroger
Ibuprofen: 800mg, 30 - $8.39
Amoxicilin: 500mg, 30 - $7.86
Cyclobenzaprine: 5mg, 24 - $9.64
Chlorhexidine: Liquid Mouth Rinse, 473ml, 1 bottle - $8.21

HEB
Ibuprofen: 800mg, 30 - $10.22
Amoxicilin: 500mg, 30 - $10.11
Cyclobenzaprine: 5mg, 24 - $9.60
Chlorhexidine: Liquid Mouth Rinse, 473ml, 1 bottle - $8.38
Please let me know if  you need anything changed or adjusted. We are here at the concierge line M-F. 9-8pm ET. 

Spoke with Dana, confirmed she received the email with the attachments.               NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-22 15:50:56', '2024-03-22 18:11:55'),
