  ('zcrm_1579374000135907003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', NULL, '03.22.2024 needs help with pulling up PHCS - was finally able to pull it up. Shares that she''s contacted a few to become their patient, and first they were not aware what PHCS was, after they searched about it (according to Krista), they notified Krista that they are not accepting new patients FROM THAT NETWORK.
