  ('zcrm_1579374000135878003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106694002', 'Renee Hornor', NULL, '3/22/24: Renee called asking if an eye doctor would be considered a specialist for copay plan. I wasn''t 100% sure, and advised she ask Planstin for confirmation (I''ll also ask next time I speak with them). she asked, assuming it''s not a specialist, then how do I present. I explained she would present as cash pay, and if the issue turned into something more, what she paid in dr visits would go towards her $1000 IUA. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-22 08:00:30', '2024-03-22 08:00:30'),
