  ('zcrm_1579374000135856034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135858012', 'Jessica Vollmer', NULL, '3-14-24 Jessica is 28 and lives in Denver in Green Valley Ranch. She was sent to me via Andrea Hinman via Michael Kosten. Jessica is starting a new job and Michael will pay 50% up to $200 for her plan. She''s earning about $57K. She''s making $27 per hr now and will get a raise to $28 per hour soon. No pre-x other than getting moles removed, no meds, no tobacco. However, she had an echocardiogram recently!  So, once I explained pre-x clause for MCS and she told me about the echo, we both agreed MCS is not a good choice now. So, the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze Silver looks to be best. She will pay about $165 and company will pay the same.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-21 16:55:38', '2024-03-21 16:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135856026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133855019', 'Talya Dash', NULL, '3-21-24 Talya isn''t receiving any of my email responses. So, I just called her and sent her a text as well as forwarded all of my original email responses. She wants to cancel HAS now. Hopefully I''ll hear from her to resolve or complete the process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-21 16:26:06', '2024-03-21 16:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135856013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '03.21.2024 Cindy called, referred by Wendy, to get assistance in having natural path treatments shared. I called her back and left her a message to call us back. 
Took a test, diagnostic is leaky gut - went away, did not feel better, CEBO is now what has surfaced (small intestine bacterial overgrowth).
Cindy and Robert have spent around 14K in the last year on doctor appointments, treatments and more. They are now seeing a natural path doctor.
They want to open a sharing request with Zion. I explained as long as the Natural Path doctor is a license medical professional, Zion will consider sharing. As well as, having the medical history on hand along with the treatment plans.
I tried transferring her to Zion, but GoTo would not allow me the option. I gave her the number and steps to follow towards getting the sharing request started. She said she will start the member portal, and wait till Robert gets home to complete the sharing request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-21 16:19:09', '2024-03-21 16:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135856008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '3-21-24 Rachel is going to join HAS for April 1st with the instructions I sent just now.  She''s excited since it sounds super easy to use unlike everything else that she''s experienced thus far. She was also asking about mental health benefits to get a prescription. I suggested she starts with CirrusMD. Then I mentioned Life Care. But, in MT that might not pan out with the lack of counselors. She will try HAS as a 2nd option from CirrusMD since that will be flexible and hopefully provide her what she needs.  She was very appreciative and knows I''m here to help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-21 16:05:20', '2024-03-21 16:05:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135856003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102931013', 'Jonathon Anderson', NULL, '03.21.2024 Jonathon called to cancel his membership, saying they got something else. I direct transferred him to Jane Kassel, per MPB''s process. 
