  ('zcrm_1579374000135680053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125960002', 'Steven Kirkland', NULL, '03.20.2024 Steven called to cancel his membership with us, because he found a job that offers benefits. I transferred him to his advisor, Maggie Roeder at (615) 999-4788, to complete the appropriate paperwork.
