  ('zcrm_1579374000135722003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, '3-20-24 Jennifer is interested in CARE+ or SECURE HSA. The price of SECURE HSA wasn''t as bad as she thought. She thought it was $500+ but it''s $405 to obtain compliance and avoid penalties. She might choose that. No pre-x, no meds and no tobacco. We also might have a new option before April 19th deadline. But, she''s leaving April 13th for Mexico. So, we''re meeting on the 11th to discuss final options. I will send her both overviews for review. She''s leaving her current job and will have insurance through April.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-20 14:59:54', '2024-03-20 14:59:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135668113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098613002', 'Lisa McDowell', NULL, '3/20/24: Reached out to speak to mbr for retention, she answered and said she would be switching to united health care, offered and emailed referral. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-20 14:45:10', '2024-03-20 14:45:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135677036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '3/20/24: Spoke to Lori and Jayden (Zion determination dept) regarding Lori''s recent appeal case. 
Lori was diagnosed with toxic mold exposure and had the following services:
Dr visits on 7/12/23, 8/2/23, 8/14/23, 9/11/23
4 lab reports
medication - oral and nasal anti fungals

Zion stated that in the appeal, the only info they had on file were the dr visits, a letter from the dr, and 2 lab reports showing all normal except for an abnormal allergy test (no prescriptions or abnormal labs). Since none of the new info that Zion collected from the provider showed evidence of her infection, it was determined ineligible because Zion does not cover "Allergy Testing".

I advised Lori to collect all of her lab work, scripts and other evidence and resubmit, and we''ll see.AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-20 14:38:52', '2024-03-20 14:38:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135668103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '3/20/24: Lori reached in to talk about a potential meeting she believed having at around 3:30 PM Eastern, reached out in the group chat and Joan mentioned needing more time to resolve it. Angee offered to speak to the mbr as she had some experience with the member already. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-20 13:47:38', '2024-03-20 13:47:38'),
