  ('zcrm_1579374000135680023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125146002', 'Jacob Lee', NULL, '03.20.2024 Heather reached out via SalesIQ re: the WHLC Link/Portal and the Zion log-in information. I sent her the following:
