	12:11:20 PM
	As for the Zion log-in. Let me pull up your profile Heather. I''ll BRB.
	12:11:44 PM
Ok I see now. So what we will need to do is have you speak to Zion directly. I''ll share the info here:
1-Zion 3 888-920-9466 > Extension 3 for customer service
2-Request the invitation link to create a sharing request
