She continued to ask about the WHLC Portal, so I asked her where she was seeing that language, and she sent me a snapshot of the MPB.Health Member Portal page information (above the guy doing the pushups without a shirt on - and BELOW the MAP and MPB Portal ''row'' - ADDITIONAL RESOURCES). 
