  ('zcrm_1579374000135677008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, '3/20/24: Sheila called to get specifics on how to handle her annual wellness visit. When I explained she would submit a preventive need with Zion, she said Zion transferred her to us and told her she didn''t have preventive care. When we called them back, Chris informed me that no one was available to check her status and we would need to call back when the right people arrived to work. Sheila requested to call her back after 5pm EST. I went over how she needed  to present for appt and will see in Nahla can reach out about her membership status at Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-20 11:26:08', '2024-03-20 11:26:08'),
