  ('zcrm_1579374000135580008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137483002', 'Denis Bashtovoi', NULL, '3-19-24 email from Denis along with my answer below:
Kirk, apologies, I am not making decsions quickly here.

I missed one thing when I was looking at the pricing.  at 2500 UIA after 50 years the plan jumps by $200 which makes it almost the same as the current plans I have.

How does that work.  I am 48 now, will it automatically increase at 50 or the rate stays locked in as long as I renew?

My answer:

Good Evening Denis,

Yes, when turn 50, the rate will be increased.  A notification email goes out announcing this at 30 and 60 days prior to the month of your birthday.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-03-19 16:19:49', '2024-03-19 16:19:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135550023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, '3/19/24: Filled out member support form to add Kerry''s info to integration files. However, I am unable to pull up this account in admin123 due to limited access. AM
