  ('zcrm_1579374000135582011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '3-19-24 Rob and Cindy chose to keep MEC for tax benefits. They are adding HAS for wellness. Effective April 1st. All set for both of them at $165. They will call me with any questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-19 14:09:43', '2024-03-19 14:13:33'),
