  ('zcrm_1579374000135550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128665002', 'Matthew Weum', NULL, '3/19/24: Matthew called in, he has a shoulder issue and going to his first appointment, which was estimated to be $750. He''s never used his health share before and wanted to check on how manage appointment. I explained to present as cash pay, and once he expects the issue''s bills to exceed his IUA, then call us back and we can walk him through opening his first sharing request. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-19 11:53:50', '2024-03-19 11:53:50'),
