  ('zcrm_1579374000135525013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, '3-19-24 I talked with Greg about possibly switching to CARE+. But, if we get a new partnership completed  then there may be no reason to move and better for continuity and no new pre-x. He doesn''t have any pre-x fortunately. But, it will still be better to stay put. Per Catherine his membership contribution might be $300.08 if we get the best pricing. This will be lower than he''s paying. So, he will pay the $500+ for the month of April. I should have answers for him for May. I added a note on my calendar to give him a solution before April 20th billing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-19 11:14:32', '2024-03-19 11:14:32'),
