  ('zcrm_1579374000135529018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152005', 'Krista Barker', NULL, '3/19/24: Called Krista and LVM: "Krista, I was able to gain some insight into your current situation with RCI yesterday - If you have time today, please give me a call back."
Krista''s RCI CoPay plan pays $50 towards her office visit, but does not pay for any procedure done during the office visit. Therefore, for her upcoming derm appt, she can use RCI and pay $50, but RCI will not pay towards the biopsy or mole removal. If those procedures exceed her IUA, then can be considered a sharing request with Sedera. 
As for the Mammogram, RCI stated they never received a claim from the provider. 
Phillip from RCI stated that when the provider called, they didn''t ask if Krista was showing up (which she is) - they asked if they had a claim on file. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-19 11:10:43', '2024-03-19 11:10:43'),
