  ('zcrm_1579374000135529013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133855011', 'Amy Myers', NULL, '3/19/24: Called Amy back and LVM: "I wanted to let you know that I spoke to Planstin yesterday. Your new membership and Chris’s cancellation has been sorted out and is accurate in their system, and according to Planstin - will be reflected in Zion’s system by end of today. If you don’t see something by tomorrow morning, please let us know."AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-19 10:57:31', '2024-03-19 10:57:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135529008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '3/19/24: Robert called to ask what is covered/not covered regarding recent issues. He has a torn rotator cuff and got an MRI. I explained that his MRI should be a $200 copay, specialists visits are a $50 copay. He''s needing physical therapy. I wasn''t sure if Physical therapy is considered a specialist visit or not. If not, he could open a sharing request for the issue. Trans to Planstin to discuss is PT is categorized under specialist. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-19 10:52:33', '2024-03-19 10:52:33'),
