  ('zcrm_1579374000135436116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106305009', 'Karen Awad', NULL, '03.18.2024 Karen has not received her 1095. Her accountant is ready to complete her file. I verified her email and physical address, and let her know I''ll add her to the list tonight and they will get it tomorrow morning out to her both ways. I made sure to add her to the loop table for Kelly to see. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-18 17:59:46', '2024-03-18 17:59:46'),
