  ('zcrm_1579374000135436103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465145', 'Munish Chawla', NULL, '3-18-24 Munish is enrolled directly to Zion via MPB''s link. He''s showing up in Planstin/Zion''s list of direct to MCS for April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-18 16:37:23', '2024-03-18 16:37:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128203001', 'Crystal Kulpcavage', NULL, '03.18.2024 Crystal has not received her 1095, and called to let us know today. I messaged the team requesting attention to this. Requesting the following, via Teams: We checked her email, spam mail, but she did not see anything there or her physical mailbox.
