  ('zcrm_1579374000135436093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, '3-18-24 Jennifer called to inquire about options again. She''s leaving her job now. She sees prices for SECURE HSA are more than she remembered. She''s also in the 50-64 age group. She''s living in CA now, so she really needs the MEC. I left her a vm just now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-18 15:57:55', '2024-03-18 15:57:55'),
