  ('zcrm_1579374000135436083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '3-18-24 I left a vm for Brandi. She just set up her account to fund her HSA but is fine with not doing so, if she choose HAS. However, I let her know she can still fund it for the first quarter of 2024, at the very least.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-18 15:27:40', '2024-03-18 15:27:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073159159', 'Melanie Jones', NULL, '03.18.2024 Melanie called back to let us know that she spoke with us earlier and someone told her to open sharing request via her portal. However Melanie tried using the old link to start a sharing request, as she''s done in the past, but it wouldn''t let her b/c it would not recognize her credentials B/C Zion had changed their sharing request, since last May, 2023.
So I coached her on the new process to connect with Zion....then transferred her to them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-18 15:25:50', '2024-03-18 15:25:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465016', 'Todd Smith', NULL, '3-18-24 Aimee and her husband Todd joined today with CARE+. She asked many more good questions about HAS wellness benefits and how it works. She''s a nurse and can order labs herself at great prices. I''m asking HAS if she''s ok to order them for herself and pay through her biz or if that''s not ok. They are healthy but they got in a car accident 1 1/2 yrs ago. The other person''s car ins took care of all of their medical expenses which were very little. Todd had a broken rib and sought PCP who told him to just let it heal. There was nothing to do. It''s healed and no problems since. Aimee sees chiro and acupuncturist for preventative measures but understands chiro and acu aren''t shared unless it''s for a new accident, injury or illness. They understand the pre-x clause and don''t have anything else to report. They also understand all alternative care for MCS must be pre-approved.  Signed up for CARE+ $1000/$615 ES with Todd as primary since he''s older. Added HAS for $165 as ES all for April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-18 15:17:52', '2024-03-18 15:17:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735002', 'Sean Reilly', NULL, '03.18.2024 Injured shoulder in January, took a while to see doctor, went to doctor who then totd him he may torn his rotator cuff, then referred him to see a specialist who may need him to get an MRI. Therefore, he wanted to make sure he''s going about the process properly. Sean is very new, so he kept on saying that he spoke to the concierge  a few times, so I prefaced with "It seems like you''re fairly new to your plan, so let me break down the part of your plan, b/c you keep saying concierge." I explained what MPB does, and reiterated what Zion does, and the process he''ll need to go through to have anything shared. He said yet it seems that is exactly what I need to do, b/c he doesnt ...', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-18 15:11:38', '2024-03-18 15:18:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135426043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133855011', 'Amy Myers', NULL, '3/18/24: Contacted Planstin to check on the Amy/Christopher files. They were showing Christopher''s cancellation on the sheet, but not Amy''s Zion healthshare. Karen from Planstin manually updated her files to include Zion essentials with the $5000 IUA, and stated that it will show up in Zion''s system within 24 hours. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-18 15:05:37', '2024-03-18 15:05:37'),
