  ('zcrm_1579374000135464003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '03.18.24:  Brooke texted me, said she changed the payment method today and wants to know when I would be available to assist her with the plan membership. I responded asking if she''s available today; she said no but she is tomorrow morning. I gave her some times and told her to let me know what works best for her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-18 14:45:17', '2024-03-18 14:45:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135426038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073159159', 'Melanie Jones', NULL, '3/18/24: Melanie called, she''s having some heart issues and getting some testing done. She wanted to know how these bills will work bc she''s about to turn 65 and age into Medicare. I explained that there''s a small grace period around her age out date of 30 days, but to go ahead and submit these upcoming appointments under a need, bc once she starts medicare they aren''t going to pay for procedures done prior to enrollment. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-18 14:44:22', '2024-03-18 14:44:22'),
