  ('zcrm_1579374000135433038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126933002', 'Adam English', NULL, '3/18/24: Gloria reached out because her son had to go to the Er and she wasn''t sure how to proceed. Explained how she would present herself as a cash payer and how she pays the $1000 IUA for the ER visit.  Transferred her to zion health to create her member portal. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-18 13:07:29', '2024-03-18 13:07:29'),
