  ('zcrm_1579374000135436049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109708344', 'Matthew Koen', NULL, '3-18-24 I spoke with Ramassha at HMA and she put in an escalation for a new card sent to Matthew at his new address above.  She says the portal should be working now if he corrects it there one more time as well. I told him she needs to correct it since it never worked for him. She says he will receive a new card in 7-10 business days. I will call and gave him the update.
Update - Talked with Matt and he has some bills from Feb. that he has submitted for reimbursement before their March 3rd deadline. He''s not sure of the status of those. I suggested he calls them now since I got a call back within minutes today. He will. Also, I let him know if he changes his address it "should" work this time. But, I requested that Ramassha change it on her end which she agreed to do. I also let Matt know the mess should be cleaned up by April as they continue to correct the problems. He was super nice and pleased to get it resolved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-18 12:50:12', '2024-03-18 12:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '3-18-24 I spoke with Ramassha at HMA and she put in an escalation for a new card sent to Jim at the address above which I verified with Jim and it''s correct. They say he will receive a new card in 7-10 business days. I called and gave him the update. He''s appreciative of my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-18 12:46:23', '2024-03-18 12:48:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135426033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133200002', 'Anya Ciecierski', NULL, '3/18/24: Anya called, she''s wanting to open her hsa account and needs specific information about her MEC to do so. But is still not showing as having a MEC in Planstin. I called Planstin, and Kaitlyn said she doesn''t start her MEC until 4/1/24. After relaying the correct info regarding her start date and plan, and insisting Kaitlyn look further, she agreed to change Anya''s start date to 3/1/24 and emailed her Planstin cards to Anya. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-18 12:11:09', '2024-03-18 12:11:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '03.18..2024 Rob called trying to better understand the Planstin portion in his plan, and how to maneuver the process of finding and using PCP services for preventative.
I explained the MEC portion briefly, seared for PCP in his area, explained how to present and what card to use. I then sent him an email for: ACA guidelines, the PHCS search results and the MultiPlan Link. 
It was very nice to speak with you. Attached you will find:
The link to the ACA Guidelines on Healthcare.GOV

Preventive health services
Most health plans must cover a set of preventive services like shots and screening tests at no cost to you. This includes Marketplace private insurance plans.
www.healthcare.gov

The link to the PHCS Network on Multiplan Link
One PowerPoint Slide to set up your search.
The PHCS Network Results for a PCP near 81623

Please let me know if there is anything we can help you with. We are here M-F, 9am-8pm EST, NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-18 12:10:27', '2024-03-18 12:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178561001', 'Genevieve Choi', NULL, '3-18-24 Genevieve was super apologetic bc they still don''t have the info about Cobra yet. They are still negotiating the contract for William and they''ve moved the transition date to May 1st from April 1st. They were having to negotiate the contract while they were on vacation which was a huge bummer. She will call me as soon as she has the Cobra information and even if they choose to go with Cobra. We didn''t want to set another appt in case she didn''t have the information yet. She''s super nice and appreciative of my time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-18 12:10:05', '2024-03-18 12:10:05'),
