  ('zcrm_1579374000135426023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '3/18/24: Lori called, she just received another determination letter from Zion, stating that the mold issue is ineligible because they do not share allergy testing. Lori is livid. She explained that they did pay for one day of testing but nothing else, and that it wasn''t just allergies, it was toxic mold exposure that required months of treatments. I said I would contact my manager about this situation to see if there is anything we can do and get back to her in a day or 2. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-18 11:06:01', '2024-03-18 11:06:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130043002', 'Jonathon Waunch', NULL, '03.18.2024 Jonathan left us a VM. When I spoke with him, he was wanting to see if sleep study sessions and DME''s for it are shareable. I downloaded the guided directly from Zion''s site, as usual,  and it still read that sleep study and DME''s are still not shareable. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-18 11:03:19', '2024-03-18 15:07:56'),
