  ('zcrm_1579374000135426013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152005', 'Krista Barker', NULL, '3/18/24: Krista called very confused about how her plan works. Her son had an ER visit. I advised that after her IUA amount is met, the bill is eligible for sharing, and she can submit that need through her Sedera member portal. She also has an upcoming dermatology appointment. When presenting her RCi card, the dermatologist says that doesn''t cover any of this. When the providers call the number of the card - 800-795-7772, they are saying Krista is not listed in their system. Reaching out to find Krista some answers and following up with her. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-18 10:45:44', '2024-03-18 10:45:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135436003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131802002', 'Mohahammad Ali', NULL, '03.18.2024 Mohammad called requesting assistance in registering CirrusMD.  He said he keeps trying to register, but it would not recognize his credentials. I tried on my end, and told him if it does not go through, I will put in a ticket. If it goes through, it won''t take him more than 2 minutes to register and connect to a physician. His credentials were recognized on my end, and I guided him to expect an email from them in the next 1/2,  if not, to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-18 10:31:06', '2024-03-18 10:31:06'),
