  ('zcrm_1579374000135270013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135324001', 'Susan Marr', NULL, '3-14-24 Enrollment completed directly with Zion using MPB''s link. She didn''t want any extras, no bells and whistles. She will likely only use it for major health occurrences.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-15 12:16:58', '2024-03-15 12:16:58'),
