  ('zcrm_1579374000135293168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, '3/15/24: Reached out to David to wish him happy birthday and offer referral, mbr answered and had a few questions about changing method of payment to his business. Wasn''t sure if there were any restrictions to doing so, told him we would reach back out to him. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-15 12:08:15', '2024-03-15 12:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '03.15.2024 Jillian called before my shift started. William caught her call, asking to speak with me. I am just now able to connect with her.
Jillian needed to hop on a call in 10 minutes. Wendy recommended she speak to me.
needs tests done
o2 intake concern, started getting palpitations after the booster shot, lives in a mountain.
always hikes this same mountain, but this time her heart started palpitating.
has an appointment with this new doctor, and she is not in network.
the energy has drastically depleted
Mainly wanted to learn how to proceed with physicians and having this shared in the process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-15 11:55:02', '2024-03-15 11:57:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135293163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122622001', 'Stephen Wold', NULL, '3/15/24: Reached out to mbr to wish them happy birthday and offer referral, lvm. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-15 11:51:18', '2024-03-15 11:51:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130566063', 'Cindy Ensman', NULL, '3/15/24: Cindy called saying she never received the provider list email Will sent earlier. I forwarded it to another email address which she was able to get. Also instructed her on how to access HCBB on her own if she ever wanted to perform her own search. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 11:50:27', '2024-03-15 11:50:27'),
