  ('zcrm_1579374000135293153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006263049', 'Peter Sarata', NULL, '3/15/24: Reached out to do birthday call and offer referral, lvm. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-15 11:46:13', '2024-03-15 11:46:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135293148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132121009', 'David Renney', NULL, '3/15/24: Reached out to do birthday call and offer referral, lvm. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-15 11:44:49', '2024-03-15 11:44:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662022', 'Jaime Klingelhofer', NULL, '03.15.2024 Jaime called but left a message. I called back and spoke with Jaime about:
- endocrinologist visits for hypothyroidism
- blood work drawn often ($20-$75)
- Possible ultrasound
- can she open a sharing request towards an ongoing thyroid issue, even if the IUA has not been met the last few months? Question for Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-15 11:41:06', '2024-03-15 11:41:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135293143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '3/15/24: Corinne reached out to see if we could provider her with the records from her last two sharing requests she submitted, transferred her to zions sharing requests  for more help. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-15 11:39:44', '2024-03-15 11:39:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130446050', 'Jason Shollenberger', NULL, '3/15/24: Tara called. She''s interested in seeing a functional medicine doctor for a stable thyroid condition she has. We discussed Zion''s pre-ex condition policy, but I advised her that it would be best to speak to them as I''m not sure how they approach functional medicine practitioners. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 11:37:20', '2024-03-15 11:37:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131816011', 'Gloria Joy Sorensen', NULL, '03.15.2024 Joy called to ask about:
1-how to attain her virtual Planstin card
2-how to present to the pediatrician
3-how to cover or take care of pediatric bills: one was sick appt and the other was a wellness visit. 

I had missed her call, but listened to her message. I ended up calling her back and leaving her a VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-15 11:31:20', '2024-03-15 11:31:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103642010', 'Mary Huber', NULL, '03.15.2024 Moved to TN. Starting over. Realizing it''s too much work. Mary''s questions were basic plan education questions, so it was an easy 30 minute guide to teach her:
- PHCS link navigation
- HCBB directions via crm, and navigation
- Prescription request navigation
- Preventive appointment presentation and how to get them to bill Planstin
- Healthsharing steps, when(s), and what is involved and how to get items shared.

Mary will call us back to get more guidance when needed. Presently she is less overwhelmed on how to move forward with her gyno and derm appointment as well as her RX requests or any large medical bills. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-15 11:21:44', '2024-03-15 11:21:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135276093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133235002', 'Nicholas Smurr', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-15 11:13:16', '2024-03-15 11:13:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135314001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131816011', 'Gloria Joy Sorensen', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Angee Montgomery', 'Visit ID : 3546 Question : Where is my digital Planstin card located?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-03-15 11:05:06', '2024-03-15 11:05:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135276088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133312002', 'Aaron Drilling', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-15 11:02:32', '2024-03-15 11:02:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080304002', 'Marcell Hetenyi', NULL, '3/15/24: Ainsley put in an Rx request for Lo Loestrin FE. It''s listed under the optum formulary as $0, so I called her back and let her know that her planstin card may cover this medication at optum rx participating pharmacy. Advised her to try and have the pharmacist run the card, and if it doesn''t work, to call back and we''ll proceed with finding a discount. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 11:00:19', '2024-03-15 11:00:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135276073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134794006', 'Jonathan Martinez', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of April 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-15 10:50:43', '2024-03-15 10:50:43'),
