  ('zcrm_1579374000135259033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '3/15/24: Sara called to make sure that her husband''s routine colonoscopy gets paid for ahead of time. I advised her on how to present, speak to the facility and doctor, and we checked the multiplan site to make sure they are in network which the provider was. Sara couldn''t remember the name of the facility. She still wanted reassurance from Planstin, and felt as though this is going to be a fight with the facility. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 10:19:22', '2024-03-15 10:19:29'),
