  ('zcrm_1579374000135298031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041599023', 'Amber Neumann', NULL, 'Member submitted Change From to update her address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-15 09:56:16', '2024-03-15 09:56:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135298026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083466001', 'Melissa Knight', NULL, 'Member called and needed to update payment method  and since she has not used her membership had some questions.  I advised her to redo her Welcome Call.  I will send out Payment Update &amp; Welcome Call Scheduler emails', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-15 09:45:02', '2024-03-15 09:45:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135259028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128112002', 'Jessica Christianson', NULL, '3/15/24: Jessica called. She had a recent bill come in that wasn''t covered. After asking whether it was preventive or diagnostic, she said both and the the wellness visit was paid for. I educated her on the difference between using Planstin for preventive and Zion for sharing of diagnostic or illness or injury related issues. Explained that there is no network for the healthshare and how to present at upcoming breast biopsy appointment. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 09:38:37', '2024-03-15 09:38:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135276058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132140018', 'James Smith', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-15 09:35:22', '2024-03-15 09:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135293093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082320001', 'Kimberly Garcia', NULL, '3/15/24: Reached out to carlos to wish them happy birthday and offer referral, lvm. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-15 09:34:42', '2024-03-22 14:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135293088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130566063', 'Cindy Ensman', NULL, '3/15/24: Member called in to have us find her husband a provider who could look at his hip, emailed her my hcbb results of orthopedics accepting nearby patients in her area. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-15 09:34:15', '2024-03-15 09:34:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135270008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '3-15-24 Cindy is interested in the HAS. Rob is having gut issues now and they''ve spent $14K on naturopathic drs. this past year and a half!  She didn''t realize that might be shareable. They''ve spent that on testing, dr. visits, supplements, fecal tests, lab tests, etc.  I told her to call MPB Concierge Team to get assistance in getting this pre-approved moving forward. They Might possibly reimburse for some aspects of it in the last 6 months if they did any traditional testing or dr. visits. As for HAS they pay for a personal  trainer app online called Playbook Technologies, $14.99 month with Claire Thomas who is licensed in Functional Nutrition and Fitness at $12.99 a month and mtn bike conditioning app as well which is only for about 3 months but $50 a month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-15 09:25:02', '2024-03-15 09:25:02'),
