  ('zcrm_1579374000135259013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081238002', 'Joseph Scaturro', NULL, '3/15/24: Joseph called. He received a 1095 form for 2023, however he was not a member during that time. Even though there''s no numbers of the form, it still states that him and his family had coverage with MPB for 2023. He said he''s been trying to reach accounting for weeks now with no call back. Reaching out to Karina via teams to have her call him about it. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 08:22:09', '2024-03-15 08:22:09'),
