  ('zcrm_1579374000135259008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179002', 'Corey Vincent', NULL, '3/15/24: Providers office called to check on the status of a "claim". I explained that it would be best if Christie called us so we can better direct this situation, and that we do not have a claims department. If it was a preventive service, I could transfer her to the Prev TPA, but if it is medical then, Christie needs to submit the bill herself. The office worker just wasn''t hearing me, and asked to be transferred to TPA. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 07:59:12', '2024-03-15 07:59:12'),
