  ('zcrm_1579374000135270003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '03.14.24:  Jessica texted me that she has a few new contacts that are paying for Kaiser and are quite annoyed. Jessica told them about her plan and asked if she could connect them directly with me.  I responded yes and to keep in mind, if they reside in CA the only plan they are eligible for is SECURE.  She responded OK.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-15 07:28:39', '2024-03-15 07:28:39'),
