  ('zcrm_1579374000135259003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108862002', 'Mark Witt', NULL, '3/15/24: Denise called checking to see if the lab her husband is going to is in network. It wasn''t showing on the multiplan website, so I gave her a few that were included and also explained that Planstin will pay out of network as long as the facility will bill them. I advised her to call and ask, providing the lab with planstin''s number if they have any questions. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-15 07:16:00', '2024-03-15 07:16:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135210079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127155010', 'Kelly Boudreau', NULL, '03.14.2024 Kelly had (main one) her retina was torn. Eye doctor at horizon on Monday 2/26th, emergency appt with phoenix retina associates, did laser surgery on her. TODAY, she went in for another procedure, and will be going in again in another two months. They are keeping an eye on both eyes. 
Another issue on her eye in December, had a procedure, it was not cancerous, but needs to get it looked at again, b/c it is growing back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-14 17:39:40', '2024-03-14 17:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135219060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132790011', 'Marilynn Piche', NULL, '3-14-24 I sent to Marilynn, "I''m just receiving word from a client who is having a bad experience with Gastroenterology of the Rockies and their billing practices. The provider changed the coding from wellness/preventative to diagnostic.  You may want to avoid this place for a preventative colonoscopy, so you don''t face an unexpected bill.

Best of luck,"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-14 17:28:30', '2024-03-14 17:28:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135219055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135324001', 'Susan Marr', NULL, '3-14-24 Susan may be getting unemployment soon. Her job ended with the owner shutting down the business. Susan is super healthy and only wants a membership for high cost items, not for wellness or small health issues.She treats most ailments with natural solutions that she''s learned over the years. She''s healed herself and kids from injuries and sickness far better than any experience she''s has with our traditional medical world. She wanted Zion Only. She won''t use any of MPB''s services or even Zion''s add-ons. So, she will enroll via MPB''s link to enroll directly with Zion into Essentials only at $270/$1000 IUA for April 1st start date. She''s still looking for a job but who knows how soon that will happen.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-14 16:42:25', '2024-03-14 16:42:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135219050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, '3-14-24 Sara called to understand for tax purposes who to change payment to reflect a business expense. I let her know they can just change the payment method to the business account. She has the info. to do so, if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-14 15:40:50', '2024-03-14 15:40:50'),
