  ('zcrm_1579374000135213096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109083002', 'Karin McGrath', NULL, '3/14/24: Patrick reached out to ask some questions about a series of injections has upcoming and how to submit them for sharing. Explained the sharing request process and got him to zion for assistance with creating portal. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-14 14:42:36', '2024-03-14 14:42:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135242030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, '3/14/24: Nicholas called. His wife had a breast cancer screening recently. Since she has dense tissue, they had to do a sonogram opposed to a regular mammogram. I advised that in the past, Planstin has paid for these as long as it''s coded correctly. She also had some genetic testing that indicated she''s at a high risk for breast cancer and dr wants to do an MRI now and in the future for her annual screenings. I advised that since she''s already had one screening, another would go over the allotted amount for preventive care, but this imaging and anything related to the issue could be eligible for sharing with Zion if they exceed their $1000 IUA. Gave Nicholas general advice of when to think about submitting a need and clarified Zion''s guidelines about genetic testing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-14 14:25:30', '2024-03-14 14:25:30'),
