  ('zcrm_1579374000135219016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135149007', 'Timur Zamaletdinov', NULL, '03.13.24:  Tim called, apologized for not getting in touch - wasn''t available for the call.  We further discussed his options and he''s opted for Care Plus.  I enrolled him and explained the on-boarding process. I instructed him to schedule a welcome call so he could better understand how to use the services in his plan.  He said he would do so.  He wasn''t aware of MAP. When I told him about the different services and mentioned mental health counseling, he said he liked that because he went for some counseling for his marital breakup and enjoyed the sessions and thinks he would utilized the MAP sessions.  I told him to keep in touch and let me know if he has any questions during his onboarding process.  Sent him an email to thank him, etc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-14 07:58:59', '2024-03-14 07:58:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135219011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135149007', 'Timur Zamaletdinov', NULL, '03.12.24:  Called Tim t 2 p.m. - no answer - left a message to call me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-14 07:53:53', '2024-03-14 07:53:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135149007', 'Timur Zamaletdinov', NULL, '03.11.24:  Tim called the Concierge, Nahla spoke with him.  He divorced Brooke Spencer and wants to enroll in his own plan.  Nahla transferred him to me.  I discussed all the plans w/him and suggested either Direct or Care Plus.  Sent him my webpage link so he could review all.  Said he''d call me tomorrow to let me know which plan would best suit his needs. We scheduled a call for 2 p.m.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-14 07:52:49', '2024-03-14 07:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135213003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132469002', 'Tymon Skidmore', NULL, '3/14/24: Mrs. Skidmore called in and explained that she was having an issue with Cirrus MD and that it looked like her husband''s Cirrus account is under her email and vice versa and she wanted to see if it can be corrected. Reached out in an email to their customer support to see if this can be resolved and cc''d Alana in it. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-14 07:39:08', '2024-03-14 07:50:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135210003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133869001', 'Laura Flores', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-14 07:36:27', '2024-03-14 07:36:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135175031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '03.13.2024 Denise Matouk has been wanting to connect, per Joan''s recommendation, to proceed in setting up her preventive appointments: Women Wellness Visit, Colonoscopy, Lab-work...
After confirming with Zion, speaking with Alana, on their preferred process, I explained to Denise their golden "rule", which is attaining a prepaid CC for up to $175 to take with her to the Women Wellness visit and Physical Annual, and open a sharing request for the larger ones: mamm/colon. Alana also confirmed that the member can cash-pay for the appt, but attain an itemized invoice to submit as a sharing request.
Denise had additional questions about what labs are covered, and although the pap smear is for sure covered for the women wellness visit, we needed clarification on what else is. We called Zion and spoke with Rebecca where she said the rest of the labs are going to be cash-pay. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-13 16:18:34', '2024-03-13 16:18:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135127083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116383002', 'Liza Bakken', NULL, '3-13-24 From Liza,  "It was sent with a z code. Planstin paid $32 for the labs. They then requested the money back saying there was an error in the coding so AVH sent the money back 

I have sent spent countless phone calls and many hours dealing with this. 
I am done trying to figure this out

It will come out of my pocket so I don’t go to collections. 

I am super disappointed 

Liza"

I forwarded this to Planstin to resolve hopefully.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-13 16:09:56', '2024-03-13 16:09:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135127078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '3-13-24 Ryan is interested in HAS. If we remove MEC and add HAS it will change his monthly cost from $294 to $341. He could use it for dental, gym membership and mental health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-13 15:52:05', '2024-03-13 15:52:05'),
