  ('zcrm_1579374000135137088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120635002', 'Timothy Bush', NULL, '5/1/24: Tim called in to go over some basic member education and ask a few questions about planstin, cirrus md and zions member portal, gave some general guidance. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-13 15:02:21', '2024-03-13 15:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135156084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084087009', 'Christopher Guthrie', NULL, '3/13/24: Amy called. After speaking with Zion, she informed me that this account is still showing active. I called planstin and indeed it is still active with both planstin and zion. Submitted Member support form detailing that this cancellation also needs to be updated along with other member integration issues. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-13 15:01:50', '2024-03-13 15:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135156076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133855011', 'Amy Myers', NULL, '3/13/24: Amy learned while trying to register for Zion that she is still showing up on her ex husband, Christopher Guthrie''s account. Christopher cancelled his account effective 3/1/24, and Amy re-enrolled in her own acct. 
