Christopher''s account is still active in Planstin and Zion with Amy listed as spouse. 
Zion told Amy she would need to enroll on their website - ?? - I informed her she did not need to do that. This is an IT issue and that I would put in a support ticket and keep tabs on the situation. She asked for a resolution timeline - I replied that her files will be updated by tomorrow and sent to Zion. After that it just depends on how long it takes them to enter it in, but should be a few days. 
