  ('zcrm_1579374000135127063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935161', 'Jill St. Aubin King', NULL, '3-13-24 Hello Jill,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522189936
Benefits Start Date: 04/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-13 12:11:20', '2024-03-13 12:11:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135127058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132226', 'Maria Borden', NULL, '3-13-24 Maria and Bob are interested in adding HAS but need to run the numbers. If they remove MEC it''s going from $650 to $780. If they keep MEC to fund the HSA which they wanted to do this year, it''s $815 at the $1000 IUA level. So, they will decide and let me know. They are turning 62 and 63 this year and want to keep MPB until Medicare age.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-13 12:10:49', '2024-03-13 12:10:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135137028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '3/13/24: Member called with questions about his copay plan for an rx he needs to get for his son, transferred him to planstin. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-13 12:01:11', '2024-03-13 12:01:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135175008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796008', 'Nancy Micloskey', NULL, '03.13.2024 Nancy called asking about the process of aging out. I wanted to be sure of all the details so I asked Joan and the team via Teams:
"Educational Question: For members who are bridging to Medicare, do THEY have to do anything prior to them aging out of the plan? ALSO - should they expect something from MPB?
 Last I checked, the plan just ends. No correspondence."
Joan: "They will be getting an email from Patti letting them know (usually one to two months before their birth day) they will no longer be eligible for their MPB plan. Some members do notify us they will be moving to Medicare as they are eligible for it." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-13 11:54:24', '2024-03-13 11:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135127053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '3-13-24 Robin Brenneise called to add HAS and is keeping Planstin for now to fund her HSA, at least for 2024. She joined for April 1st start date. She''s also curious if Cognitive Behavioral Therapy is reimbursed for her 32 year old daughter in CA who was diagnosed with ADHD.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-13 11:50:55', '2024-03-13 11:50:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135156066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130293029', 'Vincent Romanini', NULL, '3/13/24: Brenda called. She needed to schedule a welcome call and wanted assistance regarding her upcoming mammogram. I emailed her instructions for scheduling welcome call and some preventive care resources, and advised on how to present for appointment. Also gave her Planstin''s number just in case she couldn''t locate her cards to request another set. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-13 11:39:43', '2024-03-13 11:39:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135175003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092125010', 'Kenneth Adams', NULL, '03.13.2024 Kenneth needed help maneuvering his preventive care appointments and finding a physician. I guided him through the process, then generated a provider list from the PHCS list and emailed it via Outlook. Afterwards, I spoke with Neri from Planstin and requested they send him a new card to use. She shared they JUST sent him a new one a month ago, which I assumed and asked if he''d received it, but he said no, so I confirmed his addresses and then called Planstin. Neri was kind to resend it all. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-13 11:34:23', '2024-03-13 11:34:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135156051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153215', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, '3/13/24: Member called asking who is their preventive care with and how to access telehealth. I gave him RCI''s phone number to schedule a preventive visit. 
I walked him through accessing CirrusMD on the browser and advised to download the app in the future for faster service. He was able to get in and start a chat. He was confused why his husband wasn''t on his account - Cirrus''s policy that each member over 18 has to have a separate account. That their kids can be on both but they would need an account with a unique email address. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-13 11:19:17', '2024-03-13 11:19:17'),
