  ('zcrm_1579374000135156033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130371008', 'Rachel Yellin', NULL, '3/13/24: Rachel called. She''s having a medical issue and trying to get information about whether or not it''s shareable before proceeding with tests and treatments. Her hair is falling out in clumps and she''s experiencing extreme fatigue. Rachel has a pre-membership condition - Hashimotos. It''s stable and under control with thyroid medicine, but fears that bc she has this, her upcoming dr visits and labs work will not be eligible for sharing this year since she just started january 2024. I brought Zion into our phone call to try and gain clarity about Rachel''s best options moving forward.
Aleesis at Zion could not give us a clear answer on the determination of a pre-ex condition nor whether or not a different diagnosis of the thyroid would be considered pre-ex. He suggested going ahead and submitting a request, so Zion can start the process of pulling medical records, and updating it as Rachel went to these appointments. 
