  ('zcrm_1579374000135156018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131802002', 'Mohahammad Ali', NULL, '3/13/24: Sent Saima the following RX quote:

After performing a thorough search on our discount sites, the total for everything at a local pharmacy came out to approximately $1480.
If this price is alright, let me know and I''ll gather those coupons for you.

The best option came from our international shopper for approx. $690.72
Please find your quote from him below 

Nesina 25mg (Alogliptin) - 84 film coated tablets, brand- $252.63
Vitamin B12 Cyanocobalamin Injection 1mg/ml (Cyanocobalamin) - 1 x 10ml vials, generic- $137.75
Steglatro 15mg (Ertugliflozin) - 84 tablets, brand- $290.39
Total: $680.77 + shipping
Shipping is $9.95 for international shipments and $4.95 for domestic.

If you are interested in ordering from the Canada Medstore, please call 407-949-6714. They can walk you through the process. They do need a Rx from your doctor. Your doctor can fax the prescription directly to 407-949-6724, just make sure it is a regular fax and not an E-Scribe. (If they send an E-Scribe, they won''t get it).', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-13 09:14:57', '2024-03-13 09:14:57'),
