  ('zcrm_1579374000135143006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100874002', 'Troy Kreutzer', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in and told me that her spouse had a need and that there was some confusion as to whether he had a $5000 or $2500 IUA.  I looked and he changed his IUA eff 2/1.  I advised that there is a 60 day wait for the new IUA to take effect and that any expenses incurred after 4/1  would be shareable at the $2500 IUA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-13 08:45:47', '2024-03-13 08:45:47'),
