  ('zcrm_1579374000135057028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '3-12-24 We will be re-enrolling wife and kids tomorrow. May need CARE+ if not self-employed.  Wife is turning 65 in June Kids will turn 25 this year in July. They will need their own memberships by June, 2024 onward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-12 16:13:21', '2024-03-12 16:14:46'),
