  ('zcrm_1579374000135057023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916020', 'Margaret Garrido', NULL, '3-12-24 Meg is considering HAS to add in addition to current membership and to keep MEC for HSA compliance. With her own bus they want ways  to save money on taxes.  She will share this with her partner and get back to me. She knows of the 20th of the month deadline each month and knows benefits are for the calendar year. They are paying $650 now, therefore if they keep MEC it''s $815 a month total. If remove the MEC it''s only dropping to $780 a month. Might as well keep the MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-12 15:02:14', '2024-03-12 15:02:14'),
