  ('zcrm_1579374000135060042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114497002', 'Elsa Gerhardt', 'Please be patient and offer EXTRA education', '03.12.2024: Elsa  called concerned about Planstin not paying for a mammogram $491~ for 2/9/2024. Planstin sent a letter not paying for the mamm. Caitlynn said it was coded diagnostic. It''s possible it was either coded wrong or they found something that evolved it to diagnostic. 
