 Elsa was guided to contact these providers and facilities back to follow these two steps:
1-Make sure they code it preventive on all those appointments
2-Bill Planstin for the visit.

Elsa will call us back after she''s practiced the above. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-12 14:08:34', '2024-03-12 14:43:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135087031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, '3/12/24: Wendy called, she was going in for colonoscopy but provider recommended she do the cologuard instead and she wanted to know if we were going to pay for it. I informed Wendy that the ACA guidelines list colorectal cancer screening, so I believe that qualifies, but she''d have to ask Planstin directly for a 100% answer, and transferred her over. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-12 13:43:33', '2024-03-12 13:43:33'),
