  ('zcrm_1579374000135101001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124142012', 'Trudi Sorensen', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Nahla Tebcherany', 'Visit ID : 3541 Question : I need to go to urgent care to see if I have an UTI. I have a Planstin card and a MPB.health card.
