  ('zcrm_1579374000135072006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265053', 'Mary Jo Wood', 'New Membership eff 4/24', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-12 10:33:09', '2024-03-12 10:33:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135060008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114987002', 'Melissa Dixon', NULL, '03.12.2024 Melissa called needing assistance in finding a pediatrician, gyno and family practice in PHCS.  I was able to guide her with the search and was happy.
Melissa was wondering if she had a doctor not in the list, can she use him/her. I explained the RBP price model approach. She responded with that might be just more work for the doctor''s office, and wanted to do it herself. I explained that Planstin does not deal with members directly, and only with providers and facilities. She understood.
She is concerned, also, about her visit to the ER back in December 2023 (aprox.) for her son''s arm. They charged her for services not rendered and wants to appeal it (two doctors came in to see the boy, but one was there for only 20 seconds, left, they brought in another doctor - they are charging her for the 1st doctor over $300 and the doctor did not do anything), but the billing department is not hearing her. I WAS WONDERING if the Zion''s advocacy team would be of any help, even though it only cost $1800, and a sharing request was not open. I will reach out to Joan via outlook/teams. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-12 10:23:29', '2024-03-12 10:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135064013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129882002', 'Michelle Dills', NULL, '3/12/24: Michelle called in to find out her membership id, went ahead and gave it to her and she didn''t need any further help at that time- WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-12 10:20:10', '2024-03-12 10:20:10'),
