  ('zcrm_1579374000135029008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117901002', 'Kathy Stein', NULL, '3/12/24: Kathy reached out because she went to urgent care and wanted to see if she could seek a reimbursement, explained that unless it went over her $1000 iua she would not. She went on to say she hasn''t used her plan before, did some basic member education on iua and sharing requests and suggested for future urgent care visits to consider using cirrusmd. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-12 08:57:46', '2024-03-12 08:57:46'),
