  ('zcrm_1579374000135005028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '03.12.2024 Requested assistance from William to reach out to Robin to respond to the VM she left on GoTo yesterday, subject: Tax Carbon...NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-12 07:41:51', '2024-03-12 08:07:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135005023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124142012', 'Trudi Sorensen', NULL, '03.12.2024 Trudi needs a dermatologist. Needed guidance on how proceed with all the appointments in her plan. She had went for an annual physical, and we guided her for next time to call us on how to proceed. So she came to us to know how to go about it.
I explained how to proceed with the different preventive health sharing requests with Zion.
I then explained how to present herself at all cash pay visits and the next step after all of the above appointments.
She seemed annoyed and the process, feeling she cannot just make a doctor''s appointment. Maybe when she gets the hang of it all, she will find more ease with using her plan. I assured her that we are here to answer any of her questions.
To facilitate her search or confirm her recommendations she received for Dermatologist, I emailed her via CRM, the directions to using Healthgrades and HCBB. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-12 07:40:17', '2024-03-12 07:40:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135005013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113526002', 'Laurie Linn', NULL, '03.12.2024 Laurie called to confirm her doctor is in the PHCS network. I looked her up and sent her the PDF list for confirmation, via outlook.

It was wonderful speaking with you.

Attached is the PHCS list you requested.
Please call us again if you need anything changed or further assistance. We are here at the concierge line M-F, 9am-8pmEST. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-12 07:20:44', '2024-03-12 07:20:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000135005008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089271002', 'Kimberly Jarman', NULL, '03.12.2024 Kimberly called inquiring about choosing physicians/specialists towards her recently approved sharing request. I explained that she can choose whoever she prefers, asked if she had anyone in mind. She said two were recommended to her, but no one chosen. I sent her the HCBB and HealthGrades link via CRM. She will call us back with any questions regarding the use of both. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-12 07:10:30', '2024-03-12 07:10:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134959062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133732002', 'Megan Keyser', NULL, '03.11.2024 Megan is moving to CA and wanted to know the number of sessions and the space in between each set of sessions. I needed to find out how long of a gap in between sets and get back to her.
Megan is also not showing up in Zion''s platform, but is in Planstin''s. I put in a request in the newly formed page Vinnie created in, https://support.mpbhealth.net/, to add her to the list for manual input. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-11 16:53:28', '2024-03-11 17:00:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134948051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '03.11.24:  Tim called. Said he and Brooke got divorced and he needs to get his own plan.  Wants info. on the plans so he can decide which would be the best fit.  I sent him the link to my landing page. Explained the 3 plans and asked him to decide based on his needs. He said he''ll call me tomorrow, after he reviews the info. Scheduled a call w/him for 2 p.m.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-11 16:40:38', '2024-03-11 16:40:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134959051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904687', 'Mike Gardner', NULL, '03.11.2024 Mike called inquiring about some sort of letterhead to share proof he has health-sharing, when his employer asked for insurance coverage. I messaged Patti via Outlook, and she said he would not get one ''cause he does not have insurance, and if he did, he''d go to Planstin. I messaged her back asking if we at all offer proof of having health-sharing at least. I have not heard back.
Mike also needed to change his address, he seemed to have found it while we were talking on the phone. However, I do not see it in the Cognito Forms. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-11 16:28:32', '2024-03-11 16:28:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134959040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '03.11.2024 Tim called inquiring about how to remove himself from the plan to open his own. I asked Joan via Teams if she was available, and I was able to direct transfer him for her to help him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-11 15:58:54', '2024-03-11 15:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134944114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111063013', 'Stephanie Hoffman', NULL, '3-11-24 Stephanie is interested in HAS. I sent her information to review.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-11 15:57:14', '2024-03-11 15:57:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134944109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '3-11-24 Julie is very interested in HAS for $200 vs current w ACA compliant wellness at $105. She just wants to review it all before she makes her final decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-11 15:49:08', '2024-03-11 15:49:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134944104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '3-11-24 Julia is interested in HAS but doens''t want to lose HSA. She will talk with her husband who does their accounting. After sharing all of the benefits, she will likely fund the HSA for 2024 and move to HAS. "Dunbar and I both have a gym membership and go 3x/week, we have teeth cleanings 2x/year, and our general practitioner is also functional medicine certified so we lean towards preventative health measures year-round, I may prefer the thermogram over mammogram, and we both have annual skin checks."  I shared all of the other benefits which are only $60 more per month. She also has a hip issue now that she was asking how to proceed with. It may not exceed $1000 but I told her to absolutely call the MPB Concierge to create the Need now. She will do so, in case it ever exceeds $1000. So far, she sees it costing $750.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-11 15:27:09', '2024-03-11 15:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134944094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '3-11-24 Jana is 54 and her husband is 52 and they have  a 16 year old daughter. Jana is retiring May 1st from a gov job. Her husband is a contractor self-employed. Their ins will go up to between $2K-$3K with Cobra even with a high ded! She watched the video a while back but I went over it all again with her. Her husband has asthma and has never been hospitalized. He has an inhaler to be safe and has an epi pen. She has a thyroid issue. They like to do wellness such as mammo, pap screening, skin check, colonopscopy, etc. They live in Glenwood Springs where the PHCS network is more limited. She very interested in CARE+ $875 and HAS $250 EF at the $1000 IUA level. They want a May 1st start date and she knows of teh April 19th deadline. We have an appt scheduled in early April. She also wants to review 1Dental and VSP options. They are earning a decent salary but she still gets a large APTC. Even with the APTC the price for reg ins. is close to the same with MCS. But, MCS she won''t be exposed to $18,100 if something bad happens to them this year. Seriously leaning towards MCS, not ins. She has a broker she''s already working with on ACA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-11 15:11:09', '2024-03-11 15:11:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134948046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133668002', 'Alastair Cross', NULL, '3/11/24: John called. He didn''t have much luck with the drs provided last week. I helped him do another search and gave him a list of 5 options within 30 miles from him. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-11 14:46:13', '2024-03-11 14:46:13'),
