  ('zcrm_1579374000134959024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115632002', 'Tatiana Hamawi', NULL, '03.11.2024: William from Planstin called -  Michael Paul''s, child, coverage shows from April of 2023 till the end of May - THEN it switched from member and child to member and spouse.
DURING THAT TIME, Planstin was configuring and finalizing to proceed with the RBP price model, as an option to the members. William and I concluded that it sounds like a clerical error. I double checked our end, Admin123, and it still show Member & Child, with a $2500 IUA. 
