  ('zcrm_1579374000134948018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132126009', 'Robert Jordan', NULL, '3/11/24: Mental health Dr office called to confirm Cameron''s insurance. I explained that it''s not insurance and gave office worker a brief overview of what he has available. I explained his mental health services and that they only work with a network of providers. She took the MAP number from me to see if they could be in network. I advised that Cameron should call the Concierge so we can educate him on how to use the parts of his plan. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-11 11:30:15', '2024-03-11 11:30:15'),
