  ('zcrm_1579374000134948003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117970009', 'Marissa O''Neal', NULL, '3/11/24: Marissa called so we can correct her membership status in zion to reflect her direct plan opposed to essentials that they are showing. She has several bills coming up that need to be reimbursed. Amber from Zion told us that we needed to call Planstin to have this fixed. I insisted that we update it now bc in the past, planstin will just send us back to zion since in this case, there is no MEC. Amber spoke with Planstin, and came back saying that she has updated Marissa''s membership in the system. I requested that Marissa receive a followup when the update is complete. After the 3 way call, I instructed Marissa on how to submit a preventive sharing request. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-11 09:16:30', '2024-03-11 09:16:30'),
