  ('zcrm_1579374000134921008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090704002', 'Darlene LaRose Long', NULL, '3/11/24: Darlene called to find a fair price option for her colonoscopy. I walked her through how to search hcbb, and we verified that her current provider is a good option. I also walked her through how to present at the office, to gather an itemized bill, and how to open and submit that bill in her member portal. Trans to Zion to get her portal set up. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-11 08:10:39', '2024-03-11 08:10:39'),
