  ('zcrm_1579374000134921003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130136001', 'Leroy Zook', NULL, '3/11/24: Leroy called to ask if his colonoscopy and endoscopy are covered under his Planstin MEC. I advised yes for the colonoscopy as long as they don''t pull polyps, and I''m 99% sure no for the endoscopy but he''s welcome to double check me by asking a member at Planstin. I walked him through searching the multiplan network and how to move forward with a provider who is not on the list. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-11 07:40:36', '2024-03-11 07:40:36'),
