  ('zcrm_1579374000134874023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '03.08.2024 Maria called to get assistance in accessing and maneuvering the HCBB platform. I sent her the links to it and healthgrades via outlook. We accessed the site together, I briefly coached her on how to search and read the site. She said she will call us if she has anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-08 17:31:32', '2024-03-08 17:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, '3-8-24 Yes, members can be reimbursed to pay for a Personal Trainer with HAS. I let Liz know via email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 17:02:47', '2024-03-08 17:02:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '3-8-24 Left vm for Jay to discuss wellness benefits after he left me a vm today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 16:51:46', '2024-03-08 16:51:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134874018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086124001', 'Cyndi Freeman', NULL, '03.08.2024 Cyndi needed to find a whole new list of doctors for her preventive services under Zion, in the direct plan. I sent her the HCBB and Healthgrades links and we perused HCBB together, with very little results.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-08 15:58:25', '2024-03-08 15:58:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134877003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137483002', 'Denis Bashtovoi', NULL, '3-8-2024 Denis wants me to call him on Monday at 10:30 eastern.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-03-08 15:56:19', '2024-03-08 15:56:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '3-8-24 Holly really wants to keep her HSA which they can fund up to $8300 a year. She will talk with her accountant but thinks she doesn''t want to give that up and spend an extra $60 a month. She won''t use the mental health benefit. She is looking to set up her next mammo for very soon. She will likely keep everything as is for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 15:36:39', '2024-03-08 15:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134874013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, '03.08.2024 Carlos called ''cause he received a letter, 1095C with his SSN missing. I connected with Karina and Patti to check the paperwork that was sent out, b/c his SSN is indeed in the Admin123 platform. Also He already file and paid for his taxes for 2023. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-08 15:32:45', '2024-03-08 15:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '3-8-24 Holly is interested in HAS and is asking many great questions. She will call me back in a few minutes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 15:21:54', '2024-03-08 15:21:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134875003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '03.07.24:  Called Jennifer re: her daughter Samantha and her 1 mo. old baby.  We discussed options for Sam. I told Jenny I would find out if Sam could stay in her family''s plan since she is 23 but now has her own child or if Jenny would be better off transitioning to an employer group for her family who all work for their company, if that''s possible. Told her I would get back with her next week.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-08 15:18:32', '2024-03-08 15:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '3-8-24 Tanya is interested in HAS but considering waiting until her dental and vision ins are up for renewal to take advantage of this instead. However, she''s also interested in the mammo additional screening benefit, skin check and mental health benefit. So, she could take advantage of this right away possibly. She''ll let me know. She knows the deadline of 20th of the month for the next month''s start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 15:17:21', '2024-03-08 15:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134874003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '03.08.2024 Kathryn is going to an annual physical and mamm for this year, and wanted a refresher as to how to present herself. We discussed the difference between preventive and primary or non-preventive and how to present. She will call us back if she has any more questions. I sent her an email for the Healthcare.gov link and ACA services. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-08 15:14:25', '2024-03-08 15:14:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134862008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132396012', 'Cody Clanton', NULL, '3/8/24: Cody called. He hasn''t received anything from Zion yet, and son needs surgery - They scheduled it for Monday morning 7:30am. I walked him through how to navigate the billing, and trans to Zion to create his member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-08 14:19:43', '2024-03-08 14:19:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, '3/8/24: Kerry called in and mentioned that she had just joined on her husband''s plans and had some basic questions for me about zion sharing requests and the differences with planstin. Asked to get a card emailed to them and mailed as well. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-08 13:42:29', '2024-03-08 13:42:29'),
