  ('zcrm_1579374000134861013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935161', 'Jill St. Aubin King', NULL, '3-8-24 Jill is interested in HAS. She has a mammo scheduled for the 25th but didn''t know they are only allowed every other year. Her last one was Dec. 2022. She will call Planstin to make sure it''s covered and make sure her Dr. will code it as preventative. She''s happy to cancel the appt. as well, if need be.  She will benefit from the therapist, dental cleanings and gym membership reimbursements. We have a call on Monday to complete the process. She''s paying $105 for the MEC. HAS is $165 for her and her husband, so $60 more per month. It makes sense for them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 11:26:46', '2024-03-08 11:26:46'),
