  ('zcrm_1579374000134855088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133737010', 'Matthew Williams', NULL, 'Spoke to Kassie will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-08 11:19:26', '2024-03-08 11:19:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134862003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109320043', 'Kirk Archibald', NULL, '3/8/24: Kirk Called. he hasn''t received any determination or communication regarding the need he submitted to Zion 45+ days ago. Advised him to speak to the sharing department about it''s status and gave him Zion''s number. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-08 11:09:35', '2024-03-08 11:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, '3-7-24 Liz is intrigued by the HAS. She recently had a bad experience with a mammogram and the contrast chemical they injected. She got very sick from it! Fortunately she went to Banner Health in Loveland and they reversed the charge. She has to go back again to redo it and will pay at that point. She has family history of cancer, so she''s done mammo''s since age 35 and it''s always come out clean. She''s had 2 shingles vax. At Walgreen''s without ins. they told her it would be $200. Then she said it wasn''t that expensive last time. The woman came back and told her that her ins. was covering it and it would be $0, even though she said she didn''t have ins. Crazy! Liz is taking some compounded drug for weight loss call semiglutide similar to ozampec and manjaro. She lost 15 lbs already. This counts as prescription drug, not the weight loss/nutrition category. She sees and loves Dr. Gloria Oberbeck in Erie. She will do a little more research to decide if she wants HAS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 11:03:38', '2024-03-08 11:03:38'),
