  ('zcrm_1579374000134827075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083924001', 'Tommy Allred', NULL, 'Since Retention call was done, I will process cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-08 10:34:56', '2024-03-08 10:34:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134861003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947150', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, '3-8-24 Gretchen may have found a loophole in HSA funding. As family or couple, you can max out the HSA. If each family member has a separate HSA plan then it looks like both adults can fund the HSA to the max meaning $8300 each. So, they may not want to combine their memberships with her domestic partner Kurt Kincel. They may keep it separate.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-08 10:28:53', '2024-03-08 10:28:53'),
