  ('zcrm_1579374000134728183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '3-7-24 Andi checked back and her melanoma was removed in Nov. 2021, not 2022. That means she''s in her 3rd year of membership with up to $50K sharing for anything that was deemed pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 21:50:22', '2024-03-07 21:50:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134728170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636609', 'Kurt Kincel', NULL, '3-7-24 Kurt is paying $299 mo. Gretchen Reeves wants to add him to her membership now before March 11th. I need to make sure he doesn''t have any pre-x since he''s with Sedera and she''s with Zion now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 21:27:15', '2024-03-07 21:27:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134728165', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, '3-6 and 3-7-24 I notitfied Jason and Dawn Adams via email to let them know this has been corrected and now billed. Should be all set finally. Membership includes the MEC for HSA compliance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 20:56:21', '2024-03-07 20:56:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134808024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '03.07.2024 Benjamin called asking how to proceed regarding a specific issue, MRI''s and such. He was not sure if he needed to stick with a network to be shared. I explained that when it comes to healthsharing, there is not network to abide with.
I did send him an email via outlook on HCBB and Healthgrades to search for providers as needed. 
I called Benjamin back and LVM regarding the 6 month deadline to submitting the bills to be shared. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-07 17:29:07', '2024-03-07 17:31:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134808016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128798002', 'Isaac Yoshimori', NULL, '03.07.2024 Isaac put in an RX request. Sent him the following:

I do apologize for the wait. Diabetes medication and equipment are more challenging to attain savings on, specifically the equipment. 

Needless to say, after with collaboration with our international shopper and further internet digging, we are glad to present with the following savings and information for:

Ozempic: 1MG - 1 time weekly - 21 Days
Free style Libre 3: 1ML - 1 per 2 weeks - 64 Days
Januvia: 100MG - 30 days - 1/day

The prices and information below are as of yesterday and today; 03.6-7.2024:
International Shopper Quote
Ozempic for: 1MG - 1 time weekly - 21 Days
Ozempic 1mg x 1 pen- $550.00 (shipping included)
Januvia OPTIONS for: 100MG - 30 days - 1/day
Januvia 100mg x 30- $94.13+$9.95 (shipping)
Januvia 100mg x 84- $167.63+$9.95
Free style Libre- We cannot source medical supplies, strictly medication
Please connect with our international shopper with the information below to attain the medication at those amazing deals:
The Canadian Medstore

Internet options and information
Free style Libre 3: 1ML - 1 per 2 weeks - 64 Days
This was one of the reasons it took so long. The information on the internet does not seem to add up, in order for me to generate a coupon for the number of sensors needed for 64 days. It says 2 sensors = 1 month supply, but it says 1 kit = 14-day supply. What I suggest is maybe buy 2 boxes to see  how many actual sensors are in a box, and either do the auto-ship for ~$90.24/box (which you can adjust if you do not need 2 more kits) or go without auto-ship for ~$95/box.
An example how it is showing up in some discounted sites:

On their website: https://www.freestyle.abbott/us-en/myfreestyle-freestyle-libre-3.html
They offer a FreeStyle Libre 3 sensor, for free, even for cash-pay patients.
Attached you will find a coupon for your convenience, should you decide to pick it up at a pharmacy near you. Safeway did end up being the least expensive.
If you wish to receive coupons for the rest of the medication and not contact the international shopper, please respond to this email. The prices were way above $500.
Also, you noted 1 MG for the strength for OZEMPIC, however here''s the information on the strengths: "There are 3 different self-injectable pen options with Ozempic. Each pen contains 2 mg in 1.5 mL, 4 mg / 3 mL, or 8 mg / 3 mL. One pen option contains 4 doses of the 0.25 mg per week starting dose and 2 doses of the 0.5 weekly maintenance dose. This pen can also be used for 4 doses of the 0.5 mg weekly dose"

If you need anything changed or adjusted, please give the concierge a call and we would be glad to help you. We are here M-F, 9am - 8pm EST.                                                           NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-07 16:12:53', '2024-03-07 16:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134808011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131742001', 'Leslie Zann', NULL, '03.07.24:  Was informed by Angee Leslie''s integration issue is still not resolved one month today, after ouor request was sent to Planstin for Zion''s integration.  I emailed Derrick and asked if he would step in and get the integration completed as expeditiously as possible.  Waiting on his response.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-03-07 15:37:10', '2024-03-07 15:37:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134799066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133307002', 'Felix Costa', NULL, '3-7-25 Frank Pagano 914.879.6303 is one of Felix''s employees.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-03-07 15:10:34', '2024-03-07 15:10:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134799061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133307002', 'Felix Costa', NULL, '3-7-24: Hi Felix,

Thanks for this update.  As I mentioned in one of our earlier calls, MPB Health requires a minimum of 3 enrollments to have the list bill.  You and family will count as one and Frank will count as two.  We will need the third person enrolling to do the list bill. 

However, if we only get Frank Pagano then we''ll simply bill him directly and keep your family''s current billing arrangement in place.  I will assume this will be okay as you and Rosemarie indicated on our pre-call over a week ago that you were not going to pay for a portion of their bill.  So hopefully it won''t be an issue for Frank if we simply bill him directly.

This happens a lot btw, where I get a larger group interested but, in the end, obtain less than 3 enrollments. 

If we do end up gaining the third, then all three can be on the list bill to your company. Please let me know your thoughts questions about this.

I will reach out to Frank today.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-03-07 15:09:48', '2024-03-07 15:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134799056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133307002', 'Felix Costa', NULL, '3-7-245: Hi Kirk!
Thank you for following up. We have one employee who is interested in signing up, Frank Pagano. He said he would give you a call, but here is his number if you would like to reach out to him.
Frank Pagano 914.879.6303
  We are still waiting to hear back from the other employees.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-03-07 15:09:22', '2024-03-07 15:09:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134798054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131742001', 'Leslie Zann', NULL, '3/7/24: Spoke to Crystal today about Leslie''s support ticket. It is still unresolved. I asked Crystal if there is any way we can flag it as urgent. Will follow up tomorrow. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-07 15:01:01', '2024-03-07 15:01:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134798046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, '3/7/24: Lorene LVM. Called her back and helped her understand how to use the preventive care and health sharing portions of her plan. I walked her through searching the PHCS network to find primary care, obgyn, and facilities, explained how to present and what to do if she goes out of network. 
She asked if a skin cancer screening is included, I said I didn''t see it but to be 100% sure, she could call and ask Planstin directly. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-07 14:18:11', '2024-03-07 14:18:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134798041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130301008', 'Joshua Masek', NULL, '3/7/24: Josh LVM wanting to schedule a welcome call. Called him back and emailed link to scheduler. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-07 13:41:02', '2024-03-07 13:41:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134728160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '3-7-24 Kallie chose to drop the Planstin MEC and is OK with losing HSA compliance. I recommended talking with tax expert for funding for this year. They are enrolling for April 1st $250 EF. $596.50+$250 = $846.50. She completed the change form and new enrollment form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 13:24:53', '2024-03-07 13:24:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134800028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767140', 'John Parks', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in requesting to cancel membership.  I told her that she needed to be in touch with advisor.  I will send out link to member &amp; copy advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-07 13:00:11', '2024-03-07 13:00:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134728155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '3-7-24 Cami enrolled in HAS ES $165 with cc and wants to keep HSA for her upcoming Need for her shoulder.  She''s going to share this with her team to see if they want to join as well. WWSRA will pay for it also she said. It''s a no brainer for her. A few years ago she worked with a nutritionist when she got giardia. She wished this were available then. She is still hoping to avoid surgery for her shoulder but it has been approved by Zion, if she needs it. She''s doing a ton of PT right now and she knows she''s reaching her session cap of 35 sessions and likely won''t reach the $7500 cap. She''s ok with that. She may choose to pay for stem cell therapy which she thinks will be $11K vs the surgery which will be $30K-$40K. She''s on track with everything and very pleased with all of the services she''s received so far.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 12:53:25', '2024-03-07 12:53:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134728147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '3-7-24 Robin is very excited about HAS as an addition to her current membership. She wants to keep her HSA compliance with Planstin and all that''s included. However, she can benefit from dental cleanings, vision screenings, possibly thermography instead, skin check, cycling club and mental health counseling. She was affected by the fire and has gotten great benefit from her mental health counselor that was offered to fire victims.  She also has used MAP to access the 12 visits. She''s been diagnosed with ADHD. She also has Delta Dental and may have a $4K procedure coming up and possibly use Dr. Alber. I sent her 1Dental to review as well. Dr. Alber is in the Dental Access powered by Aetna network. She will review everything. She might even refer her daughter who''s in CA on Medicaid now but could benefit from HAS for the mental health aspect. Robin will make a bunch of calls and let me know when she''s ready to enroll for the March 20th deadline for April 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 12:15:54', '2024-03-07 12:16:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134728142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610459', 'Michelle Pouliot', NULL, '3/7/24: Spoke to Dr. Pouliot who informed me that she got my message from yesterday. She said that she didn''t have to use her plan much but that that she would keep in mind some of her own patients to join as members as well. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-07 12:08:23', '2024-03-07 12:08:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134728132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134794006', 'Jonathan Martinez', NULL, '3-7-24 Enrolling now in CARE+ $1000/$635 for April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 11:23:32', '2024-03-07 11:23:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134808003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128522002', 'Garet Hall', NULL, '03.07.2024 Garet has questions about his plan. We discussed two columns: Essentials and Health-sharing, in detail. I also sent him, his wife and his 23 YO dependent an invitation link for CirrusMD, recommending they visit the link within 24 hours, as it then will  expire. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-07 11:23:26', '2024-03-07 15:19:45'),
