  ('zcrm_1579374000134728127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134794006', 'Jonathan Martinez', NULL, '3-7-24 Jonathan came to me via his sister Aubrey Martinez. She''s been talking about this for years with him. He''s 31 and his wife is turning 24 soon. They have a 3 month old baby. He watched the video. He''s a contractor and has been self-employed for 10 years. They are both healthy and stay away from the doctor''s as much as possible. They did a home birth for their 3 month old and it went really well! Live in Brighton, CO and they do not do wellness visits. They don''t have ins at the moment. Wife was on Medicaid recently but no longer. They only did 1 ultrasound during the pregnancy. CARE+ is best for them. They are ready to enroll at $1000/$635. I sent them the maternity brochure as well since he asked if a midwife is shareable. I read the section from the Sharing Guidelines. Looks like it can be shareable with some simple parameters.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-07 11:03:56', '2024-03-07 11:03:56'),
