  ('zcrm_1579374000134730036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131466010', 'Matthew Berget', NULL, '03.06.2024 Thomas called again today, also and still frustrated. Although his self composure was kind and respectful, so I am glad the result of the phone call with Planstin tonight was positive.
