  ('zcrm_1579374000134721045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081477002', 'Gina Casquarelli', NULL, '3/6/24: Gina reached out via chat trying to find help getting fair priced preventive care. I provided her with a couple resources on finding providers who accept cash pay and finding a fair price facility. I also suggested looking at some of the plans that include preventive care with her advisor. reached out to Karen to give Gina a call and discuss options with her. 
