  ('zcrm_1579374000134728082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '3-6-24 Update to cost is (currently $796.50 MPB + $135 for Planstin = $931.50). We are removing the $135 for Planstin and adding $165 for HAS.  Therefore, it will be $796.50 MPB + new wellness benefit HAS at $165 to equal $961.50.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-06 14:27:56', '2024-03-06 14:27:56'),
