  ('zcrm_1579374000134728039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '3-6-24 Laura enrolled in Sedera directly for March 1st, 2024. She had no good options now that Zion will no longer honor a member who has quit smoking. She quit for over a year and then turned 50. With the newest guidelines the tobacco limitations will remain life long for 50+. Sedera won''t consider her a tobacco user since she had quit for about 14 months already upon enrollment. Sadly, we don''t have an MPB product I can enroll her into yet. So, she''s simply a Sedera member without all of the added benefits of MPB.  I think she was looking at a higher IUA of $1000 or $1500 but not certain.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-06 13:28:26', '2024-03-06 13:28:49'),
