  ('zcrm_1579374000134728023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '3-6-24 Kara is enrolling now for her family. They will test it this year and possibly offer it next year since their company open enrollment is done. Only 3 of their employees qualify since the rest live in WA. Joining CARE+ $1000 EF $875. Joined HAS for $250. Total is $1125 which is HALF of what they are paying right now with far better benefits. They are thrilled. April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-06 12:10:39', '2024-03-06 12:25:04'),
