  ('zcrm_1579374000134638117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '3-5-24 Kallie is interested in HAS. They are currently paying $731.50 EF 30-49 $1000 IUA. If they move to CARE+ it''s $635 + $250 = $885. Or if they can just drop the MEC which is $135, then it''s $596.50+$250 = $846.50. We''ll see what Patti says about dropping the MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-05 17:36:58', '2024-03-05 17:38:41'),
