  ('zcrm_1579374000134638079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '3-5-24 Was paying $931.50 with MPB CareZ Bridge.  Mindy submitted a Change Form to remove the MEC for April 1st. New membership amt is $875 for CARE+ EF. She will need to remove her daughter soon once she turns 26. She chose HAS for wellness since they go to alternative doctors for well, use gym memberships for health, get their dental cleanings every year, etc.  They''ve just been paying for those on their own and not really using the MEC. I think she also mentioned doing thermograms, not mammos. They don''t need wellness for Colton. So, they added HAS for $165 to total $1040.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-05 15:11:52', '2024-03-05 15:13:37'),
