  ('zcrm_1579374000134634036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131466010', 'Matthew Berget', NULL, '03.05.2024 Thomas called EXTREMELY FRUSTRATED with the fact that the integration file has not been resolved for them to receive their cards, and be present in Planstin''s system. He''s not finding comfort in the fact that he indeed is covered and has a solid healthsharing plan holding him and Matthew. Nor is he finding comfort in the fact that this is a purely technical issue. 
Although this matter is out of the concierge''s hands, it has become a barren conversation to have with members, given the lack of resolution on these accounts for so many  people.
