  ('zcrm_1579374000134638074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '3-5-24 Linnea and I will meet again on April 3rd at 9:00 am. She will remove herself from her parents membership. We will re-enroll her in CARE+ which I explained to her. She will be starting school but will likely not want their health ins and keep this. She can add wellness later if she wants it. I quoted her $2500 IUA since that''s what they have now as to not disrupt what their membership. She has two appt coming up for vericose veins that are already approved and ready to go with Zion. Her 1st appt is March 12th and 2nd one is April 2nd. In light of that, she decided it''s best to remove her from her parent''s membership for April 30th with a May 1st effective (backdated to their original start date of Jan. 1st, 2022).  So, we will cancel SECURE and re-enroll in CARE+ for May 1st at $185 a month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-05 14:56:05', '2024-03-05 14:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134680003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'I received an email communication from advisor Rick Willard who received an email from this member, who was unaware that the group had been cancelled eff 9/1/23.  Company went out of business.  Supposedly member continued to be payroll deducted $87. per week until she left the company on 11/13.  This was not MPB so we do not have any responsibility around this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-03-05 14:16:17', '2024-03-05 14:16:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134638069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110424026', 'David Waters', NULL, '3/5/24: Reached out to David for retention, he answered and mentioned that he was looking for more coverage when it came to seeing providers for smaller things and that his employer had gotten a low deductible anthem plan he was interested in switching too. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-05 14:13:06', '2024-03-05 14:13:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134638064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119608012', 'Megan Brosh', NULL, '3/5/24: Mrs. Brosh called in to seek reimbursement of a few preventive services that she had done, told her she would have to have her provider bill planstin for those services at which point planstin can pay the provider who will then reimburse member, advised to have provider bill directly to planstin in the future for these types of services. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-05 14:05:11', '2024-03-05 14:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134634028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '03.05.2024 SKUBIAK ROBERT called and left a message. I called him back but had to LVM for him to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-05 13:57:38', '2024-03-05 13:59:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134634023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129473010', 'Sandra Stroehmann', NULL, '03.05.2024 Sandy called to learn more about the preventive care, she thought she had.
I confirmed her plan being Care+, and explained that her plan is purely catastrophic. She then said that she thought based on possibly the person who sold this to her, or the concierge that she may have learned that she can get the preventive care.
She was interested in getting the shingles shot, and was under the impression that the flu shots were not covered in the prev. care. I explained with all MEC plans under the ACA guidelines, both would be covered, but her plan does not carry MEC.
I could swear she mentioned "according the paper/language I received, I thought it was explaining about my plan having preventive care, and Sedera would.....etc", it was a little jumbled, but I got the impression that MAYBE the wrong summary of care template was sent, but NO the right one was sent. Then I thought MAYBE the wrong fulfillment package was sent, but NO she did not confirm that. SO I asked her again, where she may have gotten the impression she has preventive care, and why does she think it''s Sedera. She responded with she never said anything about Sedera.
The conversation ended with her seeming that she understood that her plan is purely catastrophic, and I guided her to star the Summary of Care email from Vanessa''s welcome call completion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-05 13:56:16', '2024-03-05 13:56:16'),
