  ('zcrm_1579374000134630045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, '3/5/24: David called requesting 1095 B and C. I informed him that we only send out 1095 C''s to ACA mandate states, but can email him one with his permission. He consented to having the form emailed to him at david.krampetz@gmail.com. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-05 11:51:17', '2024-03-05 11:51:17'),
