  ('zcrm_1579374000134634003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122122001', 'Elizabeth Bay', NULL, '03.05.2024 Elizabeth''s script:

We are glad we were able to find you savings on:

Breztri Aero: 160 mcg/9mcg/4.8mcg per inhalation - 2x/day

It was evident that the prices for this medication, generic or brand, were not so attractive. However, I did include a couple of coupons for your convenience, should you prefer to just walk into a pharmacy and fulfill your prescription. On the other hand, I reached out to our international shopper, who provided me with two quotes that you might be interested in, should you have the time to have it delivered to you. Also, you will notice I did not include a coupon for Publix. It was 2x the price of the ones included here. If you still wish to go to Publix, please respond to this email and I''ll gladly send it to you ?.

Below are the prices as of yesterday, 03.04.2024 and today 03.05.2024:
The one price you see that is $371.38 is of a 5.9 dosage instead of the 10.7 dosage. I am unsure of the difference in affects to the symptoms, but the price differs greatly. If you wish to share details on this, because the coupons do not match what you need, please do give me a call at the concierge line, 800-519-2969.

Breztri Aero: 160 mcg/9mcg/4.8mcg per inhalation - 2x/day:
CVS = $371.38
CVS = $667.62
Rite Aid = $626.08
International Shopper Quote - they can source both the brand and generic. Both are quoted below:
Breztri Aerosphere 160mcg/7.2mcg/5mcg (Budesonide/Glycopyrrolate/Formoterol fumarate) - 3 x 120 dose inhalers, brand- $337.18+$9.95 (shipping)
Breztri Aerosphere 160mcg/9mcg/4.8mcg (Budesonide/Glycopyrrolate/Formoterol fumarate) - 3 x 120 dose inhalers, generic- $167.54+$9.95.
Should you be interested in going the mail-in option route, here are their contact information. Please use the below numbers to connect and order them accordingly.           NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-05 10:12:27', '2024-03-05 10:12:27'),
