He decided not to cancel since he learned he can stay by closing his company, and paying out of pocket. I suggested that he contact Leslie still to learn of other options in plans we might have that might be more suitable for his situation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-05 09:58:23', '2024-03-05 09:58:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134621031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, '03.05.2024 Jackie called asking how to get her preventive annual woman visit covered with RCI. Her provider is not in the PHCS network. SO I offered her three options:
1-Have the provider call RCI to bill them directly that way.
2-Call RCI to see if they too have a RBP model she can use.
3-If NOT, is there a form of deductible to practice to at least pay part of the appointment?
I also shared that RCI prefers their members to go through the RCI app to make their preventive appts. She downloaded the app and will also ask RCI for credentials/assistance to log into her account. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-05 09:40:40', '2024-03-05 09:40:40'),
