  ('zcrm_1579374000134621013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, '03.05.2024 Wendy called back this morning. She went to get a colon, and they would not let her have that procedure without a referral.
Preventive consults for colonoscopies are not covered - Said Crystal from Planstin. Three way call.
Her options provided were: make an appeal + ....
I messaged the Engagement Team group chat via Teams the following: "We apparently have members in areas that do not allow the colonoscopy procedure WITHOUT a consult. THe consult is NOT being covered by Planstin, obviously. They said to go ahead and submit an appeal with an explanation as to why they should get this covered. This confused and frustrated our member, Wendy Weiner. I would like to learn of what options we have for those members, since this is the second time this situation has surfaced, since I''ve started working here." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-05 08:32:53', '2024-03-05 08:32:53'),
