  ('zcrm_1579374000134587301', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132126009', 'Robert Jordan', NULL, '3/5/24: Kimberley called in to ask a couple of questions about how the planstin preventive network works and rpb as she want''s to stick to the provider she''s going to now. Answered some questions about some of our online services and helped troubleshoot some password problems. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-03-05 07:38:39', '2024-03-05 07:38:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134588096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108734002', 'Amy Winsand', NULL, '03.04.2024 Amy called. It showed as a missed call on my end. Everyone was gone for the day, so I assumed, given no record of anyone connecting with her, that she still needs assistance. I called her, she picked up, but she said kindly that she already spoke to someone. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-04 17:33:07', '2024-03-04 17:33:07'),
