  ('zcrm_1579374000134588086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108610001', 'Scott Beatty', NULL, '03.04.2024 Mary Beth called. We missed her call. I called her back. She said she already spoke to someone. She seemed bothered that I called. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-04 17:26:48', '2024-03-04 17:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134587296', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134593021', 'Carrie Spyra McIlvaine', NULL, '3-4-24 Carrie wanted to learn about MCS and was referred by Lena Wetzel. However, Carrie discovered they only had 60 days from the end of coverage to get on health ins. They were able to do so on Feb. 29th with someone else''s help. I asked if she migth want to explore other options for April onward and she was open to doing so. However, they earn $60K per year and get a large APTC of $800+ and only have to pay $359.57 for RMHP CO Doctors Option Gold. They do have a high ded and mop. Carrie has a TON of meds for chemo, asthma and other stuff. They are crazy expensive. She needs reg ins for sure. I thought we could put her 53 yr old husband Mark onto MCS, until I realized that will ruin the equation for their APTC. So, it''s best to leave them alone with their RMHP for 2024. His income is pretty stable at $60K. Carrie is disabled and not earning any moneny. She was SUPER appreciative of my help and wants to refer any friends she can my way. She was very nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-04 17:24:55', '2024-03-04 17:24:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134588078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115828002', 'Kathleen Totherow', NULL, '03.04.2024 Following up for the 1095. I added her name to the list in Teams. She checked her junk folder in her email. Has not received it there either. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-04 17:16:57', '2024-03-04 17:20:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134588073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116111009', 'Oleg Petrakovsky', NULL, '03.04.2024 Oleg is having financial troubles. Needs to cancel his plan. I guided him to speak to Leslie, his advisor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-04 17:07:28', '2024-03-04 17:07:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134587291', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '3-4-24 Jim called to get an update on HMA troubles. I let him know I called and emailed my top contact with no response yet, but I''ve alerted our leader about the problem. I then called Jeff Kanter and thankfully he has a meeting scheduled for tomorrow to help all of the clients experiencing troubles right now. So, I sent Jeff my 3 clients who have contacted me and who are ready to cancel since they can''t access their funds. Jeff let me know they now have 13 new in-house support staff to field calls and catch up on calls as well as clean up the mess of the transition. Some clients never received the new cards. Jim''s card just gets denied. So, he just needs the new card to give to his doctor to bill the $275. The doctor is being patient for the new card thankfully! Jim has about $750 in his account to use. I called Jim back and gave him the update. If Jeff gives me new information tomorrow, I''ll update Jim again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-03-04 17:04:24', '2024-03-04 17:04:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134588060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '03.04.2024 Heather called. We missed the call. I Called her back. Confirming when kids age out, as her daughter is 22 and needs to see an ENT. I guided her to her options. Sent her HCBB and Healthgrades links and directions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-04 16:53:43', '2024-03-04 16:53:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134588047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131955001', 'Kody Nunn', NULL, '03.04.2024 Wants to know how the plan works if he wants to make an appointment for diabetes. I shared  the following details:
SECURE Co-Pay
Your Co-Pay’s for the following visits is as follows:
Primary Care Offi ce Visit $20.00 Co-Pay/Unlimited Visits
Specialist Offi ce Visit $50.00 Co-Pay/Unlimited Visits
