  ('zcrm_1579374000134569038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131094002', 'Patrick Hill', NULL, '3/4/24: Eva called. Her daughter is having some issues and the dr is running a lot of tests to try and figure it out which is already going over the 1000 IUA amount. I advised her to go ahead and register for her member portal with Zion and if there were any specifics related to her daughter''s issue to clear that up before making a decision to have additional tests run. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-04 13:28:48', '2024-03-04 13:28:48'),
