  ('zcrm_1579374000134569028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, '3/4/34: Tessa called. While trying to schedule a colonoscopy, she learned that she needed a referral, and in order to get a referral, the GP needed to perform an annual wellness visit. She asked if this is something covered in her plan, and how to go about the admin side of this. 
I informed her that it is covered under her MEC, and she can search for providers using the multiplan site. I did a quick search for her current GP with no luck, and emailed her prev. care resources to try on her own. I also suggested just calling the provider to see if they will bill Planstin for services. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-04 09:44:28', '2024-03-04 09:44:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134579056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132824002', 'Jane Pietruszka', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-03-04 09:36:44', '2024-03-04 09:36:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134569018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', NULL, '3/4/24: Avery called. She''s been sick for quite a few days and not sure of her options, if she should go to urgent care. I suggested using the cirrus md telehealth first and helped her get logged into her account. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-04 08:58:27', '2024-03-04 08:58:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134569013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130351009', 'Kathleen Smith', NULL, '3/4/24: Kathleen called. She can''t get her lab to take Planstin. I advised to call the dr office and the lab directly and see why it''s not working digitally. According to multiplan, they are in network, and should take the insurance. It''ll cover a standard lipid panel and any lab outside of that would be self pay. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-04 08:33:30', '2024-03-04 08:33:30'),
