  ('zcrm_1579374000134569008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059752001', 'Kim McMurtry', NULL, '3/4/24: Called Kim back in regards to her chat question about copays. I explained that it really wouldn''t affect her with her plan, and that it''s just on there for compliance if a member were to ever meet that deductible which is highly unlikely with preventive care plans. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-04 08:12:08', '2024-03-04 08:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134569003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132035001', 'John Tagle', NULL, '3/4/24: John called. He''s not showing up in Planstin''s system. He asked when he should expect to hear back about the issue. Once it is resolved, he should get an email from Planstin with cards, and then someone from MPB will reach out as well. Putting his info in the spreadsheet today.', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-04 07:47:26', '2024-03-04 07:47:26'),
