  ('zcrm_1579374000134509034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, '03.01.2024 Tracey wants a mammogram overdue - 54 YO
PCP - suggested she should get one
She recently had a chest CT scan and was wondering if she can have those results used to identify or read a mammographic search.
I told her that I def do not have a golden answer to that, but what I would do is connect with the facility that does the mammography/radiology, ask them if they perform mammography first, then ask them if they are willing/capable of reading other facilities'' test to find anything mammogram related, and call Planstin to bill them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-03-01 15:50:07', '2024-03-01 15:50:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134509029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131743009', 'Eric Umali', NULL, '03.01.2024 Eric put in an RX request:
 
