  ('zcrm_1579374000134468016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129286002', 'Axel Korn', NULL, '3/1/24: Lisa called to try and understand her plan better. She was confused about how to present at a dr visit and use her preventive care services. I explained the difference between using her MEC, the services they cover, and when bills would fall under health sharing and IUA. We went through several different examples of how each would work. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-01 07:31:24', '2024-03-01 07:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134468008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122156002', 'Carlos Sisalima', NULL, '3/1/24: Ariana called. She''s sick and just wondering what to do. I suggested using Cirrus MD as her first line of defense, if she goes to urgent care, she''ll present as cash pay. I also advised her to call us back once she gets a prescription, and I''ll show her how to fill out an RX quote request to get her the best price. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-01 07:12:16', '2024-03-01 07:12:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134468003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131174002', 'Shane de Garay', NULL, '3/1/24: Cristy called, said the Rx coupons were for tablets instead of capsules. After reviewing the notes, I suggested her daughter take another look at the email bc Nahla sent coupons for both tablets and capsules. She was able to download the right one and check out. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-03-01 07:07:55', '2024-03-01 07:13:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134462018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '2-29-24 Kara Weld came to me via Julie Oldham. Kara is in OR with a company of about 18 employees with 12 possibly interested in benefits. The company is based in OR but many employees live in WA! Their other office is PA with many employees living in MD. Their headquarters is in PA. The company currently pays 100% for all salaried employees. Their family and their employees are healthy. They are the oldest in their 50''s and their employees are mostly in the 30-49 age group. They are looking for April 1st enrollment. Kara had a thing on her retina called toxoplasmosis or some type of parasite issue. She hasn''t had a problem since 1991. But, she gets it checked every year or every few years and just got it checked recently and all is well. She understands the pre-x clause. They are interested in CARE+ and HAS since they want to encourage wellness and the lack of networks is best for all of their employees and different states, etc. They will likely pay for the $1000 IUA level and she knows the deadlines for joining as a company.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-29 18:29:23', '2024-02-29 18:29:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134462013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '2-29-24 Lorie called Anthem today to make her payment for March and onward!  She''s thrilled and all set thankfully with a new March 1st start date for the year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-29 17:12:32', '2024-02-29 17:12:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134462008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '2-29-24 Andrew is very interested in becoming a Healthcare Advisor with MPB. He''s looking for a bit of a career change. His job has become too physical in long-term repetitive motions. He''s needing to have his shoulder looked at right now. He''s done many different types of jobs. He''s working as Customer Service with the Rio Grande Restaurant. He''s good at problem solving, training, supporting and helping people. He wants to have the freedom that an Advisor has with managing your days. He also owns some properties that he manages and has considered becoming a home inspector but there are Tons already. So, this might be a better opportunity for him to thrive, especially in the Boulder market. He''s 55 and ready for a positive change. He will start with the MPB Advisor On-boarding and then I''ll help him with the insurance license as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-29 16:11:06', '2024-02-29 16:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134446074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724007', 'Brenda Flowers-Specht', NULL, '02.29.2024 Brenda needed to change her address and to attain a confirmation letter for insurance. I guided her to our site to the MPB change form and I direct transferred her to Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-29 16:02:51', '2024-02-29 16:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134462003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '2-29-24 Jim called and expressed huge frustrations with the HMA. I just sent a note to Geoff Kirk as follows, "Now James Fuson is the next client who called to find out how he can use his card for his doctor visit. He was at his appointment yesterday and his card didn''t work. He tried downloading the new app per instructions in his portal. That was not functional. I no longer know how to advise clients since they''ve followed all of the instructions received from HMA. Can you please shed light onto what''s happening?" Hopefully, I will get a quick response.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-29 15:38:27', '2024-02-29 15:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134446055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '02.29.2024 HCBB: mamm
Celeste - confirmed Angela''s account - shared that as long as it was coded as preventative, Planstin will cover it.
Angela went into details regarding
ultrasound might come through as diagnostic
screening mammogram is always ok - even if it is a 3D.
Angela is nervous and disappointed thinking she could have been covered with a 3D all along and to begin with, rather than go through this entire process, including the atrocious waiting period with the facility that does not even do a high end effective mammogram screening.
Angela had a phone to attend to, but will call us back to discuss further if she needs to. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-29 15:30:51', '2024-02-29 15:58:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134431059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131742001', 'Leslie Zann', NULL, '2/29/24: Leslie called to learn how to update her payment info. After I showed her how to do that, we called Zion to check on the ongoing issue with her membership status. Zion said it was an issue with the file not being received from Planstin. We then 4 way called Planstin. Crystal from Planstin said they had no record of Leslie having services with Zion (despite the many emails sent to Desiree and supposedly forwarded to IT team at Planstin) I confirmed Leslie''s IUA amount with Crystal. Crystal put in a support ticket to get her info entered manually and promised to follow up with both Leslie and MPB. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-29 15:13:31', '2024-02-29 15:13:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134415152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115996020', 'Cord Dorcey', NULL, 'Updated Spouses email address', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-29 14:34:21', '2024-02-29 14:34:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134431054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032244040', 'Michael Forakis', NULL, '2/29/24: Mike called. He''s trying to submit a need, but Zion isn''t recognizing his email address. I explained the first step is to register for his service and gave him instructions on obtaining an invite link from Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-29 14:17:36', '2024-02-29 14:17:36'),
