  ('zcrm_1579374000134401042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113582001', 'Jennifer Levine', 'Acquiring Executive Decision Approach Email - Jennifer Levine''s Exodus', '02.28.2024 Good evening MPB Team,

