  ('zcrm_1579374000134385008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '02.28.24:  Called Denise. Reviewed her Direct plan.  She needs to have a Well Woman visit and mammography. I explained the Direct plan includes those preventive services. She will have to open a preventive care sharing request w/Zion. I directed her to call the Concierge (Nahla) to help her do that.  I also suggested she schedule a new Welcome Call when we have our new app available to register for her services and learn how to use it.  She said she was happy we will have one.  I said I would alert her when the app is launched so she can schedule her Welcome 
