  ('zcrm_1579374000134334059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659218', 'Julie Harriman', NULL, '02.27.2024 Trying to sign into CirrusMD, but it looks like she needs to download the right app. She did while we were still on the phone, and she got in just fine. What had happened was that she downloaded the "Customer Experience" version app. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-27 15:37:17', '2024-02-27 15:37:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134334054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844213', 'Jeffrey Jackson', NULL, '02.27.2024 Email on behalf of Jeffrey, based on our conversation:

"I''m writing this in response to Jeffrey''s inquiry regarding international travel and putting his membership on hold. 
I shared with him that in the past, the members have had to cancel their memberships, when that question surfaced.

If that has changed, please inform Jeffrey and his family of the next steps to take to maintain his membership.

Items to know, based on our conversation today is that they are getting a policy through their mission endeavor, and this plan will act as secondary. In addition, is it possible to find him an option where he can keep his longevity and pay the least amount possible, until this endeavor is completed? Lastly, Jeffrey will be 60 by the time he comes back to us (they will be gone for a year), confirm with him that it is ok to sign up again, given that age.

Thank you in advance. Feel free to reach out to Jeffrey and his family directly. Otherwise, we are here at the concierge line M-F from 9am-8pm EST."                   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-27 15:32:30', '2024-02-27 15:40:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134334049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115828002', 'Kathleen Totherow', NULL, '02.27.2024 Kathleen called to attain her 1095 form. I told her we will be mailing it out on 3/1, this friday. She was fine to wait for it. I did offer her the amount that she will be writing off, $50, according to Patti''s response to us via teams, and she was surprised at the amount not being $300. I explained what I understood to be the write-off amount, as the insurance portion, and to double check with her accountant and relay the information that I shared with her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-27 15:31:58', '2024-02-27 15:39:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134345018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '2-27-24 Alicia is super tired of HMA and wants to cancel even though she will lose all of the money that she hasn''t spent yet. She''s been having a terrible time and she''s completely done with it. I suggested she call them directly to cancel and to give them her feedback.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-27 13:49:14', '2024-02-27 13:49:14'),
