  ('zcrm_1579374000134281008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100874002', 'Troy Kreutzer', NULL, '2/27/24: Beth called in to get help with submitting a sharing request as she mentioned her husband was in the emergency room. Expressed my empathy and emailed some instructions to create the online member portal with zion and explained they only need to pay the first $2500 of that visit. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-27 08:01:10', '2024-02-27 08:01:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134277013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100874002', 'Troy Kreutzer', NULL, '2/27/24: Member called this morning, but no sound coming through. Called back and LVM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-27 07:47:48', '2024-02-27 07:47:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134278003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465145', 'Munish Chawla', NULL, '2-27-2024. If Munish enrolls with his wife, that''s one enrollment...and the employee would be the 2nd enrollment. This  does not qualify as the minimum of 3 enrollments for a list bill.  We will have to enroll them separately.  LM msg for Munish this morning to discuss... It''s very small and manageable so shouldn''t be a problem.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-02-27 07:45:28', '2024-03-03 09:38:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134277008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131466002', 'Marlene Brandemuehl', NULL, '2/27/24: Carmen from Planstin called to let me know Marlene was showing up now and has been mailed her cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-27 07:45:21', '2024-02-27 07:45:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134277003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091125002', 'Kevin Whalen', NULL, '2/27/24: Kevin called. He lost his wallet and needs new cards. Asked Kelly to send him another set and trans. to Planstin to request new MEC cards. Kevin is also going to a hip dr tomorrow, and has never used the health sharing portion of his plan, so we discussed how the process worked from his presenting at office, IUA amount and payment, and submitting a need for sharing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-27 07:42:55', '2024-02-27 07:42:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134197075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, '2-26-24 Heather requested to cancel. I suggested she makes sure there''s no waiting period to join her new employment insurance and here''s her response, "Hi Wendy.   I’ll double check.   I have been 100 percent satisfied with your service and product.  I have the opportunity to get free health insurance through the state so I’m going to try it.  But I have my reservations for sure.  You guys have always been so responsive and helpful.   Thank you , Heather"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 19:33:58', '2024-02-26 19:33:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134197070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109708344', 'Matthew Koen', NULL, '2-26-24 Matthew completed the cancellation form for compliance purposes since he only now called me back. He''s also struggling to get HMA to work and had to pay for something and wants reimbursement. There''s no way to do so in the portal now it seem. He''s also not sure if he has the most current card. He will call them tomorrow and ask for help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 17:36:07', '2024-02-26 17:36:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134197065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '2-26-24 Dear Affiliate and/or Group Admin: 

