  ('zcrm_1579374000134228003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '02.26.24:  Denise texted me on Friday to tell me she hasn''t needed her plan until now and she wants to know who to call to review her plan and organize a doctor''s visit.  I responded to her text, told her to schedule a call w/me to review her plan, then call the concierge to find a provider for her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-02-26 15:05:02', '2024-02-26 15:05:02'),
