  ('zcrm_1579374000134215023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131466002', 'Marlene Brandemuehl', NULL, '2/26/24: Called Marlene back and gave her P number and claims address for appt. Will follow up when I hear that it''s been resolved. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-26 14:59:19', '2024-02-26 14:59:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134215018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131466002', 'Marlene Brandemuehl', NULL, '2/26/24: Marlene called. Her daughter has an OBGYN visit tomorrow and she doesn''t have any cards. Carmen from P verified that Marlene is not in system. Added to integration sheet, and finding out what she can do for her appointment tomorrow. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-26 14:32:27', '2024-02-26 14:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134197018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636631', 'Justin Kalinski', NULL, '2-26-24 Jay is 47 and has had a terrible experience with Anthem not including his 2 kids even though he''s paid for them and it shows correctly with Anthem. He wants a March 1st start date which isn''t possible. I sent him Get Spot as a back up for accidents. He''ll take a look. He''s wanting CARE+ and HAS. He has an HSA plan now and doesn''t fund it. His Anthem plan is $800+. Instead he''d be paying $450 + $200 = $650 instead with better benefits. Jay and kids are healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. He''s still self-employed in real estate. Was referred back to me again by Lisa Wade.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 14:32:08', '2024-02-26 16:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134215013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131742001', 'Leslie Zann', NULL, '2/26/24: I called Planstin and Carmen verified that Leslie is showing up, and that she was mailed cards Jan 17, Feb 12 and again today Feb 26. Leslie emailed me earlier today following up since neither of us has heard anything from Zion, and I haven''t gotten an emailed response from Planstin. I called and left her a voicemail about using her MEC cards for this week''s appointment (and was hoping for both of us to call Zion to ask about new member emails).', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-26 14:30:49', '2024-02-26 14:30:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465145', 'Munish Chawla', NULL, '2-26-2024 LVM', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-02-26 14:20:33', '2024-02-26 14:20:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134215008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118039019', 'Taylor Bombardiere', NULL, '2/26/24: Taylor called. asking how to present at upcoming ENT visit. Previous doctor refused to see him bc of cash pay. I walked him through using Healthcare Bluebook to find more options, and sent him credentials to access member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-26 14:09:36', '2024-02-26 14:09:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134201021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 3/1/24.  Wendy spoke to member who was getting Employer Coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-26 13:48:52', '2024-02-26 13:48:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134201016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129811002', 'Scott Faver', NULL, 'Received Cancellation from this member I will process as his pmt declined.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-26 13:43:31', '2024-02-26 13:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134201008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132133010', 'Rachel Dubiner', NULL, 'Member called in now, wanting to cancel  membership prior to starting.  In order to do this member will have to be refunded the $475 that was drafted prior to them making the decision to push start date until 3/24.  I left a vm for Mike and let him try to handle.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-26 13:34:19', '2024-02-26 13:34:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134204008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '2/26/24: Reached out to get help with finding our website to fill out the rx discount form, guided her there and showed her how to do so. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-26 13:23:56', '2024-02-26 13:23:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912002', 'Teresa Hostutler', NULL, '2/26/24: Teresa reached out because she had gotten a planstin copay card which confused her because she never had to pay a copay for her preventive services before. Explained how it might have been sent an error and told her she still has the HSA and not the copay plan, Reached out to Planstin to send a replacement. They informed me that the card was sent was correct. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-26 13:23:33', '2024-02-26 13:23:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', 'Decline of 3/24 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 2/26
Member submitted PU Form I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-26 13:13:10', '2024-02-27 08:14:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134196013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119069002', 'Jeffrey Davenport', NULL, '02.26.2024 Jeffrey had his 1st physical annual and wants to get covered with planstin for the 1st time.
knows planstin is preventive
appointment 02/06 (email from MPB on the 16th), for blood work (cortisol and hormonal....).
Presented Planstin card for that appt
they spoke with Planstin about the extra labwork, they told him to call us for billing
Here are TWO situations: getting coverage from Planstin for an annual physical and having the blood work covered as well.
I explained how preventive works, and he was extremely confused as to how to use Planstin and when to present the card.
However, where he gets his physical, as a retired firefighter, they refused to bill Planstin.
I told him then it would be best to compare all the services your received to the ACA guidelines in healthcare.gov, then call Planstin to confirm what options you have to get covered with this provider, since they do not want to bill Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-26 13:11:14', '2024-02-26 13:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134196008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132133010', 'Rachel Dubiner', NULL, '02.26.2024 not educated Rachel and David', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-26 13:08:30', '2024-02-26 13:08:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134197013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, '2-26-24 Elisa completed the Change Form to remove Rodney for April 1st since he''s aging into Medicare. She has tried calling Planstin first and never got a call back. Somehow she found the Change Form and completed it on her own just before I called them back. She''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 13:05:30', '2024-02-26 13:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134144041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133844002', 'Alex Woelfel-Smith', 'Decline of 3/24 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 2/26 Member submitted PU form I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-26 12:56:06', '2024-02-26 13:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134197008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, '2-26-24 Ashlee and Desiree missed fixing their account upon request back in Jan. 17-18. I found my initial request to Planstin and resent it. Ashlee is saying they will fix this today and backdate it to Dec. 1st, 2023. They are working on it now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 12:54:11', '2024-02-26 12:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134197003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354202', 'Louis Romero', NULL, '2-26-24 Hi Wendy,

We need your help answering this question.
Louis who is on Medicare and previously unemployed—has found a job.
If this company offers him insurance—and he declines this insurance because he’s on Medicare —can I still keep my insurance thru the exchange?
I need the exchange insurance until June 30th—then I qualify for Medicare.

Thanks for your help.

Chris Romero

and my response - 

Hi Christine,

Since Louis has a new job, that will change your household income. You will need to update the income amount. If you are offered "affordable" coverage through his employer then you no longer will qualify for a tax credit. If you aren''t offered coverage through his employer, then we will need to update the household income which will adjust your tax credit amount per month. Let me know and I can help you make the necessary updated to your account.

Thanks,

Wendy', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 12:52:39', '2024-02-26 12:52:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134187016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '2-26-24 Lisa will also call to request a March 1st start date to be extra safe. It is showing March 1st already. This must be newly fixed with C4. She should be good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 12:40:50', '2024-02-26 12:40:50'),
