  ('zcrm_1579374000134168063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131742001', 'Leslie Zann', NULL, '02.26.24:  Angee emailed me a thread she and Leslie were sending each other re: Leslie''s member integration problem with Zion/Planstin which has not been resolved since 2/7/24.  I forwarded this thread to Vinnie to show him the long delays we''ve been dealing with and asked him to advise.  Vinnie had told me as long as the member is in MPB''s system they have access to their services. MPB''s IT team will work directly w/Planstin''s to manually integrate the member so the timeline should be much shorter. Leslie is concerned because she has an appt. to do labs on Wednesday, the 28th.  Waiting for Vinnie to get back to me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-02-26 11:50:33', '2024-02-26 11:50:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134189014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130212026', 'Cristin Connelly', NULL, '02.26.2024 Cristin put in an RX request. The below information was sent to her:
