Please let us know if you need anything changed or adjusted. We are here at the concierge line M-F, from 9am-8pm EST.                                                            NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-26 11:45:54', '2024-02-26 11:45:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134187008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '2-26-24 Lisa and I have successfully completed her enrollment. She paid with a cc for one month. She has on her calendar to Call Cigna to set up ongoing payments. I uploaded her Cobra letter which shows her loss of coverage on 1-31-24. She now has to show proof of her investment income by 5-26-24. She will try to do it today. I showed her how to upload the documents in her account.  We put her income at $34,288.01. She has $10K from IRA, $18K from dividends, $8288 from Aviv invesment, $800 from former employer as retirement income and about $5K loss in her jewelry business. We can''t show a loss in the system, so we just had to adjust it when it asked if the amount would be the same in 2024.  She''s getting a $789.92 APTC and paying $85.89 a month for Cigna Connect CO Option Silver with $100 ded and $1100 mop. 

