  ('zcrm_1579374000134168053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133641002', 'Darrell Creekmore', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of March 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-02-26 11:29:25', '2024-02-26 11:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134168048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850001', 'Scott Egbers', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of March 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-02-26 11:06:30', '2024-02-26 11:06:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134189003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129714015', 'Charlene Dickey', NULL, '02.26.2024 Charlene called wanting to know how to proceed to get care for developing shingles. It is fair to say that Charlene is going through a few rough patches, given her dad passing away and her mom not doing well, and Charlene being the only caretake for both with no support. 
She had not had her welcome call, and was very confused about the plan, and is getting the feeling that it might not be the right package for her, given all the moving pieces, her lack of education, experience and patience or time. I offered her the 20 minute welcome call, but she was too frustrated to hear that offer and its benefits for her that could help her. 
So then I gave a brief description of her plan re: preventive and health-sharing solely, but starting the conversation with it being a plan of three parts.
After explaining those two parts, she was worried that then she has to pay out of pocket for her care for shingles. I explained to her that she can use the telehealth service as part of her plan at no extra cost. UNLESS they recommend that she see someone in person. I had to repeat this part a few times throughout the conversation. Charlene seemed very stressed. 
Then I explained the IUA correlation NOT DEDUCTIBLE, with Zion the health-sharing part of the plan.
I sent Charlene a registration link for CirrusMD that she received and was able to register and attempt to begin a conversation with a doctor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-26 10:57:29', '2024-02-26 11:07:49'),
