  ('zcrm_1579374000134187003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '2-26-24 Lisa is going to create her C4 account now. She doesn''t have internet and has an old computer. She may try on her  phone to create the account and walk through all of the steps. She thought she was ready to go to enroll. She''ll let me know when she''s done with this part. She has a Cobra letter which will hopefully appease the carrier. She can''t get a letter from her company showing end of coverage in a timely fashion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-26 10:13:40', '2024-02-26 10:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134143008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131466010', 'Matthew Berget', NULL, '2/26/24: Thomas reached out requesting cards from planstin and zion, reached out to planstin and they still don''t have them on file. Not sure what else to do at this point except to follow up with Desiree again via email. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-26 09:54:39', '2024-02-26 09:54:39'),
