  ('zcrm_1579374000134162013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131816011', 'Gloria Joy Sorensen', NULL, '2/26/24: Gloria called. She tried to open a need with Zion and is not showing up in their system. Will send over integration files. I let Gloria know that I''m not sure how long it will take Zion to enter the files in their system, but she should receive an email from them once the issue is resolved. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-26 09:46:16', '2024-02-26 09:46:16'),
