  ('zcrm_1579374000134076003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088963002', 'Noreen Knight', NULL, 'I got a call from a Physical Therapy facility called Essential Health requesting eligibility for Noreen. I asked a few questions and about what Noreen''s physical therapy would be for, was it due to an injury or illness, requested by Noreen''s provider, etc. So, I can determine my answer of what Noreen needs to do or if it is a Shareable request for Noreen to put in with Zion. Unfortunately, this is something that is just for leisure. No injury, illness, or requested by Noreen''s doctor of any sort. Noreen just wants to do this for her own accord. I explained that due to that reason then this would not be eligible for any sharing whatsoever, BUT if Noreen would like to speak with Zion Health to put in a request or possible be able to utilize the additional giving funds (didn''t say that to the woman on the phone about giving fund), but provided Zion''s phone number in case the facility and/or Noreen wants to call Zion for anything else regarding this. All set and didn''t ask anything else from me. Very nice but when she heard me say this is a sharing plan, her tone of voice changed and sounded skeptical. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-02-23 13:15:43', '2024-02-23 13:15:43'),
