  ('zcrm_1579374000134060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163125', 'Sharon Linnebur', NULL, '2-23-24 Sharon is willing to patiently wait for the new debt settlement program to roll out. The old program was a debt invalidation program but the banks have changed their ways and no longer ignore and not respond to the letters sent to them. With a response, the debt can''t be invalidated. So, instead they have lawyers who will negotiate the rates down as low as possible. The cc company may call the client to try to collect on the debt. The client can immediately let their team know and they will reach out to the credit card company and tell them to cease and desist. The clients credit may be damaged for about 24 months depending on the situation but that''s much better than 7 years which is what happens with bankruptcy.  An example client had $45K in cc debt which would take 500 months to pay off and $81K in interest! Instead the client is paying $651 a month into an escrow account to pay off the debt in 60 months. It can be pre-payed if the client is able as well. Sharon''s interest rates are around 7%-12% which is better than what Destiny shared is happening with other clients who have 20%-30% interest now! Sharo is willing to wait for the roll out since she waited 2 years already from when I first mentioned the ability to help people with debt.  The debt we can help with is cc debt/unsecured debt. They can currently help with student debt and tax debt as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-23 10:58:50', '2024-02-23 10:58:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134038008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819002', 'Kristin Dotlich', NULL, '2/23/24: Kristin called with followup questions to welcome call. I helped her log into her member portal, we discussed RX coverage and quotes, WHLD. She hasn''t received Planstin cards or any emails from P or Zion. I told her I would look into that for her. Called Planstin and Celeste verified she was not in their system. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-23 10:54:24', '2024-02-23 10:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134034071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122117002', 'Leisa Heuple', NULL, '2-23-2024 Called LVM for Lisa re declined card. Gave her the number to call in Patti''s email. Also sent her the cognito form link to update her method of payment.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-02-23 10:49:58', '2024-02-23 10:54:01'),
