  ('zcrm_1579374000134035069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '02.23.24:  Recvd. an email from Derrick asking for the member''s name and membership I.D. #. Sent this info. to him.  Heard from Derrick:  "Got it - we have made an exception for this and the claim has been sent for processing."  I asked him if the member needs to do anything further in this process. He responded: "No next steps- we will review and decision the claim shortly and send out a EOB.  Good news is she can go to her provider of choice if needed." Called Kristin at 4:35 p.m. today and left her a message to let her know the claim will be paid.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-02-23 10:40:52', '2024-02-23 14:39:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134035074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131103011', 'Sara Turner', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-02-23 10:40:52', '2024-02-23 10:40:52'),
