  ('zcrm_1579374000134052011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106045002', 'Lance Simonson', NULL, 'Member called in and left me a vm asking about removing a dependent and also adding a dependent.  Since there will be no change in price I can do this.  She will be submitting form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-23 10:03:37', '2024-02-23 10:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000134052006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130351009', 'Kathleen Smith', NULL, '2/23/24: Kathleen reached out because she was having a mamogram and bone density test as well as some preventive lab work done she said and wasn''t too sure if her doctor was in network. Verified with her that they were, and she will be fine to have her services there and to bill her planstin insurance for them. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-23 09:49:27', '2024-02-23 09:49:27'),
