  ('zcrm_1579374000134034053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133307002', 'Felix Costa', NULL, '2-23-2024 Felix Costa Prep Mtg set for 2/27 at 0730 pacific to discuss in advance of the group mtgs on 2/29:
