  ('zcrm_1579374000133971058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091225002', 'Robert Howell', NULL, '2/22/24: Member called. She wanted to know the difference between using her Planstin and MPB cards for presenting at dr visit. Aster explaining the difference, she said her daughter had seen a urologist and her issue looks like it will go over IUA. I advised her to collect itemized bills, receipts, and how to submit a need. Transferred to Zion to create portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-22 11:59:28', '2024-02-22 11:59:28'),
