  ('zcrm_1579374000134002003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, '2-22-24 Scott got a new job with benefits as of 3/1/24. I asked how his experience has been and I was concerned from some of the above notes. Fortunately Scott followed through with creating a new Need and he''s working with Veronica at Zion who is helping him process the Need. It was just approved. They are sending him a check in the mail. So, he''s confident it''s all set now to move forward with the cancellation process. He''s been very happy with his membership and experience.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-22 10:27:24', '2024-02-22 10:27:24'),
