  ('zcrm_1579374000133986009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779263', 'Catherine Collins', NULL, 'Member called in asking about her recent colonoscopy.  She has started receiving bills and was unsure how to proceed.  I advised her to reach out to Planstin and ask what they have received and what the status is on the bills and have them advise her what to do.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-22 10:06:54', '2024-02-22 10:06:54'),
