  ('zcrm_1579374000133971018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130300001', 'Aaron Schmidt', NULL, '2/22/24: Aaron called. He wanted to schedule a welcome call and get some new cards bc his house caught fire. Send link to scheduler, and emailed address update form. REaching out to Kelly to send another fulfillment package and trans member to Planstin to request new MEC cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-22 09:47:12', '2024-02-22 09:47:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133971008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126614002', 'Sarah Swisher-Leatherman', NULL, '2/22/24: Omnia Trauma called asking how to bill for Jeffrey''s appointment. I gave the receptionist a vague overview of his type of plan, but she wasn''t able to provide enough details for me to give solid billing info. I advised to have Jeffrey call us when he get out of his appointment so we can educate him on how to present for this and future appointments. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-22 09:04:16', '2024-02-22 09:04:16'),
