  ('zcrm_1579374000133947039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '02.21.2024 Cameron ended up cancelling, but she did it too late. She will call tomorrow to request a refund. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-21 16:31:28', '2024-02-21 16:31:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133947031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, '02.21.2024 Tessa called to get guidance on how to proceed with getting a colonoscopy. I guided her to use her Planstin card to coach the facility to call the number ...7526 to bill Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-21 16:07:00', '2024-02-21 16:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133947026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113582001', 'Jennifer Levine', NULL, '02.21.2024 Emailed Jennifer a brief timeline explaining all the above, to make sure all the details are correct, and I Bc Joan and Patti for their information, since I did not get a chance to speak to Joan at all then call Jennifer.
I called Jennifer after I emailed her the details. 

Below is what I email via outlook:
Good evening Jennifer,

I understand I offered you a call today, and that was with hopes that I had the opportunity to discuss the matter with an upper hierarchal management, who may have POC''s in Zion where direct conversations could be had with, regarding the issue and experience you went through.

As it took place (in bullet form below), and in a nutshell:
It took you 3 attempts to get a sharing request open, for back pain
Finally, they requested you send everything in via email - and you did.
You uploaded all the documents 11.13.2023
THEN the reciprocation finally started with Zion - but communication was vague & generic
All your documents went missing 02.03.2024
You tried numerous times to connect with your case manager, Kelsey, who NEVER returned your calls. You eventually escalated it to the supervisors at Zion.
You wanted to cancel, but they told you "if you cancel now, you will not get reimbursed"
...but your sharing request was open and active.
AO 2.12.2024 they start dragging their feet? Saying they are sending you $1775 that was approved on 1/26th but sent you 2 checks instead: $650 & $1040.
Presently, you are  seeking a form of reparations through reimbursement.
Although the total services in the end cost $2250, you spent over $3800.

I''m typing this here to confirm the details, one, and to let you know that I did not forget about you. However, I have not had the opportunity to speak with my supervisor yet (we are in different time zones & we do not see each other in person), but I am trying to connect with her differently, since we are in different states. 

Please read through the details above and let me know if there''s anything that needs to be changed or adjusted.                                                                                         NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-21 15:56:53', '2024-02-21 16:08:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133914039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '2-21-24 Sally has an upcoming surgery that she trying to sort through. She has a form from Sedera to complete and she wasn''t sure how Redirect fits in. I let her know that Redirect won''t be involved in a surgery scenario and to run it through Sedera. I left her a vm. We''ll see if she needs more help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-21 15:37:08', '2024-02-21 15:37:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133947013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122273001', 'Jill Gregory', NULL, '02.21.2024 Jill called to learn the best way to proceed regarding an incident of her falling off of her bike that rendered her into the ER. The bill they are going to send her (she has not received it), is $500 or so.
