  ('zcrm_1579374000133899023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130295012', 'Aana Camp', NULL, '2/21/24: Reached out to Aana and spoke to her about the cancellation, she wanted to know if her membership would be refunded. Told her she didn''t cancel in time but she said she was expecting it and asked me to escalate, will reach out to Patti. Offered referral fee- WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-21 12:34:46', '2024-02-21 12:34:46'),
