  ('zcrm_1579374000133892028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, '2/21/24: Terese called back very frustrated because she hasn''t been able to register for telehealth services. All of this effort just to fill a script. To add to the confusion, apparently according to Chris at Zion, she''s had teledoc services since 2022. I brought zion into our phone call and corrected her email address with them and Chris sent over registration link for teledoc. Need to verify why this is and what members should expect. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-21 11:46:00', '2024-02-21 11:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133915046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131246003', 'Derek Menold', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Derek. Received  Planstin card. Still waiting on Zion email. Will follow up with Nahla in regards to this. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-02-21 11:00:59', '2024-02-21 11:17:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133914016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084814001', 'James Rosenow', NULL, '2-21-24 Joe Forte called bc he had to lay off James. Joe is paying for James'' membership. I called James to see if he wants to keep his membership active while he''s looking for a new job. He said no, he''s fine with going without ins/mcs, even with kids. So, I sent him the cancellation form now since he wasn''t near a computer. I cc''ed Patti as well. I also called Joe back to let him know James wants to cancel and I sent him the form to do so. I told Joe to feel free to call me back before the end of the month to make sure it''s all cancelled so he''s not billed again. He will need to be reimbursed for March as well since it was billed last night.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-21 10:58:45', '2024-02-21 10:58:45'),
