  ('zcrm_1579374000133839078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '2-20-24 Lisa thinks her income will be somewhere between $24K - $36K. With that income she''ll get an $802 APTC at $36K!  So, the cost of a Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver is only $104.79 and $100 Ded and $1000 MOP. That''s hard to beat. If she determines her income will be more, she can move to MCS or adjust her income amount. She gets money from her father from investments that both her father and accountant seem to agree that it''s non-taxable. So, I sent instructions for her to create a C4 account and she now has until Feb. 29th to enroll due to her employer benefits ending Jan. 31st. She wants a March 1st start date. She doesn''t have to opt into Cobra.  She will let me know once she''s created her account and I will guide her through the enrollment process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-20 17:23:42', '2024-02-20 17:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133848074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128357001', 'Samuel Johnson', NULL, '02.20.2024 Karen called and left us a VM. Just called her back today and ended up leaving her a VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-20 17:14:09', '2024-02-20 17:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133848069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130300001', 'Aaron Schmidt', NULL, '02.20.2024 Aaron called and left us a VM. I called him back and left him a VM back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-20 17:10:56', '2024-02-20 17:10:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133839070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133855019', 'Talya Dash', NULL, '2-20-24 Talked with Talya again and she was hoping for a traditional plan like what she was getting from her large employer group. She now understands that''s not possible as an individual or self-employed person. She''s super healthy but wanted co-pays for the small things. However, even so, she''s still liable for $9450 with most of the plans available to her and very little coverage. She how understands the options I''m sharing are more comprehensive in case of something really happening with her health. She will call me in 25 min. to enroll for a March 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-20 16:56:20', '2024-02-20 16:56:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133848064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130295012', 'Aana Camp', NULL, '02.20.2024 Aana called to cancel her membership. She attempted connecting with Analisa but was unsuccessful. She does not want to chase Analisa''s schedule given her busy schedule, she shared. I guided her to the cancellation form. She filled it out and submitted it. She might call back tomorrow to discuss reversing her payment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-20 16:38:38', '2024-02-20 16:38:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133839065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850008', 'Melissa Mangum', NULL, '2-20-24 Sent to Patti and Vinnie separately - Melissa Mangum''s enrollment platform was showing the wrong pricing upon enrollment. We couldn''t wait due to the deadline. It was showing the 2023 pricing for CARE+ EC $1000 IUA at $520 instead of the correct $615. Vinnie has corrected the enrollment platform but her pricing is still wrong. I''m hoping one of you can correct this before it gets billed tonight.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-20 16:33:34', '2024-02-20 16:33:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133839054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121090002', 'Jeri Smith', NULL, '2-20-24 Jeri is now Jeri Galati and is choosing to re-enroll in SECURE HSA. She just wants her annual mammo and well check. She''s super healthy otherwise and only under active thyroid managed with meds. So, $405/$1000 plus only $25 to enroll since she was already a member. She was very appreciative of me waiving the $100. March 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-20 16:26:36', '2024-02-20 16:30:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133839049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850008', 'Melissa Mangum', NULL, '2-20-24 Melissa is 56 and was referred to me by Holly Weise and Tanya (not sure which one). But, Holly connected us. Melissa has 3 sons and 2 who are joining. Cooper and Tucker are 19 and 20. The other son is in Eugene, OR right now but may join later. Melissa use to have Medicaid bc of a divorce. She''s self-employed massage therapist since the early 90''s. They are all healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. She takes HRT / hormone replacement therapy. She chose CARE+ $615 and HAS $200 = $815. One son may like to use mental health benefits. They all can use wellness benes. They are enrolled and ready to go for March 1st start date. However, HAS auto defaulted to 2-20-24 start date for wellness which she''s fine with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-20 16:12:39', '2024-02-20 16:12:39'),
