  ('zcrm_1579374000133839026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '2-20-24 I talked with Reba and according to Karina, they have not been paying since Sept. or Oct. Reba''s saying if they will pay Jan. 1st, 2024 onward they will waive the few missed months and maintain their active membership onward at the new 2024 price. If so, I''ll contact Jonathan and help him move forward with the re-enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-20 11:42:53', '2024-02-20 11:42:53'),
