  ('zcrm_1579374000133839018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '2-20-24 I talked with Jonathan VanNoy again and he will complete the upgrade process if MPB will put into writing that his membership will remain active as of Jan. 1st 2023. Sedera has continued to tell him he was cancelled back then. However, MPB has continued to collect his money. If MPB can send in writing that his membership will be honored as Active this entire time since Jan. 2023 and provide the correct new price and reassure him that his sons Need will be shared according to Sedera''s Sharing Guidelines. If MPB will do this he will complete the Sedera Upgrade/Re-Enrollment process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-20 11:25:34', '2024-02-20 11:25:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133848003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124142012', 'Trudi Sorensen', NULL, '02.20.2024 Trudi called to get clarification on which insurance card to use for her annual physical that she is going to as we were speaking.
