  ('zcrm_1579374000133818008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '2/20/24: Georgeanna reached out because she was having shoulder issues and wanted to see if she could have a stem cell procedure, mentioned how she had an ongoing shoulder procedure already, transferred her to the ongoing sharing request department at zion to speak with someone there further about this. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-20 09:21:22', '2024-02-20 09:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133798021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132133010', 'Rachel Dubiner', NULL, '2/20/24: David called about a withdraw made on his account today. He said someone just tried calling him from MPB, but I didn''t recognize the number. Transferred to Patti since it was billing related. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-20 09:17:40', '2024-02-20 09:17:40'),
