  ('zcrm_1579374000133766003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130553001', 'Keith Barbour', NULL, '2/20/24: Sarah called. OBGYN Provider refused to bill planstin bc they are not in network and not "insurance". I advised to call them back, let them know it is insurance, that they will pay out of network, and please send bill to P. 
