2. WHLD - and how to register and search for Chiropractic discounts
3. RX quotes and how to submit a quote request. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-20 07:38:47', '2024-02-20 07:38:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133758008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108891001', 'Sarah Stokes', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/1 citing financial reasons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-20 07:30:12', '2024-02-20 07:30:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133758003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101333010', 'Christapher Cogswell', NULL, 'Member emailed in requesting cancellation.  I responded letting him know that today was the deadline to avoid getting billed for 3/24 Share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-20 07:27:32', '2024-02-20 07:27:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133697077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '2-19-24 Lisa is 61 and left her job on Feb. 1st. Employer only covered her through Jan. 31st even though she quit on Feb. 1st. She can choose Cobra for Feb. at $667.73. C4 plans are terrible and starting at $689.66. The Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 is $873.67. She gets paid $5K a month from dad and some is not taxed as gift and takes $1500 from investments. Therefore, she lives off $6500 a month. So, I quoted her full price of ACA plans since she wasn''t sure about her taxable income for 2024.  The only meds she takes are for anxiety and sleep. Lexapro and Escitalopram or Trazodone. They are all affordable when I looked them up on GoodRX. Her Anthem plan has $4K ded and $8250 mop. She has a lympoma on her back that needs to be removed. It is Not cancerous. She will call tomorrow to find out the cost. She wanted to see a podiatrist for a bunyon but realizes she''ll have to pay most of that with her current ins as well if they do anything more than talk to her about it. She will check her with dr. about something they heard with her heart that they were not concerned about. They told her simply to let them know if she experiences anything down the road. She''ll check with her Dr for the records for that. She knows of the deadline for tomorrow for March 1st start date. Interested in CARE+ since she has no self-employment. Very interested in HAS since she wants another mammo this year, bone density scan, pap, etc. Her cost for CARE+ $350 and HAS $107 = $457, $125/$25.  Also interested in dental discount plan for $99 +$20.  Lisa also watched the MPB video.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-19 17:38:10', '2024-02-20 17:19:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133741003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '02.19.24:  Was informed by Nahla and Angee of Kristin''s issue with her provider''s office not updating her insurance w/Planstin, therefore, billing Krisitn instead of Planstin for her 9.18.23 Wellness visit. After trying to contact her provider several times and also calling Planstin, Krisitn found this info. out in Jan.''24 when she called Planstin who told her to have her bill faxed to them and they would bill the provider.  The provider faxed the bill to Planstin, who then denied this claim due to it being outside timely filing of 90 days. I told Kristin I would do my best to resolve this w/Planstin, since Planstin sent Kristin the wrong EOB (dated in 2022) and time was lost to correct this info.  If Planstin refuses to pay the provider, I suggested Kristin take this issue, in which the provider was also at fault, to her provider since they made several errors and when finally realized they needed to bill Planstin, it was after the 90-day time limit. Told Kristin I would apprise her of my discussion w/Planstin once I''ve contacted them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-02-19 15:58:21', '2024-02-23 10:36:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133723049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, '02.19.2024 Robert called. Spoke to Will. Notes in later. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-19 15:03:24', '2024-02-19 15:03:24'),
