  ('zcrm_1579374000133697046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', NULL, '2/19/24: Hermilo called. He''s having issues scheduling a wellness visit bc dr office is not taking planstin. I advised to have the dr office call, and ask if they are concerned about billing, and also did a quick search for Hermilo to find some other options in his area. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-19 13:15:11', '2024-02-19 13:15:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133697041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133214002', 'Robert Grinnell', NULL, '2-19-24 Enrolling now in HAS for $250 starting March 1st. Chose ACH. All set. He also set up his Welcome Call with the MPB Concierge Team for on or after March 1st. He''s good to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-19 13:12:15', '2024-02-19 13:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133701051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', NULL, 'Member called in asking about adding dependent Tyler back to the membership.  I gave her the pricing and will send her out the link to add.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-19 13:01:02', '2024-02-19 13:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133723036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131623002', 'William Pullano', NULL, '02.19.2024 Karen called re: her son spraining his right ankle.
