  ('zcrm_1579374000133696046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '2/19/24: Maria called in to find out about the process of her ongoing sharing request, told her she might need to reach out to zion healths ongoing share department but that she would need to call tomorrow as they are closed for presidents day. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-19 12:57:31', '2024-02-19 12:57:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133723031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130371008', 'Rachel Yellin', NULL, '02.19.2024 Rachel called returning Angee''s phone call, checked her email and confirmed she received the right coupon that Angee sent. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-19 12:41:13', '2024-02-19 12:41:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133696036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129473010', 'Sandra Stroehmann', NULL, '2/19/24: Sandra called in for help getting discounted labs and rx for progesterone and to find a primary care provider as well as a derma, was able to facilitate all of these requests for the member. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-19 12:30:15', '2024-02-19 12:30:15'),
