  ('zcrm_1579374000133701046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044551026', 'Sharon Helden', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking what our cancellation policy was.  I responded back to her and shae emaild back requesting to be cancelled eff 2/29/24.  I will send her out the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-19 12:09:06', '2024-02-19 12:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133723018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116046002', 'Mark Magnussen', NULL, '02.19.2024 RX request, too expensive, shot - International shopper cannot source it - support from Zion up to $3000 per SR.
Below is what was sent via Outlook:
It was nice to briefly chat with you today. I hope Megan is finding her treatments to meet her with what she needs.

Savings for:
Vivitrol: 1 380 mg sus er rec

Attached you will find the steps to retrieving the guidelines from Zion and a snippet of the mention of support with this medication. Also attached is a coupon, should you want to start the process of healing then getting it shared with Zion (up to $3000).
I thought it was a good idea to try to see what the manufacturer has to offer for cash-pay patients. This one is a shot in the dark, as most of the times it is aimed for commercially insurance held patients.

Below prices and information are as of today Monday 02.19.2024:

Coupon:
Vivitrol: 1 380 mg sus er rec: Walgreens =$1597.23

Zion Guidelines Freshly: https://zionhealthshare.org/member-guidelines/
Snippet as of today 02.19.2024:

Manufacturer''s Possible Savings:  https://www.vivitrol.com/alcohol-dependence/co-pay-savings-program
VIVITROL&#174; Co-Pay Savings Program | Get Your Co-pay Card
Check your eligibility for the VIVITROL Co-pay Savings Program and see how much you may save on VIVITROL (naltrexone for extended-release injectable suspension).
www.vivitrol.com

Please let me know if you have any questions, want to start a sharing request or need anything adjusted. We are here at the concierge line M-F from 9am - 8pm EST.          NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-19 11:44:52', '2024-02-19 12:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133697028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130371008', 'Rachel Yellin', NULL, '2/19/24: Emailed Rachel the following coupon:
