  ('zcrm_1579374000133581013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131825002', 'Ryan Burke', NULL, '2/16/24: Ryan called in and explained that he was having issues with creating his online member portal with zion when he called them they said they didn''t have him on file as a member. He mentioned that Whitney had submitted a ticket in to zion to resolve the issue, reached out to zion and spoke to Denise who wasn''t able to confirm. She said she would call back, will reach out if I don''t hear back later today. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-16 08:11:17', '2024-02-16 08:11:17'),
