  ('zcrm_1579374000133350128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122117002', 'Leisa Heuple', NULL, '02.13.2024 Leisa had her annual physical, blood tests, and wanted to know if the labwork is covered. I explained it is out of pocket.
