  ('zcrm_1579374000133350048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309004', 'James Skurski', NULL, '2/13/24: James called to cancel. I advised him to call Wendy to complete that process, and gave him her number. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-13 12:16:12', '2024-02-13 12:16:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133350043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '02.13.2024 Asiye called to attain a better handle on how to use the MAP program in her plan. I guided her to the M&amp;S collaborative site, their contact information, the Impact Ste app, and the resources embedded via hyperlinks on the site. I recommended she offer them to pull up virtual and in person therapists in her area, to increase her chances of finding a therapist. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-13 12:11:07', '2024-02-13 12:11:07'),
