  ('zcrm_1579374000133332043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'Refresher welcome call with David. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code card. Verified address. Added secondary email. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-02-13 10:46:15', '2024-02-13 10:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133339028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131956012', 'Ty Perdue', NULL, 'Received a call from Zac requesting this member to push back start date until 4/1/24 due to ember still having financial issues.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-13 10:24:34', '2024-02-13 10:24:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133350023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, '2/13/24: Karen called. She got a lab bill and wondered why P didn''t cover it. I informed her that the labs they cover is very limited, but if was a lab for a standard lipid or pap, then to call them directly and see why it wasn''t. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-13 10:13:48', '2024-02-13 10:13:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133350018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '2/13/24: Kim called asking about new P card, why it says co-pay and deductible, and if she needed to print new cards or use old ones for upcoming dr visit. I informed her why the cards listed those things and what does and does not apply to her. And that while she should receive a new card in the mail as well, she can still use her old one for this visit. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-13 10:08:32', '2024-02-13 10:08:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133332038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132943002', 'Wallace Reid', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of March 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-02-13 10:02:35', '2024-02-13 10:02:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133343133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130301001', 'Julie DeSutter', NULL, '2-13-24 She answered, see below. Sent her another email making myself available. 

Things are going great!
I do have a few questions, but I just need to carve out the time to read and retain all of the information from emails about Planstin, etc. 
I also want to know more about spending accounts and what''s reimbursable. Just timing issues.
Julie', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-02-13 09:22:44', '2024-02-13 09:22:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133350013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130553001', 'Keith Barbour', NULL, '2/13/24: Sarah called. She has a well woman visit scheduled this week, and wondering how to present. The provider was not listed in the PHCS network when I searched. I informed Sarah about RBP and UCR pricing, and gave her some helpful verbiage to use when approaching provider about billing. I advised to call them ahead of time to see if they will be willing to bill planstin, and if there are any issues to have the provider call us or planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-13 09:14:16', '2024-02-13 09:14:16');
