  ('zcrm_1579374000133296082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '02.12.2024 Rachel called to get help in opening a sharing request. She was receptive and kind and just wanted to be proactive. 
I explained the procedure to her then transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 17:35:24', '2024-02-12 17:35:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133296077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117661001', 'Elizabeth Geronime', NULL, '02.12.2024 Elizabeth called and left a VM, I called her back... 
1- A mammogram - shared? I explained that the mamm is covered through the ACA guidelines with Planstin.
2- preventative annual exam - Shared?- with heart testing. I guided her to have the provider separate the heart screening from the preventative appointment to keep it preventative, and anything heart stress related, EKG and more could be shared. 
Double checked the guidelines, did not find anything on heart, unless it was with tobacco use, transferred her to Zion to double check with them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 17:28:25', '2024-02-12 17:28:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133296069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '02.12.2024 Roseann called  b/c Planstin sent her back to US to attain the 1095C. I messaged the team and Angee responded with "..Those forms are due to be sent out March 1" (but still unsure WHO would be sending them out, Planstin or MPB), and that Patti will be sending out the ones for Sedera Members. According to Karina and Patti that is. (copied notes from Jason Wright''s experience).  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 17:03:16', '2024-02-12 17:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133296061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '02.12.2024 Robin called and left a message re: daughter/mental wellness and annual child wellness physical.
I guided her to the MAP program, and explained the next wellness visit would be in fiscal year, April 12th, 2024. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 16:54:03', '2024-02-12 17:13:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133296050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '02.12.2024 Stephanie is following up on her conversation with Will re the reimbursement of $330.75 for her preventative wellness check up. 
I understood that the doctor did not follow preventative screening protocol initially, and attempted to charge her for diagnostic and preventative appointments at the same time. She went back and forth with them numerously to get them to remove the diagnostic coding and now that it is down to just preventative they are not willing to bill Planstin. 
In the past, members who end up with providers who do NOT want to bill Planstin, have the option to fill out a claim form to get reimbursed. I''ll be sure to get  her connected with the right party at Planstin. 
*****************************************************************************************
I contacted Planstin solely and spoke with Celeste, who confirmed if the provider confirmed with the member that they WILL NOT bill Planstin, to email the claim form and receipts and the confirmation if possible (she only spoke with them verbally, so she does not have that. If Planstin requests it, she will get it. )NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 16:33:53', '2024-02-12 16:42:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133296045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467623', 'Christopher Bonelli', NULL, '02.12.2024 Crystal called from Planstin wanting to confirm that Christopher is cancelled on our end, b/c he''s not showing up as cancelled with planstin.
In the CRM, he shows active WITH THE WRONG bday (2nd instead of the 20th), but he is showing  CANCELLED in Admin123.
I will connect with Dayra to correct the bday and status in CRM.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 16:19:32', '2024-02-12 16:51:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133299048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637239', 'Dean Dealy', NULL, '2-12-24 Dean still does not see the $500 withdrawn from his OE Federal Credit Union account. NLG is stating he was charged on 1/31/24 but he doesn''t see anything on his cc accounts either.  I''ve sent another email to NLG and Five Rings to solve the problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-12 15:59:59', '2024-02-12 16:00:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133296037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '02.12.2024 Needs to get escalated to the higher ups at Planstin to have this cleared. 
They told her to fax over in the end of it all but when she did, they denied it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 15:48:55', '2024-02-12 15:55:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133296029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113582001', 'Jennifer Levine', NULL, '02.12.2024 Jennifer attempted to opening a sharing request three times. They finally requested that she send everything in via email.
Chiropractor
PT
Everything was uploaded November 13th,  2023.
Finally started receiving reciprocation regarding bill coverage, but the emails were very vague and generic.
January 18th finally received a specific reimbursement acknowledgement $138~ (~$538 or more what she had already spent).
$2250.39 total of services in the end.
02.03.2024 When she went into her portal, all of her documents were missing. 
Kelsey was her case manager with Zion, NEVER returned her calls. Escalated to supervisors (Kimberly X223...): They told her she cannot cancel b/c they would not share after that point. They are dragging their feet, on 2/12/2024, they sent her another email telling her they are sending another check $1775, approved on 1/26th, but sent her two checks Saturday that equaled $650 $1040.

Refund for February due to no coverage and lack of customer service and communication. At this point, she had spent over $3800', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-12 15:30:44', '2024-02-12 15:36:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133275093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120831001', 'Lorena Arias Martinez', NULL, '2/12/24: Lorena started a chat asking about how to proceed for an upcoming ultrasound. Since she has the co-pay plan, it really depended on whether the test is related to an open or about to be opened need - or related to a preventive or less expensive health issue whereas she could use her MEC and pay the $200 copay. I advised her to call the concierge line as we needed more info, but she never called, and left a neutral review stating I didn''t answer her question. I called in an attempt to resolve the issue and LVM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-12 15:01:15', '2024-02-12 15:01:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133290018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128845002', 'JoAnn Riedl', NULL, '2/12/24: Joann called in looking for a proof of coverage, directed her to call planstin. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-12 14:56:59', '2024-02-12 14:56:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133306003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133307002', 'Felix Costa', NULL, '2-12-2024 
NOTE: This account will be converted to a list-bill for the company. Rosemarie and family will be effective 3-1-24 and the entire company will be effective 4-1-24.
Tent group meeting set for next Thursday 3-22-24 time TBD (Rosemarie will let me know.)

