  ('zcrm_1579374000133290008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116003002', 'Robert Hanley', NULL, '2/12/24- Andrea called in because she was unable to get her provider to pay for her childs annual wellness visit, sounded like she had provided them an incorrect card and so she paid out of pocket and decided she would try to get reimbursed. Reached out to planstin and was told by Celeste that members could so something like this if they have the provider submit the bill to them so they can pay the provider and in turn the provider reimburse the member, explained this process toe the member. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-12 09:35:38', '2024-02-12 09:35:38'),
