  We are interested in starting the process to become a part of MPB. Please let us know when is the next time you have available to help us start the process.
  You can reach my wife, Rosemarie, at the number below and just ask for her and they will transfer you to her line or reach her at cell at 203.912.1409.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-02-11 15:04:47', '2024-02-11 15:04:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000133232023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '2/9/24: Kristen called very frustrated about a bill she has received for wellness checkup. It was a convoluted series of events leading to the bill not being paid. See below:

Sept 18th - wellness visit 
30 days after she got bill
Called dr - said this is covered, make sure it’s coded correctly
30 days later - got another bill.
Nahla and Kristen and called Planstin
Planstin said they paid this bill - very nice. We’ll send you an EOB
Kristen kept trying to call dr - would never called back
Then in Jan - got another bill
Dr finally said their system was wrong, and they were never billing the insurance
After looking at EOB P sent, it was 2022, not 2023.
Called P again, they said to fax the bill directly to claims department - they said all good, we’ll take care of it. 
Kristen asked dr to fax bill, early Jan
Today, 2/9/24 Member got EOB that planstin denied bc time limit has expired for payment
$166 patient responsible - P did pay a portion bit not all bc of timeframe. 

Essentially, the issue here is that the dr office had incorrect info in system, and wasn’t billing planstin for services. When Member called Planstin (bc she thought it was billed there) they said they already paid it, which caused even more time to lapse. The bill was eventually faxed to Planstin under the assumption that everything would be taken care of, however Planstin denied a portion of the bill bc time limit expired for complete payment. Now Kristen is responsible for her bill even though all of this was bc of errors from the provider and planstin. 

I advised Kristen to send me the EOB, and let me speak to Planstin and see if there is anything I can do for her. Or see if the provider would cover the costs since it was their error. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-09 14:41:47', '2024-02-09 14:41:47'),
