  ('zcrm_1579374000132962061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164112010', 'Megan Berry', NULL, '2-6-24 Meg and Chris are moving to TN on March 3rd. They don''t know what the hospital will be offering Chris for ins yet. But, Meg and kids are on Medicaid at the moment and might get kicked off any time now. They''re not too worried about it. They don''t do the traditional wellness. They are interested in the mental health benefits and everything else. Chris will be a W2 and Meg might get a part-time job as W2 also. So, CARE+ is the best fit for them. They want the most affordable option and are thinking $2500/$520 EF banking on no incidents.  They are all super healthy, no meds, no tobacco, au natural.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-07 10:33:24', '2024-02-07 10:33:49'),
