  ('zcrm_1579374000132965013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '2/7/24: jennifer called to check about in-network, out of network for well child visits. I advised to speak to planstin directly, that they usually employ an RPB pricing model for out of network, but to double check for this scenario. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-07 10:03:22', '2024-02-07 10:03:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132965008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, '2/7/24: Robert called.
1. Having a Colonoscopy. Dr office called Planstin yesterday, and Bc of polyps, labeled surveillance and planstin refuses to consider.Nor will they cover the Pre-op visit for colonoscopy
I will call P to check the info he was given and see if I can find out something else. 
2. Is Cataract surgery shareable? Yes, but under pre-ex guidelines according to Zion
3. Medicare? What happens if in the middle of need and is switched to medicare? Will ask, and let him know

Follow up: 
1. Nakita from P stated that when the provider called, they simply asked if P covered a specific cpc code and P did not. I advised Robert that P does not look at your history or base decisions on any previous services, that they only look at whether it is coded preventive. 
3. Zion''s guidelines for aging out at 65 are attached. I went over the guidelines with Robert and showed him where to find this information.', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-07 09:59:23', '2024-02-08 10:16:53'),
