  ('zcrm_1579374000132948003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471338', 'Steve Tobias', NULL, '2/7/24: Steve called to verify that the shingles vaccine is covered. I checked the ACA and it is. We also verified his preferred pharmacy location on optum rx and I advised him to call the pharmacy to make sure they have it in stock. He claims he never got planstin cards, so I called to have them resent to him digitally and physically. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-07 07:09:24', '2024-02-07 07:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132923041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132943002', 'Wallace Reid', NULL, '2-6-24 Tray came to me via Andrea Hinman through his girlfriend Holly Johnson. I don''t see Holly as a member. Tray is 29 turning 30 in June. He knows of the price increase. His company is paying him $450 towards all medical, dental, vision, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-06 16:26:38', '2024-02-06 16:26:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132932028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088964002', 'Christopher Cucullu', NULL, '2/6/24: Chris was calling in because he''s in a secure plan right now only because it''s eligible to contribute to an hsa, he was told that he as long as he had an ein number than he''s still able to be part of the plan, but he wants to make sure he''s compliant, Will need to get back with him . -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-06 14:56:25', '2024-02-06 14:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, '2/6/24: Karen called saying that the provider she had booked an appt with for her mammogram called planstin, and that planstin said "they would not grant a single case agreement" to pay for mammogram. I said that didn''t sound right and advised Karen to speak to planstin directly and transferred her over to them. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 14:54:36', '2024-02-06 14:54:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132923026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '2-6-24 Bobbi called to better understand funding her HSA to cover her recent surgery. She''s on the plan alone so she can only fund it $4150 +$1000 as 55+. She''ll fund it fully and likely use the full amount. She''ll call her accountant to see if she should keep the account open or just use up the money and close it. There are fees if she drops below about $500, she thinks. Her surgery went well. She''s 2 weeks post-op and she won''t know how much feeling she''ll get back until about 12 months since she had long term nerve damage. She''s doing well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-06 14:16:26', '2024-02-06 14:16:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132890144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132825011', 'Marissa Goldhoff', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-06 14:06:19', '2024-02-06 14:06:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132890139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132824010', 'Brigitte Chupek', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-06 14:02:46', '2024-02-06 14:02:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110069011', 'Lisa Fraser', NULL, '2/6/24: Rawlings Group called to verify Lisa''s insurance. I explained that Lisa has a plan with us, but it''s not insurance, that we are a health sharing organization and use a reimbursement model, so our members present as cash pay patients. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 14:02:07', '2024-02-06 14:02:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132923021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168301001', 'Gretchen Clark', NULL, '2-6-24 Gretchen watched the video. She''s about 43 and her husband is 46. She''s self-employed and lives in Northwest OH. Family of 3 with 8 1/2 year old son. He''s currently on Medicaid. They are simply cash pay patients right now. They are healthy and rarely visit the drs. office. However, her husband smokes and I told her about the limitations once he''s 50. She asked about how to prove if/when he quits and I explained the process. They don''t have any pre-x and no meds. Son plays sports and she wants to make sure he''s protected. She wants an HSA however they don''t do the annual wellness visits. So, she''ll decide if it''s worth the extra money to fund the HSA. They might want a March 1st start date. Gretchen practices Tae Kwon Do. She''s interested in SECURE HSA or CARE+.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-06 14:02:03', '2025-07-17 09:12:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132890134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132824002', 'Jane Pietruszka', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-06 13:59:55', '2024-02-06 13:59:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058875042', 'Denzel Rodriguez', NULL, '2/6/24: Denzel called to update payment info. Led him to form on MPB website. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 13:51:32', '2024-02-06 13:51:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132890129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132757014', 'Michelle Beckman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-06 13:43:24', '2024-02-06 13:43:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916020', 'Margaret Garrido', NULL, '2/6/24: Margaret called wanting to get additional cards for her husband who was just added to the plan. I let her know that we could send a new MPB card, and for planstin - just call and request another physical card. She also asked how to find a new primary care doc under the PHCS network. I walked her through searching multiplan.com for a doc in her area. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 13:41:58', '2024-02-06 13:41:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132890124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132899338', 'Larry Parsley', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Co-Pay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-02-06 13:40:40', '2024-02-06 13:40:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, '2/6/24: Emailed Lester portal Credentials. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 13:21:02', '2024-02-06 13:21:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010815094', 'Lisa Hudson', NULL, '2/6/24: Per chat yesterday, emailed Lisa her portal username and pw. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 13:19:31', '2024-02-06 13:19:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132937003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', NULL, '2/6/24: I didn''t realize when sending the other script quotes that Laura wanted the coupons to be for Meijer Pharmacy. Emailed new ones with updated prices:
Acyclovir   $1841
Atorvastin   $12.28
Spironolactone   $22.21
Vilazodone   $148.20
Albuterol  $47.66', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 13:09:22', '2024-02-06 13:09:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132923013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '2-6-24 Julia and I had a long conversation about her current health items which mostly fall outside of what Zion will share. Zion is telling her if it''s not recognized by the CDC or FDA then they aren''t going to share in the cost such as heavy metals in her case. So, she''s needing to pay for all of the labs, dr. visits, etc. without even a chance for reimbursement on those. She also has some hormone issues. BUT, her hormones fall within the range of normal even though she''s at the very extreme edge of normal. So, they won''t share in those costs. She does have a medication or two for that but they are compounded to her specifically. She will have to pay for that still. Also, the State of WI doesn''t recognize naturopaths as licensed doctors, so Zion can''t share it those visits either! Both of Julia''s parents died last year as well. So, her nerves are shot. Oh man!  I let her know she could at the very least fund her HSA for $4150 in 2024 which she wants to look into doing. She can pay for her labs, dental cleanings, meds, vision, etc. That was the one positive option we determined after talking through it all for an hour.  She now realizes this more for catastrophic needs and not for her alternative care needs since it all got rejected by Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-06 12:59:47', '2024-02-06 13:56:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120998002', 'William Chilton', NULL, '2/6/24: William called. His wife is having a colonoscopy on 2/13, and he wanted to know how the billing would work. I advised to have the provider bill planstin for the procedure, and if they pull any polyps and the bill is kicked back to him, then call us back and we would walk them through submitting it as a need. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 12:57:52', '2024-02-06 12:57:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132914013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '2/6/24: Tania called back confused about the "deductable" on her new cards. She thought that number was her IUA. I explained that her IUA is $2500 and that the number she was seeing was simply to qualify her for her HSA account. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-06 12:56:17', '2024-02-06 12:56:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132932023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105906002', 'Derick Brooks', NULL, '2/6/24: Mrs. Brooks called in to ask us to look for three procedures at a fair price, used hcbb and sent her three separate images with the providers for the respected procedures she was looking for being a neck ultrasound, brain mri and sleep study. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-06 12:50:54', '2024-02-06 12:50:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132932018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114497002', 'Elsa Gerhardt', NULL, '2/6/24: Mbr called in and mentioned she was supposed to get a Planstin card emailed to her, Guided her to her email and helped her find the virtual card and told her she should still be getting a physical one as well. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-02-06 12:49:54', '2024-02-06 12:49:54'),
