  ('zcrm_1579374000132788065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130152006', 'Troy Baker', NULL, '2-5-24 Donna called to understand tax documentation for the MEC. I explained that he doesn''t qualify for the MEC since he''s not self-employed. But, it doesn''t matter since OH doesn''t have any penalties for no ACA compliant ins. So, there are no forms to gather for taxes, no penalties and no HSA compliance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-05 14:59:35', '2024-02-05 14:59:35'),
