  ('zcrm_1579374000132786049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109378024', 'Lorie Somermeyer', NULL, '2/5/24: Lorie called. She''s having an ultrasound done and asked how to proceed. I advised that she present as cash pay, collect an itemized bill during her appointment. And if she foresees needing more services done in relation to this issue that exceed her $1000 IUA, to then call us back, and we''ll help her submit a need with Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-05 11:42:25', '2024-02-05 11:42:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132786044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '2/5/24: Martha called. Lives in a rural area, and wanted to use planstin for mammogram. Provider is not willing to bill them, so she is trying to see if there is any way to get a reimbursement. I informed her on how their RBP works, but that it only works in the provider will send P the claim. Martha''s going to call P anyway to explore options on how to get the mammogram done at said provider and covered. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-05 11:21:39', '2024-02-05 11:21:39'),
