  ('zcrm_1579374000132788019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132790011', 'Marilynn Piche', NULL, '1-30-24 Marilynn 45 is getting divorced and her benefits end Jan.  31st. She is self-employed, no health issues, no tobacco, no meds. Lives in Lafayette. DOB 5/4/78. She will make about $22K plus she gets a 1x annual $150K alimony. So, her income is too high for a subsidy. She needs a plan for Feb. 1st. She chose the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 for the month of Feb. She will choose MCS for March and onward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-02 16:33:58', '2024-02-02 16:36:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132788014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, '2-2-24 No answer for our appt today. Left him a vm to call me when he''s free.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-02 16:02:15', '2024-02-02 16:02:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132786008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114987002', 'Melissa Dixon', NULL, '02.02.24:  I recvd. an email from Ashlee Williams of Planstin notifying me Melissa contacted them and said it''s too hard to understand what is covered.  She said she can''t find any information easily. I emailed her, introduced myself and told her I''d be happy to further explain her plan to her and provide more information, if she''d like.  I asked her let me know the best days and times for a call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-02-02 15:34:46', '2024-02-02 15:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132786003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095808002', 'Barbara Brannock', NULL, '02.02:24:  Recvd. an email from Ashlee Williams at Planstin notifying me Barbara Brannock informed them she can''t seem to get to a doctor for a mammogram less than an hour away and can''t see her regular doctors. I checked HCBB and found there are facilities for mammograms but their are at the Red level. I''m checking w/Ashlee at Planstin to see if Barbara can take advantage of  RBP pmt. There are 3 facilities within 9 miles of her.  Also, she may be able to use her doctors with RBP. Emailed Ashlee to ask if Planstin would approve RBP pricing for a facility near Barbara although they are out-of-network. Ashlee responded with the following:  
"Yes, exactly. She has RPB which means she can see a doctor out of the network for her mammogram (or any preventive care). When she goes to the doctor, have her show the ID card attached so the provider can see their section that says “out-of-network benefits” to have the provider contact us where we will verify she does have out-of-network benefits."', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-02-02 15:16:45', '2024-02-07 12:48:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132763028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, '2/2/24: Pam called. During her routine mammogram, they found something and she is having several other tests run. She wanted to know how to keep the costs down. We searched fair price for breast ultrasound and a digital diagnostic mammography in HCBB, and discussed how to handle bills and sharing requests guidelines. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-02 14:09:32', '2024-02-02 14:09:32'),
