  ('zcrm_1579374000132695013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133214002', 'Robert Grinnell', NULL, '1-31-24 Chad came to me via Craig Schkade. The company Chad was working with just sold and his benefits ended today. He can choose Cobra if he needs something for Feb. Cobra will cost about $1900 a month! He will be moving forward as self-employed with his own LLC and he has some real estate investments. His family is super healthy, no tobacco, no meds other than bc for his wife. They are both 42 and kids are 12 and 10. They want wellness and HSA compliance. SECURE HSA is $760/$1000 and $125/$25. Chad wants to share this with his wife to review. I''ll send video and email. He will follow up when they are ready. He knows of the 20th deadline for March 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-02-01 19:16:39', '2024-02-01 19:16:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132695008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '2-1-24 Lorie called in a panic. Their plan has been deactivated. I submitted an escalation per the below email to brokerteam@c4hco.com.  See email for screenshots to show up.


