Hi Lorie,

Your health is important, and your time is valuable. Here are personalized shortcuts to help you manage both.


Your plan started
Good news! Your Anthem health plan is now working for you. Check your plan details at the link below. You can also do things like track claims, see what your plan covers, and chat with us.

Check your plan details


Track your claims
It’s quick and easy to check the status of your claims, see where you stand with your deductible, and find out if you owe anything for your care. You can also see your Explanations of Benefits (EOB).

Track your claims


Do you have another health plan?
We need to know if you or someone else on your plan has another plan that covers your care. That helps us make sure we apply your benefits correctly. Please use the link below to let us know.

