  ('zcrm_1579374000132653031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666920', 'Rachel Brandon', NULL, '2/1/24: Rachel called, the provider said planstin denied the dexascan bill. I advised to speak to Planstin directly, ask the reason it was denied - and clarify why her current condition (already gone through menopause)  deems this bill eligible. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-02-01 10:38:20', '2024-02-01 10:38:56'),
