  ('zcrm_1579374000132680014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, '02.01.2024 Karen called b/c she wanted to be guided on how to proceed with getting a mamm and be covered. I walked her through the preventative process.  She also wanted to know how to share the PT sessions. I walked her through presenting as a cash pay patient, sharing requests, IUA''s and deadlines. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-02-01 10:32:33', '2024-02-01 10:39:14'),
