  ('zcrm_1579374000132623026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, '1-31-24 I can''t find Cari''s active account and proof of payment in Admin123. She''s not showing in the green or blue side. She''s not seeing her payment come out. Patti updated her information per the above. But, something isn''t showing up properly. The last payment I see was Feb. 2023. She was part of the MPB Group until Jan. 1st 2024. Sent a note to Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-31 23:36:22', '2024-01-31 23:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132623021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109708344', 'Matthew Koen', NULL, '1-31-24 Left another vm', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-31 15:52:45', '2024-01-31 15:52:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132623016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, '1-31-24 Monique changed her payment method for her HMA to pay on her own for $140 a month. She understands how it works and will call HMA to request some new cards. She can''t find hers. She was also considering moving to trad ins. but we are at the final hour to do so within her SEP from change of employment. Money is tight right now. So, I suggested she can change her IUA to $2500 from $1000 and that drops their monthly from $425 to $320. They were also paying a cc fee. So, she changed to ACH Bank Draft and the IUA. She was very pleased to do so in order to afford it still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-31 15:50:00', '2024-01-31 15:50:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132602036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985028', 'Phil Welch', NULL, '01.31.2024 Brittany called to get her children set up on telehealth. I walked her through the steps and explained each adult needs their own account and email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-31 15:47:22', '2024-01-31 15:47:22'),
