  ('zcrm_1579374000132623008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132624011', 'Roger Keeler', NULL, '1-31-24 Roger is my neighbor. He came over and I helped him review the options. He has asthma and needs a high cost med Dulera or Trelegy. It shows up as Non-Preferred Brand with Cigna and is not covered. It shows up at Tier 2 with Anthem and is covered on the plan we chose with drug co-pays. Looks like it should be $75 per month for the inhaler. His income is about $70K as his best guess. He''s getting about $142 APTC and he will call to request his Feb. 1st start date. He got kicked off Medicaid for Jan. 31st, 2024. Paid with a cc and knows to call Anthem to set up ongoing payment directly with them. He''ll do that by next Friday to make sure they have his information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-31 14:33:32', '2024-01-31 14:56:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132599126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '1/31/24: Emailed Tania Rx quote per request, and sent new planstin cards over per our conversation yesterday. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-31 14:27:52', '2024-01-31 14:27:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132602023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129873002', 'Daniel Kiefer', NULL, '01.31.2024 Daniel called on behalf of his daughter who had a snowboarding accident, and wanted to know the procedure to filing a sharing request. I walked him through how to present, receipts towards the $2500 IUA and uploading all the bills. They will call us back once she''s paid that IUA. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-31 14:14:19', '2024-01-31 14:18:11'),
