  ('zcrm_1579374000132599023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131108002', 'Richard Huang', NULL, 'Member submitted 2 Cancellation requests 1 for 2/29/24 other for 1/31/24.  I will cancel him prior to start and refund him the Feb share Amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-31 08:23:16', '2024-01-31 08:23:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132599018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132396012', 'Cody Clanton', NULL, 'Memebr &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-31 08:17:15', '2024-01-31 08:17:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132599013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132396012', 'Cody Clanton', NULL, 'Member requested change of IUA due to  problem in enrollment.  Updated in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-31 08:17:01', '2024-01-31 08:17:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132601013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082754', 'Ricardo Trespalacios', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Heidy. Added secondary email. Put in request to Kelly to send out QR life code cards to wife and child. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-31 08:03:39', '2024-01-31 08:32:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132601008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130059020', 'Elizabeth Wiersma', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-31 07:58:00', '2024-01-31 07:58:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132599008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107710002', 'Jana Baldwin', NULL, '1/30/24: Jana called. She has an open need, and is getting additional services done related to the need. She asked if needs start over with the new calendar year. I advised that they do not and she can still submit the new bills. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-31 07:47:59', '2024-01-31 07:47:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132599003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130192002', 'Retha Parsley', NULL, '1/31/24: Retha called to get Planstin cards sent to her new email address (called planstin and had them sent). We also went over how to send over an RX request and create her Zion member portal. 

Zion determined her hip replacement pre-ex, so now she needs to remove herself from the plan. I advised to call her advisor Andrea. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-31 07:47:21', '2024-01-31 08:24:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132569031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, '01.30.2024 Charlene Conlin - attempted a cancellation on the 18th, which looks like it went in effect - TOMORROW is her last day.
She called today inquiring and strongly wishing that she could reverse that request. She did share that she had been trying to connect with her advisor and billing w/o success. I did explain that it is our busiest time of the year, and apologized on behalf of MPB.
Is there a way anyone can connect with her to discuss this matter? I requested that she call back tomorrow and speak to the concierge for transferring or even if you offer them the news here to deliver to her.
Messaged Patti and the concierge to put the reversing in action if possible. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-30 18:12:48', '2024-01-30 18:12:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132569023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090935002', 'Tracy McKinney', NULL, '01.30.2024 Tracy called to learn the best way to proceed with getting services for a knee discomfort that keeps progressing, including finding the right physician. She called referring to the mentioning of HCBB via the newsletter.
We started with discussing the steps in searching the tool HCBB and her options in perusing that site.
We went over the steps in opening the sharing request, what to expect and what Zion will look for.  Needs to see the doctor for knee', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-30 16:26:58', '2024-01-30 17:50:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132546018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101333002', 'Johnathan ONeal', NULL, '1/30/24: Heather called in and mentioned a conversation that she had back on 12/20 with concierge that told her that childhood immunizations including rsv were covered. Got a bill for $500 and saw a breakdown that plansin covered everything but rsv. Reached out to planstin and was told by a rep named Hayden that the government had removed RSV from the aca preventive guidelines, explained this to the mbr and she asked that we do something on MPB''s side as she says she would never have gotten it if we didn''t tell her it was covered, will check with joan the process for escalating. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-30 14:59:54', '2024-01-30 14:59:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132550023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '1-30-24 Ryan is super intrigued in possibly becoming a DBO and getting 3 Tranzact Card members by the midnight deadline tomorrow. I sent him the revenue plan to ponder. He thinks he can get 3 people by tomorrow to become Founder level. He''ll keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-30 14:54:40', '2024-01-30 14:54:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132569018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919695', 'Erinn Magin', NULL, '01.30.2024 Erinn left us a VM....', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-30 14:21:52', '2024-01-30 14:21:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132569013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '01.30.2024 Listened to Tanya''s VM, ....', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-30 14:20:26', '2024-01-30 14:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132542038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '1/30/24: Tanya called wanting the October newsletter. Her acupuncture treatments have been denied by Zion because they weren''t pre-approved, and Tanya is trying to gather info to submit an appeal. I sent over the Zion guidelines for 2023 bc that''s when her need was opened. The excuse Zion is giving for denying the bills doesn''t match the literature in the guidelines. 
This is what I advised her to do:
- First call them and ask if there has been a mistake especially if your treatments meet the requirements of being prescribed by a licensed professional and related to your issue.
- If it''s not a mistake, go ahead and file an appeal providing appropriate documentation. 
- Let her know I''d be happy to reach out to Zion regarding her case if she is still having issues after the appeal.', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 14:19:59', '2024-01-30 14:19:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132569008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125327002', 'John Davis', NULL, '01.30.2024 Listened to John''s VM to learn, Will graciously connected with him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-30 14:15:08', '2024-01-30 14:15:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132569003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111981002', 'Michelle King', NULL, '01.30.2024 Listened to Michelle''s VM upon my clocking in, it looks like William attended to her request graciously. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-30 14:11:29', '2024-01-30 14:11:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132542033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '1/30/24: Tania Called asking about something Wendy sent her about rural areas and wellness visits. She''s had difficulty in the past finding a provider that will take Planstin. I asked Tania if I could call her back after looking into this further. She also asked about Optum RX. I explained that Optum only 100% covers some birth control, statins, and immunizations. There is a list of other discounted drugs on there, but offered our RX discount search services instead and showed her how to access that. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 13:51:48', '2024-01-30 13:51:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132522028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130553001', 'Keith Barbour', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-30 13:26:23', '2024-01-30 13:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132546013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125327002', 'John Davis', NULL, '1/30/24: Reached back out to John as I missed his call, mentioned he was going for an annual physical. Explained the guidelines for presenting the Planstin card and to go in for purely a physical. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-30 12:48:02', '2024-01-30 12:48:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132550018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113410109', 'Jeremy Colbert', NULL, '11-30-24 I changed Jeremy''s address in C4 while he''s in Costa Rica right now. New address is 142 Meadowlook Way, Boulder, CO 80304. I submitted it on the Peak side of the site and signed the Declarations page. I put a 12/1/23 change date. It''s just a sublease, so no utility bills or anything. His APTC remained the same at $348 and plan is $384.91. Still living in Boulder.  I left his plan alone so there''s no disruption in benefits. I told him he can review his account and see the change. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-30 12:47:23', '2024-01-30 12:47:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132546008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111981002', 'Michelle King', NULL, '1/30/24: Michelle reached out to find out how to fill out a rx discount form request, walked her through the process. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-30 12:40:23', '2024-01-30 12:40:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132550013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095963008', 'James Kjellsen', NULL, '1-30-24 Jim is very interested in the Tranzact Card and I sent him the site and 2 min video to watch after explaining it to him. He likes the idea of supporting conservative companies and seems to have an understanding of what I explained. He may join for the $25 1x fee and dig in more later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-30 12:29:06', '2024-01-30 12:29:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132555008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128112002', 'Jessica Christianson', 'New Membership eff 2/24', 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-30 12:06:54', '2024-01-30 12:06:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128112002', 'Jessica Christianson', NULL, 'Member''s other children were not removed as requested so I will change billing in A123 and refund member out of FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-30 12:06:05', '2024-01-30 12:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132542023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086946002', 'William Alemaghides', NULL, '1/30/24: William called wondering if he could get his colonoscopy covered after the fact. I explained that Planstin does not reimburse, but he could have the doctor''s office send the bill to Planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 12:00:31', '2024-01-30 12:00:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132550008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '1-30-24 Ryan is wanting to enroll ion the Tranzact Card. We had an excellent conversation about it. He asked good questions and seems to have a good grasp of how and why it works. He also recognizes the risk is only $25 1x for life. It''s worth the risk to gain the benefits. He was curious how I got into medical cost sharing and the alternative solutions world. I explained. He''s tired of the huge corporations taking so much from people and is happy to support forward thinking businesses. He''s also had a very good experience with MPB and Zion thus far as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-30 11:59:51', '2024-01-30 11:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132542018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130192002', 'Retha Parsley', NULL, '1/30/24: Sent support ticket to CirrusMD. Retha was getting the "no records found" message. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 11:58:51', '2024-01-30 11:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057253057', 'Tobin Ortenblad', NULL, '1-30-24 Tobin is getting health ins from his partner now and is needing to cancel. I sent him the cancellation form and cc''ed Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-30 11:56:46', '2024-01-30 11:56:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132542013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109168002', 'John Fry, Jr', NULL, '1/30/24: John Fry called. He cancelled and hoping to get reimbursement. Transferred to Patti. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 11:49:20', '2024-01-30 11:49:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132542008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132133010', 'Rachel Dubiner', NULL, '1/30/24: David Dubiner called (Rachel''s dad) to see if they could pause the start date till March 1. I transferred to Patti. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 11:48:34', '2024-01-30 11:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132522023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129115002', 'Tyler Hazen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Tyler and Dana. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-30 11:32:12', '2024-01-30 11:32:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132540007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130192002', 'Retha Parsley', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Angee Montgomery', 'Visit ID : 3460 Question : I tried to register for telehealth, however it says I don''t have access. We have not received our cards either.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-01-30 11:31:29', '2024-01-30 11:31:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132542003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109320043', 'Kirk Archibald', NULL, '1/30/24: Kirk called to submit a need with Zion. Instructed him on how to get the process started and begin submitting his bills. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 11:17:21', '2024-01-30 11:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132522008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131309012', 'Tyler Dalton', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-30 10:27:56', '2024-01-30 10:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132899276', 'Kimberly Mason', NULL, '1-30-2024
Kim lives in Georiga, she is 52 yo.
Is currently a W2 employee but leaving the company to become self-employed in February.
Non smoker
Pre-ex: Hypothyroidism
Wants Secure HSA at the $1000 IUA

I showed her everything on the web site.  She is going to watch the video and review the member guidelines.

Call her tomorrow.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-01-30 10:27:15', '2024-01-30 10:27:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132508039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130311020', 'Rob Withers', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Rob and Molly. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-30 09:37:41', '2024-01-30 09:37:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132508028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130568018', 'Darcy Cole', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Changed email as well. Also told her to go to our website to fill out form to update email as well. She did not have the time for me to show her as we were on phone. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code card to member. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-30 09:25:28', '2024-01-30 10:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132508013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129463007', 'Catheryne Harsh', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-30 08:02:54', '2024-01-30 08:02:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132508008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129054002', 'Maximilian Stone', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-30 07:46:25', '2024-01-30 07:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132498003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130221002', 'Nadine Bunting', NULL, '1/30/24: nadine called to get clarity on how to use services for a need. She received a 8K bill for CT scan that was way higher than the providers originally agreed price of $1600 - I advised she call the provider and dispute the charge. We discussed how using her health sharing work, collecting itemized bills and how to open a sharing request. Transferred directly to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-30 07:30:55', '2024-01-30 07:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129893002', 'Clayton Roberts', NULL, '01.29.2024 Clayton called to learn more on how to proceed with a colonoscopy screening and if it is covered. I gave him the steps to presenting and if it turns diagnostic and what to do from there. Clayton is very knowledgeable and is a physcian himself. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 18:01:02', '2024-01-29 18:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132442053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, '1-29-24 Noah is 24 and wife is 24 and newborn as of Nov. near Thanksgiving, 2023. His wife is still on her parents plan and is told by her parents insurance company that she can stay until she turns 26 even if married.  However, they can''t put their newborn on her plan, so they had to put him onto Noah''s plan. But, they added him and then removed him. Cost was $750 with son and $483 solo without son at age 24! They can get coverage for son again for Feb. 1st. They want to get the immunizations and were supposed to do them already but it was going to cost too much without ins. They live in CA and need the MEC. Priced out SECURE HSA $1000/$530 EC or EF $740. They will get a $100 waived for being an ASHI member. They are interested in the maternity benefits. March 1st will work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 17:29:16', '2024-01-29 17:29:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '01.29.2024 Carey put in an RX request for: Nystatin: 1 tube of 100000/15g ointment

I sent her the following:
We were able to find you three options for savings in the zip-code, 80302.
The prices below are as of today 01.29.2024:
Nystatin: 1 tube of 100000/15g ointment
Safeway = $8.62
King Soopers = $12.06
Costco = $7
Please let us know if you need anything changed or adjusted. We are here at the concierge line from M-F, 9am-8pm EST.                       NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 17:22:31', '2024-01-29 17:22:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132442048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '1-29-24 Sean Burke made sure the Anthem plan is cancelled in ICQuotes properly for Feb. 1st, 2024.  Estefania reached out bc she got an email from Cigna indicating her old plan is still being billed. I called Cigna and they are showing it as Active! I cancelled it immediately. Sean told me to to send an  email to Sales@Cigna-IFP.com to request cancellation back dated to 12/31/23. She can''t have two IFP''s bc then a Coordination of Benefits becomes a bigger problem.  I sent the email and will wait for the reply.  Anthem was cancelled previously per the notes above for Feb. 1st. 2024.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 17:22:09', '2024-01-29 17:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130965026', 'Jonathan Neher', NULL, '01.29.2024 Just found out TODAY that his wife needs to have a hysterectomy. Contacted Zion to confirm no waiting period to use Zion upon their start date. They were solid on that part. But it turns out that b/c she was seen by the doctor TODAY, it is now considered a preX condition. Jonathan is pondering staying with BCBS till after the surgery and pushing their start date with us, MPB till May. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 16:47:05', '2024-01-29 17:20:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, '01.29.2024 Daryl called and left a message while I was with another valued member.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 16:44:50', '2024-01-29 16:44:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '01.29.2024 Catherine needs to open a medical need for leg pain, consistently, went and got an x-ray, scoliosis, not sure where the pain is coming from still, she''s having a blood draw tomorrow for autoimmune.
She was under too much stress for a very long time.
kind of doctors she''s seeing are: Internal Medicine right now, PT, is also having more bloodwork done.
I sent her the directions for Sedera to open a medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 16:34:40', '2024-01-29 16:39:02');
