  ('zcrm_1579374000132439078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131477004', 'Jason Ketcham', NULL, '01.29.2024 Ashley called confirming they thought that payment was fraud, and wanted to rectify the situation, change their banking information and adjust their phone number. I sent them the below via CRM:
