In section 5 in this form, there is a tiny comment box that allows you to articulate detailed requests. Be sure to bring to their attention that extra character next to your number, there.     
Banking Information: https://www.cognitoforms.com/mpoweringbenefits1/mpoweringbenefitsexistingmemberpaymentinformationupdate                                  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 16:16:12', '2024-01-29 16:16:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132442043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '1-29-24 Cathy sent me her bills for $1920 for a PCP or wellness visit. I sent it along for reimbursement. She tried submitting it twice and no response.  The bill is from 1 year ago! It may go to collections.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 15:04:10', '2024-01-29 15:04:10'),
