  ('zcrm_1579374000132439068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131956012', 'Ty Perdue', 'SENT MPB Perm. to Discuss Plan w/ Ashley, on 01.29.2024', '01.29.2024 Ashley, TY''s spouse, called trying to confirm a refund performed on their plan-account. However, she is not on the plan nor has a permission form completed so that we can speak freely. I sent them the form, and spoke generally to the plan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 14:53:17', '2024-01-29 14:53:17'),
