  ('zcrm_1579374000132442038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, '1-29-24 Julie was trying to figure out how to show proof of ins for her 18 year old son to compete in surfing events in Costa Rica. He can get really good ins and travel ins for $1000 for the year through the event org. She was hoping by removing him it would lower her cost. But, she has another kid on her membership, so it won''t change the price. She will see if they''ll accept his ins/MEC and call me back once she knows more.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 13:55:26', '2024-01-29 13:55:26'),
