  ('zcrm_1579374000132442033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132461002', 'Julie Lewis', NULL, '1-29-24 Julie just joined for March 1st since she missed the deadline for Feb. 1st. She will keep her husband on his Anthem plan since he recently began chewing tobacco again. She joined SECURE HSA to fund her HSA and get the tax benefits. She might not use the wellness part. She just takes meds for a thyroid issue. All set to go for March 1st. She also knows to cancel her from Anthem before her bill date for that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 13:52:57', '2024-01-29 13:52:57'),
