  ('zcrm_1579374000132452003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128581003', 'Ian Leventhal', NULL, '1/29/24: Ian called to check on an open sharing request. Transferred directly to Zion and advised to speak to a member of their sharing department. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-29 13:07:32', '2024-01-29 13:07:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132444001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3456 Question : Trying to login, and I don''t have a record of my user name/ password. Please help me get those.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-01-29 12:55:08', '2024-01-29 12:55:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132442028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '1-29-24 I helped clarify the HMA again for Tina and how the account balance grows and caps out at $10000. Then to keep it afloat they only have to pay the maintenance fee instead of the full $140. She didn''t understand that you can''t simply close the account and have access to the available cash for medical expenses. They just have to keep the account open to use the money in the account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 12:53:19', '2024-01-29 12:53:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '01.29.2024 Corinne called inquiring about how to use her plan specifically the preventative section. I walked her through the steps, including how to use HCBB. Searched for places in her area. Sent them and the directions on how to HCBB via Outlook, had her change her address while we were on the phone and transferred to Zion to inquire about her sharing request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 12:33:32', '2024-01-29 12:57:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132442023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085362001', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '1-29-24 Laura will cancel her MPB membership bc of Zion''s tobacco limitations for 50+ that will be ongoing for life even though she''s quit. Sedera doesn''t have those limitations. She''s already quit for 13 1/2 months which will be 14-15 months once she starts fresh for March 1st with Sedera directly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 12:31:44', '2024-01-29 12:31:44'),
