  ('zcrm_1579374000132442008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002095005', 'Dustin Spencer', NULL, '1-29-24 Since Dustin hasn''t received his card yet, I said this, I''d recommend calling Cigna right away at 877-900-1237 and make sure they are showing your account in their system. Since your tax credit funds the entire cost of your plan this may have caused a problem on their end. I''d make sure to set up your online account with them as well. You should be able to download your new card that way as well. I see your account is showing active with Connect for Health CO.

Please let me know if you run into any problems."

Dustin followed through and learned this, "I contacted them and I am insured, she said she will send a card in the next 2 weeks.  Thanks Wendy!"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 11:38:21', '2024-01-29 11:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132436013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116121002', 'Brayden Luna', NULL, '1/29/24: Bryan called to discuss an open need for Brayden. He claims that bills hav been sitting in there for 9 months and haven''t been paid for. He asked how he could seek legal action. After he complained about Zion, their website, and other unrelated things, I started asking specifics to gather data if indeed this needs our attention. Bryan couldn''t tell me the determination of bills in question, nor did he disclose any specific unpaid bills. Since there was nothing he would give me to go on, and I can''t look into from my end, I ended up transferring him to Zion and advised he speak to the person in the sharing department who has been assigned this need. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-29 11:05:24', '2024-01-29 11:05:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132425046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130964002', 'Michael Coblentz', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-29 11:04:53', '2024-01-29 11:04:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117661001', 'Elizabeth Geronime', NULL, '01.29.2024 Elizabeth called and left a VM, sounding hoarse, saying she''s trying to use telehealth. 
I called her back, but ended up on her VM, I left her a VM to call us back to help her get registered. I went in on the registration page for CirrusMD and entered her information and it sent me the message that she is already registered, which is great, b/c then all she needs to do is change her passcode. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 11:01:43', '2024-01-29 11:01:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132442003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132824002', 'Jane Pietruszka', NULL, '1-29-24 Jane is 26 and newly working for Marni Shymkus with Akamai Basics. Jane lives in Denver and is super healthy. No health issues at all, no tobacco ever, no meds other than bc which should be free through ACA. Marni will pay $295/$1000 for SECURE HSA membership. I let her know about the $125/$25 as well. Jane needs another dental cleaning since she hadn''t been for a long time. Affinity Family Dental is showing up in the Aetna Dental Access network in 1dental. It includes her dentist Marvinh Tran. We''re not sure if Marni is paying for anything with dental or not. TBD for our enrollment call on Monday. Feb. 5th. I will call Jane 1st to get the app started and then we''ll call Marni to complete the app with the payment details. Jane was very pleased with this option and is excited to get started. I also explained the insurance benefit for wellness and non-ins for everything else. She understands now. She understands about the HSA now as well. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 10:45:35', '2024-01-29 10:45:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132425033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122156002', 'Carlos Sisalima', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Ariana. Added secondary email as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-29 10:40:52', '2024-01-29 10:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132439003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819216', 'Rebecca Brignole', NULL, '01.29.2024 Rebecca called sharing her husband had a surgery on his miniscus last year, and wants to upload her bills and receipts to be shared. I understand Sedera is more lenient on the deadline. I emailed her the instructions for Sedera and asked her to call us back with anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-29 10:37:43', '2024-01-29 10:47:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132436008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, '1/29/23: Julius called. Wants to add daughter to plan. I directed him to the member change form. He asked about mental health coverage. I explained the Member Assistance Program and how to access it. He also asked what his new fee would be, so transferred to Patti. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-29 10:32:09', '2024-01-29 10:32:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132425023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130073002', 'Nathan Carden', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-29 10:29:07', '2024-01-29 10:29:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132436003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904687', 'Mike Gardner', NULL, '1/29/24: Mike called again, wanting to verify that the services he is about to have will be shared by Zion. I advised that according to guidelines, I don''t foresee any issues. Just make sure that all supplementary documents point back to the issue at hand, and since Zion is the ultimate decision maker, they would have to tell you one way or the other regarding what you submit. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-29 09:46:01', '2024-01-29 09:46:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132434008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076713079', 'Staci Wiley', NULL, '1-29-24 Staci called to see if she should fill out the tax credit LINQQS app herself. I told her to hold tight until I get some answers as to how to avoid the hiccups that I experienced on my end. She will wait to hear from me. She was also ready to cancel her SECURE membership bc they found some short-term plan in Boise that they were going to go with. She realizes she''d have to bounce around a bunch to do this. I explained that they are in their 3rd year of membership with $50K sharing for pre-x. They didn''t have any pre-x. But, if they hop off now and then have a new pre-x it won''t be ideal to restart their membership at that time. She also better understands that if something new comes there no cap. For example her friend was recently diagnosed with breast cancer. I explained how that works as  a new Need. She feels better about her membership. She and her husband primarily use alternative care Drs. and chiro for preventative purposes. They haven''t submitted a new Need ever and have just paid for their stuff as preventative on their own. She will discuss this again with her husband and likely remain as  a member.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-29 09:38:40', '2024-01-29 09:38:40'),
