  ('zcrm_1579374000132429023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', NULL, '1/29/24: Lisa called. She thought she could use Zion for mammogram, but I explained that she would need to present her planstin cards. Since she didn''t have cards, we called Planstin and them emailed to her. We also discussed when to use Zion versus planstin and reimbursement policies for planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-29 08:29:52', '2024-01-29 08:29:52'),
