  ('zcrm_1579374000132356003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128525025', 'Pamela Burns', NULL, '1/25/24: Pam has called several times today while we were in Concierge meeting, and it was not caught. She was also left hanging on the chat bc we were getting so many calls. She has been wanting to cancel her insurance and in the chat states she cancelled in January, and was charged for Feb. I called and LVM apologizing for the communication issues today and asked her to please give us a call back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-26 07:14:55', '2024-01-26 07:25:25'),
