  ('zcrm_1579374000132261116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, '1-24-24 I just forwarded the email to Ashlee and Desiree from 11-20-23 from Ashlee on the progress for her reimbursement for the mammo. Sarah just emailed me letting me know it was never reimbursed still... Ugh!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-24 15:56:40', '2024-01-24 15:56:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132261111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521080', 'Amy Korres', NULL, '1-24-24 Amy and Kostas are looking to have Amy and kids join MPB again with SECURE HSA. They used to have EF at around $700 and now it''s EC at $710/$1000. They are contemplating the different IUA options and we will reconnect next week to enroll. They are super healthy still, no pre-x, no meds, nothing to report. Kostas will get ins through work at no cost to him. To add the rest of the family will cost around $1000+ per month. This will save them at least $300+ per month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-24 15:29:14', '2024-01-24 15:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132261106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '1-24-24 Christina asked to better understand how to proceed with a Drs. appt. She said it is a lingering issue from a few years, so it will be pre-x. I explained it to her and let her know of the tiered increasing benefits starting Aug. 1st, 2024 for up to $25K sharing.  I told her still to call the MPB Concierge Team for help in getting the highest quality care at a fair price locally. Also, she asked about dental and I sent her my dental discount plan to review. She currently has VSP as well.  So, if she  joins the dental discount plan, she might be able to cancel VSP if it looks robust enough.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-24 15:22:24', '2024-01-24 15:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132261101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674121', 'WAHEED AYUBI', NULL, '1-24-24 Waheed called bc he''s getting "forced" by Anthem who is the carrier of his wife''s plan to reveal whether or not he has health ins. His membership includes the MEC for wellness only. He''s concerned bc Anthem is trying to say if he has ins. then his ins. will need to pay for the birth of their children in Dec. It''s nuts. I can''t get a call back from David Shull with Apex. Rod doesn''t think he''ll know the answer. I chatted with Patti and we determined he simply needs to disclose the MEC for wellness only and let them determine what they are each responsible for. I left a vm with Waheed just now and awaiting his call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-24 14:35:19', '2024-01-24 14:35:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132312028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114497002', 'Elsa Gerhardt', NULL, '1/24/24: Elsa called needing help finding a primary care provider. I walked her through searching the PHCS network, and we found a possible list of PCPs. We also discussed how to present for billing based on type of service provided. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-24 13:54:59', '2024-01-24 13:54:59'),
