  ('zcrm_1579374000132310018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130459009', 'Skye Harry', NULL, '1/24/24: Skye reached out explaining that she was a new member and had a few questions about the zion health share, preventive services through planstin and some basic membership questions. Emailed the welcome call template and encouraged her to schedule one at her earliest convenience.', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-24 13:10:00', '2024-01-24 13:10:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132310013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109279002', 'Monica Violante', NULL, '1/24/24: Monica called in and asked for help registering for Cirrus MD and then had some other questions about the zion health share services and her planstin services. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-24 13:07:12', '2024-01-24 13:07:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132261096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '1-24-23 Cathy has some health issues she needs to look into and get reimbursed for with Redirect. She will send me her old Redirect bills that haven''t been paid for. Newly she wants to go to an internal medicine Dr. and Redirect is telling her they will pay for it. I told her I don''t believe that''s true.  So, she''ll try and if not, she''ll submit it to Sedera as a new Need. If Redirect gives her a cc to pay in advance, great. If not, she''s prepared to pay the first $1500 per need and include Sedera in the process. Her old bills were for having a fever and going to PCP and then a rash on her legs which hurt. That finally cleared up and was determined to be a virus. She also thinks she has arthritis, too much stress and possibly a pinched nerve causing issues. It''s all changed her life she said. She''s ready to do her part in creating the Needs and submitting the bills, etc. Very nice and super appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-24 12:46:38', '2024-01-24 12:46:38'),
