  ('zcrm_1579374000132250033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111873002', 'Gregory Cox', NULL, 'I received a call from a representative of this member''s estate.  They told me that he had passed away in October of 2023.  Also told me that they had notified Zion however we continued to bill them.  I advised that this was the 1st we were hearing of this.  Said that the bank acct that we draw from has been depleted and that the 2/24 pmt will decline.  I have contacted Planstin who had no notes indicating any contact.  I am awaiting a call back from Affiliate Services @ Zion re: this matter.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-24 08:39:33', '2024-01-24 08:39:33'),
