  ('zcrm_1579374000132261067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085362001', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '1-23-24 Laura is pissed about the new limitations on tobacco users even though she''s quit for 13 1/2 months already. I checked Sedera''s Guidelines and they look back 12 months without limitations once they''ve quit. With Zion they are penalized for life if they used tobacco when  joined even if they were under age 50. Once the member turns 50 they have strict limitations.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-23 15:25:04', '2024-01-23 15:25:59'),
