  ('zcrm_1579374000132272029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122803002', 'Peter Fenwick', NULL, '1/23/24: Peter called with questions regarding prescriptions, using MEC, submitting needs to Zion, and how his IUA worked. We discussed case by case examples, and I guided him on how to use his preventive care services, submitting bills as a need, and the fact that IUAs are issue specific and cap at 3 per rolling year per membership which includes all the members of his family. Per discussion, sent email with link to RX quote form and Member Portals section of website. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-23 13:13:49', '2024-01-23 13:13:49'),
