  ('zcrm_1579374000132178065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, 'On 1/19 along with Pmt update member submitted Change from to update address.  This was submitted to Sedera who then came back to me with the following request asking for documentation of the address change.  This was never a requirement.  This was sent to member and I got a 2nd notice from Sedera so I will resend to Member & Sedera and tell them to deal with Member directly.

 
John Kim (Sedera) 
Jan 18, 2024, 4:37 PM CST 
Hello Patti,
 
Thanks for reaching out to us to keep the member''s information up-to-date. We would need proof of their address for 4811 S. Niagara St Denver, CO 8037. Listed below are the acceptable documents they may submit to proceed with the request for changes.
 
Proof of address (scans and electronic statements acceptable):
•	Lease/rental agreement
•	Utility bills dated within the last 30 days
•	Bank statements dated within the last 30 days
•	Pay stub dated within the last 30 days
•	Insurance policy dated within the last 30 days
 
If you have further questions please let me know!
 
Kind regards,
John', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-22 12:42:46', '2024-01-22 12:44:04'),
