  ('zcrm_1579374000132154018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128951002', 'Philip Sheridan', NULL, '1/22/24: Jan called over the weekend - called back to see if she needed additional assistance. She had questions regarding the app and how to use it. I let her know that it was still in progress, and  to access resources and links to services to visit the mpb.health website.', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-22 09:54:09', '2024-01-22 09:54:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132154013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106618002', 'Simon Dullingham', NULL, '1/22/24: I spoke to JC (ext 245)  at Zion regarding Simon''s case. She explained that situations like this happen all the time, and she doesn''t see an issue with the appeal being approved if Simon can prove that the bill hasn''t been lying around for 9 months.
