  ('zcrm_1579374000132154008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095555002', 'Kyle Larsen', NULL, '1/22/23: Kyle called asking for advice on using his plan for his knee issues and possible surgery. He had an MRI in December 23, and looking to see an orthopedic surgeon. I taught him how to search HCBB for providers in his area. We discussed Zion''s phase in period for pre-ex conditions and how to open a need. At the end of the conversation, I transferred to Zion so he could open his member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-22 08:33:22', '2024-01-22 08:33:22'),
