  ('zcrm_1579374000132130028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093638002', 'Jill Nagle', NULL, '01.19.2024 Jill called requesting a way to share she has "insurance"  b/c they don''t accept any self pay patients. I offered that we speak to Zion. Amber answered and she was able to email jill a certificate that shares her sharing plan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-19 17:20:16', '2024-01-19 17:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132138003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132290002', 'Tracy Zottola', NULL, 'Appt set with Tracy for Tuesday 1-23-24 at 4pm. I will call her.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-01-19 17:12:51', '2024-01-19 17:12:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132130023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '1-19-24 Rebecca called and demanded I call Kaiser to correct her DOB. She didn''t want to listen to me that it has to be changed on C4 first. I asked her to call C4 and she refused. She wants me to call. I was able to correct it in the Peak side of C4 even though their own instructions say you must re-enroll and they will backdate it. I called C4 and spoke with Sophia who was lovely and said I did all that I needed to do on the Peak side and it will be sent to Kaiser. It may take up to 21 days for it to be updated in Kaiser''s system. Rebecca can call Kaiser again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-19 16:59:33', '2024-01-19 16:59:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132130018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128922010', 'Glen Randall', NULL, '01.19.20024 Glen put in an RX request for: ​Clomiphene: QTY 183 • 50 MG • Tablet •
Tamsulosin: QTY 366 • 0.4 MG • Capsule 
I SENT HIM the following:
I was able to price your Rx request for:
​Clomiphene: QTY 183 • 50 MG • Tablet •
Tamsulosin: QTY 366 • 0.4 MG • Capsule •
I tried finding the least expensive coupons at the same pharmacy, but that was a bit tricky. So attached you will find 2 pharmacies for both medicines and one rogue at Savon and another at Costco. The other prices were a lot higher. and for that I reached out to our international shopper. I have not heard back from him, so I decided to send you, my findings. When I hear back from the international shopper, I will forward you the offered quote.

Below are the prices as of ​yesterday 01.19.2024. 

