  ('zcrm_1579374000132130008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084375002', 'Troy Axelson', NULL, '01.19.2024 Troy needed insight on whether his therapist he is already going to is part of the M&amp;S EAP. I guided him to the site on our MPB Portal site, briefly shared the highlights of the M&amp;S site and his options on how to connect and that he can ask them to sponsor his therapist if not on the list. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-19 15:28:25', '2024-01-19 15:28:25'),
