  ('zcrm_1579374000132086023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '1/19/24: Jennifer called. Having issues finding someone in network to perform colonoscopy. I walked her through searching the network, and checking to see if providers are willing to bill prior to appointment. We found two options together over the phone as a starting point. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-19 13:05:13', '2024-01-19 13:05:13'),
