  ('zcrm_1579374000132084008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '1-19-24 Peter decided to go with SECURE HSA $1000/$405 since re-enrolling him isn''t possible for Feb. 1st. He doesn''t have any pre-x, no needs in past 24 months and he''s healthy. He''s also self-employed. This gives him a lower IUA for same price but removes chiro and PCP visits which he never used. This gives him HSA compliance as well. He will need to re-enroll in CirrusMD when doing the Welcome Call. He''s all set. I just let Suzy know that she can remove him and change her billing now for Feb. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-19 12:42:56', '2024-01-19 12:42:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132069008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130113002', 'Beth O''Hara', NULL, '1-19-24 Sent her a howzit going email.   She replied; happy.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-01-19 12:19:06', '2024-01-19 12:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132086008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916020', 'Margaret Garrido', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to add spouse eff 2/24.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-19 12:14:36', '2024-01-19 12:14:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132086003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401086', 'Andrew Brinkmeyer', NULL, 'Member was transferred to me by Planstin, he wants to change his IUA.  Told me that Analisa never sends him any information about this and he has been asking for 1.5 yrs.  He will think about this and get back to me', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-19 12:06:57', '2024-01-19 12:06:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132084003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '1-19-24 Suzy and Peter are officially divorced now. Suzy 56 will remove Peter from the membership for Feb. 1st effective date. She''s changing the payment method. Her new membership fee will be $400.78.  If Peter is fine with changing his membership he can join SECURE HSA. He''s self-employed and 56 and it will be $405 a month. She says he''s only used the membership once and only for some blood work and he doesn''t have any pre-x. So, this may be the simplest solution for them. She will wait to remove him until I give her the thumbs up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-19 11:53:14', '2024-01-19 11:53:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132042041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103567002', 'Gene Seguin', NULL, 'Catherine called with 2 questions. How to proceed with getting a spot checked on her neck and whether or not she needed a referral for colonoscopy and where to go. 
- I advised she start with telehealth regarding her neck, and if she did go to derm, it would be cash pay. We also discussed in the event the issue escalated into more appts, when it would fall into cost sharing territory.
- I walked her through searching the PHCS network for providers that perform colonoscopies, and how to present for that and other preventive services. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-19 11:33:15', '2024-01-19 11:33:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132012096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129058001', 'Elizabeth Black', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-19 11:19:23', '2024-01-19 11:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132049013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '1-19-24 Nathalie has a bill for a mammogram that''s about for $1471! For some reason it shows a payment of $1103.25 that Nathalie has paid. I''m not sure why the difference since it doesn''t show any adjustments. Either way Redirect hasn''t reimbursed her for any portion of the bill inspite of pre-approval. The provider wouldn''t accept the cc information provided by Redirect either. It''s very bizarre and the most expensive mammo I''ve ever seen. She said it''s 3D. She will send me the itemized bill next before I send it to Redirect for processing. She hasn''t been able to get any progress or movement on the bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-19 11:12:07', '2024-01-19 11:12:07'),
