  ('zcrm_1579374000132011008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196010', 'Robert Wadlington', NULL, '1/19/24: Robert called in explaining how his wife slipped and fell this morning and they''re both currently in the ER. Immediately expressed my empathy for his wife and told him how sorry I was to hear that but did explain he has our lowest IUA and that this is a straightforward sharing request where he can expect to pay the first $1000 and everything else will be shareable. Robert asked if he needed to deal with this right away, provided him the 6 month time frame and told him he can handle it a later time if he needs to be with her but advised that he try to get itemized bills or a treatment plan so he can have what he needs ready to submit a sharing request. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-19 10:07:32', '2024-01-19 10:07:32'),
