  ('zcrm_1579374000132012013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129054009', 'Jana Leija', NULL, '1/19/24: Jana called. Confused about welcome call. I let her know that Vanessa would be calling the number you put down on the scheduler at the time you chose. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-19 07:12:24', '2024-01-19 07:12:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000132012008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111523002', 'Laurie Gershgorn', NULL, '1/19/24: Laurie called to cancel. Advised to contact advisor and emailed cancellation form link reminding her that today is the final day to do so.', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-19 07:09:48', '2024-01-19 07:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131947062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095850002', 'Dave Chamberlin', NULL, '01.18.2024 Dave called on behalf of his wife Kristen re: her visit to her GP for her ailed bladder. The GP recommended an imaging session, and Dave wanted to learn how he can save according to an email/newsletter HSA sent them. I could not speak to the email but I did guide him to find his "Summary of care" email with HCBB in it,  and we perused that site briefly to show him how it works. I explained his plan to him brielfy (3 pillars....etc), and how healthsharing through a sharing request with Zion works. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-18 18:06:12', '2024-01-18 18:10:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131978033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078638002', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, '1-18-24 Hello,

I’d like to cancel my coverage effective immediately (through January). Please make sure the withdrawal for February is stopped.

I’ve appreciated this cost sharing program, but have my first medical need (explant removal due to implant rupture) and it has been denied as it is deemed cosmetic and not based on an injury or illness. I am moving to traditional insurance who will cover it.

Please confirm receipt.

