Claudia Nanino', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-18 17:52:52', '2024-01-18 17:52:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131947051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598030', 'Jeffrey Pietras', NULL, '01.18.2024 Jeffrey called letting us know he  completed the cancellation form, and if there''s anything else he needed to do for that process. I checked Cognito forms for him and confirmed we did receive it. Jeffrey was very complimentary. I sent him the link to review MPB.NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-18 16:36:28', '2024-01-18 16:36:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131947041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893179', 'Brian Cosner', NULL, '01.18.2024 Brian called back wanting to know how to get assistance with his neuropathy treatment for his leg.
We talked extensively about his plan, his condition (s), and treatments he is getting.
