  ('zcrm_1579374000131986026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131159002', 'Lucy Levine', NULL, '1/18/24: Lucy called, received cards and now trying to figure out how to use plan. I alerted her that her plan is showing as cancelled and suggested she reach out to her advisor - Jablonski. And emailed advisor alerting her of issue. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-18 14:38:26', '2024-01-18 14:41:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131947016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', NULL, '01.17.24:  I emailed Leslie Jablonski, Trevon''s Advisor, to exxplain to her what had actually transpired between us and Planstin/Zion to clarify the issue.  Leslie responded to my email thanking me for our efforts in support of her member.  She added she had 2 other clients with the same problem but didn''t have time to search for their names as she is leaving for a brief long weekend.  I responded to her email to ask if she could, when she returns, find those names so we can track the status of these members being in the Zion''s system.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-18 14:26:05', '2024-01-18 14:26:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131986016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089148002', 'Laurel Laird', NULL, '1/17/24: Laurel called asking how to get labs covered. I explained that her MEC only covers a standard lipid panel, but can assist in finding discounted labs once she had the exact name of what she needed. She kindly declined bc the labs were not typical and she was working with her provider on getting those costs down anyway. I emailed her some resources on using her preventive care services. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-18 14:00:01', '2024-01-18 14:00:01'),
