  ('zcrm_1579374000131834003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044079035', 'Eugene Max Myers', NULL, '1-17-24 Called me for help. He reinstated me as his Broker. He''s choosing Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0. He will have to call C4 to make sure they will honor a Feb. 1st start date with the extension of open enrollment. He''s putting in his first month''s payment now. He didn''t get the tax credit when he did it on his own. I fixed it for him and now getting APTC of $235.25 with $40K income. He''s enrolled successfully. I gave him the # to call C4 to request his Feb. 1st start date. He also paid for the 1st month via C4. So, he''s all set once he calls them. He knows to call Cigna in 3-10 biz days as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-17 16:07:29', '2024-01-17 16:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131833003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114987002', 'Melissa Dixon', NULL, '01.17.2024 Melissa needed to learn about her plan and how to maneuver it, as well as how to search for providers and such. I noticed she has not had her welcome call, I sent her the scheduling link and urged her to move forward with that to attain the resources that come up after it. 
