  ('zcrm_1579374000131809063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122214002', 'Tara Skredynski', NULL, '1-17-24 Tara spoke with a different local broker who is undercutting MPB and getting her a Zion  membership plus separate wellness for $247 a month. That''s more expensive than going directly to Zion and less expensive than MPB. She doesn''t want the bells and whistles. She just wants Zion and wellness. She''s using Scott Thompson with White Hat Insurance / NoCo Health Insurance servicing Longmont and FC. Not sure what more I could have done to save the client.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-17 15:47:21', '2024-01-17 16:40:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131766106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122214002', 'Tara Skredynski', NULL, '1/17/24: Tara called to cancel membership. I informed her she''d need to speak to Wendy directly to cancel and transferred her over. Also emailed a cancellation form and reminded her of the deadline of the 19th to make changes. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-17 15:04:02', '2024-01-17 15:04:02'),
