  ('zcrm_1579374000131767206', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126354002', 'Paulette Schaap', NULL, '1/17/24: Mbr called in to find out how to have her colonoscopy as she was told it could be an outpatient procedure and not covered through Planstin. Explained to her that her colonoscopy was 100% paid for but any polyp removal may fall under a sharing request through Zion. Mbr continued to mention how she was told her colonoscopy will not be paid for. Explained again the above which frustrated the mbr, told her she just needs to schedule the colonoscopy and have her provider call Planstin directly to clarify. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-17 13:27:17', '2024-01-17 13:27:17'),
