  ('zcrm_1579374000131767176', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122156002', 'Carlos Sisalima', NULL, '01.17.2024 Ariana called. Missed the call. Called back the number she called from, 14803160071, and left her a VM to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-17 12:50:14', '2024-01-17 12:50:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131809039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779011', 'Elizabeth Wolfson', NULL, '1-17-24 Liz called bc she''s getting the same cancellation emails from Cigna but also for her kids. I didn''t get the emails for her kids. In her divorce they decided to just use her husbands agent Heather Miller to keep it simple. But it seems Heather isn''t use C4 even though they''re choosing a Cigna Connect plan for the two kids. Liz is now on employer ins but adding the kids is too expensive. Her x husband earns too little so they''d be put onto Medicaid which is not what she wants. If she can''t get the answers she needs from Heather, she''ll call me back again. It''s all a bit strange.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-17 12:44:57', '2024-01-17 12:44:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131767171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105905002', 'Stephanie Mundy', NULL, '01.17.2024Stepanie called, her husband is need of a MAJOR oral surgery. Affecting his medical health and life. I explained that Zion will consider sharing, if it is affecting his medical health. I gave her the process to follow when I transfer her to Zion to open a sharing request, get more information, and offer them the opportunity to consider the share. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-17 12:29:00', '2024-01-17 12:29:00'),
