  ('zcrm_1579374000131767161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789002', 'Martin Smith', NULL, '1/17/24: Martin called in and explained how I had given him wrong information as he was under the impression he would pay for the first $1000 and then be reimbursed the balance, Explained to him that his request is eligible for sharing and that he only needs to pay the first $1000 and that everything else related to that sharing request is shared and explained how he would submit a sharing request after creating his mbr portal- WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-17 12:24:04', '2024-01-17 12:24:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131767156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131713032', 'MaryAnn Camacho-Viera', NULL, 'Member Only Essentials', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-17 12:22:26', '2024-01-17 12:22:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131818001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129920002', 'Jeremy Holzmeister', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with William Upton', 'Visit ID : 3436 Question : How do I register for a member portal account?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-01-17 12:17:19', '2024-01-17 12:17:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131809031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131950002', 'Gabe Rothkamp', NULL, '1-17-24 Angie, Gabe''s mom called me and was referred to me by Kristy Barber. However, she just happened to have found an article online that discussed all of the religious healthshares as well as MPB as the only non-religious option open to all people. She''s already a member of Medishare herself but Gabe is not willing to sign the statement of faith with Medishare. So, she called MPB and talked with Kirk. By chance as soon as she finished her conversation with Kirk, Kristy Barber told her to call me. So, she had found MPB on her own. I called Kirk and let him know what happened. He will enroll her son, Gabe today into CARE+. Gabe is W2 employee, 21 years old and earns about $40K-$45K as Chipolte Manager. He missed open enrollment and doesn''t qualify for a subsidy. She doesn''t know if he uses tobacco or anything. Otherwise, he''s healthy and she just wants catastrophic and prefers alternative care. I''m hoping she''ll share the article she read but forgot to give her my email. I''ll have Kirk ask her for it. We''re keeping the lead with Kirk since he gave her the spiel yesterday and she was clear about the order of events.  I''ve asked Kirk to make sure Kristy Barber gets credit for the referral! He entered it into Zoho but needs to have her add it on the application.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-17 12:15:28', '2024-01-17 12:17:10'),
