  ('zcrm_1579374000131767126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130421011', 'Shane Mellin', NULL, '01.17.2024 Emailed Shane via Outlook with:
Greetings Shane,

My name is Nahla, and this email is regarding your RX request you placed with us, on the 9th of this month.

Your request was for the following:

 Rosuvastatin: 10mg, 30 tablets (it''s very possible this one is one of the very few that is covered by Planstin)
Diltiazem: 120mg, 30 tablets

I started researching the Diltiazem, but quickly learned that there are more details needed to search for the right medicine.
The form and type of medication (12hr vs 24hr, vs ER 24hr......) strength/dosage. Snippet of choices attached.
What strength? Is 120mg still apply? Snippet included.

I called and left you a VM, also on the 9th, but I have not heard back. I am here at the concierge line M-F 9am - 8pm EST.
In the meantime, I will label your request complete in the system, so message me here to offer more details to clip the coupons.

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
