  ('zcrm_1579374000131766026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108862002', 'Mark Witt', NULL, '1/17/24: Mark called, had cortisone shot this month in knee for arthritis. According to Zion guidelines, arthritis treatment is considered pre-ex, but since he had it done this month, he will be able to access the 2nd year rate of $25K. I advised on how to submit a need, and transferred directly to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-17 08:43:56', '2024-01-17 08:43:56'),
